        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/0010800002sWgNHAA0",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/0010800002sWgNHAA0/prestwick-community-cafe",
            "name": "Prestwick Community Cafe",
            "description": "The broad aim of The 65 Club is to take action which will improve the quality of life of older people (50 years and older), their families and disabled people living in Prestwick and the surrounding areas within South Ayrshire.",
            "cause": [
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/OlderPeople",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Older People"
                }
            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000Pv9TyAAJ",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000Pv9TyAAJ/community-cafe-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2024-10-03",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-12",
                    "title": "Community Cafe Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nJust a few hours out of your week could make an older person's day! Help reduce loneliness and social isolation by volunteering at our community cafe. This offers older people the chance to meet others for a chat over a cup of tea or coffee and cake at a very reasonable price. \r\n\r\nYou will get to know the customers and build a positive relationship with them. You will do this by:\r\n\r\n- Meeting and greeting customers in our Tearoom \r\n- Serving refreshments and clearing away at the end \r\n- Building a positive relationship with customers by chatting to them and getting to know them.\n\n## Experience required\n\nTo be sociable, reasonably good with money and willing to get involved with the general duties of the club.\n\n## Travel details\n\nCentral to bus and train services in Prestwick\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel expenses paid on receipt of tickets.",
