                },
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000GvbwIAAR",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000GvbwIAAR/social-media-co-ordinator",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-10",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-08",
                    "title": "Social media co-ordinator",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nGeneral Description:\r\n\r\nAs social media co-ordinator you will be responsible for the daily running of the larder social media accounts. You will be responsible for responding appropriately to any queries for the larder that come in via social media accounts.\r\n\r\nSummary of Main Activities and Tasks:\r\n\r\n- develop creative and engaging social media strategies\r\n\r\n- manage the day-to-day handling of all social media channels\r\n\r\n- create engaging multimedia content (and/or outsource this effectively) across multiple platforms\n\n## Experience required\n\nGood knowledge of social media platforms\r\n\r\n- IT skills\r\n\r\n- Competent literacy skills\r\n\r\nThese skills are desirable however all applications are warmly welcomed",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000GvbwIAAR#role",
