            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/0010800002urN6WAAU",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/0010800002urN6WAAU/fresh-community-wellness-scio",
            "name": "Fresh Community Wellness SCIO",
            "description": "Operating from Seaton and Linksfield neighbourhoods, and surrounding areas, we are a volunteer, lived experience and local resident led community charity. We believe in a salutogenic approach to community wellness.\r\n\r\nA ‘salutogenic’ approach is one that focuses on factors that support health and wellbeing, beyond a more traditional, ‘pathogenic’ focus on risk and problems.\r\n\r\nThis approach is widely used around the world – in health, education, workplaces, architectural design – and we believe it has enormous relevance in the transformation of the community.",
