                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000068hFYAQ",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000068hFYAQ/delivery-driver",
                    "publishStart": "2023-10-10",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-25",
                    "title": "Delivery Driver",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAs a community interest company we value volunteers and their support really means a lot to us. We are looking for Delivery Drivers to assist us with delivery to our wholesale clients. You must have a full clean driving licence and be aged over 30.\r\n\r\nIn exchange for your time and energy volunteering with us, we can offer the opportunity to improve employability skills and give you driving experience. We offer references after you have volunteered with us for several months.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo experience is required but it would be helpful if you have previous customer service skills and you must have a clean driving licence.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nVery flexible volunteering hours. Recommended hours committed to volunteering approx 4 hours a week, yet it depends on the availability and interest of volunteers.\n\n## Travel details\n\nOur bakery, cafe and other venues are all in central Ayr and close to public transport. All travel expenses will be reimbursed.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel expenses paid and lunch & tea/coffee provided for a shift of more than 3 hours.\n\n## Taster details\n\nFeel free to contact us or drop by at the Narture Ayr Cafe 3 Cathcart Street, Ayr",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F20289068-8e22-7278-5132-b62ae3130893%2FXiQTI9rs8XhdfYu2EPhcBTs4his2%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=ffaf667b-eac2-4f1e-98a7-4c5551d0a3b0",
