            "name": "Camphill Wellbeing Trust",
            "description": "Camphill Wellbeing Trust is a registered Scottish charity supporting the wellbeing of patients and their families through an integrated, person-centred approach to health, education and social care.",
            "website": "https://www.camphillwellbeing.org.uk/",
            "cause": [
