            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000QNzcyAAD",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000QNzcyAAD/community-fridge-volunteers",
                    "publishStart": "2022-09-06",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-18",
                    "title": "Community Fridge volunteers",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nDo you care about reducing food waste and have a couple of hours free a week? Why not help Greener Orkney in their Kirkwall and Stromness community fridges?\r\n\r\nThe community fridge aims to reduce the amount of food waste going into landfill and will be stocked with ‘use by’ and ‘best before’ food given by the supermarkets and local businesses. Donations from the public are also accepted under certain circumstances.\r\n\r\nAs a community fridge volunteer you will be:\r\n- picking up the food from the supermarket (if you have transport)\r\n- Weighing and sorting the food\r\n- assisting members of the public coming to take food away\r\n\r\nFull training will be given and there is flexibility on evenings and cover for holidays or sickness etc.\n\n## Experience required\n\nWe are looking for volunteers with a passion for reducing food waste - could this be you?\n\n## Training details\n\nFull training will be available to include understanding the Greener Orkney Community Fridge Operations Manual and if interested training for the Level 2: Food Hygiene and Safety for Catering Qualification.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible. There are daytime and evening volunteering options to collect and stock fridge items.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F03909c97-667b-79fc-5375-c86803085158%2F47Tx2kdmwYfilSzPKnW1PvQyS0A2%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=8a5aa1ea-009d-4d72-a6c8-4709ccb0fa2e",
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000QNzcyAAD#role",
