                    "title": "Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nVarious volunteer roles are available: Donation Centre Driver; Gardener; Fundraising Support; E-Commerce Assistant; Retail Assistant and Corporate Volunteering.\r\n\r\nIf you are interested please e-mail: volunteer@ayrshirehospice.org",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
