                    "publishStart": "2026-10-20",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-11-14",
                    "title": "Join the Magic: Volunteer at the Paisley Christmas Lights Switch-On 2026",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nJoin the Magic: Volunteer at the Paisley Christmas Lights Switch-On 2026\n\n## Description\n\nCreate Christmas Magic: Volunteer at Paisley&#39;s Festive Switch-On\n\nWe are excited to invite you to register as a volunteer for the Paisley Christmas Lights Switch-On!\n\nEvent Details\n\n\nDate: 15th November\nLocation: Paisley Town Centre\nTime: Various shifts available throughout the day\n\n\nJoin us in helping bring festive cheer to Paisley and create a magical Christmas experience for thousands of residents and visitors. We are looking for enthusiastic volunteers to support the event team in delivering a safe, welcoming, and memorable celebration.\n\n&nbsp;\n\nVolunteer Roles\n\nEvent Information &amp; Welcome Volunteer\n\n\nWelcome visitors to the event.\nProvide directions and information about activities, entertainment, and facilities.\nHelp create a friendly and festive atmosphere throughout the town centre.\n\n\nAccessible Viewing Area Volunteer\n\n\nSupport visitors using the accessible viewing area.\nHelp ensure the space remains safe, welcoming, and accessible for all.\n\n\nStage &amp; Performance Support Volunteer\n\n\nSupport the stage management team with performer coordination.\nAssist community groups and performers before and after their stage appearances.",
