                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000IeZ1VYAV",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000IeZ1VYAV/johnstone-christmas-lights-switch-calling-all-festive-event-volunteers",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-20",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-11-29",
                    "title": "Johnstone Christmas Lights Switch - Calling all Festive Event Volunteers!",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nJohnstone Christmas Lights Switch - Calling all Festive Event Volunteers!\n\n## Description\n\nThe Renfrewshire Council events team is looking for festive event volunteers to help us Deliver Johnstone Christmas Lights Switch &ndash; On event. As a Christmas Elf volunteer, you will play a crucial role in creating a festive atmosphere during the event. Your responsibilities will include:\n\nAssisting with Santa&#39;s Grotto: Help manage the entry line, greet children and families, and ensure a magical experience as they meet Santa.\n\nHelping with the Inflatable Snow Globe: Assist visitors in and out of the snow globe, ensuring safety and enjoyment as they capture memorable photos.\n\nSupporting the face painting queue: Support the queue for the face painting tent, &nbsp;welcoming visitors, and ensure the queue runs efficiently and provide assistance to artists if needed.\n\nWhat We&rsquo;re Looking For:\n&bull;Friendly and enthusiastic volunteers who enjoy working with children and families.\n&bull;A willingness to help create a joyful and memorable experience for the community.\n&bull;Ability to work in a team and follow instructions from event coordinators.\n\nWhy Volunteer?\n&bull;Be part of a wonderful community event that brings joy to many.\n&bull;Gain valuable experience in event management and customer service.\n&bull;Enjoy the festive spirit of the season while making new friends!\n\nIf you&#39;re interested in spreading holiday cheer and being part of the Johnstone Christmas Lights event, we would love to have you on our team!",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
