                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000IeBaIYAV",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000IeBaIYAV/volunteer-at-the-renfrew-christmas-lights-switch-on-2026",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-20",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-11-21",
                    "title": "Volunteer at the Renfrew Christmas Lights Switch-On 2026!",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nVolunteer at the Renfrew Christmas Lights Switch-On 2026!\n\n## Description\n\nThe Events Team is looking for Festive Event Volunteers to help us spread Christmas magic in Renfrew!\n\nEvent: Renfrew Christmas Lights Switch-On\nDate: Saturday, 21st November 2026\nLocation: Renfrew Town Centre\n\nAs a festive event volunteer you will:\n\n\nHelp create a warm, festive, and welcoming atmosphere for visitors attending the event.\nSupport activities at Santa&rsquo;s Grotto, greeting families, managing queues, and helping children enjoy a magical visit with Santa.\nAssist with the Town Hall concert, panto and elf party, welcoming guests and carrying out ticket checks to ensure a smooth entry process.\nSupport the operation of the Inflatable Snow Globe, helping visitors safely enter and exit the attraction while capturing festive photographs.&nbsp;\nProvide information and directions to visitors throughout the event.\nWork closely with the Events Team to ensure activities run safely and efficiently.\nBe a friendly and festive presence, helping create memorable Christmas experiences for local families and visitors.\n\n\nIf you&#39;re interested in spreading holiday cheer and being part of the Renfrew Christmas Lights event, we would love to have you on our team!",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
