                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000V7M2JAAV",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000V7M2JAAV/gardens-and-grounds-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-04-14",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-12",
                    "title": "Gardens and Grounds Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nRiver Garden is a Scotland-based recovery community helping people rebuild their lives after alcohol and drug addiction. We provide a safe, structured environment where individuals can grow, heal, and move forward with purpose.\r\n\r\nWe appreciate and value the support given to us at RGA by volunteers. Our volunteers help and support our residents, garden, social enterprise projects and charity to grow and develop. They become part of the community, which is at the heart of River Garden.\r\n\r\nWe’re looking for passionate people to help our social enterprise grow.\r\nIn the Gardens: Help us tend our beautiful grounds and grow fresh food for our café and shop.\r\n\r\nBy joining us, you’ll help provide professional, real-world training for our residents.\r\nTo find out more about volunteering at River Garden, contact Yvonne, the Volunteer Coordinator at: yvonne@rivergarden.scot\r\nYou can find out more about our charity at: https://www.rivergarden.scot/",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F26e0f293-0769-377f-45ed-2ce047479350%2Fgpx6nnIWvxXFMLCpJdEzZH9maTg1%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=759cb3a8-18d1-4086-bdf9-7339bce96f57",
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000V7M2JAAV#role",
