        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/0010800002osQF1AAM",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/0010800002osQF1AAM/the-chatty-cafe-scheme",
            "name": "The Chatty Cafe Scheme",
            "description": "The Chatty Café Scheme aims to alleviate loneliness by encouraging conversation and interaction. In order to achieve this aim, we encourage cafes to designate ‘Chatter & Natter tables,’ run Chatty Café zoom sessions and set up weekly one-to-one phone calls with the help of our Chatty Volunteers.",
            "website": "https://thechattycafescheme.com/uk/",
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000AVlRWYA1",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000AVlRWYA1/chatty-cafe-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2025-06-23",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-16",
                    "title": "Chatty Cafe Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nMany people feel the need to get out and meet other people. The Chatty Cafe Scheme is addressing that need by creating \"Chatty Tables\" around the country, and for the last few weeks, people who have been coming in on a Tuesday morning to our Chatty Table cafe de Paulo in WASPS Creative Academy in Inverness, for a friendly chat and a drink. As they arrive, they are met by a volunteer who makes sure they feel welcome and that everything runs smoothly. We are looking for another volunteer. \r\n\r\nOur Chatty Table is proving popular and is making a real difference to people's lives, so if you enjoy meeting people and would like to spare two and a half hours a week to help, please contact Christine at ChattyCafeInverness@gmail.com. Thereafter, application will be via the Chatty Cafe Scheme website.\r\n\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61575080605247\n\n## Training details\n\nInitial online training from The Chatty Cafe Scheme, with further online training and ongoing support sessions",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F794d5bbe-ddfd-42c2-8303-aaf4f33e9b94%2FJqK8q7mcUtcgywKvmhEW9RRQbgy1%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=21f128de-c3ba-4c61-80b0-46feac0b62ca",
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000AVlRWYA1#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Chatty Cafe Volunteer",
                        "applyLink": "https://thechattycafescheme.co.uk/",
                        "allowsRemoteParticipation": false,
                        "minimumAge": "18",
                        "theme": [
                            {
                                "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Theme/LocalCommunity",
                                "skos:prefLabel": "Local Community"
                            }
                        ],
                        "reward": [
                            "https://ns.volunteeringdata.io/TrainingProvided"
                        ]
                    },
                    "session": {
                        "type": "Session",
                        "location": [
                            {
