                        "commitment": "On average a Coordinator undertakes around 8-12 hours of volunteering a month, \nthis can be flexible and fit around work and home commitments. Some of this will \nbe from home, other time will be spent meeting new volunteers and/or visiting local \norganisations and groups which could be in or out of work hours, in the evenings \nand/or weekends to suit your other commitments. This role requires a minimum commitment of 6 months.",
