                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000001ydyoYAA",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000001ydyoYAA/boys-brigade-activity-helper-coylton",
                    "publishStart": "2024-01-22",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-14",
                    "title": "Boys Brigade Activity Helper (Coylton)",
                    "description": "## Description\n\n1st Coylton Boys' Brigade are looking for enthusiastic volunteers to help lead games and sporty activities for their children and young people aged between 5 and 18 years old. The group meets on Wednesday evenings during term-time, taking part in a wide range of activities including crafts, games, sports, cooking, life skills and community projects.\n\n## Experience required\n\nA passion and enthusiasm to support children and young people experience new activities and learn new skills. Training will be provided.\n\n## Training details\n\nSafeguarding Training, E-Learning and Virtual/In Person Training Course on a range of topics. You will also be supported by other volunteers from the local group to help you settle into the role.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nVolunteers can help on a weekly, bi-weekly or monthly basis depending on your other commitments.\n\n## Travel details\n\nCoylton Chruch Halls",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-volunteerscotland-search.appspot.com/o/opportunities%2FKlxPbX8Ch5epIjYtxuPPFaNPYFs2%2FXMVj2JK9iwVh2Hu5-thumbnail.jpg?alt=media&token=d9fde735-fdc9-4173-b403-1852f59f045c",
