                    "description": "## Description\n\n8th Ayr Boys' Brigade are looking for enthusiastic volunteers to help lead games and sporty activities for their children and young people aged between 5 and 18 years old. The group meets on Friday evenings during term-time, taking part in a wide range of activities including crafts, games, sports, cooking, life skills and community projects.\n\n## Experience required\n\nA passion and enthusiasm to support children and young people experience new activities and learn new skills. Training will be provided.\n\n## Training details\n\nSafeguarding Training, E-Learning and Virtual/In Person Training Course on a range of topics. You will also be supported by other volunteers from the local group to help you settle into the role.\n\n## Travel details\n\nSt James Church Halls, Ayr",
