                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000DPKNSYA5",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000DPKNSYA5/cog-community-outreach-group-volunteers",
                    "publishStart": "2026-09-14",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-08",
                    "title": "COG: Community Outreach Group Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe at COG: Community Outreach Group give out food and hot drinks to anyone in need in Aberdeen city centre 6 evenings a week, we also run a cafe 2 mornings, Monday and Friday  and on a Sunday evening. COG is a well established non judgemental community outreach group, we are looking for anyone who wants to help in our mission.\r\n\r\nIf you think you would like to give it a try drop us an email at cogsecretary@hotmail.com  Thank you for your interest.\n\n## Training details\n\nInduction and on job training\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible times to volunteer. All help makes a real difference and is appreciated.\n\n## Travel details\n\n56 King Street, Aberdeen",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-volunteerscotland-search.appspot.com/o/opportunities%2F3KjMyf4ZGcg8D8NhaCpb56Sqif72%2FqPP1yQgAlJC4qkvi-thumbnail.jpg?alt=media&token=a7afbf5b-1758-4096-ad32-53d8f4de6db6",
