            "name": "Active Schools (South Ayrshire)",
            "description": "To offer sport and physical activity opportunities to young people and families in the Prestwick cluster area, to enable life long participation to help people grow well, live well and age well. Especially after covid, we want to be able to offer out lots of opportunities to kids who have missed so much and can only do that through the help of volunteers!",
