                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000I1rPhYAJ/north-berwick-bookshop-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-09-16",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-15",
                    "title": "North Berwick Bookshop Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nThis role helps in creating a friendly, welcoming and helpful environment in our secondhand bookshop in North Berwick. The bookshop sits within our large shop on Westgate, in the centre of North Berwick which also includes a café, art gallery and new gifts.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo Expertise Retail / Customer Service\n\n## Training details\n\nFull training in volunteering in a bookshop including pricing and operating the till\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nCommitment 6 Months 3 Hours, Weekly\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nMonthly via BACS",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
