                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000007mP4vYAE",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000007mP4vYAE/north-berwick-cafe-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-09-16",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-15",
                    "title": "North Berwick Café Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nThe purpose of this role is to provide a café service for the local community and visitors to North Berwick. The Café sits within our secondhand bookshop, art gallery and new gifts shop on Westgate in the centre of North Berwick.\r\nOur aim is to provide a welcoming, friendly, attractive space for people to meet together with friends and family or just come in for a quiet coffee on their own.\r\nWe aim to maintain a high level of professional service and cleanliness.\n\n## Experience required\n\nCatering / Hospitality\r\nCleaning / Tidying / Sorting\r\nRetail / Customer Service\r\nCaring\r\nGood Communicator\r\nGood Listener\r\nHard Working\r\nOpen minded\r\nOrganised\r\nPatient\r\nPractical\r\nReliable / Dependable\r\nSociable\r\nTeam Player\r\nTrustworthy",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
