                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000007xm30YAA",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000007xm30YAA/north-berwick-catering-assistant-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-09-16",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-15",
                    "title": "North Berwick Catering Assistant Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nThis is an opportunity to be part of our North Berwick café team who are committed to providing customers with a high quality, person centred and safe catering service.\r\nVolunteering alongside our chef, you will be involved in the preparation of food and drink, including sandwiches, salads, paninis, soup, scones and cakes and will contribute to the operation & cleanliness of the catering area.\n\n## Training details\n\nFull training is given including Food Hygiene and Allergens\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nMonthly via BACS",
