                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-17",
                    "title": "Social Wellbeing Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nOur Compassionate Wellbeing Service provides a range of person centred inpatient and community-based activities in the Hospice and we are now delighted to offer a new social group in Prestonpans Library. We will meet on Tuesday mornings and offer local people living with a palliative diagnosis the opportunity to come together for some good company and coffee and cake. Carers are very welcome too.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo Expertise tactful and sensitive, understand confidentiality",
