                    "publishStart": "2025-03-13",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-10",
                    "title": "Volunteer Golf Buddy",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nVolunteer Golf Buddies assist our activators support our golf clients. No golf experience necessary, training provided.  We have centres in Glasgow, Stirling and Edinburgh.\r\n\r\nPlease register your interest to arrange a chat or visit one of our sessions.\n\n## Travel details\n\nVarious locations in and around south Glasgow, Edinburgh and Stirling.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nExpenses not paid",
