                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HvFtNYAV",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HvFtNYAV/community-golf-activators",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-31",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-11-30",
                    "title": "Community Golf Activators",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWHAT DOES A COMMUNITY GOLF ACTIVATOR DO?\n• Lead warm, welcoming weekly golf sessions for people in your local community\n• Welcome new members into the Golf in Society family\n• Inspire and support a team of local volunteers\n• Be a kind, compassionate and respected face of your community\n\nWHY BECOME A CGA?\nThis isn't just a role - it's a chance to give something back through the sport you love.\n• See the difference you make, week after week\n• Use your love of golf for real purpose\n• A flexible role that fits around your life\nFull training and ongoing support, every step of the way\n\nGIVE BACK THROUGH GOLF\nGet in touch to find out more about the opportunities to get involved as\n\n## Experience required\n\nAt Golf in Society, we run welcoming Golf Health Hubs at local golf clubs — inclusive spaces where people living with long-term conditions, along with carers and families, can move more, connect with others, and rediscover joy.\n\nNo experience needed — just a place to belong, feel better, and take the first step.\n\n## Training details\n\nFull training and expenses paid\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nWeekly\n\n## Travel details\n\nStrathclyde Park Gokf Centre\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nActivator paid 17.50 per hour",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-volunteerscotland-search.appspot.com/o/opportunities%2FroyCPd50IeUu6PqjU2Pr4KNW9mi1%2FT2vGwapFew89654b-thumbnail.jpg?alt=media&token=c93d7c4a-d69d-49b7-b519-fc3dfc978fbe",
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HvFtNYAV#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Community Golf Activators",
