                    "title": "Performance music volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nVolunteers required to deliver high quality musical performances to patients (usually in ward settings) to provide stimulation, distraction and boast mood to aid wellbeing and recovery\r\nWe are not looking for applications forms at this time just an email to NHS Lothian Charity: loth.charity@nhs.scot\r\nThere will be an audition in the first instance.\r\nTo play acoustic instrument eg guitar or violin.\r\nCompile set list and engage in conversation with patients.\r\nProvide brief summary of performance to the Tonic Arts Team\n\n## Experience required\n\nArts / Music / Drama / Crafts\r\nLiteracy / Numeracy\r\nCaring\r\nCreative\r\nGood Communicator\r\nGood Listener\r\nOrganised\r\nPatient\r\nReliable / Dependable\r\nSociable\r\nTeam Player\n\n## Travel expenses\n\npaid monthly",
