                    "publishStart": "2022-12-20",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-15",
                    "title": "Volunteer Match Reporter",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nCan you support Carrick Rugby? Do you enjoy spending time with a rugby team and report writing? We need volunteer match reporters and it would be the perfect volunteering opportunity for you.\r\n\r\nReporter responsibilities include:\r\n- collecting and verifying newsworthy information\r\n- assembling information into a stable story\r\n- writing and delivering news stories with the readers' perspective in mind \r\n- accompany the youth and senior teams during the tournament (matches, activities and events) and report\n\n## Experience required\n\nThe following skills would be ideal yet this volunteering opportunity might help to develop and improve these skills.\r\n- Ability to gather, write and edit news\r\n- Broad knowledge \r\n- Computer literate \r\n- Excellent communication, lobbying and active listening skills\r\n- Integrity and morality",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F78626519-34d7-2d5b-8e02-d2ae0a645e57%2FXiQTI9rs8XhdfYu2EPhcBTs4his2%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=50e10cde-ed41-4f9a-aebc-6e714b9a46cc",
