                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000OUvqRAAT",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000OUvqRAAT/volunteer-driver-carrick",
                    "publishStart": "2020-10-21",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-16",
                    "title": "Volunteer Driver (Carrick)",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAs we cover the whole of Carrick (North and South) transport is a huge issue and cost for the club. Could you help us by driving SACT or Community minibuses? This will allow us to offer transport links to rural areas and give young people in these areas the opportunity to participate in our fantastic sport and committed community club.\r\nFor this role full membership of the PVG scheme is mandatory but we can organise that free of charge through the SRU. You will be fully supported by our club committee, volunteers and players. The time commitment for coaching is generally approx. 5 hours per week including 1 weekday evening and either Saturday or Sunday mornings during term time,  you will primarily be associated with one year group.\r\n\r\nContact us on carrickrugby@gmail.com please mark Volunteering in the subject line and have a look at our Facebook pages to see what our amazing volunteers support:   @carrickrugby and @ Carrick Micro/minis\r\n\r\nPlease note: only drivers between the ages of 25 and 75 with two full years of driving experience and who have or are willing to complete MiDAS training within 12 months will be permitted to drive the minibuses. Over the age of 70, drivers must have completed a PCV medical in order to continue driving any minibus.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2Fd5a4d909-1674-47f8-161a-ad0cd2193c1a%2FXiQTI9rs8XhdfYu2EPhcBTs4his2%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=f0053769-c390-4b44-b899-2eee5bc748f8",
                    "role": {
