            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/0010800002mxM51AAE",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/0010800002mxM51AAE/ayrshire-council-on-alcohol-south-ayrshire",
            "name": "Ayrshire Council on Alcohol (South Ayrshire)",
            "description": "Ayrshire Council on Alcohol offers a free one-to-one confidential service to individuals who are concerned about their drinking. Counsellors trained to professional standards work with people whether they wish to abstain from alcohol or reduce their drinking to less harmful levels.\r\n \r\nA family service is also available to those whose lives are affected by someone else’s drinking",
