        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/0010800002mxeMmAAI",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/0010800002mxeMmAAI/sisg",
            "name": "SISG",
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000004bRJtYAM",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000004bRJtYAM/board-members",
                    "publishStart": "2024-07-15",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-22",
                    "title": "Board Members",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAs SISG, we currently have 14 hearing hubs in Ayr, Prestwick, Troon, Girvan, Alloway, Largs, Arran, West Kilbride, Saltcoats, Kilwinning, Cumnock, Kilmaurs, Galston and Kilmarnock. We also support 27 battery pick up points across North, South and East Ayrshire libraries.  We also carry out visits to over 2,000 older people with hearing and/or sight loss throughout North, South and East Ayrshire each year. We wouldn't be able to carry out all this work without the help and support of our volunteers.\r\n\r\nNew Board Members for Local Charity\r\nS.I.S.G Charity based in Ayr are looking for new Board members who would be able to attend\r\nmonthly board meetings in Ayr.  The time commitment would be 1.5hrs each month and the meetings take place at our offices in Suite 4, Beresford Court, Beresford Lane in Ayr. Travel expenses will be given for any travel involved in this voluntary role.\r\nPrevious volunteering experience, social or health care experience, business experience would be beneficial.\r\nFor more information about this role please contact Denise McClung (Project Manager)\r\non denise@sisg.co.uk and check out the charity website for more information www.sisg.co.uk",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2Fba671212-3f4f-4495-4411-117a1e8b74b8%2FXiQTI9rs8XhdfYu2EPhcBTs4his2%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=e07199de-8075-4ceb-b5c7-c9f5b7085138",
