                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000Vup4vAAB",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000Vup4vAAB/e-bike-project-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2023-06-19",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-15",
                    "title": "E-bike Project Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nDo you have an interest in cycling?\r\nWould you like to spend time running an e-bike project?\r\nWould you like to get experience in e-bike maintenance?\r\n\r\nVolunteer with us, by supporting our cycling project in Maybole. Responsibilities might include:\r\n- helping out during cycling events\r\n- dispatching bikes from the Carrick Centre, Maybole and/or Kirkmichael\r\n- picking up bikes from different localities around the North Carrick area\r\n- cleaning and up keeping of e-bikes after and before rentals\r\n- communicating with people hiring e-bikes\r\n- give a short demonstration/explanation of using an e-bike before rental\n\n## Experience required\n\nWe welcome interest from any age group and we would favour anyone with an interest and some experience of cycling and bike maintenance. The ideal volunteer would be willing to work with people and promote our organisation.  Due to some duties, the ideal volunteer would also have a driving license and owns a vehicle. Mileage expenses would be paid.",
