            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/0010800002myb7BAAQ/barra-thrift-shop",
            "name": "Barra Thrift Shop",
            "description": "Barra Thrift shop is the local charity shop on Barra.  It receives any goods donated by the community and resells them.  Any monies made is then donated to local organisations and charities.",
            "cause": [
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/CharityShop",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Charity Shop"
                }
            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000VhvbCAAR",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000VhvbCAAR/thrift-shop-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2023-10-31",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-26",
                    "title": "Thrift Shop Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWorking in local charity shop.  Variety of tasks to do including sorting through donations of clothing, toys, bric a brac, shoes and electronics.  Keeping the rail/shelves tidy and clean and well stocked. Selling to customers at the desk. Occasionally help with hoovering and general cleaning.  We would like to work with your strengths.\n\n## Experience required\n\nEnjoy working with other people.\r\nFriendly manner and enjoy meeting the public.\r\nEnthusiastic, willing  and committed.\r\nReliable. Turn up on rota time or find a replacement.\r\nFull support from other members of staff\n\n## Training details\n\nOther volunteers within the Thrift Shop are very happy to give support and guidance.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nHours vary depending if Summer Mid June- Mid August) or Winter.  Rota is in place for volunteers. 2 hours",
