                }
            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000SsKswAAF",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000SsKswAAF/treasurer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Treasurer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe are a local charity in Aberdeen (Registered Charity SC049024).  We raise vital funds for Orchard Brae school which is a school for children with multiple and complex additional support needs. More information is available at https://orchardbrae.aberdeen.sch.uk/parents/friends-of-orchard-brae/ and www.facebook.com/friendsoforchardbrae \r\n\r\nWe are seeking a treasurer, a valuable part of the committee which is made up purely of volunteers.  This is a great opportunity to enhance the education of children with disabilities. All help makes a real difference and is greatly appreciated.\r\n\r\nFor more information please contact Lisa Simons (Chairperson) at email friendsoforchardbrae@mail.com or telephone 07708801886.\n\n## Training details\n\nRelevant guidance and excellent support is provided to all volunteers. Includes an initial handover from current treasurer and anything that's thought to help in the future.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible times available to assist. All help makes a difference and is greatly appreciated.\n\n## Travel details\n\nBased in Aberdeen, we meet once a term (usually 4/5 times a year).  Meetings are held at the school or online.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000SsKswAAF#role",
