                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000AzNWbYAN",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000AzNWbYAN/gardening-volunteers",
                    "publishStart": "2026-06-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-14",
                    "title": "Gardening Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nWe are looking for help with our lovely small garden area at AberNecessities (located at Abernecessities, Grove House, Howe Moss Road, Dyce, AB21 0ER).  It is a great spot for all our volunteers and staff to take a bit of time out away from their work stations.  If anyone interested in gardening had any spare time perhaps a few hours per week or even fortnightly and could help with weeding the garden we would be very grateful.  \r\n\r\nA fantastic opportunity to help in a garden and with a major charity. For more information please contact Karen Macangus, Volunteer Co-ordinator at email: karen@abernecessities.co.uk or telephone: 01224 784000\n\n## Description\n\nWe are looking for help with our lovely small garden area at AberNecessities (located at Abernecessities, Grove House, Howe Moss Road, Dyce, AB21 0ER).  It is a great spot for all our volunteers and staff to take a bit of time out away from their work stations.  If anyone interested in gardening had any spare time perhaps a few hours per week or even fortnightly and could help with weeding the garden we would be very grateful.  \r\n\r\nA fantastic opportunity to help in a garden and with a major charity. For more information please contact Karen Macangus, Volunteer Co-ordinator at email: karen@abernecessities.co.uk or telephone: 01224 784000\r\n\r\nMore information about Abernecessities is also available at https://www.abernecessities.co.uk/\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible times available to help. All help makes a difference and is greatly appreciated.\n\n## Travel details\n\nThe garden is located at Abernecessities, Grove House, Howe Moss Road, Dyce, AB21 0ER",
