                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g1p00000LExPoAAL",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g1p00000LExPoAAL/video-maker-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2020-02-07",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-31",
                    "title": "Video Maker Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nAerial Art House is looking for a video maker to produce a video for a crowdfunding platform. \nThe Video Producer will be responsible for leading on, creating and delivering compelling video content for Aerial Art House\n\n## Description\n\nAerial Art House is looking for a video maker to produce a video for a crowdfunding platform. \nThe Video Producer will be responsible for leading on, creating and delivering compelling video content for Aerial Art House\n\n## Experience required\n\n-Able to demonstrate some video production experience (gained at university or privately)\n-Proficient in Adobe Creative Cloud and a confident and experienced self-shooter and editor\n-Strong communication skills\n-Focused & organised\n-Have their own camera (access to the editing software will be provided)\n\n## Training details\n\nYou will be introduced to the venue and to all activities we run. We will talk you through the projects we have in mind. We will assist you with the creation of the video.\n\n## Travel details\n\nAerial Art House\n\n40 Restalrig Drive\nEH7 6JF\nEDINBURGH\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nNo expenses paid.",
