                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000QhisVAAR",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000QhisVAAR/event-assistant",
                    "publishStart": "2023-08-09",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-31",
                    "title": "Event Assistant",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nWe're looking for people to help run various community events organised by Action Porty, usually taking place at or nearby Bellfield Community Hub in Portobello. This includes a variety of roles . If you'd like to support us with these events, we can always find a role that adapts to you!\n\n## Description\n\nAction Porty are looking for event volunteers who can help with one or a number of different community events. Previous events have included Porty's Christmas Lights 'Switch On', a street festival celebrating bikes, Porty Flea fleamarket and concerts. This role varies depending on which community events are planned. Events may be indoors or outdoors.\n\n## Experience required\n\nMinimum requirements: ability to follow instructions and communicate with organisers and other volunteers.\nDesirable skills: working as part of a team; ability to take initiative when needed; adaptable to different tasks; speaking clearly to issue instructions to members of the public.\n\n## Training details\n\nGenerally there will be information sent by email or given over the phone and a briefing at the beginning of the event or beginning of a shift.\n\n## Travel details\n\nBellfield,16A&B Bellfield St, Edinburgh EH15 2BP. \nBellfield is a vibrant community space in the heart of Portobello. Formerly Portobello Old Parish Church, Bellfield offers hire space for  every occasion and a programme of regular classes and events. Since opening in June 2018 following a community buy-out, our halls have become a hub for Portobello's lively community, providing a local venue for people to come together to meet ,play and celebrate. Buses: Bellfield is 0.1 mile from nearest bus stop for buses 26,45,19 and 0.4 mile from Portobello Town Hall bus stop for buses 21,49,12.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nWe can provide pre-paid bus tickets.",
