                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Lunchtime Care Van Volunteer",
                        "description": "A volunteer should be able to;\nListen & communicate clearly\nWork as part of a team\nRemain patient & calm\nWork within appropriate boundaries\n\nVolunteers should be sympathetic with the aims of Bethany Christian Trust as expressed in its mission and values statements (found on our website)",
