                    "title": "Cooking/Baking Group Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nLooking for someone who has a keen interest in cooking and or baking to lead a cooking/baking class at our wellbeing hub in Penicuik. You would be in charge of a small group of less than 10 to show them how to prep and cook/make recipes.\n\n## Experience required\n\nConfident enough to lead a small group of people of ages from 16 to 70.\r\nEnjoys cooking and baking and cooks at home.\n\n## Travel details\n\nOn a bus route. Bus 140, 141, 37, 47, x62, 101 all stop outside.",
