                    "description": "## Description\n\nMidlothian pantry and  wellbeing  hub is a community run food initiative in response to the  community needs we provide a affordable food shop and safe place with a café volunteers help  to set up and move stock and greet our customers and help them with they shopping and  operate the till as well.\n\n## Travel details\n\nbus  37  47  140 141 101 x62",
