                    "title": "Knitting Group",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nLooking for someone who has knitting knowledge and is confident in leading a Knitting group. We will supply wool and knitting equipment and can also supply patterns but welcome to knit anything you like.\r\n\r\nContact Amy Campbell email wellbeing.coordinator@foodfactsfriends.org.uk for more details.\n\n## Experience required\n\nConfident enough to lead a small group of people of ages from 16 to 70.\r\nEnjoys knitting and has experience in knitting.\n\n## Travel details\n\nBuses 140, 141, 37, 47, x62, 101 all stop outside.",
