            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/0011p00002CIxYVAA1/common-weal-aberdeen",
            "name": "Common Weal Aberdeen",
            "description": "Common Weal Aberdeen is an Aberdeen based not for profit group. We are loosely associated with the wider Common Weal group covering Scotland but we decide how our local group operates and feed into the national group.",
            "website": "https://commonweal.scot/local-groups/common-weal-aberdeen",
            "cause": [
