                    "title": "Peer Support Volunteers (Textline)",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nMIKEYSLINE VOLUNTEERING OPPORTUNITIES \r\nJOIN OUR TEXTLINE PEER SUPPORT VOLUNTEER TEAM\r\n\r\n*Do you have a few hours to spare one or two evenings a month?\r\n*Are you looking for a volunteer role which will let you give back by helping those in need of support?\r\n*Would mental health related training assist you with your studies and career progression?\r\nTo find out more or to arrange a chat please email enquiries@mikeysline.co.uk and we will get back to you or visit https://getinvolved.mikeysline.co.uk/volunteer-with-us/\n\n## Training details\n\nFull induction training and ongoing support is provided",
