                    "publishStart": "2023-09-04",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-01",
                    "title": "IT Support",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nTo provide a timely, effective, free and impartial advice and assistance on a one-off or short-term basis, to disabled or older people to resolve their computer related issues in their home and/or remotely.\n\n## Description\n\nAs an IT Support volunteer you will provide a timely, effective, free and impartial advice and assistance on a one-off or short-term basis, to disabled or older people to resolve their computer related issues in their home and/or remotely.\n\n## Experience required\n\nGood IT and computer skills; Good knowledge of standard hardware operating systems and software;  Good interpersonal and communication skills;  Access to a computer and email facilities; Own transport or appropriate public transport links.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nCan commit, on average, 2 hours per week, but role is flexible depending on client requests/needs.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel expenses incurred on behalf of ITCanHelp will be reimbursed",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
