                    "publishStart": "2026-08-25",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-22",
                    "title": "Community Outreach Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nThe Community Outreach Volunteer Charity Worker supports frontline charitable activities by engaging directly with individuals and families within the local community. The role involves assisting with community information sessions, signposting beneficiaries to appropriate support services, supporting food and wellbeing outreach initiatives, and helping reduce social isolation among vulnerable groups. The volunteer works under supervision and contributes to promoting inclusion, community participation, and access to essential charitable services.\n\n## Experience required\n\nInterest in community activities, teamwork, and commitment to charitable objectives. Volunteers must demonstrate availability, cultural sensitivity, willingness to support others, and ability to work collaboratively.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible\n\n## Travel details\n\nHilton Convention Centre, 13 Smithfield Road, AB24 4NR",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-volunteerscotland-search.appspot.com/o/opportunities%2F4pQJCF0rsjbsvZCpV0WypaqzWam1%2FLwkPAEdHzP5WDVyy-thumbnail.jpg?alt=media&token=13a7dd10-9c04-4981-9631-24531d8d4520",
