                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Event Coordinator",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe are looking for enthusiastic Event Coordinators to help plan and execute community events. You will be responsible for coordinating logistics, managing volunteer teams, and liaising with partners to ensure successful events.\n\nResponsibilities:\n\nPlan and organize community events such as meet and greets, cultural festivals, and workshops.\nCoordinate event logistics, including venue setup and teardown.\nManage volunteer teams and delegate tasks effectively.\nLiaise with partners and vendors to ensure smooth event execution.\n\n## Experience required\n\nStrong organizational and project management skills.\nExcellent communication and leadership abilities.\nAbility to work under pressure and meet deadlines.\nFlexibility to work evenings and weekends as needed.\n\n## Travel details\n\nAberdeen",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
