                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000003u5EbYAI",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000003u5EbYAI/volunteer-driver",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Volunteer Driver",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe are seeking Volunteer Drivers to assist with the transportation of goods, supplies, and individuals for the Mamacita Foundation. Your role will be crucial in ensuring that our food bank deliveries, community outreach materials, and event setups run smoothly.\n\nResponsibilities:\n\nTransport food parcels, supplies, and equipment to various locations.\nAssist with loading and unloading goods.\nEnsure timely and safe delivery of items.\nOccasionally transport volunteers and clients to and from events or services.\nMaintain accurate logs of trips and deliveries.\n\n## Experience required\n\nValid driving license and clean driving record.\nReliable and punctual with a strong sense of responsibility.\nAbility to handle physical tasks such as loading and unloading items.\nGood navigation skills and knowledge of local areas.\nExcellent interpersonal skills and a friendly demeanor.\n\n## Travel details\n\nAberdeen\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nMileage",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-volunteerscotland-search.appspot.com/o/opportunities%2F2MwPF5yVuafuRWZmJnwbkWOFay02%2FBzYhkaSInQ4f4lnA-thumbnail.jpg?alt=media&token=dcb90e47-b94d-4097-9fc6-882737548bbd",
