                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000003uftCYAQ",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000003uftCYAQ/volunteer-welfare-worker",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Volunteer Welfare Worker",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nMamacita Foundation is seeking compassionate and dedicated Volunteer Welfare Workers to support the well-being of our volunteers. The role involves providing emotional support, ensuring volunteers have the resources they need, and promoting a positive and supportive volunteering environment.\n\nResponsibilities:\n\nProvide emotional support and a listening ear to volunteers.\nAddress any concerns or issues raised by volunteers and escalate if necessary.\nEnsure volunteers are aware of and have access to necessary resources and training.\nPromote a positive and inclusive volunteering environment.\nConduct regular check-ins with volunteers to monitor their well-being.\nAssist with the organization of volunteer appreciation events and activities.\nMaintain confidentiality and handle sensitive information with care.\n\n## Experience required\n\nStrong interpersonal and communication skills.\nEmpathetic and compassionate approach.\nAbility to handle sensitive situations with discretion and professionalism.\nPrevious experience in a welfare, support, or counseling role is a plus.\nReliable and committed to supporting the well-being of others.\nAbility to work independently and as part of a team.\nBenefits:\n\nMake a positive impact on the lives of volunteers.\nGain experience in welfare and support roles.\nWork in a supportive and collaborative environment.\nTraining and support provided by the Mamacita Foundation.\nFlexible schedule to accommodate your availability.\n\n## Travel details\n\nAberdeen",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-volunteerscotland-search.appspot.com/o/opportunities%2F2MwPF5yVuafuRWZmJnwbkWOFay02%2FGT9dyq2GWV6BIIKN-thumbnail.jpg?alt=media&token=1b3daad7-9032-475f-bea7-04bd5c763300",
