                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000EmYk5YAF",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000EmYk5YAF/creative-crafts-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Creative Crafts Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe are looking for a creative and enthusiastic volunteer to support children and young people through fun, inclusive arts, crafts, and DIY activities. This role helps young people build confidence, express themselves creatively, and feel connected in a safe and supportive environment.\n\nYou will work alongside our team to deliver structured and informal creative sessions that promote wellbeing, social skills, and positive engagement.\n\n## Experience required\n\nCreative, arts, crafts, or DIY skills (formal or informal)\n\nEnjoy working with children and young people\n\nPatient, friendly, and encouraging approach\n\nAbility to communicate clearly and positively\n\nReliability and commitment to weekly sessions\n\nNo formal qualifications required – passion and creativity matter most.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nMinimum 3 hrs weekly\n\n## Travel details\n\nHilton Convention Centre, 13 Smithfield Road, AB24 4NR",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-volunteerscotland-search.appspot.com/o/opportunities%2F4pQJCF0rsjbsvZCpV0WypaqzWam1%2FY3sMn6cHJxVfx0jk-thumbnail.jpg?alt=media&token=1caf5d11-512c-49db-8947-b07d53f5239a",
