                    "title": "Volunteer Welfare Worker",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAs a Volunteer Welfare Worker, you will work alongside a dedicated team to support the Mamacita Foundation Food Bank Project and Community Outreach initiatives. Your role will involve direct engagement with food distribution activities and community support programs.\n\n## Experience required\n\nCompassionate and community-focused mindset.\nAbility to work well in a team environment.\nGood communication and interpersonal skills.\nWillingness to handle food safely and follow hygiene protocols.\n\n## Travel details\n\nHilton Convention Centre, 13 Smithfield Road, AB24 4NR",
