                    "title": "Emergency Food Bank Volunteer Driver",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nMamacita Foundation is looking for compassionate and reliable volunteer drivers to support our emergency food bank service in Aberdeen. Your help will ensure that food reaches families and individuals facing hardship.\n\n## Experience required\n\nClean and Full Uk Driving License\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nSunday food parcel deliveries\n\n## Travel details\n\nHilton Convention Centre",
