                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Assistant Food Bank Coordinator",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nMamacita Foundation is looking for a dedicated Assistant Food Bank Coordinator to support our emergency food distribution efforts in Aberdeen. If you're passionate about helping others and have strong organizational skills, this role is for you\n\n## Experience required\n\n✅ Assist with coordinating food collection and distribution\n✅ Support volunteer drivers and food bank staff\n✅ Keep track of stock levels and ensure smooth operations\n✅ Help with admin tasks and community outreach\n\n## Travel details\n\nHilton Convention Centre",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-volunteerscotland-search.appspot.com/o/opportunities%2FrCwMyvl0W5amNTM7QlAVsy0VOmz2%2Fvn9yISFlWrnc2clD-thumbnail.jpg?alt=media&token=8d60ea19-db63-4833-a37e-40937271ca78",
