            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000003OmRaYAK",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000003OmRaYAK/various-exciting-volunteer-roles",
                    "publishStart": "2026-07-30",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-22",
                    "title": "Various Exciting Volunteer Roles",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nNow that our Salvation Army Donation in Hamilton has been open since the 09th May 2024, we continue to require volunteers for various roles.\n\nWe still require the following roles filled:\nTill operator, shop floor assistant, eBay Lister, drivers mate, stock processor to name but a few. \n\nPlease feel free to drop in and speak to the team about the volunteer opportunities and get a feel for charity retail.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo Expertise, Caring,Creative,Good Communicator,Patient,Practical,Reliable / Dependable,Sociable,Team Player,Trustworthy,No skills are required as training will be provided, but a knowledge of specific roles would be ideal such as social media/EBay, for the social media/eBay roles\n\n## Training details\n\nAn initial induction will be completed with further training in your specific role\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nThe trading hours are 9am to 5pm, so feel free to volunteer within these hours.\n\n## Travel details\n\nThe opportunity takes place at multiple location across South Lanarkshire \nAcross South Lanarkshire,Blantyre,Cambuslang,East Kilbride,Glasgow,Hamilton,Rutherglen,Airdrie,North Lanarkshire\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nReasonable expenses will be provided and a minimum of 4hrs on a specific day preferably for travelling expenses",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
