                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000Vhw8wAAB",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000Vhw8wAAB/rutherglen-charity-shop-various-retail-volunteer-roles",
                    "publishStart": "2026-06-29",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-18",
                    "title": "Rutherglen Charity Shop - Various Retail volunteer roles",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nThere are many roles available from the shop floor to the back of house.\nWe have book Specialist, media specialist, visual merchandising specialist, jewellery specialist or you can be involved in the processing and selection of stock.  We also require shop floor assistants, whether operating the till or carrying out rotation/recovery of items or simply just keeping the shop floor nice and clean for the customers. \nTraining and support will be provided whether you have been involved in retail or not and we would love to utilize your knowledge, and background.\nCome and join our shop team and make a difference.\n\n## Experience required\n\nRetail / Customer Service, Good Communicator,\n\n## Training details\n\nInitial induction with specific training dependent on the volunteer role.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible; to suit volunteer This applies to expense payment frequency\n\n## Travel details\n\nThe opportunity takes place at multiple location across South Lanarkshire \nBlantyre,East Kilbride,Glasgow,Rutherglen,Airdrie,North Lanarkshire\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nReasonable expenses are reimbursed",
