                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000VhvgvAAB/trustee",
                    "publishStart": "2023-04-27",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Trustee",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe are open to applications from individuals who have a general interest in our work and are keen to make a difference, but specific skills in relation to HR and legal issues would be particularly welcome Board meetings take place six times a year and last between one and two hours, starting at 530pm on Thursday’s. Members typically also join one of four sub-groups (Operational, HR, Finance, Policy and Compliance) which meet four times a year. Currently, the meetings take place online via zoom.\n\n## Experience required\n\nWe are open to applications from individuals who have a general interest in our work and are keen to make a difference, but specific skills in relation to HR and legal issues would be particularly welcome.\n\n## Training details\n\nEvery board member will receive induction, ongoing training and support.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nSix meetings a year which last between 1-2 hours.\n\n## Travel details\n\nNo travel required, this is an online opportunity via Zoom",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
