                        "commitment": "We require all our volunteers to follow the same weekly pattern as routine is important to our students. \nUpmo is open Monday - Friday 10am to 4pm, our volunteers can discuss times that would work for them with the Operational Services Coordinator and come to an agreement that works for both Upmo and the Volunteer.",
