        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/0010800003D61GSAAZ",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/0010800003D61GSAAZ/megans-space-scio",
            "name": "Megan's Space SCIO",
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000FtegwYAB",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000FtegwYAB/centre-support-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-09-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-15",
                    "title": "Centre Support Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nThe Volunteer Centre Support Volunteer helps ensure the centre runs smoothly by welcoming visitors and assisting with light organisational and cleaning duties. This role helps create a warm, comfortable, and safe environment for young people attending sessions\n\n## Description\n\nMegan’s Space is a mental health charity supporting children and young people who are struggling with their mental health. We provide one-to-one counselling sessions, have practitioners working within schools, deliver workshops to primary and academy schools, attend information sessions, hold fundraising events and run youth groups designed to create safe and supportive spaces for young people.\r\n\r\n\r\nOur centre is a welcoming place where young people and families can access support. Volunteers play an important role in helping us maintain a calm, friendly environment for everyone who visits.\r\n\r\n\r\nPurpose of the Role\r\n\r\n\r\nThe Volunteer Centre Support Volunteer helps ensure the centre runs smoothly by welcoming visitors and assisting with light organisational and cleaning duties. This role helps create a warm, comfortable, and safe environment for young people attending sessions.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000FtegwYAB#role",
                        "type": "Role",
