                                "type": "Location",
                                "name": "North Ayrshire"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                },
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000Ftie5YAB",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000Ftie5YAB/volunteer-cleaner",
                    "publishStart": "2026-09-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-15",
                    "title": "Volunteer Cleaner",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nThe Volunteer Cleaning Assistant helps ensure the Megan’s Space centre remains clean, tidy, and comfortable for young people attending counselling sessions, youth groups, and workshops.\n\n## Description\n\nMegan’s Space is a mental health charity supporting children and young people who are struggling with their mental health. We provide one-to-one counselling sessions, have practitioners working within schools, deliver workshops to primary and academy schools, and run youth groups designed to create safe and supportive spaces for young people.\r\n\r\n\r\nMaintaining a clean, calm and welcoming environment is extremely important for the young people and families who visit our centre.\r\n\r\n\r\nPurpose of the Role\r\n\r\n\r\nThe Volunteer Cleaning Assistant helps ensure the Megan’s Space centre remains clean, tidy, and comfortable for young people attending counselling sessions, youth groups, and workshops.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000Ftie5YAB#role",
