                            }
                        ]
                    }
                },
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000FtkXpYAJ",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000FtkXpYAJ/youth-group-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-09-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-15",
                    "title": "Youth Group Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nThe Youth Group Volunteer supports staff in delivering safe, welcoming, and engaging youth group sessions. Volunteers help create a positive environment where young people feel comfortable, supported, and included.\n\n## Description\n\nMegan’s Space is a mental health charity supporting children and young people who are struggling with their mental health. We provide one-to-one counselling sessions, have practitioners working within schools, deliver workshops to primary and academy schools, and run youth groups designed to create safe and supportive spaces for young people.\r\n\r\n\r\nOur youth groups give young people the opportunity to connect with others, build confidence, and take part in activities that support positive mental wellbeing.\r\n\r\n\r\nPurpose of the Role\r\n\r\n\r\nThe Youth Group Volunteer supports staff in delivering safe, welcoming, and engaging youth group sessions. Volunteers help create a positive environment where young people feel comfortable, supported, and included.",
