            "name": "Positive Help",
            "description": "To relieve the suffering and distress of adults and children in Edinburgh and the Lothian area who are infected or affected by HIV/ AIDS and Hepatitis C and their families, friends and carers.",
            "website": "https://www.positivehelpedinburgh.co.uk/",
