                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD0000086jnRYAQ",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD0000086jnRYAQ/fundraising-support-volunteers",
                    "publishStart": "2025-01-23",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-03",
                    "title": "Fundraising Support Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nVolunteer with Friends of the Broadway Prestwick.\r\n\r\nFriends of the Broadway Prestwick is a community group dedicated to bringing the former Broadway Cinema in Prestwick into community ownership.\r\n\r\nOur aim is to reopen the Broadway as a professional cinema, exciting multi-use venue, and inter-generational community hub. \r\n\r\nWe are looking for Fundraising Support Volunteers to identify and take forward a variety of suitable fundraising opportunities. This will involve collaborating with local, and sometimes national businesses. \r\nResponsibilities will include:\r\n- Attend regular fundraising meetings\r\n- Identify potential opportunities to raise funds\r\n- Use negotiation skills to secure no-cost/low-cost venues for entertainment events\r\n- Participate in the distribution of information, sell tickets and collect donations \r\n- Setting up for the sale of goods\r\n- Generate ideas for potential fundraising activities\r\n\r\nIf you would like to volunteer in a role which allows you to give back to the local community while participating in a innovative project, and to join an enthusiastic, diverse and dynamic team of volunteers this could be the opportunity for you. The role can also allow you to make a significant contribution to the future of the Broadway. You will also be able to access a range of training and gain experience in a variety of new activities.\n\n## Experience required\n\n- Good time management and organisational skills\r\n- Excellent people skills\r\n- Creativity and innovative energy",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2Fbc8918e6-c182-4ece-9090-43853556279e%2Fgpx6nnIWvxXFMLCpJdEzZH9maTg1%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=2e333e69-e3b4-4f0e-b81a-c12f5ce31e59",
