            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/0010800003F0oURAAZ/safe-families-uk-western-isles",
            "name": "Safe Families UK ( Western Isles)",
            "description": "No one should feel alone. Safe Families exists to create relationship and connection because we believe everyone deserves to belong. At Safe Families, our fully trained volunteers come alongside a family that is struggling, offering them hope, love and friendship by being a Family Friend, a Host Family, a Connect Friend or a Resource Friend.",
            "website": "http://safefamilies.uk",
            "cause": [
                {
