                    "publishStart": "2024-08-14",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-26",
                    "title": "Resource Friend (Uist)",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nIndividual volunteers needed who are able to provide (or transport) useful items, such as a cot or children’s clothing as required.   We also welcome those with helpful skills, such as cooking or gardening to enhance the services.  Training and support is offered to all volunteers.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F2515610f-3b30-4e0e-a121-5ce0c2d62d64%2FLRTxG1oQeeZP2aKYQ1WKrkeWOO62%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=b9c591d6-c6f7-4944-bf83-47fb7ea73836",
