                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-26",
                    "title": "Host Family (Harris)",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nSometimes life is hard and family members need a break. Our fully trained volunteer Host Families host child(ren) for short periods of time to provide rest and respite for both the child(ren) and their family. Becoming a Host Family with Safe Families is an amazing gift to local families in your community who are struggling to manage life for whatever reason. Safe Families is a UK wide Christian charity and seeks to provide early intervention to the lives of struggling families in order to reduce any statutory service input. We provide full training and support for all our volunteers, who come from all walks of life, and give them the chance to get alongside local people, helping to strengthen their family life by supporting them through a time of crisis. Volunteering opportunities can be flexible around the needs of the family and the volunteer so that they suit both parties. Hosting involves caring for children from a local family in your home overnight for a fixed length of time – either a few nights in a row or on a regular basis, a night at a time.\n\n## Experience required\n\nFull training is given, however, to be a Host Family, all members of the host family must apply for a PVG Scheme membership (submitted via Safe Families) and undertake our full training course in order to be eligible as a host.\n\n## Taster details\n\nNo taster possible but each potential volunteer goes through a rigorous approval process in order to be sure that volunteering for Safe Families is right for them and vice versa.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000008XRBJYA4#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Host Family (Harris)",
                        "description": "Full training is given, however, to be a Host Family, all members of the host family must apply for a PVG Scheme membership (submitted via Safe Families) and undertake our full training course in order to be eligible as a host.",
                        "applyLink": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000008XRBJYA4/host-family-harris?#modal_register_a0gQD000008XRBJYA4",
