        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/0010800003F1LgPAAV",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/0010800003F1LgPAAV/cats-protection",
            "name": "Cats Protection",
            "description": "We are here to help people see the world through cats’ eyes\r\nSince 1927 we have helped cats across the UK and helped people to better understand their needs. As a community of volunteers, employees, supporters and partners, we’ve improved the lives of millions of cats and transformed the way millions of people see and care for cats.\r\n\r\nOur vision is a society where every cat has their best possible life because they are protected, cared for and understood by everyone.\r\n\r\nThis is not an easy thing to achieve, but that’s the point. It’s challenging and ambitious. But by moving towards it we’ll continually make the world better for cats and people.\r\n\r\nWe also have a clear definition of what we all do in Cats Protection – the mission we are on to deliver our vision.\r\n\r\nWe are a movement of people championing the welfare of cats. We lead society in a richer understanding of all cats and care for those that need our help.\r\n\r\nThis can be summed up by our purpose. If we can help everyone to better understand cats and their needs, we can help them to behave differently towards them, to care for them in the best way and to ensure the world appreciates and protects cats. That is why our purpose is:\r\n\r\nTo help people see the world through cats’ eyes",
            "cause": [
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/AnimalWelfare",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Animal Welfare"
                }
            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000AKWKXYA5",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000AKWKXYA5/fundraising-events-helper",
                    "publishStart": "2025-06-11",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-04",
                    "title": "Fundraising Events Helper",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAs a charity we can continue to help cats and kittens in need thanks to the donations we receive at fundraising events from generous members of the public. Our fundraising event helpers have the exciting and varied role of helping at local fundraising events.\r\nYou'll be:\r\n- helping set up and/or man stalls at events\r\n- helping on collection days including supermarket collections, events or street collections\r\n- helping at fundraising events such as quiz nights, cake sales and dances\r\n- promoting a professional image of Cats Protection at events\r\n\r\nWe’ll keep you up to date with upcoming local events where volunteers are needed. You’ll then be able to choose which events you’d like to volunteer at and how many hours you’d like to give. However much time you can give, your contribution will help raise much needed funds to continue the work of Cats Protection.\r\n\r\nYou will develop new skills, expand your knowledge and make a significant contribution to improving the lives of cats and kittens by helping raise funds through events. \r\nDue to the nature of the role having your own transport is preferred, but is not essential. Anybody under the age of 18 will have to be accompanied by a parent/guardian.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F1737c807-0509-4dfd-a222-6a5589b0ae1e%2FXiQTI9rs8XhdfYu2EPhcBTs4his2%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=c8538786-7c61-4007-9492-e72c8afd67d6",
