            "name": "Enable East Kilbride Branch",
            "description": "We are a charitable organisation founded in 1954 by the parents of children who had learning disabilities in order to ensure that children with this have the same choices and opportunities in life as everyone else. We campaign to fight discrimination and inequality and ensure that people who have learning disabilities are regarded as equal members of society.",
