                    "title": "Befriending/General Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe require volunteers to help with our befriending groups  Some examples of what we require are Pick up/drop off bus chaperon, general set up and break down of equipment, befriending - chatting with attendees and serving refreshments.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo Expertise, Caring,Creative,Good Communicator,Good Listener,Hard Working,Open minded,Organised,Patient,Practical,Reliable / Dependable,Sociable,Social Conscience,Team Player,Trustworthy,\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nThursday evenings 7pm - 9pm Thursday evenings 7pm - 9pm This applies to expense payment frequency\n\n## Travel details\n\nThe opportunity takes place at multiple location across South Lanarkshire \nAcross South Lanarkshire,East Kilbride",
