                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000009u2OaYAI",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000009u2OaYAI/stockbridge-shop-retail-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2023-11-22",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-31",
                    "title": "Stockbridge Shop Retail Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nWe are looking for energetic, enthusiastic volunteers to join the team in our new shop in Stockbridge, which opens in January. If you enjoy charity shops and have always wanted to get behind the scenes, this is a great role for you. We will be open 7 days a week and we can offer flexible volunteering.\n\n## Description\n\nWe are opening a new shop in Stockbridge in the New Year and are starting to recruit volunteers. If you enjoy volunteering as part of a team of people and would like to get involved right from the start of our new charity shop, we would love to hear from you. There will be clothes, books, bric-a-brac, jewellery and collectibles. You can help with sorting and placing stock, taking payments on the till and researching unusual or interesting items.\n\n## Training details\n\nShop orientation and training.\nHospice Induction Programme.  \nGroup supervision / continuing professional development updates.\n\n## Travel details\n\nStockbridge is accessible by public transport.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nVolunteers may claim public transport travel expenses as agreed with their manager. There is a form to fill in and expenses are paid monthly via BACS.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000009u2OaYAI#role",
