            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000Hzm2jYAB",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000Hzm2jYAB/volunteer-driver-flexible",
                    "publishStart": "2026-09-09",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-09",
                    "title": "Volunteer Driver - Flexible",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nTurn your miles in to nutritious meals for people in Wester Hailes and Sighthill. We need volunteer drivers to help us ensure our pantry shelves, fridges and freezers are stocked up for our members.\n\n· Drive to a local supermarket to collect a pre-arranged donation of surplus food \n· Deliver food donations to the The Healthy Living Centre, Wester Hailes or Gate 55, Sighthill\n\n## Experience required\n\n· Reliable, friendly and trustworthy\n· Community minded\n· Hold a valid, clean drivers licence\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nThis a flexible role so days and times can be discussed based on volunteer's availability and level of donations. Commitments are up to 3 hours a week. You do not need to be available every week but we ask that you will provide reasonable notice of changes in your availability.\n\n## Travel details\n\nSupermarkets will be in the Edinburgh area, particularly around the South West of the city. Delivery locations are in Wester Hailes and Sighthill.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nVolunteers will be reimbursed for fuel expenses at 45p per mile while undertaking volunteering role\n\n## Taster details\n\nVolunteers will be invited to an induction to the organisation where they will be introduced to the organisation, the pantry and other volunteers and staff members.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-volunteerscotland-search.appspot.com/o/opportunities%2FVE0tcOPT6OUgt8Jx0sJwiccZi152%2FofDprwzrUQAarVOJ-thumbnail.jpg?alt=media&token=52e77eef-2433-47f5-af7a-f24d5b65b9f2",
