            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000Qhji7AAB",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000Qhji7AAB/board-trustees",
                    "publishStart": "2023-09-04",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-31",
                    "title": "Board Trustees",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nBoard Trustee for Peace and Justice.  Come and help with the overall good management and administration of our organisation.  Contribute to the overall financial health and productive use of resources at Peace and Justice.  Help raise our profile and make a contribution to peace making in  Scotland.\n\n## Description\n\nOur Board Trustees have legal responsibility for the overall good management and administration of Peace and Justice.  They are responsible for the overall strategic direction of the organisation, management of resources, identify and manage risks and management of HR.  We are looking for  various people to commit for one and a half hours per week which includes attending bi-monthly Board meetings.\n\n## Experience required\n\nEssential:  Ability to work as part of a team; commitment to the ethos of the organisation; communication and leadership skills.\nDesirable:  Finance management; fundraising; HR; Health and safety; Knowledge and experience of the voluntary sector.\n\n## Training details\n\nThere will be opportunities to come along to a Board meeting as an observer and to find out more about the responsibilities of the role before making a commitment.  Induction training will be provided by the Convenor of the Board.\n\n## Travel details\n\nThe location is conveniently based on bus routes (12) with paid on-street parking nearby.  We are wheelchair accessible with a ramp at the entrance. Unfortunately we do not have a disabled toilet.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nA volunteer would fill in an expenses form. This would be submitted to the Administrator.  Expenses would be reimbursed as soon as possible.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
