            "description": "Edinburgh Leisure’s Active Communities team uses physical activity to improve the lives of people affected by health conditions, disabilities, inequalities and poverty. We have opportunities to volunteer in a vast range of projects and programme that help people become and remain active. We aim to make a positive impact on the Health and Wellbeing of people in Edinburgh.",
