                        "description": "Need to attend regular committee meetings. Must respect opinions/ ideas of other board members. Must be able to work in a team and  communicate well. must have an interest in contributing to the local community. Ideally be prepared to take action point minutes on a rotating basis. Practical skills useful too.",
