        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/00124000008nbWBAAY",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/00124000008nbWBAAY/heart-research-uk",
            "name": "Heart Research UK",
            "description": "Heart Research UK is a visionary chrity, which leads the way funding groud breaking and innovative medical research projects at the cutting edge of science into the prevention and cure of heart disease.  There is a strong emphasis on supporting clinical and surgical projects and young researchers on their first steps into research.  The charity also encourages and supports original healthy lifestyles initiatives that explore novel ways of preventing heart disease in all sectors of the community.",
            "website": "https://www.heartresearch.org.uk",
            "cause": [
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/Children",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Children"
                },
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/Health",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Health"
                }
            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g1p00000MdHjLAAV",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g1p00000MdHjLAAV/community-awareness-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2019-12-20",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-31",
                    "title": "Community Awareness Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nCommunity awareness volunteers needed to raise awareness of Heart Research UK's Heart of Scotland Appeal. Do you have a spare few hours to flyer, speak to communities or do some online research for Heart Research UK?\n\n## Description\n\nIn June 2019 Heart Research UK launched the Heart of Scotland Appeal, 48 people a day in Scotland die of heart disease. The heart of Scotland Appeal is to raise money to be spent in Scotland funding cutting edge research projects. The Heart of Scotland Appeal is calling you to help us spread the word in your communities. We are looking for people who will help us flyer at hospitals, GP's, community groups etc. We are also looking for research volunteer to help us reach out to online communities.\n\n## Experience required\n\nTime management\nCommunication\nPersonable\nFlexible\n\n## Training details\n\nInduction will be an informal chat about the organisation and the Appeal. We will look at the outcome you are hoping to get from volunteering and create a work plan that suits both the organisation and the needs of the volunteer. Training will be given as and when it is required.\n\n## Travel details\n\nThis volunteering opportunity is flexible to your geographical location, availability and capabilities. It can be done from  a computer at home or in a library or around you local neighbourhood.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nExpenses provided.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
