            "name": "Edinburgh Cyrenians - Main Office",
            "description": "Edinburgh Cyrenians is a charity which exists with the sole purpose of tackling homelessness and promoting community. Its focus is on working with and for people who are homeless, including those who are rebuilding their lives after having been homeless and those who are vulnerable to becoming homeless.",
            "website": "http://cyrenians.scot/",
            "charityRegistration": [
                {
                    "registrar": "https://www.oscr.org.uk",
