                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g1p00000DKCuaAAH",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g1p00000DKCuaAAH/store-merchandiser",
                    "publishStart": "2018-11-02",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-31",
                    "title": "Store Merchandiser",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nDo you have a knack for presentation, an eye for detail and enjoy making things look their best? We’re looking for people like you to volunteer in our F&E stores to help make them look as appealing and inspiring as possible.\n\n## Description\n\nDo you have a knack for presentation, an eye for detail and enjoy making things look their best? We’re looking for people like you to volunteer in our F&E stores to help make them look as appealing and inspiring as possible. You can expect to be helping out with visual merchandising, making sure everything is displayed to its full potential; you will also be involved in creating eye catching displays in our homeware department ensuring the items are clean and labelled.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo experience is required as we try to develop our volunteers skill set however having a bubbly can-do attitude is beneficial.\n\n## Training details\n\nInduction, support and training provided.\n\n## Travel details\n\n56a Dalry Road, EH11 2BA\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nBus fares will be paid on the day so they can attend and return home from their volunteering role.",
