                    "title": "Retail Volunteer - Haymarket",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nDo you always have a welcoming smile on your face and love getting in to conversations? Why not get to know the people from your community with this versatile volunteering role.\n\n## Description\n\nDo you always have a welcoming smile on your face and love getting in to conversations? Why not get to know the people from your community with this versatile volunteering role. You will be serving customers, helping to promote our stock and awareness campaigns and encouraging every donor to become part of our Gift Aid scheme.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo experience is required as we try to develop our volunteers skill set however having a bubbly can-do attitude is beneficial.\n\n## Training details\n\nInduction, support and training provided.\n\n## Travel details\n\n56a Dalry Road Edinburgh, EH11 2BA.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nBus fares will be paid on the day so they can attend and return home from their volunteering role.",
