            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000QNs4ZAAT",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000QNs4ZAAT/sales-assistant",
                    "publishStart": "2020-10-01",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-28",
                    "title": "Sales Assistant",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nCreative customer orientated team member needed at Barnardo's in Stockbridge\n\n## Description\n\nCustomer service and creative focused role with in our Stockbridge Barnardos branch. Visual Merchandising, till work, preparation of stock and being part of a friendly team.\nApply here https://volunteer.barnardos.org.uk/opportunities/17926-retail-volunteer-edinburgh-stockbridge-2021-04-13\n\n## Experience required\n\nFriendly, trustworthy, creative,  reliable, common sense. (full training will be given by Barnardos.)\n\n## Training details\n\nWe provide online training  throughout our volunteers journey, and in store training by staff.\n\n## Travel details\n\n29, 24 bus route\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nNo expenses",
