                    "description": "## Summary\n\nWe need someone to come and make our green spaces as good as they should be.\n\n## Description\n\nDo you have green fingers, do you enjoy making green spaces neat and tidy. You would be required to cut grass and weed borders, help plant out seasonal plants and sweeping up of leaves and rubbish. We are a children and young people?s project based in East Edinburgh.\n\n## Experience required\n\nAble to use garden machinery\n\n## Training details\n\nInduction and support provided.\n\n## Travel details\n\n61 Niddrie Mains Terrace, Edinburgh, EH16 4NX\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel expenses paid.",
