                    "title": "After School Club / Playscheme Support",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nTo work with children in a variety of settings which might include group work and individual support. To help ensure overall smooth running of club activities including the setting up preparation and the serving of snack as directed by the senior staff\n\n## Description\n\nTo work with children in a variety of settings which might include group work and individual support. To help ensure overall smooth running of club activities including the setting up preparation and the serving of snack as directed by the senior staff\n\n## Experience required\n\nThe volunteer need to have an understanding off issue affecting children living in a deprived area\n\n## Training details\n\nInduction given at start, possibly training opportunities.\n\n## Travel details\n\n61 Niddrie Mains Terrace, Edinburgh, EH16 4NX\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel expenses paid.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g24000008kaUzAAI#role",
                        "type": "Role",
