                    "description": "## Summary\n\nTo fix up some wooden toys, change light bulbs, repair locks on doors, keep our storeroom clean and tidy and do general maintenance.\n\n## Description\n\nTo fix up some wooden toys, change light bulbs, repair locks on doors, keep our storeroom clean and tidy and do general maintenance.\n\n## Experience required\n\nHandyman skills, ie fixing things.\n\n## Training details\n\nInduction given at start\n\n## Travel details\n\n61 Niddrie Mains Terrace, Edinburgh, EH16 4NX\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel expenses paid.",
