            "name": "Dalkeith & District Citizens Advice Bureau",
            "description": "The aims of the CAB service are as follows:-\r\nTo ensure that individuals do not suffer through lack of knowledge of their rights and responsibilities or the services available to them, or through an inability to express their needs effectively and equally.\r\nTo exercise a responsible influence on the development of social policies and services, both locally and nationally.",
            "website": "https://www.cas.org.uk/bureaux/dalkeith-and-district-citizens-advice-bureau",
