            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000VupxqAAB",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000VupxqAAB/centre-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2023-07-18",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Centre Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nSt. David's Bradbury Day Centre are looking for Volunteers to assist our Service Users to carry out various activities within and out with St. David’s, this could be sitting talking, assisting with arts and crafts, jigsaws, dominoes, quizzes, days out, helping to serve meals etc. - minimum age is 16.\n\n## Experience required\n\nPatience, compassionate, empathetic, good communication skills, good listener, positive attitude.\n\n## Training details\n\nFirst Aid\r\nFood Hygiene\r\nMoving and Handling\r\nHandling Difficult Situations/Challenging Behaviour\r\nUnderstanding Dementia\r\nStroke\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nfour hours a week\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nWe provide either travel expenses or a meal",
