                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Volunteer Driver",
                        "description": "Drivers need to have MIDAS training and are required to be 21 or over and hold a licence for a minimum of two years to be eligible for this.\r\nVolunteers must enjoy working with a variety of people particularly elderley and vulnerable.",
