            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD0000051zWPYAY",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD0000051zWPYAY/volunteer-gardener",
                    "publishStart": "2024-08-08",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Volunteer Gardener",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe are looking for a keen gardener to help upkeep our amazing nursery garden space, from cutting grass to planting vegetables in our own vegetable patch. We have a variety of fruit trees that also need to be maintained, lots of pots to fill and make our garden colourful and safe. \r\nLooking for someone who is keen to help the children learn about planting and nature. \r\nLooking for someone who can offer a day a week or more if available.\n\n## Experience required\n\nLooking for someone who is keen to help the children learn about planting and nature. \r\nNo experience necessary and be physically fit to maintain a large garden\n\n## Training details\n\nThe volunteer, will be inducted with all relevant health and safety risks and fire evacuation, access to employee handbook\n\n## Travel details\n\nYou can access travel to Mayfield via the number 3 bus, 5 min walk from bus stop. This is a main and regular route from Dalkeith .",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2Fc4d433fa-7904-4818-a424-f6c189dd90a4%2FHi3K7lHa8wXatOHLGJFdBGJQtau2%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=ff1f9acf-ba14-4268-8883-510521907dbc",
