            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000QO1kBAAT",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000QO1kBAAT/general-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2022-04-11",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "General Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nThis is a wonderful opportunity to work with and befriend adults with additional support needs.\r\nThe PHAB Club is a registered charity and offers a range of activities in a social setting. Volunteers offer friendship and help facilitate members to engage in craftwork, computer gaming, music and cooking. The club also organises social events such as a meal out, Christmas party and panto nights.\r\n\r\nThe club takes place during school term time only\n\n## Experience required\n\nA friendly positive attitude and willingness to help facilitate a number of activities\n\n## Training details\n\nPotential volunteers are asked to come along to a club night where they can shadow other volunteers and be introduced to members before committing themselves\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nDuring school term time\n\n## Travel details\n\non main bus route",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F9bd7c592-7010-4d79-543f-38d1382fa1ea%2FWkLzgT1VE9cAHEWcVMpdVMd5bL63%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=bb9f4462-e714-4dcf-ba4a-4be8334026d9",
