                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-16",
                    "title": "Presenter/Producer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe are looking for volunteers who will carry out all aspects of being a radio dj/producer. This includes research, production, presenting and the technical aspects.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo experience required as full training will be provided\n\n## Training details\n\nDepending on volunteer interests training varies\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\n1 Event\n\n## Travel details\n\nAccessible by train and bus",
