            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g1p00000CNNtIAAX",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g1p00000CNNtIAAX/gorebridge-community-fridge-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2018-06-28",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Gorebridge Community Fridge Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nPassionate about food? Enjoy sharing, eating and being creative with it? Become a Gorebridge Community Fridge volunteer to help people cut food waste and become innovative with their fridge items.\n\n## Description\n\nFood waste is a big issue in the UK and beyond. It’s estimated that a third of all food gets wasted. Most of this is avoidable and could have been eaten had it been better managed.\r\nHelp us look after the fridge in the following ways: \r\n* Operate fridge during allocated opening times * Collection of food from donors\r\n* Fridge cleaning and monitoring\r\n* Local fridge promotion \r\n* Assist with events to support the fridge and the local community Experience required: Interest in food. Confident and happy to work on own. Friendly and helpful manner.\n\n## Experience required\n\nInterest in food, confident and happy to work on own. Friendly and helpful manner\n\n## Training details\n\nInduction session on volunteer role\r\nOther training may include manually handling, food hygiene\r\nRegular support from Food Sharing Coordinator\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\n3 hours per week initially for 3 months with possible extension.\n\n## Travel details\n\n‘29' and '33' bus route. It is easily accessible using Lothian Buses.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nReasonable travel expenses will be reimbursed.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F888e8d49-99e8-3a3d-20c5-75df50a3776b%2FHi3K7lHa8wXatOHLGJFdBGJQtau2%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=6137adbe-636b-4333-bfae-c8c522eb2951",
