            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000DB0RpYAL",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000DB0RpYAL/community-garden-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-07-07",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-05",
                    "title": "Community Garden Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nVolunteers are needed for the newly established Drying Green Community Garden in Saline.\n\n## Description\n\nVolunteers are needed for the newly established Drying Green Community Garden in Saline. The garden is a place for the community to enjoy, and is maintained using permaculture principles.\r\n\r\nGeneral activities for volunteers will include:\r\n-\tPlanting vegetables\r\n-\tPlanting flowers, trees and hedging\r\n-\tWeeding, watering and fertilising plants\r\n-\tDeveloping the polytunnel to grow food\r\n-\tMaking compost\r\n-\tMaintaining pathways\r\n-\tBuilding raised beds\r\n-\tManaging biodiversity and biodiverse areas in the garden\r\n\r\nAs a volunteer, you can decide which of the above activities to get involved with, and you’ll have the opportunity to engage in a range of activities every week.\r\n\r\nIf you enjoy the outdoors, and would like to help maintain and develop The Drying Green garden for the Saline and Steelend community, this could be the role for you.\n\n## Experience required\n\nIt would be appreciated if volunteers had a knowledge for gardening, and enjoyed spending time outdoors, however it is most important to be enthusiastic and willing to get stuck in.\n\n## Training details\n\nVolunteers will receive support from other members of the garden team, and will be given a full induction when they first come along.\n\n## Travel details\n\nThe Drying Green (opposite Saline General Store) \r\n28 Main Street\r\nSaline\r\nKY12 9TL\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nExpenses can be discussed on a case by case basis.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000DB0RpYAL#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Community Garden Volunteer",
                        "description": "It would be appreciated if volunteers had a knowledge for gardening, and enjoyed spending time outdoors, however it is most important to be enthusiastic and willing to get stuck in.",
