            "name": "Age Peterhead",
            "description": "•To provide a comprehensive and practical service for the elderly  and disabled people living in Peterhead and the surrounding areas \r\n• Befriending to the housebound and lonely. A caravan holiday for pensioners, veterans, disabled or carers who need a break from their caring duties.",
