                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-07",
                    "title": "Volunteer Sitter",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nCan you spare a couple of hours a week to make a different to people in the Peterhead area. Age Peterhead are looking for people to join their sitter service. Providing a vital short break for a carer we would like you have a chat, play some cards or watch a film with an older person while their loved one gets some shopping, attends medical appointments or has some well-earned time to themselves. \r\nThere is no personal care involved in this service and no experience is needed, training will be provided and PVG is required.",
