                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-06",
                    "title": "Driver",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nFlexible volunteering opportunity for drivers in and around Alford. We provide transport, using the volunteer driver's own vehicle, to help people within the Alford Medical Practice area attend health related and well being appointments. Typical journeys are to the local medical practice, dental/vaccination appointments, and trips to hospital, e.g. Aberdeen; Huntly; Aboyne; Inverurie.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nWe reimburse volunteer drivers for fuel used, currently 55p per mile.",
