                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000SsL5CAAV",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000SsL5CAAV/group-support-volunteers-a-bite-a-blether",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-30",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-10",
                    "title": "Group Support Volunteers-A Bite & A Blether",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe are looking for an enthusiastic individual who has a passion for equality, fairness\r\nand justice to volunteer alongside our team.\r\nAs a volunteer, you will provide support to our existing lunchtime peer support groups,\r\nA Bite & A Blether, across East Dunbartonshire. Assisting the group facilitators, you will\r\nplay a vital role in supporting participants and ensuring the smooth running of the\r\ngroups. Our groups meet once a week for a duration of one and a half hours.\r\nMain tasks include:\r\n- Setting up venue\r\n- Welcoming group members\r\n- Serving light lunches, teas & coffees\r\n- Chatting with and listening to group members\r\n- Raising any issues/sign posting requirements with group facilitators\r\n- Venue clean and tidy up at end of session\r\nAll Volunteers must be willing to apply to the Protecting Vulnerable Groups Scheme for\r\na membership which is an online application and is free\n\n## Training details\n\nVolunteer can visit the group for a taster session to see if it is what they are looking for.\n\n## Travel details\n\nHillhead Parish Church every second Thursday &  The Fraser Centre in Milngavie every second Thursday.\r\nBishopbriggs every Monday.\n\n## Taster details\n\nVolunteer can visit the group for a taster session to see if it is what they are looking for.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000SsL5CAAV#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Group Support Volunteers-A Bite & A Blether",
                        "applyLink": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000SsL5CAAV/group-support-volunteers-a-bite-a-blether?#modal_register_a0g0800000SsL5CAAV",
                        "allowsRemoteParticipation": false,
                        "minimumAge": "18",
                        "theme": [
                            {
                                "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Theme/Elderly",
                                "skos:prefLabel": "Elderly"
