            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/00124000008nYJvAAM/marie-curie-bearsden",
            "name": "Marie Curie (Bearsden)",
            "description": "Given the choice, most of us would want to die at home, surrounded by the people and things we cherish. Marie Curie Cancer Care makes this possible. Our nurses give free hands-on care to people with all terminal illnesses in their own homes or in one of our nine hospices, and vital emotional support to their loved ones. We allow families to make the most of the precious time they have left together.",
            "website": "https://www.mariecurie.org.uk",
            "charityRegistration": [
