                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g24000000eI5zAAE/shop-worker",
                    "publishStart": "2026-02-13",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-13",
                    "title": "Shop Worker",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nMarie Curie Centre volunteer required to work in local charity shop, Saturdays only\n\n## Description\n\nShop volunteers are involved in sorting, pricing and sizing stock.  Steaming of clothes. Stocking front shop and the sculling of old stock. (turnover)\r\nUse of cash register. Dealing with public and general tidying of shop.\n\n## Experience required\n\nCommon sense and the ability to deal with the public.\n\n## Training details\n\nInduction given on first week\n\n## Travel details\n\nCharity shop in Bearsden",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
