                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000GTXDtYAP",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000GTXDtYAP/cafe-support",
                    "publishStart": "2026-04-22",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-21",
                    "title": "Cafe Support",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nTwechar Community Action and its projects including twechar Healthy Living & Enterprise centre focuses\r\non enhancing the lives of Twechar residents and residents from the wider East Dunbartonshire on wellbeing,\r\nyouth and elderly projects as well as life long learning. With a host of activities and events for the\r\ncommunity to enjoy and get involved with. With a cafe on site.\r\nDescribe the volunteering Opportunity\r\nCafe Support will help in our on site cafe with duties like, taking orders, cashing, stock handling, clearing\r\ntables, cleaning dishes and general cleaning. Good level of customer service is required.\n\n## Experience required\n\nGood level of customer service, polite and well turned out. Chatty and hard working. Good in a team and\r\nworking on their own.\n\n## Training details\n\nAfter an application is filled in and an informal chat taken place, if the post is to be filled is suitable for both\r\nparties then an induction will take place. This will include a tour of the building covering health & safety, fire\r\nregulations and relevant policy and procedure forms filled in. The volunteer will be introduced to key\r\nmembers of staff and be given a buddy to have as a contact who will meet at least once a month to check\r\nin, of course they can be contacted when the volunteer needs them. Further training will be offered to the\r\nvolunteer\n\n## Travel details\n\nTwechar Healthy Living & Enterprise Centre, St John's Way G659TA\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nWe do however offer a light meal and drink when the volunteer is on duty.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000GTXDtYAP#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Cafe Support",
                        "description": "Good level of customer service, polite and well turned out. Chatty and hard working. Good in a team and\r\nworking on their own.",
                        "applyLink": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000GTXDtYAP/cafe-support?#modal_register_a0gQD00000GTXDtYAP",
                        "allowsRemoteParticipation": false,
