                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g24000000eOGXAA2",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g24000000eOGXAA2/connect-online-home-visitor",
                    "publishStart": "2018-01-01",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Connect Online Home-Visitor",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nWe are looking to recruit volunteers who have IT skills to share. Volunteers will assist housebound learners within their own homes to improve their skills on the computer.\n\n## Description\n\nVolunteers will visit housebound learners within their own homes for one hour per week to provide tuition on the computer. Tuition will last for 8 weeks and will generally cover basic digital skills such as using internet and email, online shopping & social media, but can be flexible dependent on what the learner would like to cover.\n\n## Experience required\n\nGood general IT skills and good communication skills are essential. Previous experience of working with the internet and email are essential. Volunteers should be patient and friendly, previous experience of working with people is desirable.\n\n## Training details\n\nAll volunteers will provided with an initial induction/training session. This will cover Health & Safety issues and a general induction to the role. Ongoing training and support will also be provided.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nVolunteers will visit learners for one hour per week to deliver IT tuition.\n\n## Travel details\n\nTuition will take place in learners' own homes throughout Midlothian. Volunteers must arrange their own transport to and from learners' homes.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nVolunteers travel expenses will be reimbursed for journeys to and from learners’ homes. We will reimburse public transport rates or mileage at 45p per mile. Expenses can be reimbursed weekly or monthly.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2Ffc3c267c-14ab-9531-1e1d-1b784d1b4755%2FWkLzgT1VE9cAHEWcVMpdVMd5bL63%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=6bc39014-feaa-4b46-826f-6e5f7ade9f56",
