                        "title": "Activity Assistant - Dalkeith",
                        "description": "No skills required as training will be provided. The project is aimed at young people who would like support and supervision while volunteering, who are non judgemental, enjoy socialising and get on well with people.",
                        "commitment": "Monday evenings 6.15pm-7.45pm",
