                    "title": "Volunteer Drivers",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nUse your driving skills and friendly personality to help people spend time in your their community. We've got opportunities for you to be an important link in your community.\r\n\r\nAs a Volunteer Driver for our RVS Cuppa Club, you will pick up members of the club and take them home afterwards, the club runs on a Thursday from 10am till 2 pm.\r\n\r\nThe Aberdeen Cuppa Club is held at Froghall Community Centre, Powis Terrace, AB25 3RF, the members live within a few miles of the club.\r\n\r\nA great, enjoyable way to help make a difference. All volunteers are greatly appreciated. To help/for further details please contact Michael Bartley, Support Coordinator at email: michael.bartley@royalvoluntaryservice.org.uk or telephone:  07769286532\n\n## Description\n\nUse your driving skills and friendly personality to help people spend time in your their community. We've got opportunities for you to be an important link in your community.\r\n\r\nAs a Volunteer Driver for our RVS Cuppa Club, you will pick up members of the club and take them home afterwards, the club runs on a Thursday from 10am till 2 pm.\r\n\r\nThe Aberdeen Cuppa Club is held at Froghall Community Centre, Powis Terrace, AB25 3RF, the members live within a few miles of the club.\r\n\r\nA great, enjoyable way to help make a difference. All volunteers are greatly appreciated. To help/for further details please contact Michael Bartley, Support Coordinator at email: michael.bartley@royalvoluntaryservice.org.uk or telephone:  07769286532\n\n## Experience required\n\nDriving licence required.\n\n## Training details\n\nExcellent support and training is provided to all volunteers.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nthe club runs on a Thursday from 10am till 2 pm. All help greatly appreciated.\n\n## Travel details\n\nThe Aberdeen Cuppa Club is held at Froghall Community Centre, Powis Terrace, AB25 3RF, the members live within a few miles of the club",
