            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000QNsxCAAT",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000QNsxCAAT/charlie-house-volunteers",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Charlie House Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Description\n\n*Volunteer with Charlie House and give the gift of time*\r\nThousands of volunteers across the North-east of Scotland make an amazing contribution to the third sector and provide vital hours of support to charities and the families which they support. Our volunteers are an integral and invaluable part of Team Charlie House. Every single hour they contribute makes a difference to the babies, children, young people and families we support.\r\n\r\nAs we develop our range of services to support even more families across the region, we are looking to expand our team of Charlie House volunteers. Some of our volunteers gift an occasional hour or two, some a whole day, and some make a regular commitment every week or month. We have a wide range of volunteering opportunities available for each and every individual, based on their available time.\r\n\r\nTo find out more about volunteering with Charlie House and the full range of current ways you can help and make a real difference through volunteering please visit: https://www.charliehouse.org.uk/support-us/volunteer-with-us/ or contact us at E Mail: volunteer@charliehouse.org.uk\n\n## Experience required\n\nWe are looking for team players with a friendly, welcoming approach.\n\n## Training details\n\nExcellent support and relevant training is provided to all volunteers.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible times available to help. All help is greatly appreciated.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000QNsxCAAT#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Charlie House Volunteers",
                        "description": "We are looking for team players with a friendly, welcoming approach.",
                        "commitment": "Flexible times available to help. All help is greatly appreciated.",
                        "applyLink": "https://www.charliehouse.org.uk/support-us/volunteer-with-us/",
                        "allowsRemoteParticipation": false,
                        "minimumAge": "16",
                        "theme": [
                            {
