                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000004ulI8YAI",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000004ulI8YAI/media-marketing-and-advertising-volunteers",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Media Marketing and Advertising Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nWe're seeking enthusiastic volunteers with a passion for creativity and community engagement to help us promote our community centre’s activities. We're looking for individuals with skills in:\r\n\r\n•\tVideo editing\r\n•\tSocial media management\r\n•\tGraphic design\r\n•\tPhotography (optional)\r\n\r\nAs a volunteer, you will play a crucial role in:\r\n\r\n•\tCreating engaging video content to showcase our activities\r\n•\tManaging our social media channels to reach a wider audience\r\n•\tDesigning eye-catching promotional materials\r\n•\tHelping us increase attendance and community participation\r\n\r\nWe offer a flexible volunteering environment where you can share your talents and make a positive impact on our community.\r\n\r\nFor further information please contact John Amalanand, HALLA Development Worker at email hallaprojects@gmail.com or telephone 07378777996.\n\n## Description\n\nWe're seeking enthusiastic volunteers with a passion for creativity and community engagement to help us promote our community centre’s activities. We're looking for individuals with skills in:\r\n\r\n•\tVideo editing\r\n•\tSocial media management\r\n•\tGraphic design\r\n•\tPhotography (optional)\r\n\r\nAs a volunteer, you will play a crucial role in:\r\n\r\n•\tCreating engaging video content to showcase our activities\r\n•\tManaging our social media channels to reach a wider audience\r\n•\tDesigning eye-catching promotional materials\r\n•\tHelping us increase attendance and community participation\r\n\r\nWe offer a flexible volunteering environment where you can share your talents and make a positive impact on our community.\r\n\r\nFor further information please contact John Amalanand, HALLA Development Worker at email hallaprojects@gmail.com or telephone 07378777996.\n\n## Training details\n\nExcellent support and relevant guidance is provided to all volunteers. All help is greatly appreciated.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nThe volunteering times are flexible. All help makes a difference and is greatly appreciated.\n\n## Travel details\n\nBased at Kaimhill Learning Centre, Pitmedden Terrace, Garthdee, Aberdeen AB10 7HR.\r\n\r\n6 minute walk from ASDA Garthdee Superstore.",
