        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/00124000008nYYDAA2",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/00124000008nYYDAA2/pushing-out-the-boat",
            "name": "Pushing Out the Boat",
            "description": "Pushing Out the Boat (a registered Scottish Charity - SCIO No SC044919) and run by a team of enthusiastic and dedicated volunteers is North-East Scotland’s unique literary and arts journal, publishing high-quality prose, poetry and art selected from a unique blend of the global and the local. In its pages are thrillingly gathered artists and writers from all around the world, as well as just around the corner, creating a linguistic mix that welcomes Doric, Scots, and a world of eclectic Englishes that help to bring us a’thegither. We maintain a strong commitment to first time writers and artists; and to outreach, by supplying copies to worthy causes, local libraries and schools – the latter specially to encourage young contributors. We aspire to offer readers the very best regional literary magazine in Scotland.",
            "website": "https://www.pushingouttheboat.co.uk",
            "cause": [
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/ArtsAndCulture",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Arts and Culture"
                },
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/CommunityDevelopment",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Community Development"
                },
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/EducationLearningTraining",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Education / Learning / Training"
                },
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/Volunteering",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Volunteering"
                }
            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000QNxDdAAL",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000QNxDdAAL/volunteer-treasurer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Volunteer Treasurer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\n*NEW YEAR, NEW CHALLENGE? PUSHING OUT THE BOAT MAGAZINE IS LOOKING FOR A VOLUNTEER TREASURER*\r\n\r\nPushing Out the Boat magazine (North-east Scotland’s Biennial Magazine of New Writing and the Visual Arts) is looking for a new treasurer to join our team of unpaid volunteers.\r\n\r\nWe are a small registered charity (SCIO No SC044919). We get our main income from selling our magazine and holding events. Our main costs are printing the magazine and    administration.\r\n\r\nYour duties would include:\r\n1.\tManagement of our receipts and payments through our bank and PayPal accounts and in cash\r\n2.\tUsing Excel spreadsheets to keep our financial records and prepare our annual accounts.\r\n\r\nThe Treasurer is also a member of our management committee. Whilst the basic skills required to perform the duties described above are essential, we will provide help and support on other aspects of the role. A general interest in the arts would be an asset but is not essential.\r\n\r\nWe are a friendly group of volunteers whose meetings and occasional events are held in or near Aberdeen. Please browse our website at https://www.pushingouttheboat.co.uk/ to get a feel for what we do.\r\n\r\nContact us at info@pushingouttheboat.co.uk to discuss this opportunity. If you’re interested and qualified, we’ll invite you to meet a small group of trustees to confirm that we’re suited for each other.\n\n## Training details\n\nExcellent support and relevant guidance is provided to all voliunteers.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000QNxDdAAL#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Volunteer Treasurer",
                        "applyLink": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000QNxDdAAL/volunteer-treasurer?#modal_register_a0g0800000QNxDdAAL",
                        "allowsRemoteParticipation": true,
                        "theme": [
                            {
                                "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Theme/ArtsMusicDramaCrafts",
                                "skos:prefLabel": "Arts (Music / Drama / Crafts)"
                            }
                        ],
                        "service": [
                            {
                                "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Service/NamedContactForVolunteer",
                                "skos:prefLabel": "Named Contact For Volunteer"
                            },
                            {
                                "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Service/WheelchairAccessDisabledAccessToilet",
                                "skos:prefLabel": "Wheelchair Access/Disabled Access Toilet"
