                    "title": "Variety",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nVolunteers can support Generation Arts by\r\nBecoming a Trustee on our Board.\r\nVolunteering for our weekly arts classes.\r\nVolunteering for a one off event.\r\nFundraising for our Charity.\r\nPromoting our projects by distributing leaflets and posters in the local community.\n\n## Experience required\n\nWe are looking for volunteers who are friendly, approachable and have an interest in the arts.",
