                        "title": "Volunteer member of the Progressing Forward Steering Group",
                        "description": "An ability to be non- judgemental, be inclusive and view substance use as an issue which can impact anyone.\r\nTo be proactive in approach to future developments of services and be happy to be an active participant in events which promote the service.",
