                    "title": "Volunteer Walk Leader (Linlithgow)",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe’re looking for friendly volunteers to help support our walking group for people aged 60. Volunteers \r\nsupport, and ensure the safety and enjoyment of group walks while promoting health, wellbeing, and \r\ncommunity engagement. No special experience is needed—just a warm, patient approach and a \r\nwillingness to help people connect and enjoy themselves. Full training is provided. If you have a little \r\ntime to spare and would like to help bring people together through short easy health walks, we’d love to \r\nhear from you\n\n## Experience required\n\nGood listening and communication skills\r\nFriendly personality\r\nReliable with good time keeping\r\nPatience and empathy\r\nRespectful of confidentiality\r\nAble to work within set boundaries\r\nGood organisation skills",
