                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe’re looking for friendly volunteers to help support our welcoming group for people aged 60 and over in Cunnigar House (Mid Calder). Volunteers may help prepare and serve refreshments, assist with simple activities and games, welcome attendees, and encourage conversation in a relaxed, supportive environment where everyone feels included. No special experience is needed—just a warm, patient approach and a willingness to help people connect and enjoy themselves. Full training is provided. If you have a little time to spare and would like to help bring people together, we’d love to hear from you.",
