                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000008WVTtYAO",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000008WVTtYAO/digital-support-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-20",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-16",
                    "title": "Digital Support Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nYou will be matched with a client who wants to learn about a device (phone, tablet, laptop) and through short weekly sessions over the phone or in person, your support and encouragement could help them to:\r\n• Understand the basics of using their chosen device\r\n• Undertake specific online tasks such as email, joining online groups or web browsing and using search engines\r\n• Feel connected and engaged \r\n• Reduce feelings of loneliness, isolation and vulnerability\r\nShort weekly sessions either in the OPAL Hub in Bathgate or in the clients home.\n\n## Experience required\n\nSolid understanding of one or more specific device(s) e.g. iPad, android tablet or phone, windows or mac computer, chromebook etc\r\n• Good listening and communication skills\r\n• Friendly personality / approachable\r\n• Reliable with good time keeping\r\n• Patience and empathy\r\n• Non-judgemental\r\n• Respectful of confidentiality\r\n• Able to work within set boundaries\r\n• Keep accurate call records and feed back to the team regularly",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
