            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g24000000eNdkAAE",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g24000000eNdkAAE/volunteer-buddies",
                    "publishStart": "2026-11-10",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-05-03",
                    "title": "Volunteer Buddies",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nVolunteer Buddies support people who require this service in their recovery journey. People who have had problems with substance misuse often say they can lose touch with friends and colleagues – and also lose their confidence in social situations. In Aberdeen & central/south Aberdeenshire, we can offer volunteering opportunities.\r\n\r\nBuddies aim to help people build up their confidence again by supporting the person to get out and about and to rediscover old interests or find new ones.\r\n\r\nFor further information regarding this opportunity, please  visit https://www.alcoholanddrugsaction.org.uk/join-us/volunteering-vacancies or email volunteering@alcoholanddrugsaction.org.uk\n\n## Description\n\nVolunteer Buddies support people who require this service in their recovery journey. People who have had problems with substance misuse often say they can lose touch with friends and colleagues – and also lose their confidence in social situations. In Aberdeen & central/south Aberdeenshire, we can offer volunteering opportunities.\r\n\r\nBuddies aim to help people build up their confidence again by supporting the person to get out and about and to rediscover old interests or find new ones.\r\n\r\nFor further information regarding this opportunity, please  visit https://www.alcoholanddrugsaction.org.uk/join-us/volunteering-vacancies or email volunteering@alcoholanddrugsaction.org.uk\n\n## Training details\n\nGood support and relevant training is provided to all volunteers.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible days and times available to suit volunteers. All help is greatly appreciated.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nPublic transport of all day ticket will be reimbursed upon production of valid ticket for the day of volunteering.",
