                    "title": "Sesssional Play Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nPlay Alloa is looking for fun and committed volunteers to help support our play, youth and adult sessions for children, young people and adults with disabilities and additional support needs.  Opportunities vary across the week. Please contact for more information.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo experience required, just an ability to get stuck in and have fun\n\n## Training details\n\nThere are ongoing training opportunities.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nWeekly during school term but also varies during school holidays\n\n## Travel details\n\nPlay Alloa is based in Broad Street Alloa",
