            "name": "Mearns & Coastal Healthy Living Network",
            "description": "The project aims to implement preventative approaches to ensure that older people have a healthy and fulfilling lifestyle that will ease the demand on services and contribute to the wellbeing of communities.",
            "website": "https://www.mchln.org.uk",
            "charityRegistration": [
