                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000A66ubYAB",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000A66ubYAB/community-advocacy-supporter",
                    "publishStart": "2026-07-01",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-22",
                    "title": "Community Advocacy Supporter",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nDo you believe that everyone should have a voice?\r\n\r\nAre you friendly and outgoing?\r\n\r\nThen we may have the volunteering opportunity you are looking for.\r\n\r\nAdvocacy North East is a local charity that provides an essential independent advocacy service for vulnerable adults throughout Aberdeenshire, strengthening the voice of those who are most at risk of exclusion and speaking up for those who might otherwise go unheard. \r\n \r\nPeople affected by dementia can be amongst the most vulnerable in our communities, some may be entirely dependent on others for their care, others may have little or no other networks of support and many may be unaware of their rights.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for volunteers in all areas to distribute our leaflets in supported accommodation and care homes locally (or further afield) and to pop in occasionally to raise the profile of Independent Advocacy amongst residents and staff.  You will be fully trained in advocacy to be able to answer any questions, you  will have full support from our training and volunteer coordinator and, of course, you will receive out of pocket expenses.\r\n\r\nThe time commitment is variable according to your own availability and enthusiasm!\r\n\r\nIf you think it’s important that everyone should have the opportunity to have their voice heard and you have some spare time to give to a valuable cause, we would really love to hear from you.\n\n## Training details\n\nWe have a dedicated Training and Volunteer Co-ordinator and further training opportunities are available bi-monthly either online or in person.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel expenses to and from the site of the volunteering activity are paid on a monthly basis.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F9a93daac-c0d3-4363-a6a6-44780f9e553d%2FFhIRWlL25tYMP904X0t8vKyc1FY2%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=80940cc4-fddf-4c5a-9bd0-2d020044a8ce",
                    "role": {
