                    "description": "## Description\n\nTaking care of our members who are largely older local folk who might struggle to otherwise get out of their homes. \r\nServing morning tea/coffee and lunch for those who stay.\r\nChatting with our very sociable members, and facilitating participation in games and social intercourse to ensure everyone gets the most out of every session.",
