                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000ILGNZYA5",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000ILGNZYA5/youth-rainbow-leader-and-helpers-peterhead",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-05",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-05",
                    "title": "Youth Rainbow Leader and helpers  - Peterhead",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nGirlguiding Banff & Buchan is part of Girlguiding Scotland, the leading charity for girls and young women in Scotland. Girlguiding helps members discover their full potential by having fun and enjoying new adventures.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of guiding are our regular group sessions, called unit meetings. These are run by volunteer teams of adult leaders, helpers, and young leaders. We are looking for leaders, helpers and young leaders in Peterhead across all of our sections but especially for Rainbows:\r\n\r\nRainbows are aged 4-7 and focus on fun, friendship and adventure. \r\nBrownies are aged 7-10 and focus on fun, adventure, and even first nights away! \r\nGuides run for those aged 10-14 and is a relaxed, safe space for young members to develop their interests and take on new challenges. \r\nRangers are aged 14-18, and are supported to be independent, take the lead on activities, and explore UK and international adventures!\r\n\r\nOur units in Peterhead meet on weekday afternoons and evenings.\r\n\r\nIf you're not sure what role would suit you, register your interest in the same way and a senior volunteer will get in touch to chat about other ways to volunteer.\n\n## Training details\n\nAll volunteers have to complete our online safeguarding training.\r\nAnyone interested in becoming a leader also needs to work towards their leadership qualification - a great training programme where you'll receive mentor support and learn new skills!\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nVolunteering shouldn't cost you anything! You can speak to our volunteers how to claim expenses.",
