                    "title": "Guide Leader in Inverbervie",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nGirlguiding Coastal South is part of Girlguiding Scotland, the leading charity for girls and young women in Scotland. Girlguiding helps members discover their full potential by having fun and enjoying new adventures.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of guiding are our regular group sessions, called unit meetings. These are run by volunteer teams of adult leaders, helpers, and young leaders.\r\n\r\nLeaders help to run our units, support the volunteer team, and are involved in planning and running the activities for girls with their fellow volunteers. You’ll be supported to complete our required Leadership qualification and receive training on everything from admin and finance to child safety.\r\n\r\nWe’re looking for volunteers in Inverbervie to support unit meetings for Guides.\r\n\r\nGuides run for those aged 10-14 and is a relaxed, safe space for young members to develop their interests and take on new challenges.\r\n\r\nOur units meet on weekday evenings.\n\n## Training details\n\nYou’ll be supported to complete our required Leadership qualification and receive training on everything from admin and finance to child safety.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nVolunteering shouldn't cost you anything! You can speak to our volunteers how to claim expenses.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F9d45d49f-21dd-4757-a727-da2799ab7cec%2Fwv9dTLCIT0fRxVP0MqgEDF8Fhwt1%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=b283522c-d6fb-471f-b00f-587442586763",
