            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000005N2PeYAK",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000005N2PeYAK/adult-carer-support-volunteers",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Adult Carer Support Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nAberdeen Carers Support Service (Quarriers) are looking for Volunteers to help for an hour or two per week at our adult carer support groups. We have various groups running across Aberdeen city, where carers and the people they care for can meet up for friendship and support.  Aberdeen Carers Support Services supports unpaid adult carers. \r\n\r\nIf you are friendly and outgoing and have an hour or two a week to spare, we would love to hear from you.\r\n\r\nPlease  email, call or pop in and see us for more details about this volunteer role:\r\nEmail: aberdeencarers@quarriers.org.uk or Tel: 01224 914036\r\n37 Albert Street, Aberdeen AB25 1XU\r\n\r\nAll help makes a real difference and is greatly appreciated.\n\n## Description\n\nAberdeen Carers Support Service (Quarriers) are looking for Volunteers to help for an hour or two per week at our adult carer support groups. We have various groups running across Aberdeen city, where carers and the people they care for can meet up for friendship and support.  Aberdeen Carers Support Services supports unpaid adult carers. \r\n\r\nIf you are friendly and outgoing and have an hour or two a week to spare, we would love to hear from you.\r\n\r\nPlease  email, call or pop in and see us for more details about this volunteer role:\r\nEmail: aberdeencarers@quarriers.org.uk or Tel: 01224 914036\r\n37 Albert Street, Aberdeen AB25 1XU\r\n\r\nAll help makes a real difference and is greatly appreciated.\n\n## Experience required\n\nIf you are friendly and outgoing and have an hour or two a week to spare.\n\n## Training details\n\nRelevant guidance, training and excellent support is provided to all volunteers.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nTo help for an hour or two per week.   Flexible times available to help. All volunteers make a real difference and are greatly appreciated.\n\n## Travel details\n\nAberdeen City\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nAll agreed expenses are reimbursed.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
