            "name": "Riding for the Disabled Aberdeen Group",
            "description": "Aberdeen RDA is a member group of the national charity Riding for the Disabled Association (RDA). The Aberdeen Group was formed in 1970 so is one of the oldest groups in Scotland. Since 1970, we have provided horse riding therapy for thousands of disabled children and adults. Nationwide, RDA horses benefit the lives of over 25,000 disabled children and adults.",
