            "name": "Grampian Credit Union ltd",
            "description": "Grampian Credit Union as an ethical financial co-operative, owned by our members offer a genuine alternative to High Street financial organisations and high interest lenders with our comprehensive range of savings and loans products designed with our members in mind.",
            "website": "http://www.grampiancreditunion.co.uk/",
            "cause": [
