                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g24000008kaMMAAY",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g24000008kaMMAAY/passenger-assistant",
                    "publishStart": "2017-02-02",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-31",
                    "title": "Passenger Assistant",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nAssisting PEP's drivers in our accessible fleet of minibuses collecting frail and older people from their homes and accompanying them on the bus to various local clubs.\n\n## Description\n\nJoin our amazing team of volunteer Passenger Assistants who play an important role in providing  minibus transport to our elderly and vulnrable attendees.\n\n## Experience required\n\nFairly fit, confident, patient, outgoing personality. Care for older people.\n\n## Training details\n\nWe will provide training and support. Must be willing to undertake a disclosure through the PVG scheme.\n\n## Travel details\n\nOffices are at The PEP Centre, 3 West Pilton Park, Edinburgh, EH4 4EL.\nRoutes are mainly in North Edinburgh.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nPublic transport and out of pocket expenses paid.",
