            "name": "Firsthand Lothian",
            "description": "1:1 support - doing activities with children both at home & local community which provides regular respite for parent/carers. You will build children’s confidence & social skills & you will both have fun in the process. You can work alongside experienced staff if you want to gain experience in child care.",
            "website": "http://www.firsthand-lothian.org.uk/",
