                    "skos:prefLabel": "Education / Learning / Training"
                },
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/Employment",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Employment"
                }
            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000004XI77YAG",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000004XI77YAG/event-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2024-07-10",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-28",
                    "title": "Event Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nJoin our team as an Event Coordination Volunteer! Are you passionate about making a difference and being part of a dynamic team? We are on the lookout for enthusiastic volunteers to join us and contribute to the success of our organization by supporting and coordinating our events.\n\n## Description\n\nJoin our team as an Event Coordination Volunteer! Are you passionate about making a difference and being part of a dynamic team? We are on the lookout for enthusiastic volunteers to join us and contribute to the success of our organization by supporting and coordinating our events.\nWhat You'll Do: Recruit participants and promote events through social media, email, and flyers. Welcome and engage with guests, ensuring they feel valued and included. Help manage and coordinate event logistics.\n\n## Travel details\n\nLocation:\n31 Guthrie Street, Edinburgh, EH1 1JG\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nNo expenses.",
