            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000Pv9RxAAJ",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000Pv9RxAAJ/lead-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2021-07-26",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-31",
                    "title": "Lead Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nWe've developed a comprehensive training programme to give you all the skills and support you need to lead a team of up to 5 volunteers at a time in the daily running of our charity shops.\n\n## Description\n\nOpening & closing the shop.\nDaily admin & accountancy tasks. \nMonitoring performance & training the team. \nUnderstanding sales figures & targets.\n\n## Experience required\n\nHonesty, reliability, and commitment. \nHard working and a willingness to learn. \nAble to work well in a team.  \nNo experience is required, all we ask is you are over 18 due to the nature of the role.\n\n## Training details\n\nTraining provided.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nWe ask for a minimum of 4 hour a week\n\n## Travel details\n\nOxfam is located at 120/122 Nicolson Street, Edinburgh\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTransport expenses will be covered - please retain your train or bus ticket\nLunch with be covered if a full day is worked.",
