                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-29",
                    "title": "Community Facilities Assistant",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe require volunteers to support the day-to-day operation of Whitburn Community Centre, helping visitors, assisting with room booking and set-ups, and ensuring the building remains welcoming for the whole community. \r\nWe have flexible opportunities during weekdays where you can contribute a few hours per week or support on an occasional basis.\n\n## Experience required\n\nWe’re looking for reliable, approachable and responsible people who take pride in their volunteering and enjoy helping others.",
