        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/00124000008nbm1AAA",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/00124000008nbm1AAA/cancer-research-uk-aberdeen",
            "name": "Cancer Research UK  (Aberdeen)",
            "description": "Lets beat cancer sooner!  At Cancer Research UK we pioneer research to bring forward the day when all cancers are cured. We fund scientists, doctors and nurses to help beat cancer sooner. We also provide cancer information to the public.",
            "website": "https://www.cancerresearchuk.org",
            "cause": [
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/CharityShop",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Charity Shop"
                },
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/Health",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Health"
                },
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/Volunteering",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Volunteering"
                }
            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000C2LHZYA3",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000C2LHZYA3/shop-volunteers-homeware-and-clothing",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Shop Volunteers - Homeware and Clothing",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nOur shop volunteers are helping us beat cancer right now.   \r\n\r\nOver 14,000 volunteers give 3.1 million hours of their time to Cancer Research UK across our shops every year and have sold items totalling £15million. These funds are helping us start new clinical trials and research treatments as we speak.  \r\n\r\nIf you volunteer at a Cancer Research UK shop, you too could make a real difference to what we can achieve. Nothing we do would be possible without amazing volunteers like you.  \r\n\r\nYou’ll also gain valuable skills to help develop your CV and experience. And you’ll volunteer alongside a wonderful team of passionate, friendly people who will support you every step of the way.  \r\n\r\nVolunteering is open to everyone and no experience is required. So, if you’re looking for a new challenge, we’d love to hear from you. \r\n\r\nVolunteering in our shops is varied, exciting and rewarding. No two days are the same and you have the chance to flex different skills regularly. There are always new opportunities to keep you engaged and help you grow and develop in your role. \r\n\r\nWhile this list is not exhaustive, it gives you a flavour of some of the typical tasks in our charity shops: \r\n•\tServing customers, taking cash and providing good all-round customer service \r\n•\tSorting through donated items and pricing stock \r\n•\tWorking on window and shop displays \r\n•\tKeeping the shop tidy, clean and well organised \r\n•\tInteracting with the general public \r\n\r\nTo volunteer with us in Aberdeen please visit https://www.cancerresearchuk.org/get-involved/volunteer/shop-volunteer-aberdeen-superstore?_gl=1*15jppe1*_gcl_aw*R0NMLjE3NTc1ODA2ODQuRUFJYUlRb2JDaE1JaTQzOW9LclFqd01WU1pWUUJoMFpRQXJmRUFBWUFTQUFFZ0pMS3ZEX0J3RQ..*_gcl_dc*R0NMLjE3NTc1ODA2ODQuRUFJYUlRb2JDaE1Ja for more details and to apply or contact Gavin Allan at email gavin.allan@cancer.org.uk if you have any questions or require more details.\n\n## Experience required\n\nYou just need to be motivated, hardworking and enjoy being part of a team. There’ll be a full induction as well as ongoing training opportunities to make sure you’re fully confident and able to excel in your role. \n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nWe are looking for volunteers for any day of the week, weekdays or weekends. We are appreciative of any time you are able to volunteer with us.\n\n## Travel details\n\nWe are located at the Beach Boulevard retail park, in between Aldi and Smyths\n\n## Taster details\n\nIf you are interested in volunteering we will invite you along for a taster session to meet the team and see what a normal day looks like.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-volunteerscotland-search.appspot.com/o/opportunities%2FdHNETEFVwpSyLjQAuZrCzlT2S342%2FKPao6xQC5Arf2yLQ-thumbnail.jpg?alt=media&token=15e19dde-7c9e-46b9-9d83-40b7eef2ef7f",
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000C2LHZYA3#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Shop Volunteers - Homeware and Clothing",
                        "description": "You just need to be motivated, hardworking and enjoy being part of a team. There’ll be a full induction as well as ongoing training opportunities to make sure you’re fully confident and able to excel in your role. ",
                        "commitment": "We are looking for volunteers for any day of the week, weekdays or weekends. We are appreciative of any time you are able to volunteer with us.",
                        "applyLink": "https://www.cancerresearchuk.org/get-involved/volunteer/shop-volunteer-aberdeen-superstore?_gl=1*15jppe1*_gcl_aw*R0NMLjE3NTc1ODA2ODQuRUFJYUlRb2JDaE1JaTQzOW9LclFqd01WU1pWUUJoMFpRQXJmRUFBWUFTQUFFZ0pMS3ZEX0J3RQ..*_gcl_dc*R0NMLjE3NTc1ODA2ODQuRUFJYUlRb2JDaE1Ja",
                        "allowsRemoteParticipation": false,
                        "minimumAge": "18",
                        "theme": [
                            {
                                "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Theme/GeneralPublic",
                                "skos:prefLabel": "General Public"
                            },
                            {
