                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-01",
                    "title": "Volunteer Youth Group Helper",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nYouth Group Helpers required for evening session working with young people who have ADHD to provide support and guidance. Experience is not essential as training will be provided.\n\n## Description\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity to build new skills while making a difference to others.\r\n\r\nYouth Group Helpers will be required to help young people during activities and outings within the group, assess the needs of the young people during the session, support young people to facilitate personal and social growth to encourage greater social inclusion, and attend training and development opportunities as provided by the group alongside team meetings when necessary.\n\n## Experience required\n\nAn interest in ADHD/Additional Support Needs is desirable however not a requirement.\n\n## Training details\n\nTraining on ADHD - buddy system with established volunteer.\n\n## Travel details\n\nManhattan Works.",
