                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe are looking for volunteers who can provide support with preparing and completing CT600 and CT600E tax return forms.\n\n## Experience required\n\nKnowledge and experience in the preparation and completion of financial records and tax returns\n\n## Training details\n\nWe will provide any support we can manage to help the completion of this work. Documents travel \r\nWe can offer help in the repair or production of an item volunteer may have in mind\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nWe expect work can be completed at home but can pay for pre-agreed  travel costs or even transport person if local to Westhill area",
