            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000008h2htYAA",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000008h2htYAA/board-member",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-13",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-12",
                    "title": "Board Member",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAre you passionate about making a difference in the community? Do you have the skills and dedication to help guide a dynamic organisation committed to supporting vulnerable individuals in the heart of the community?\r\n\r\nYMCA Glenrothes is a leading community and homeless organisation dedicated to providing essential services, advocacy, and support to those in need.  They are seeking enthusiastic and committed individuals to join their Board of Trustees. Ideal candidates will have experience in one or more of the following areas:\r\n\r\n-Fundraising and Development\r\n-Legal and Compliance\r\n-Financial Management\r\n-Strategic Planning\r\n-HR Services\r\n\r\nAs a board member, you will:\r\n\r\n-Provide strategic direction and oversight\r\n-Support fundraising and resource development efforts\r\n-Advocate for our mission and programs\r\n-Ensure the organisation’s financial health and sustainability goals\n\n## Experience required\n\nFundraising and Development\r\nLegal and Compliance\r\nFinancial Management\r\nStrategic Planning\r\nHR Services\r\naccountancy or treasury background.\n\n## Training details\n\nSupport will be provided for all volunteers and training offered depending on each individuals’ skills/needs.\n\n## Travel details\n\nNorth Street, Glenrothes KY7 5PP\n\n## Travel expenses\n\n45p per mile, reimbursed on a monthly basis.",
