                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000I3X6jYAF",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000I3X6jYAF/digital-display-promotion-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-09-22",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-23",
                    "title": "Digital Display Promotion Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nYMCA Glenrothes is an independent local charity, governed by a dedicated team of volunteers from across Fife and proudly affiliated with the worldwide YMCA movement. Committed to supporting the local community, the charity delivers practical services, information, and opportunities that help people thrive, build connections, and overcome challenges.\r\n\r\nYMCA Glenrothes is looking for an enthusiastic volunteer to help maximise the potential of its brand-new digital advertising screen.\r\nLocated on the exterior of the organisation's Head Office, the screen provides a high-visibility, 24/7 platform for promoting services, events, campaigns, and community initiatives. YMCA Glenrothes is keen to increase awareness and usage and explore opportunities to promote it to local businesses and organisations.\r\n\r\nPossible duties include:\r\n•\tPromoting the digital advertising screen to local businesses and community organisations.\r\n•\tIdentifying opportunities to increase awareness and usage of the platform.\r\n•\tBuilding and maintaining positive relationships with potential advertisers.\r\n•\tAssisting with the creation of promotional materials and marketing campaigns.\r\n•\tResearching similar advertising initiatives and sharing ideas for development.\r\n•\tWorking alongside the YMCA team to develop new and innovative ways to maximise the screen's impact.\n\n## Travel details\n\nIn around the central Glenrothes area.",
