                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-15",
                    "title": "Early Years Helpers",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nThis volunteering opportunity is to support our early year’s activities within our busy centre. \r\nOn a Tuesday we have our fun Mucky Pups activities. This is a messy play activity with sand, art and water etc. Parents come along and interact with their children.\r\nWe would wish our volunteer to speak to parents, filling up resources and help our caretaking staff set up the resources. \r\nGood induction and ongoing support is provided to all volunteers.  A fantastic opportunity to help at a busy and enjoyable group. All volunteers make a real difference and are greatly appreciated.\r\nFor more details please contact:\r\nLyndsay Johnstone\r\nE Mail: danestonecentre@btinternet.com / tel.: 01224 828333\n\n## Description\n\nThis volunteering opportunity is to support our early year’s activities within our busy centre. \r\nOn a Tuesday we have our fun Mucky Pups activities. This is a messy play activity with sand, art and water etc. Parents come along and interact with their children.\r\nWe would wish our volunteer to speak to parents, filling up resources and help our caretaking staff set up the resources. \r\nGood induction and ongoing support is provided to all volunteers.  A fantastic opportunity to help at a busy and enjoyable group. All volunteers make a real difference and are greatly appreciated.\r\nFor more details please contact:\r\nLyndsay Johnstone\r\nE Mail: danestonecentre@btinternet.com / tel.: 01224 828333\n\n## Experience required\n\nFriendly personality and a good communicator.\n\n## Training details\n\nGood support and induction provided to all volunteers.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nTakes place on a Tuesday morning.\n\n## Travel details\n\nDanestone Community Centre, Fairview Street, Danestone Aberdeen, AB22 8ZP. The centre is close to the Bridges number one bus stop. Car parking also available.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nWe pay public transport rates and will reimburse weekly",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
