                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g24000000eNFdAAM",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g24000000eNFdAAM/playgroup-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-15",
                    "title": "Playgroup Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nBusy Bees Playgroup is looking for an enthusiastic, person who enjoys working with children.  This opportunity is to help support our 2 Playgroup Leaders.\r\n\r\nA variety of activities would be included in this role, from playing games, painting, craft making and most importantly having FUN !\r\n\r\nFor more details please contact: \r\nLyndsay Johnstone \r\nE Mail: danestonecentre@btinternet.com / tel.: 01224 828333\n\n## Description\n\nBusy Bees Playgroup is looking for an enthusiastic, person who enjoys working with children.  This opportunity is to help support our 2 Playgroup Leaders.\r\n\r\nA variety of activities would be included in this role, from playing games, painting, craft making and most importantly having FUN !\r\n\r\nBusy Bees is a small playgroup with up to 20 children aged between 2 yrs and pre-school nursery age.\r\n\r\nA fantastic and enjoyable opportunity to help and gain good experience in a dynamic Playgroup and Community Centre. All volunteer assistance is greatly appreciated and makes a real difference. For more details please contact: \r\nLyndsay Johnstone \r\nE Mail: danestonecentre@btinternet.com / tel.: 01224 828333\n\n## Experience required\n\nPatience, experience working with children and working as part of a team.\n\n## Training details\n\nGood support provided to all volunteers and relevant early years training, First Aid and Elementary Food Hygiene.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nVolunteers required for any morning(s) that the Playgroup operates (Monday, Wednesday and/or Fiday).\n\n## Travel details\n\nBusy Bees Play Room at Danestone Community Centre, Fairview Street, Danestone Aberdeen, AB22 8ZP. \r\nPlenty of parking spaces available should the volunteer have a car\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nWe pay public transport rates and will reimburse weekly",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g24000000eNFdAAM#role",
