            "name": "Aberdeen Women's Alliance",
            "description": "Aberdeen Women's Alliance are a small, local, charity that was set up in 2004. Our aim is to enable Aberdeen womens' voices to be better heard by decision-makers.  Since 2013 we have also run a successful local women's history project.  Most recently during the pandemic, we have worked with our partners to make sure some disadvantaged women are having their basic needs met.",
