                    "publishStart": "2026-09-07",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-01",
                    "title": "Admin Assistant",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nGeneral office duties that include:  typing letters & minutes, completing mail shots, maintaining filing systems, photocoping & laminating and assisting others to complete relevant paper work\r\n\r\nThe length of time for volunteering commencement can vary as per a phone call on 15/01/08 - BC\n\n## Description\n\nGeneral office duties that include:  typing letters & minutes, completing mail shots, maintaining filing systems, photocoping & laminating and assisting others to complete relevant paper work\n\n## Experience required\n\nPrevious experience of working in an office/administration environment.  Knowledge of Microsoft packages including Word, Excel and Access.  Confidentiality is essential in this role.\n\n## Travel details\n\nThe Frank Sweeny Centre, Glasgow Street, Ardrossan",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
