                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g24000000eGnUAAU",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g24000000eGnUAAU/technical-operator",
                    "publishStart": "2026-07-13",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-11",
                    "title": "Technical Operator",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nTo assist in the broadcast of a live show, drive the mixing desk for the presenters, abide by all legal issues relating to radio broadcast and carry out administrative duties as required\n\nThe length of time for volunteering commencement can vary as per a phone call on 15/01/08 - BC\n\n## Description\n\nTo assist in the broadcast of a live show, drive the mixing desk for the presenters, abide by all legal issues relating to radio broadcast and carry out administrative duties as required\n\n## Experience required\n\nExperience of working in a radio studio, you must be technical minded. N.B.  Although experience is preferred it is not essential, as full training will be provided\n\n## Travel details\n\nFrank Sweeny Centre Ardrossan",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g24000000eGnUAAU#role",
