                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-11",
                    "title": "Studio Worker",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nTo answer the telephone in the studio & log all calls, complete playlists on behalf of presenters, assist with competition entries & prizes, greet visitors & guests in the studio, abide by all legal issues relating to radio broadcast and carry out administrative duties as required. \n\nThe length of time for volunteering commencement can vary as per a phone call on 15/01/08 - BC\n\n## Description\n\nTo answer the telephone in the studio & log all calls, complete playlists on behalf of presenters, assist with competition entries & prizes, greet visitors & guests in the studio, abide by all legal issues relating to radio broadcast and carry out administrative duties as required.\n\n## Experience required\n\nPrevious experience of working in a radio studio desirable, but not essential as full training will be providedl. A friendly personality is a must for this role\n\n## Travel details\n\nThe Frank Sweeney Centre, Ardrossan",
