                    "title": "Board member",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nHeartstart provide free Emergency Life Support skills to members of the public within Ayrshire.  We are looking to recruit new members for our Board.  The Board help manage and support the aims of Heartstart.  Candidates with a background in administration, accountancy/bookkeeping, quality assurance, or HR experience would be most welcome to join.\n\n## Experience required\n\nCandidates with a background in administration, accountancy/bookkeeping, quality assurance, or HR experience would be beneficial but not necessary.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nWe meet quarterly, however the experience mentioned above is often required to support and manage the administration of the scheme.\n\n## Travel details\n\nBoard meetings are usually held within Ayr Hospital.",
