                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-16",
                    "title": "Fundraising Team Volunteer – Bucket Collections",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nFundraising Team Volunteer – Bucket Collections\n\n## Description\n\nDuties include:\n\n\nGreeting and engaging with the public\nEncouraging donations in a positive way\nRepresenting the hospice at community locations\nHandling collection buckets safely\n\n\nSkills required:\n\n\nFriendly and confident\nReliable and punctual\nComfortable standing for periods of time\nPositive and enthusiastic\n\n\nTime commitment:\n\nFlexible, typically a few hours per month\n\nTraining, support and benefits:\n\n\nFull induction and ongoing support\n20% discount in our community charity shops\n\n## Experience required\n\nFriendly and confident\nReliable and punctual\nComfortable standing for periods of time\nPositive and enthusiastic",
