                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000Hv29lYAB",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000Hv29lYAB/fundraising-team-volunteer-events-support",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-20",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-16",
                    "title": "Fundraising Team Volunteer – Events Support",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nFundraising Team Volunteer – Events Support\n\n## Description\n\nDo you enjoy being part of a team and getting involved in events? We are looking for volunteers to help at our fundraising events, helping bring events to life and create memorable experiences while raising vital funds.\n\nThis role is perfect for someone who enjoys variety, meeting new people, and getting stuck in.\n\nDuties include:\n\n\n\tHelping set up and pack down events\n\tWelcoming and engaging with attendees\n\tSupporting activities like raffles and sales\n\tHandling donations and payments\n\n\nSkills required:\n\n\n\tFriendly and enthusiastic\n\tTeam player with a flexible approach\n\tConfident engaging with the public\n\tWilling to try a variety of tasks\n\n\nTime commitment:\nFlexible, typically around one day per month\n\nTraining, support and benefits:\nFull induction and ongoing support\n20% discount in our community charity shops\n\n## Experience required\n\nFriendly and enthusiastic\nTeam player with a flexible approach\nConfident engaging with the public\nWilling to try a variety of tasks",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
