                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000Hv24vYAB",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000Hv24vYAB/pre-loved-shop-retail-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-20",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-16",
                    "title": "Pre-Loved Shop Retail Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nPre-Loved Shop Retail Volunteer\n\n## Description\n\nAre you looking for experience in retail or would just like to give something back? Our shops raise vital funds for the Hospice from selling donated clothes, books, toys and small electrical items.\n\nWe are currently looking for friendly and organised people to help in our pre-loved shops:\n\n\nLivery Walk, Bridge of Weir\nMoss Street, Paisley&nbsp;\nNeilston&nbsp;Road, Paisley\nHigh Street, Johnstone\n\n\n&nbsp;\n\nDuties include:\n\n\nSorting through donation bags and selecting items suitable for sale (some lifting is required).\nHanging and steaming selected items.\nResearching item values on the internet when necessary.\nPricing goods according to St Vincent&rsquo;s Hospice pricing guide.\nRecycling unsellable items.\nOffering excellent customer service\nTaking payments from customers at the till\nPromoting St Vincent&rsquo;s Hospice fundraising events.\n\n\nSkills required:\n\n\nFriendly personality.\nWillingness to learn new skills.\nAbility to work independently and as part of a team.\n\n\nTime commitment:\n\nWe are looking for volunteers who can commit a few hours, one day per week or fortnight. We can be flexible in terms of which day(s)\n\nOur shop opening times are:\n\nMonday to Saturday 10am &ndash; 4.30pm\n\nTraining, support and benefits:\n\n\nA full induction and further skills training to enable you to fulfil your role as required.\nA staff member will support you throughout your time as a volunteer.\n20% discount in our community charity shops.\n\n## Experience required\n\nFriendly personality.\nWillingness to learn new skills.\nAbility to work independently and as part of a team",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000Hv24vYAB#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Pre-Loved Shop Retail Volunteer",
