                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-16",
                    "title": "Fundraising and Events Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nFundraising and Events Volunteer\n\n## Description\n\nWe are looking for outgoing and enthusiastic volunteers to support our fundraising events either on a one off basis or as a more regular commitment.\n\nDuties will be event dependant but may include:\n\n\n\tBucket Collections.\n\tEvent preparation (i.e. Administration tasks).\n\tPhysical event set up.\n\tMarshalling or assisting at events.\n\n\nSkills required:\n\n\n\tReliable and honest.\n\tAbility to work independently and as part of a team.\n\tEnthusiastic with a positive attitude.\n\n\nTime commitment:\n\nAs and when required. We run events throughout the year so this would be a flexible role and details would be shared before each event.\n\nTraining, support and benefits:\n\n\n\tA full induction and further skills training to enable you to fulfil your role as required.\n\tA staff member will support you throughout your time as a volunteer.\n\t20% discount in our community charity shops.\n\n## Experience required\n\nReliable and honest.\nAbility to work independently and as part of a team.\nEnthusiastic with a positive attitude.",
