                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HsytRYAR",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HsytRYAR/ebay-books-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-12",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-08",
                    "title": "Ebay Books Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nEbay Books Volunteer\n\n## Description\n\nDo you have a love of books and an eye for detail? We&rsquo;re looking for volunteers to join our eBay team, helping us turn donated books into vital funds for St Vincent&rsquo;s Hospice.\n\nAs part of our online retail team, you&rsquo;ll play a key role in identifying, researching, and preparing books for sale on our eBay store. Every book sold directly supports compassionate care for patients and families in our community.\n\nThis role is perfect for anyone interested in books, sustainable reuse, or online selling.\n\nDuties include:\n\n\n\t\n\tSorting donated books and identifying those suitable for online sale\n\t\n\t\n\tResearching book titles, editions, and resale value\n\t\n\t\n\tPreparing books for sale by checking condition and writing accurate descriptions\n\t\n\t\n\tPhotographing books and assisting with creating eBay listings\n\t\n\t\n\tSupporting with organisation and management of book stock\n\t\n\n\nSkills required:\n\n\n\t\n\tInterest in books and literature\n\t\n\t\n\tGood attention to detail, particularly when checking editions and condition\n\t\n\t\n\tOrganised, reliable, and punctual\n\t\n\t\n\tComfortable using a computer or willing to learn basic eBay processes\n\t\n\t\n\tPositive attitude and ability to work as part of a team\n\t\n\n\nTime commitment:\n\nWe are looking for volunteers who can commit to a few hours per week. There is flexibility depending on stock availability and team needs, with opportunities to increase hours during busy periods.\n\nTraining, support and benefits:\n\n\n\t\n\tFull induction and ongoing training to support you in your role\n\t\n\t\n\tOngoing support from a member of staff throughout your volunteering\n\t\n\t\n\t20% discount in our community charity shops\n\n## Experience required\n\nFamiliar with use of a smart phone",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HsytRYAR#role",
