                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HlYKbYAN",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HlYKbYAN/ebay-listing-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-07-14",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-10",
                    "title": "Ebay Listing Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nEbay Listing Volunteer\n\n## Description\n\nDo you have an eye for detail and are familiar with a smartphone? If so, we are looking for volunteers to assist with selecting, listing and preparing items for sale on our online retail platforms.\n\nDuties include:\n\n\nSelecting suitable items for sale on our online shops.\nCapturing good quality images of items for sale using a smartphone.\nResearching and writing item descriptions.\nPreparing and packaging items for posting.\n\n\n&nbsp;\n\nSkills required:\n\n\nAwareness of eBay, and&nbsp;similar online selling platforms.\nConfident using a smartphone.\nGood writing skills.\nAbility to work independently and as part of a team.\nEnthusiastic with a positive attitude.\n\n\nTime commitment:\n\nWe are looking for someone who can commit to a few hours, one day per week. We can be flexible in terms of which day(s)\n\n&nbsp;\n\nTraining, support and benefit:\n\n\nA full induction and further skills training to enable you to fulfil your role as required.\nA staff member will support you throughout your time as a volunteer.\n20% discount in our community charity shops.\n\n## Experience required\n\nFamiliar with using a smartphone.",
