            "name": "Haldane Youth Services",
            "description": "Our main aim is to make a positive difference to the lives of the  children and young people, aged 7 -12 years living within Haldane.\r\nTo achieve this goal we are specifically looking towards ;\r\n· Providing opportunities for children to broaden their horizons and raise their aspiration.\r\n· Encouraging confidence and self-esteem.",
            "website": "http://www.haldaneyouthservices.org.uk/",
            "charityRegistration": [
