            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/0011p00002bTA8DAAW/the-conservation-volunteers",
            "name": "The Conservation Volunteers",
            "description": "TCV in Scotland offers a wide range of environmental activity for all in helping to protect and enhance our local greenspace and biodiversity whilst also learning new skills, getting fitter, engaging with your environment and meeting other like-minded people.\r\nWe are also committed to providing a diverse range of high quality learning opportunities for a wide range of participants, we support local communities and can help you discover your 'inner scientist' and that hidden passion for nature.",
