                    "title": "Admin Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe are looking for admin volunteers to join our existing team to assist the elderly and vulnerable within the G64 area: Bishopbriggs, Auchinairn, Torrance and Balmore.\r\nDuties include: taking calls from clients, putting requests out to volunteers on WhatsApp, updating our spreadsheet and uploading receipts to our google drive.\r\nPhone lines are open Monday-Friday 9am to 4pm.  Our admin teams work on a rota and cover 1 day per week.\n\n## Experience required\n\nBasic computer skills\n\n## Travel details\n\nHome based",
