                    "title": "Local Donations Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nOur local donations team coordinates the collection and drop-off of the pre-loved items that are generously donated to us. They must be comfortable managing their own Facebook page and inbox. \r\n\r\nMain Tasks\r\n\r\nManaging your local Facebook group including responding to queries, managing inbox messages and promoting any relevant information from the main Bairnecessities Facebook page.\r\nOrganising the collection and drop-off of items from donors \r\nCompleting basic checks to make sure items are in appropriate condition (training provided)\n\n## Training details\n\nHealth & Safety",
