            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000006R0uvYAC",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000006R0uvYAC/help-host-a-tea-party-for-older-people",
                    "publishStart": "2026-09-29",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-20",
                    "title": "Help Host a tea party for Older People",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAre you a kind empathetic person who loves to help your community?\r\n\r\nWe are looking for some volunteers to help our with our monthly tea parties for Older People in the community. Our tea parties offer people a chance to meet other people, get out the house, and just make life that little bit less lonely.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for people who would be up for having people around for a cuppa and offering some light refreshments to a small group- like a neighbourhood coffee morning! You will only host once or twice a year and everyone is driven to your home by our Volunteer Drivers and you are supported by the team at Re-engage as well as your Volunteer Coordinator\r\n\r\nIf you don't have a space that is suitable. maybe you know about a local community centre, hall, garden centre, cafe.. the list goes on and on! All that matters is connecting with someone who lonely or isolated.\n\n## Experience required\n\nBefriending / Mentoring\r\nCatering / Hospitality\r\nCaring\r\nGood Communicator\r\nGood Listener\r\nPatient\r\nSociable\n\n## Training details\n\nOnline training\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nCommitment Flexible 2 Hours, Monthly",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
