                    "title": "Volunteer Car Drivers",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nNETT is looking for volunteers who can use their own car to help local people get where they need to go.\r\n\r\nFrom hospital appointments and visiting loved ones, to shopping, social visits and the things that help people stay independent — your time, your car and a friendly face could make all the difference.\n\n## Training details\n\nWe can also provide MiDAS/ MiDAS MPV and PATS courses as well as 1st aid and other courses.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nWe can pay mileage costs from your home back to your home.",
