                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Older People Befriender",
                        "description": "There are no formal educational or experience requirements but you must be reliable and a good communicator with a sense of humour. An awareness and understanding of the needs of older people and the difficulties they may face living at home whilst ageing would be beneficial.",
                        "commitment": "We ask for a commitment of two hours per fortnight, though time and location are flexible.",
