                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-01",
                    "title": "Brodick Lunch Club chef",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nChef for lunch club.  To provide two course meal for around 15-18 older people once per fortnight.\r\nWill be responsible for planning menu, with regard to dietary requirements & budget.  Responsible for preparing meals & keeping kitchen clean & tidy.\n\n## Experience required\n\nPlanning, budgeting, food preparation.\r\nLevel 2 Food Safety & Hygiene course required - to be arranged by organisation.\n\n## Training details\n\nLevel 2 Food Hygiene & Safety Certificate\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nOnce per fortnight\n\n## Travel details\n\nDue to island location, this is only suitable for Arran residents",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
