        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/0011p00002gRwKOAA0",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/0011p00002gRwKOAA0/stand-international-aberdeen-volunteers",
            "name": "STAND International (Aberdeen Volunteers)",
            "description": "We are STAND International. We work with disadvantaged communities across Scotland and abroad. We make a difference by offering participants in our programmes the opportunity to Start A New Day (STAND) by providing training and support and placements within partner charities abroad. \r\n\r\nWe believe everyone has the potential to be able to turn their lives around and do something great.",
            "website": "https://standinternational.org/",
            "cause": [
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/OverseasAidDevelopingWorld",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Overseas Aid / Developing World"
                },
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/Poverty",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Poverty"
                },
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/Volunteering",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Volunteering"
                }
            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000VhnbQAAR",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000VhnbQAAR/stand-international-overseas-volunteering",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-15",
                    "title": "STAND International Overseas Volunteering",
                    "description": "## Description\n\n- Willing to participate in activities and learn about new cultures?\r\n- Ready to create social change and improve peoples lives?\r\n\r\n\r\nNo matter where you are in Scotland, you have access to training and learning opportunities abroad that can help you gain skills, boost confidence, and earn qualifications.\r\n\r\nOur organisation offers multiple trips throughout the year, with mentors available to provide support. We partner with other organizations to offer placements in Ghana, Romania, and potentially Eastern European countries, each with a unique set of activities and tasks that focus on developing various skills.\r\n\r\nWe offer shorter 3 to 4 day trips for young people, aged 16-30, as well as longer trips of 2 to 3 weeks for anyone over 16.\r\n\r\nAn exciting and great opportunity to help and make a difference.\r\n\r\nFor more information please contact Megan Beattie, Project Delivery Lead at email: start@standinternational.org or telephone: 0131 659 9943.\r\n\r\nFurther information is also available at: https://www.standinternational.org/\n\n## Experience required\n\nYou don't need any experience, you just need to be committed and motivated!\n\n## Training details\n\nExcellent support and relevant training is provided to all volunteers.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nThe volunteering times are flexible.",
