        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/0011p00002gS3yiAAC",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/0011p00002gS3yiAAC/the-salvation-army-debt-advice-service",
            "name": "The Salvation Army Debt Advice Service",
            "description": "A free, Impartial and confidential service helping clients to manage their financial situation.",
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g1p00000McarAAAR",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g1p00000McarAAAR/debt-advisor",
                    "publishStart": "2019-10-23",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-31",
                    "title": "Debt Advisor",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nTo Help clients address their financial challenges and gain new skills, becoming debt free\n\n## Description\n\nInterview clients to gain a full understanding of their financial situation\nRecord financial and other relevant information accurately and summarise action points and timescales, Complete all necessary paperwork at the interview and ensure that actions are agreed with the client, Ensure all information and paperwork is given to the person responsible for carrying the action points forward, Signpost clients as appropriate, without bias, Undertake administrative tasks as appropriate.\n\n## Experience required\n\n• Interest in Salvation Army’s work\n• Ability to keep confidences\n• Good listening and empathy skills \n• Reliable\n• Able to record information accurately\n• Computer literate\n\n## Training details\n\nThere is a formal induction process.\n\n## Travel details\n\nThe Salvation Army  1 East Adam Street, Edinburgh , EH8 9TF\nThe Salvation Army  431 Gorgie Road, Edinburgh EH11 2RT\nThe Salvation ARmy 36 Wardieburn Drive EH5 1BZ\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nSubmit to Centre Coordinator",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
