            "name": "Naval Childrens Charity (WI)",
            "description": "A childrens charity for children with a parent serving or ex serving in the Royal Navy, Royal  Marines, Reserves and Royal Fleet Auxilliary.  Many children experience long separations from their parent(s).  Story books have been written to help younger children understand and manage their emotions.  With the book knitted rabbits/penguins with faces on their tummies (smile/frown) are given to help express how they are feeling.",
            "website": "https://www.navalchildrenscharity.org.uk",
