                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g1p00000KuN9VAAV/retail-assistant",
                    "publishStart": "2026-05-27",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-11-16",
                    "title": "Retail Assistant",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAs part of a committed team you would have an active role in raising the profile of barnardos as well as providing excellent customer services. This has many elements that would enhance any existing skills as well as providing an opportunity to learn new ones\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo formal qualifications required, friendly enthusiastic person, no experience necessary\n\n## Travel details\n\nEast Road Retail Park, Irvine",
