                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000D9dsHYAR",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000D9dsHYAR/maintenancecare-taker-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2025-11-10",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-05-07",
                    "title": "Maintenance/Care Taker Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nStenhousemuir Gymnastics Club located within Carron Gymnastics Centre a state of the art gymnastics training facility in Falkirk.  The Centre is the focal point of gymnastics development in Falkirk and has the full range of women's and men's artistic equipment and specialised training equipment, including a foam pit, full sized sprung floor and tumble tracks.  \r\n\r\nWe currently have a volunteer role available for someone to carry out small maintenance and/or repairs to our premises both inside and out.\r\n\r\nTasks involved may include:\r\n*painting\r\n*basic plumbing\r\n*changing light bulbs\r\n*simple repairs and maintenance checks\r\n*General tidy up on the outside of the building.\n\n## Experience required\n\nGeneral awareness of DIY, building maintenance or previous experience an advantage.\n\n## Training details\n\nInduction will include a walk round the Centre and information on what we do.  \r\nIntroduction to staff and volunteers where required. \r\nOther relevant training may be available - can be discussed.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\n4hours per week.\r\nFlexible to suit the volunteer.\n\n## Travel details\n\nCarron Gymnastics Centre, Carronlea Drive, Falkirk FK2 8DN\n\n## Travel expenses\n\n45p per mile or bus fares upon receipt of ticket.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2Ff1faac59-791e-4323-9e1e-518f80a01fa9%2Fq19DcOWGQCRPIPMRCkAF0XcUA2l1%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=63179dc7-fff6-4f6e-b1c5-0544dcf204c1",
