            "name": "Action Against Stalking",
            "description": "We are Scotland's only charity dedicated exclusively to the victims of stalking. We provide a unique throughcare service for victims of stalking. We also deliver advocacy, campaigning, expert advice, accredited training and a range of other activities to support victims and those working to challenge stalking behaviour.",
            "website": "https://www.actionagainststalking.org/",
            "charityRegistration": [
                {
                    "registrar": "https://www.oscr.org.uk",
