                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000009Tf95YAC",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000009Tf95YAC/fundraising-secretary",
                    "publishStart": "2026-07-13",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-11",
                    "title": "Fundraising Secretary",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nDo you have a knack for planning and organisation? Are you interested in making a difference? Then becoming a Fundraising Group Secretary could be the right step for you.In this interactive volunteer role, your support will include getting involved in these activities:\r\n\r\nSpreading tokens of appreciation to the hard-working fundraisers that support our cause.\r\nSharing the word about the exciting fundraising activities your fundraising group gets involved with.\r\nSupporting your fundraising group with various admin activities, like writing agendas for meetings or making applications for events.\r\nBeing an ambassador for Guide Dogs!\n\n## Experience required\n\nHave good organisational skills.\r\nHave good communication skills.\r\nBe confident in the use of technology and email.\r\nIf you don’t feel you tick every box but are sure this role is the one for you, we’d love to hear from you! We’re always open to suggestions and are very happy to chat with you to find out what’s possible,",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000009Tf95YAC#role",
