        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/00124000008ndcaAAA",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/00124000008ndcaAAA/leuchie-house",
            "name": "Leuchie House",
            "description": "We support individuals and families living with neurological conditions such as MS, MND, Parkinson's and stroke through short respite breaks at Leuchie House in East Lothian, and outreach services.\r\n\r\nWe're the only charity in the UK to combine specialist nursing, physio and occupational therapy with healthcare technology. We proactively improve health, re-enable independence and reduce the loneliness endured by people with a neurological condition and the loved ones who care for them, while providing families with a respite break.",
            "website": "https://www.leuchiehouse.org.uk",
            "charityRegistration": [
                {
                    "registrar": "https://www.oscr.org.uk",
                    "registrationNumber": "SC042249"
                }
            ],
            "cause": [
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/Carers",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Carers"
                },
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/PhysicalDisability",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Physical Disability"
                }
            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000Hgek1YAB",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000Hgek1YAB/volunteer-at-leuchie-house",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-01",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-30",
                    "title": "Volunteer at Leuchie House",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nOur volunteers are involved in just about everything that goes on at Leuchie. From assisting in the physiotherapy department, to helping in the kitchen and maintaining our grounds, our volunteers get stuck in.\r\n\r\nLeuchie is truly a place like no other, and our friendly team of volunteers make it extra special. In return for your time, we'll work on your confidence, improve your CV and offer invaluable work experience.\r\n\r\nFor some, volunteering at Leuchie gives them a reality check and a different lens through which to view the stresses of their working lives. Other volunteers say that it helps keep them connected and introduces them to lots of interesting people.\r\n\r\nNo matter their background, all of our volunteers tell us that they leave with full hearts and big smiles after spending time at Leuchie.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo Expertise",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
