            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/00124000008nbdFAAQ/childrens-hospices-across-scotland",
            "name": "Childrens Hospices Across Scotland",
            "description": "CHAS is the only charity in Scotland that provides vital hospice services for children and young people with life-shortening conditions. We offer care for the whole family in our two children's hospices, Rachel House in Kinross and Robin House in Balloch. We also run a homecare service called CHAS at Home helping families in their own homes across Scotland when they need it most. \r\n\r\nWe are currently supporting over 300 families, as well as significant number of families who receive bereavement support. Our services are funded mainly through the generousity of our many supporters who help us to raise over £9million needed each year to provide these hospice services.",
