            "name": "Sunrise Partnership",
            "description": "Sunrise Partnership is a small local charity established in 2014.  We provide free, therapeutic confidential support for children and young people up to the age of 18 experiencing loss and bereavement.  We work in Aberdeen City and Aberdeenshire.  Our website is at: www.sunrisepartnership.org",
