                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000A7bhqYAB/trustees",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Trustees",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nSunrise Partnership (SCO44859) is a small, local charity working in Aberdeen and Aberdeenshire for over 10 years.  We provide free, therapeutic, confidential support for children and young people up to the age of 18 who have been affected by significant loss and  bereavement.\r\n\r\nOur friendly trustees come from a variety of experience and backgrounds, and we are aiming to strengthen our Board by recruiting up to 4 new trustees who have a good understanding of the third sector, and in particular with skills in any or some of the following: Finance, Fundraising, IT, Secretarial, Marketing and Publicity.\r\n\r\nWe hold 10 Trustee Board meetings in the evenings (the majority are virtual) during the year, and there are opportunities to attend various events, either promotional or fundraising and training sessions.  Reasonable travel expenses are reimbursed.\r\n\r\nExcellent support and relevant training is provided. Includes full induction regarding roles and responsibilities required of Trustees; supportive team; annual safeguarding training, role specific training.\r\n\r\nIf you would like further information, or to request an application form, please email vacancies@sunrisepartnership.org\n\n## Training details\n\nExcellent support and relevant training is provided. Full induction regarding roles and responsibilities required of Trustees; supportive team; annual Safeguarding training.  Role specific training will be considered.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible times. All help is greatly appreciated and makes a positive difference.\n\n## Travel details\n\nWe hold 10 Trustee Board Meetings in the evenings (the majority are virtual) during the year, and there are opportunities to attend various events, either promotional or fundraising and training sessions.  Reasonable travel expenses are reimbursed.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nReasonable travel expenses will be reimbursed when incurred for events, on submission and approval of expenses claim form.",
