                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Book Delivery Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nThe volunteer will collect books and other materials from their local community library and deliver to library members who are physically unable, through illness, infirmity or disability, to be able to make the journey themselves. They will collect returned books from those they visit and return them to the library. Volunteers will not usually have to enter customer’s houses, beyond sometimes briefly entering to pick up returned items for those too frail to lift them. The library will make sure they inform each customer of the volunteer’s expected time of arrival so the volunteer will be expected.\n\n## Experience required\n\nThe person needs to be physically fit, as they need to be able to carry bags of books to and from people’s homes.\n\n## Training details\n\nThe volunteer will liaise with a nominated member of staff at their local library, who will guide them through their induction, and will be the first point of contact for any issues, questions, or problems should they arise.\n\n## Travel details\n\nUse of a car is desiarable but not essential. Penicuik Centre is 5 minutes walk from a bus stop.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel expenses only can be reimbursed",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F6464bc98-c3cc-43c3-92d2-156acb10239b%2FWkLzgT1VE9cAHEWcVMpdVMd5bL63%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=295f9212-21b3-4a93-856f-ad784ab66adb",
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000006W0W5YAK#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Book Delivery Volunteer",
                        "description": "The person needs to be physically fit, as they need to be able to carry bags of books to and from people’s homes.",
