            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HnASfYAN",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HnASfYAN/football-session-assistant",
                    "publishStart": "2026-07-21",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-19",
                    "title": "Football Session Assistant",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nThe Pars Foundation run lots of community football sessions in the Dunfermline area. Their sessions are for all ages – starting from 18 months and running all through children, young people and adults. They also run lower impact sessions such as walking football.\r\n\r\nThey are looking for volunteers to help with their community football sessions, whether assisting with coaching and activities within sessions, or helping with set up and supporting and engaging with the participants. No coaching experience is required, as volunteers will have the opportunity to shadow existing coaches and will have ongoing support.\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in football, or if you want to help local people stay active, get in touch with the Pars Foundation now.\n\n## Experience required\n\nVolunteers should be enthusiastic about football/getting active, able to communicate well and be willing to get involved in the sessions. As a volunteer, you will have access to training and will always be accompanied by a coach.\n\n## Training details\n\nAll volunteers will be given an induction to the Pars Foundation, and ongoing support from the development manager and coaches.\n\n## Travel details\n\nMost sessions will take place within Pitreavie Sports and Soccer Centre, Dunfermline. Some sessions are delivered within the community.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nVolunteers will be matched with opportunities as locally as possible. Travel expenses can be discussed on a 1-1 basis.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HnASfYAN#role",
