            "name": "South West Aberdeenshire Citizens Advice Bureau",
            "description": "To provide advice and information on a wide range of categories to any citizen who needs it and to exercise a responsible influence on the development and implementation of national and regional policies.",
            "website": "http://www.westhillcab.org/",
            "charityRegistration": [
                {
