                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HBMhlYAH",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HBMhlYAH/volunteer-treasurer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-06-08",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-07",
                    "title": "Volunteer Treasurer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAt South West Aberdeenshire Citizens Advice Bureau we are looking to appoint a new unremunerated treasurer to join our board. We play an important role in serving the community across South West Aberdeenshire. \r\nAs treasurer you will contribute to ensuring Board Members are aware of their financial responsibilities with sufficient understanding of the CAB’s financial systems, policies and reports to enable effective Board decision-making. \r\nThis includes attending Bi-monthly board meetings with hall members. Presenting financial information and reports to Board meetings, General Meetings, strategic review and planning exercises or other meetings as needed. \r\nGuiding and advising the Board in their consideration of budgets, accounts, financial statements, financial procedures and other financial issues, including the financial implications of the strategic and project plans. Further requirements will be discussed on application\n\n## Training details\n\nFull Bureau and Trustee Induction and bespoke training programme",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F3d420816-3c6f-4a4a-8989-0ff2cfa693da%2FxxymN99P34NhsjAgh9k3z5xnvpz1%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=0019f771-fe0b-4c7f-b037-2439f56569d0",
