                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-07",
                    "title": "Volunteer Triage",
                    "description": "## Description\n\n. South West Aberdeenshire Citizens Advice Bureau are currently on the lookout for volunteers to help us facilitate our advice services.\r\nAs Triage volunteers your role would entail obtaining key information from clients on their support needs in order to determine the correct advice pathway for our clients.\r\nKey Responsibilities\r\n•\tWelcome and assist clients.\r\n•\tGather client details for interviews.\r\n•\tManage client data in our systems.\r\n•\tCoordinate appointments and manage expectations.\r\n•\tSupport facility management and perform administrative tasks.\n\n## Training details\n\nBureau induction and Triage training programme",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F3d420816-3c6f-4a4a-8989-0ff2cfa693da%2FxxymN99P34NhsjAgh9k3z5xnvpz1%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=0019f771-fe0b-4c7f-b037-2439f56569d0",
