                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HBMQ1YAP",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HBMQ1YAP/social-media-content-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-06-08",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-07",
                    "title": "Social Media Content Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAs a social media volunteer, you will work with the Chief Officer to create and share content on our social media platforms to increase our brand awareness, visibility, accessibility and engagement. You will also help us seek out new social media opportunities and new ways to connect with our community.\r\nThis list is not exhaustive and tasks will vary from department to department.\r\n•\tAdministration – follow procedures relating to office organisation.\r\n•\tInput data and information into computer systems.\r\n•\tEstablishing and/or maintaining active social media accounts.\r\n•\tResearching and creating creative content for different social media channels\r\n•\tIdentifying opportunities to establish relationships with local community groups.\r\n•\tThinking of innovative ways to drive online engagement.\r\n•\tCreating/ updating timetable of upcoming events and awareness days (Christmas, Red Nose day, etc.)\n\n## Training details\n\nFull Bureau induction and bespoke training programme",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F3d420816-3c6f-4a4a-8989-0ff2cfa693da%2FxxymN99P34NhsjAgh9k3z5xnvpz1%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=0019f771-fe0b-4c7f-b037-2439f56569d0",
