                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HBLvNYAX",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HBLvNYAX/receptionists",
                    "publishStart": "2026-06-08",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-07",
                    "title": "Receptionists",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nSouth West Aberdeenshire Citizens Advice Bureau offers free, impartial and confidential advice. They deliver support and guidance on a range of topics, giving people the information they need to deal with any situation and improve their lives.\r\nBy choosing to volunteer with South West Aberdeenshire Citizens Advice Bureau you’ll be giving something truly valuable back to the community.\r\nReception volunteers will be the clients' first point of contact with the bureau and will make sure they are given a warm and efficient welcome and are aware of what will happen during their visit.\r\nThis can be a varied role, here are some of things you might be doing within this role:\r\nMain Duties\r\n\r\n•\tWelcoming clients and anyone they have with them\t\r\n•\tExplaining waiting times and procedures to clients\r\n•\tTelling people what the CAB can do in a way that suits them \r\n•\tWorking within agreed bureau systems and procedures\r\n•\tAnswering the telephone and passing on callers to the appropriate person or taking a message\r\n•\tCreating and updating client records in the electronic recording system\r\n\r\nAttributes Needed for the Role\r\n\r\n•\tCommitted to the aims and principles of the Scottish CAB Service\r\n\r\n•\tOrganised and systematic\r\n\r\n•\tUnderstand the importance of CAB work\r\n•\tHave good communication skills\r\n•\tWilling to attend training and other meetings\n\n## Training details\n\nFull induction and training programme",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F3d420816-3c6f-4a4a-8989-0ff2cfa693da%2FxxymN99P34NhsjAgh9k3z5xnvpz1%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=0019f771-fe0b-4c7f-b037-2439f56569d0",
