            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/00124000008ndIZAAY/community-use-fife",
            "name": "Community Use Fife",
            "description": "Community Use is the team that works hard to ensure most of the Halls, Community Centres and Schools in Fife are available for everyone to enjoy learning, leisure, life, and cultural events.\r\n\r\nTogether with amazing partners they deliver a fantastic programme of inclusive pursuits including physical activity & sport, performing arts, arts & crafts, cookery, modern languages, and vocational training.\r\n\r\nThey also offer space for meetings, celebrations, and community events in both modern and historical buildings usually found in the heart of the Kingdom’s city, towns and villages.",
            "website": "https://active.fife.scot/about/community-use",
            "cause": [
