            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000GUoMLYA1",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000GUoMLYA1/retail-volunteers",
                    "publishStart": "2026-09-30",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-24",
                    "title": "Retail Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\n🐾 Love cats and dogs? Want to gain new skills while giving back? 🐾\r\n\r\nWe’re looking for friendly, enthusiastic volunteers to join our PDSA Torry charity shop team!\r\n\r\n✨ Roles available:\r\n• Till Assistant\r\n• Merchandising\r\n• General Cleaning\r\n• Social Media Tagging\r\n• Stock Sorting\r\n• Steaming & preparing clothing\r\n\r\n💡 Why join us?\r\n• Build retail & customer service skills\r\n• Learn merchandising and social media basics\r\n• Meet new people\r\n• Support a charity helping pets in need 🐶🐱\r\n\r\nNo experience needed—just a positive attitude and a love for animals!\r\n\r\n📍For more information please pop into our store at store at 93 Victoria Road, Torry, Aberdeen, AB11 9LU or message Natalie Dermody, PDSA Retail Assistant to get involved today at email: Dermody.Natalie@pdsa.org.uk\r\n\r\nFurther details about volunteering with the PDSA is also available at https://www.pdsa.org.uk/get-involved/volunteer\n\n## Description\n\n🐾 Love cats and dogs? Want to gain new skills while giving back? 🐾\r\n\r\nWe’re looking for friendly, enthusiastic volunteers to join our PDSA Torry charity shop team!\r\n\r\n✨ Roles available:\r\n• Till Assistant\r\n• Merchandising\r\n• General Cleaning\r\n• Social Media Tagging\r\n• Stock Sorting\r\n• Steaming & preparing clothing\r\n\r\n💡 Why join us?\r\n• Build retail & customer service skills\r\n• Learn merchandising and social media basics\r\n• Meet new people\r\n• Support a charity helping pets in need 🐶🐱\r\n\r\nExcellent support and relevant guidance is provided to all volunteers. We do trial shifts, provide constant support and upskilling is optional. No experience needed—just a positive attitude and a love for animals!\r\n\r\n📍For more information please pop into our store at store at 93 Victoria Road, Torry, Aberdeen, AB11 9LU or message Natalie Dermody, PDSA Retail Assistant to get involved today at email: Dermody.Natalie@pdsa.org.uk\n\n## Training details\n\nExcellent support and relevant guidance is provided to all volunteers. We do trial shifts, provide constant support and upskilling is optional.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible shifts available  to suit volunteers. All help is greatly appreciated and valued.\n\n## Travel details\n\nPDSA Charity Shop, 93 Victoria Road, Torry, Aberdeen, AB11 9LU",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
