                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000655BhYAI/stand-up-to-falls-volunteer-falls-ambassadors",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Stand Up To Falls Volunteer Falls Ambassadors",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nStand Up To Falls is collaboration between Volunteer Falls Ambassadors, NHS Grampian, Sport Aberdeen and  Aberdeen City Health & Social Care Partnership.\r\n\r\nVolunteer Falls Ambassadors are a vital part of the Stand Up To Falls Team, helping with our falls awareness sessions in the community.  The Stand Up To Falls Team offer falls awareness in the community through our pop up stand with information, top tips and signposting.\r\n\r\nFalls Ambassadors will;\r\n•\tEnjoy meeting new people\r\n•\tHave a positive and empathetic attitude\r\n•\tBe happy speaking to people and sharing falls prevention advice\r\n•\tBe available 4-6 times per year to volunteer\r\n\r\nFull training and support is provided to all volunteers and is an excellent opportunity to make a difference for people and help in the health and wellbeing of the community.\r\n\r\nIf you are interested or you would like to find out more, please email:\r\nActiveLifestyles@sportaberdeen.co.uk or telephone 01224 047926.\r\n\r\nFurther details are also available at: https://www.sportaberdeen.co.uk/stand-up-to-falls\n\n## Description\n\nStand Up To Falls is collaboration between Volunteer Falls Ambassadors, NHS Grampian, Sport Aberdeen and  Aberdeen City Health & Social Care Partnership.\r\n\r\nVolunteer Falls Ambassadors are a vital part of the Stand Up To Falls Team, helping with our falls awareness sessions in the community.  The Stand Up To Falls Team offer falls awareness in the community through our pop up stand with information, top tips and signposting.\r\n\r\nFalls Ambassadors will;\r\n•\tEnjoy meeting new people\r\n•\tHave a positive and empathetic attitude\r\n•\tBe happy speaking to people and sharing falls prevention advice\r\n•\tBe available 4-6 times per year to volunteer\r\n\r\nFull training and support is provided to all volunteers and is an excellent opportunity to make a difference for people and help in the health and wellbeing of the community.\r\n\r\nIf you are interested or you would like to find out more, please email:\r\nActiveLifestyles@sportaberdeen.co.uk or telephone 01224 047926.\r\n\r\nFurther details are also available at: https://www.sportaberdeen.co.uk/stand-up-to-falls\n\n## Training details\n\nFull training and support is provided to all volunteers.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible times available to help. All help makes a difference and is greatly appreciated.",
