                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-01",
                    "title": "Secretary",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nThe secretary plays a vital role in assisting the committee organise the smooth running of the support group ensuring vital support is given to those who have suffered a brain injury, their families and carers.\n\n## Description\n\nHeadway Dundee & Angus aims to support and provide information for those people with a brain injury, their families, and carers. \r\n\r\nThe secretary plays a vital role in assisting the committee organise the smooth running of the support group ensuring vital support is given to those who have suffered a brain injury, their families and carers.\n\n## Experience required\n\n•\tExcellent telephone manner and people skills \r\n•\tGood verbal and written communication skills\r\n•\tOutgoing, friendly and proactive character\r\n•\tAbility to work on own initiative\r\n•\tCommitment to working with compliance, policies and procedures\n\n## Training details\n\nBrain injury training is offered through Headway UK.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel expenses reimbursed.",
