                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000617vIYAQ",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000617vIYAQ/general-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2024-10-10",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-11-20",
                    "title": "General Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nContribute to the maintenance of a professional and welcoming environment of Headway Dundee and Angus peer support group and continue in providing the vital support needed for those with brain injury, their families and carers.\n\n## Description\n\nHeadway Dundee & Angus aims to support and provide information for those people with a brain injury, their families, and carers.\r\n\r\nContribute to the maintenance of a professional and welcoming environment of Headway Dundee and Angus peer support group and continue in providing the vital support needed for those with brain injury, their families and carers. \r\n\r\n•\tTo arrange refreshments for the group\r\n•\tSetting up and clearing away for the group\r\n•\tArrange activities for the group and source materials\r\n•\tTo distribute literature from Headway UK to members including competitions and information  \r\n•\tLiaise with other volunteers to produce quarterly newsletter\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo experience required, just dedication and enthusiasm.\n\n## Training details\n\nBrain injury training is offered through Headway UK\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel expenses reimbursed on group business (not to and from meetings).",
