                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g24000003VN6JAAW",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g24000003VN6JAAW/kitchen-assistant",
                    "publishStart": "2022-03-11",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-24",
                    "title": "Kitchen Assistant",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nA kitchen worker is required to assist staff in preparing meals for our older people’s lunch club and snacks for the toddler groups.\n\n## Description\n\nA kitchen worker is required to assist staff in preparing meals for our older people’s lunch club and snacks for the toddler groups. The centre cooks all food on a daily basis on site and this position entails all areas from preparation to serving. Other main duties relate to dish washer operation, kitchen surface cleaning and table setting and cleaning. All of these activities to be conducted to agreed standards. Regular contact will be made with centre users, staff and other volunteers, therefore good communication skills are required as well as the ability to be adaptable and work as part of a team.\n\n## Experience required\n\nWhat Will You Be Doing?  Preparing weekly menu, food shopping, preparing and cooking meals, clearing up kitchen and washing up Other ad hoc duties include: collecting in dirty plates, serving food, serving drinks, washing up\r\nWhat Skills/Experience Are Needed? Good Communication Skills; Friendly, helpful and understanding.\r\n What Will You Gain from the Role? Working with a variety of people; new experiences and skills; a sense of achievement.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nTuesday-Thursday 9.30am-1.30pm (flexible\n\n## Travel details\n\nThe facility is in Kemback Street in the Stobswell area.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nPublic Transport expenses paid weekly.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g24000003VN6JAAW#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Kitchen Assistant",
                        "description": "What Will You Be Doing?  Preparing weekly menu, food shopping, preparing and cooking meals, clearing up kitchen and washing up Other ad hoc duties include: collecting in dirty plates, serving food, serving drinks, washing up\r\nWhat Skills/Experience Are Needed? Good Communication Skills; Friendly, helpful and understanding.\r\n What Will You Gain from the Role? Working with a variety of people; new experiences and skills; a sense of achievement.",
                        "commitment": "Tuesday-Thursday 9.30am-1.30pm (flexible",
