                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-24",
                    "title": "Gardener",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nWe are looking for volunteers to help maintain our community garden and general grounds at the Centre.\n\n## Description\n\nThe volunteer will maintain the grounds at the centre with weeding, planting and harvesting veg in the planters, watering plants and other general garden maintenance. Our lead Garden Volunteer will give tasks to be completed each week. Volunteer times are flexible throughout the week Mon-Fri 9am-4pm.\n\n## Experience required\n\nGardening experience or interest in gardening.\n\n## Training details\n\nShadowing another volunteer/staff, any other relevant training will be offered.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nweekly. 1-2 hours per session, minimum of 1 session per week\n\n## Travel details\n\nBoomerang Centre, 10 Kemback Street, Dundee DD4 6ET\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel expenses for getting to the centre may be reimbursed\n\n## Taster details\n\nCan trial one session to see if the role suits",
