                    "title": "Digital Skills Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nVolunteers will help support in-person digital skills at the drop in and assist with Databank.\n\n## Description\n\nVolunteers will help support in-person digital skills at the drop in and assist with Databank.. \r\n\r\nThis role is suitable for someone who is friendly, organised, and comfortable working in a community setting. You should be confident in communicating with people and have good basic IT Skills.\n\n## Experience required\n\nThis role is suitable for someone who is friendly, organised, and comfortable working in a community,setting. You should be confident in communicating with people and have good basic IT Skills.\n\n## Travel details\n\nOpportunities Department, Central Library, Wellgate Centre, Dundee, DD1 1DB\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nPlease note: No expenses are available for this opportunity.\n\n## Taster details\n\nVolunteers can come in for a meet the team session to get to know the setting and service provided.",
