                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HD5ZZYA1",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HD5ZZYA1/acvtivities-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-06-09",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-08",
                    "title": "Acvtivities Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nAssist with weekly crafting sessions. \r\n\r\nYou would be friendly, welcoming and supportive, reaching out to adults looking to learn new skills, and sharing your own.\n\n## Description\n\nActivities could include; painting, drawing, 3D printing, sculpture, modelling, papercraft, sewing, card-making, photography, as well as other creative arts.\r\n\r\n· In partnership with staff plan and design activities\r\n· Set up and tidy the space and supplies\r\n· Keep a register of attendance\r\n· Encourage and support participation in activities\r\n· Assist with the display of completed artwork \r\n· Take photos of work for our social media to help promote the great work produced and encourage a sense of achievement.\n\n## Experience required\n\nThis role is suitable for someone who is friendly, organised, and comfortable working in a community setting. You should be confident in communicating with people and enjoy crafting.\n\n## Travel details\n\nColdside Library\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nPlease note - No expenses are payable for this opportunity.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
