            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g24000000eJ8MAAU",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g24000000eJ8MAAU/resource-assistant",
                    "publishStart": "2023-09-04",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-01",
                    "title": "Resource Assistant",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nAre you fit and able to move playroom equipment around? If so, this is the opportunity for you to join a happy band of volunteers working with parents and young children.\n\n## Description\n\nEquipment for the play room is stored in many areas and some of it is of medium weight. We require someone who is prepared to move such equipment to the appropriate place and put it away at the end of the session. Cleaning and maintenance of equipment would suit someone interested in basic DIY.\n\n## Experience required\n\nWe require someone who is interested in play equipment for young children and understands the need for equipment to be clean and safe. A person who is aware of the importance of storing equipment safely and in an orderly manner would be welcomed.\n\n## Training details\n\nVolunteers will be assigned to an established worker, shown the building and resource areas and be given the equipment plans.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nMinimum 9.00 am - 10.00 - earlier if possible and/or 3.30 - 4.30 but this is flexible.Monday or Tuesdays.\n\n## Travel details\n\nSt Ninians Church, Kingsway East, Dundee. This is easily reached by taking a bus to Asda's in Mid Craigie and walking along to the church.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nBus fares will be remibursed on production of ticket.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g24000000eJ8MAAU#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Resource Assistant",
                        "description": "We require someone who is interested in play equipment for young children and understands the need for equipment to be clean and safe. A person who is aware of the importance of storing equipment safely and in an orderly manner would be welcomed.",
