            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HojzRYAR",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HojzRYAR/various-volunteering-opportunities",
                    "publishStart": "2026-07-27",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-25",
                    "title": "Various Volunteering Opportunities",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nLochaber Hope provides support to people across Lochaber, helping them cope with a wide range of sensitive and personal issues. We are a person-centred organisation and believe that everyone has the ability within themselves to reach their own potential. Our staff and volunteers work and learn closely together to create a safe, inspiring, and positive environment where people can explore their strengths, overcome barriers, and feel supported.\r\n\r\nWe offer a range of volunteering opportunities to suit different interests, skills, and availability. Roles may include mentoring, supporting peer support groups, and getting involved in other community activities.\r\n\r\nIf you’re interested in volunteering with Lochaber Hope, we would be delighted to hear from you. Where suitable opportunities are available, we’ll work with you to find a role that matches your interests, skills, and availability.\n\n## Training details\n\nSupport. guidance and role-specific training will be provided as appropriate, helping you feel confident and well supported in your volunteering role.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F5ab44ae4-5f16-41a1-b9f9-fed296f1d46a%2FuxRXK9sBxDYL7PLU3NFiS2FQXXF2%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=880e5a86-19b9-40b0-82ef-a2139e2d7ac1",
