                    "publishStart": "2026-11-03",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-05-04",
                    "title": "Book Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\n📚 Book Volunteer Wanted!\r\n\r\nAre you a bit of a bookworm? Do you have an eye for a timeless classic, love discovering a hidden gem, or prefer a light-hearted read?\r\nWe’re looking for an enthusiastic volunteer to help look after and organise our growing collection of books.\r\nThis is a lovely opportunity for someone who enjoys books, is organised, happy to work independently and has basic IT skills (or is willing to learn!).\n\n## Training details\n\nTraining to be discussed",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
