                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000JMltQYAT/ebay-research-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-11-03",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-05-04",
                    "title": "eBay Research Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\n🔎 eBay Research Volunteer Wanted!\r\n\r\nDo you enjoy browsing online, spotting a bargain or discovering something special?\r\n\r\nWe’re looking for an enthusiastic volunteer to help research items for sale on eBay, identifying interesting pieces, checking values and helping us make the most of the donations we receive.\r\n\r\nThis role would suit someone who is organised, enjoys online research, has a good eye for detail and is reasonably confident using a computer.\n\n## Training details\n\nTraining to be discussed",
