                    "publishStart": "2026-06-01",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-11-30",
                    "title": "Warehouse Assistant",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAssisting with the daily tasks incurred in the warehouse. \r\nIncluding but not limited to; \r\n- Loading and unloading vans and lorries\r\n- Following appropriate procedures for new donations (acceptance, cleaning, distributing)\r\n- Engaging/interacting with members of the public & New Start Highland team members\r\n- Stock Rotation\r\n- Helping with start of day / end of day routines \r\n- Working in a safe manner, in accordance with Health & Safety guidelines (training provided)\r\n\r\nWe are looking for volunteers who are enthusiastic to join the existing warehouse team, complimenting and contributing to the work we do. Being able to use initiative and work independently. A good attitude, strong reliability, being physically fit and capable are key characteristics to this role.\n\n## Training details\n\nMandatory Training includes Health & Safety, Manual Handling. On-site, on the job training provided until the volunteer is confident and capable to carry out the role independently.",
