            "name": "Talk Now SCIO",
            "description": "The organisation is established for charitable purposes only, and in particular, the objects are to advance the health of victims of childhood sexual abuse, advance the human rights and ease the suffering of people who have been victims of childhood sexual abuse who have suffered from ill-health, mental health or disability due to their childhood trauma, and advance education of health and social care providers and staff.",
            "website": "https://www.talknow.org.uk",
            "charityRegistration": [
                {
                    "registrar": "https://www.oscr.org.uk",
