            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000AjfhBYAR",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000AjfhBYAR/music-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2025-07-04",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-01",
                    "title": "Music Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nMusical activities can enhance the well-being and quality of life for residents of care homes, including those at various stages of dementia and other health issues.\r\n\r\nOur music volunteers will provide one hour of entertainment each month for the residents.  We are looking for several volunteers to offer a variety of musical entertainment, which can include singing, playing instruments, DJ’ing different music genres  and encouraging both residents and staff to participate during the sessions.\r\n\r\nOur Volunteers will be supported by our Wellbeing Co-ordinator.\r\n\r\nThis role requires a PVG check.\n\n## Travel details\n\nBonnyton House Care Home, Oliphant Crescent, Busby, G76 8PU",
