                    "publishStart": "2025-07-04",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-01",
                    "title": "Befriender Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nBonnyton Care Home is looking for enthusiastic volunteers with good conversation and listening skills to visit a bedbound resident.  Through weekly visits, the volunteer will help reduce feelings of isolation and improve the resident's well-being by providing companionship and conversation.\r\n\r\nVolunteers will be supported by our Wellbeing Co-ordinator.\r\n\r\nThis role requires a PVG check.\n\n## Travel details\n\nBonnyton House Care Home, Oliphant Crescent, Busby, G76 8PU",
