                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-01",
                    "title": "Gardening Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nBonnyton Care Home is looking for enthusiastic volunteers to assist residents in maintaining and enjoying the raised beds and potted plants on the care home grounds.  This opportunity is perfect for individuals who love gardening, have patience, and wish to positively impact the well-being of older adults.\r\n\r\nVolunteers will assist residents in light gardening activities, such as planting, watering, weeding, harvesting in raised beds and pots and encourage our residents to engage with gardening tasks according to their abilities and interests.\r\n\r\nThis volunteer role will require a PVG check.\n\n## Travel details\n\nBonnyton House Care Home, Oliphant Crescent, Busby, G76 8PU",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
