        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/00124000008nZ0ZAAU",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/00124000008nZ0ZAAU/eastwood-district-scout-council",
            "name": "Eastwood District Scout Council",
            "website": "https://www.eastwoodscouts.org.uk/index.html",
            "charityRegistration": [
                {
                    "registrar": "https://www.oscr.org.uk",
                    "registrationNumber": "SC041046"
                }
            ],
            "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FAccount%2Fca50c067-4c69-70ec-45f8-78563d212e6f%2FmQsKXYYIupgt1ub9BeDSGFfo1O33%2Fuser-upload.jpg?alt=media&token=d2d83856-0927-46dc-842b-de3b75a12974",
            "cause": [
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/Children",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Children"
                },
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/YoungPeople",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Young People"
                }
            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g24000000eIt5AAE",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g24000000eIt5AAE/scouting-volunteers-eastwood",
                    "publishStart": "2011-07-28",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-28",
                    "title": "Scouting Volunteers Eastwood",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nOne of the biggest myths about Scouting is that Groups are closing down due to a lack of young people wanting to become Members. Nothing could be further from the truth; Scouting in the UK is a growing Movement and we currently have 30,000 young people on our waiting lists simply because we do not have enough adults to help out.\n\n## Description\n\nYou can I help with Scouting whatever your gender, age, abilities and skills. Simply let us know your availability and how you would like to help and we will match this to roles within your local area. \r\n\r\nYou do not need to have a background in Scouting\r\n\r\nIf your child is in Scouting, You could help\r\nMany of our helpers and Leaders are parents of our youth Members. This is for a number of reasons including being able to see first hand how Scouting benefits young people and wanting to give something back, being able to spend more time with their child and realising that volunteering for Scouting is enjoyable and teaches them new skills. Speak to your child’s Section Leader to discuss how you might become involved.\r\n\r\nYou can help out on a flexible basis.\r\nWhether you can help out once a fortnight, month or term or just at special events or camps, there is bound to be a role you can play. Learn more. \r\nAlthough Scouting is a uniformed organisation, adults in Scouting do not have to wear a uniform. \r\n\r\nWhat is the process for joining? \r\nThere is an application form to fill out which someone in your Group will be able to help you with. For some roles you will be required to meet a small group of people outside of the Group to discuss the role you wish to take on. References are also required for some roles.  An enhanced Criminal Records (or equivalent in Scotland or Northern Ireland) check is carried out on all volunteers.\r\n\r\nAssistant Leader\r\nsection Assistant\r\nOccasional Helper/Parent\r\nYoung Leader (14-18)\r\nChairman\r\nTreasurer\r\nSecretary\r\nGroup Scout Leader\r\nDistrict Le\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo previous Scouting experience is needed. Energy and enthusiasm are the qualities we are looking for\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nDepends on Scouting UnitWeekdays\n\n## Travel details\n\nEastwood District supports Scouting in part of East Renfrewshire. The District has 12 Scout Groups and provides Scouting to young people in the local communities of: \r\n\r\n•Clarkston \r\n•Crookfur \r\n•Giffnock \r\n•Eaglesham \r\n•Newton Mearns \r\n•Netherlee \r\n•Thornliebank",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F099317d0-8d3c-35be-5295-e1d2e78432c0%2FmQsKXYYIupgt1ub9BeDSGFfo1O33%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=6da1ba87-b15c-47f0-ad6b-6aea74e5ef7b",
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g24000000eIt5AAE#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Scouting Volunteers Eastwood",
                        "description": "No previous Scouting experience is needed. Energy and enthusiasm are the qualities we are looking for",
                        "commitment": "Depends on Scouting UnitWeekdays",
                        "applyLink": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g24000000eIt5AAE/scouting-volunteers-eastwood?#modal_register_a0g24000000eIt5AAE",
                        "allowsRemoteParticipation": false,
