                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000008a88yYAA",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000008a88yYAA/climate-action-champion",
                    "publishStart": "2025-02-19",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-18",
                    "title": "Climate Action Champion",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe are looking for volunteers to help plan and deliver climate-focused projects and events in East Renfrewshire.  Our aim is to get the climate conversation going through interactive, thought-provoking and fun activities.  They may be on a particular theme or designed to raise awareness of the climate emergency.  We are hoping to deliver climate conversations, local pop-ups, family fun days, seed swaps, local litter picks or any ideas you may have as a Climate Action Champion volunteer, you will help us to design and deliver these events to community groups.\r\n\r\nOur events and training take place in-person and sometimes online.  You do not need to be an expert – we can provide training.  A little understanding of how we change the things we do can have a big positive impact on our planet, would be great.\r\n\r\nMain duties:\r\n* Assisting with the design and delivery of events that promote and increase positive climate actions\r\n* Assisting in delivering environmental projects at our Rouken Glen hub\n\n## Travel details\n\nThroughout East Renfrewshire.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2Fdd47cb18-5553-4bdb-8242-0e89561e5edd%2FZTpsVM2s6uO1kBK4LhzHjps4n472%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=a2adf8f5-e234-4ac0-8261-745c460d2c61",
