            "name": "East Renfrewshire Carers' Centre",
            "description": "The Carers Centre provides a range of  services aimed at providing practical and emotional support to carers.  A carer is someone of any age who provides unpaid support to family, friends or neighbours who are ill, disabled or have a mental health or substance misuse problem.",
            "website": "https://www.eastrencarers.org.uk",
            "charityRegistration": [
                {
                    "registrar": "https://www.oscr.org.uk",
