                    "publishStart": "2026-10-15",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-15",
                    "title": "Wellbeing Group Activity Assistant",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nYou will be assisting a range of adults with learning disabilities make the most of their time in our weekly wellbeing group, encouraging the attendees to engage and participate in the activities:\r\n\r\n* Yoga/stretching\r\n* Preparing healthy snacks\r\n* Music and dancing\r\n\r\nYou will be part of a team which includes a Wellbeing Facilitator and Cosgrove Support Workers.\r\n\r\nThe group meet weekly on Mondays from 10 am -12 pm.\r\n\r\nPVG membership required.\n\n## Travel details\n\nMearns Kirk Halls, 404 Mearns Road, Newton Mearns, G77 5BU.",
