                    "publishStart": "2026-10-15",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-15",
                    "title": "Music Group Activity Assistant",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nThe focus of the group is on encouraging participation and creativity through music in a fun supportive environment.\r\n\r\n* Joining in with exercises and songs with enthusiasm\r\n* Partner work with participants\r\n* Helping to create a calm and supportive atmosphere\r\n\r\nThis volunteering role will suit individuals who are calm and outgoing and provides the opportunity for gaining experience of supporting adults with a range of learning disabilities to make the most of their time in a creative setting.\r\n\r\nThe group meet weekly on Mondays from 1-3 pm.\r\n\r\nPVG membership required.\n\n## Travel details\n\nMearns Kirk Halls, 404 Mearns Road, Newton Mearns, G77 5BU.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
