                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000ISxHJYA1/befriender",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-12",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-12",
                    "title": "Befriender",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nVolunteer Befriender wanted for a man, in his late 40s, that we support.  He has a cheerful outgoing personality and enjoys 80s music, Doctor Who, Batman and action movies.\r\n\r\nMeeting up fortnightly or weekly for 1-2 hours - fairly flexible times to suit volunteer's availability - to share outings to the cinema, walks, going for a coffee.\r\n\r\nPVG membership required.\n\n## Travel details\n\nEast Renfrewshire & Glasgow.",
