                    "publishEnd": "2026-11-19",
                    "title": "Drama Group Volunteer Activity Assistant",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nWould you like to join in the fun of our Monday afternoon ‘Drama class’? where it’s all about encouraging creativity and fun within the group of adults we support?\n\n## Description\n\nAssisting our drama facilitator with the weekly drama group.  Supporting the adult attendees, who have a range of learning disabilities to participate, focus and have fun.\r\n\r\nTwo groups run on Fridays:\r\n\r\n10.30 am - 12.30 pm or 1 - 3 pm.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo experience necessary. Induction, instruction and support provided by Cosgrove.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFridays\n\n## Travel details\n\nMearns Kirk Church Halls, 404 Mearns Road, Newton Mearns, G77 5BU.  Transport will be provided to and from Mearns Kirk from our head office at May Terrace, Giffnock, G46 6LD.",
