                        "title": "Citizen Advocate (North East Fife)",
                        "description": "We are looking for individuals with a strong sense of fairness and a desire for marginalised groups to be included in society. Citizen Advocates are ordinary people who choose to get to know and stand by someone in their own community who may be vulnerable and cannot safeguard their own rights.\r\n\r\nCitizen Advocates don’t need formal qualifications or professional experience.",
