                        "title": "Treasurer",
                        "description": "We will provide a full induction to the role and it is possible to come and observe before you commit.\r\n· Good financial analysis skills.\r\n· Ability to communicate clearly\r\n· Knowledge and experience of current and fundraising finance practice relevant to voluntary and community organisations.\r\n· A desire to volunteer with a charity who are passionate about healthy outdoor environments which are open to all to enjoy and learn new skills",
