                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "General Retail Assistant - Dalkeith",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nMeeting different people.  Giving your time to a worthwhile cause. Helping others.  Being a valued team member.\n\n## Description\n\nLearning new skills. Helping a charity whilst having fun at the same time.  Development of talents that we value such as communication skills, numeracy, teamwork and taking responsibility.\n\n## Experience required\n\nTraining will be given.  Friendly, Good communication skills.  Trust.\n\n## Training details\n\nH & S, Manual Handling and in-store training.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\n4 hours per week.\n\n## Travel details\n\n12 High Street, Dalkeith.",
