        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/00124000008nZqFAAU",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/00124000008nZqFAAU/marie-curie-midlothian",
            "name": "Marie Curie (Midlothian)",
            "description": "To help people and their families living with a terminal illness make the most of the time they have together by delivering expert care, emotional support, research and guidance.",
            "website": "https://www.mariecurie.org.uk",
            "charityRegistration": [
                {
                    "registrar": "https://www.oscr.org.uk",
                    "registrationNumber": "SC038734"
                }
            ],
            "cause": [
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/AdviceInformation",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Advice / Information"
                },
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/Health",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Health"
                },
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/SocialCare",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Social Care"
                }
            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000APxLhYAL",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000APxLhYAL/volunteer-retail-driver",
                    "publishStart": "2025-06-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Volunteer Retail Driver",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAre you looking for a meaningful way to give back to your community? Marie Curie is seeking Volunteer \r\nDrivers in Edinburgh to support our retail team by rotating stock between our shops and storage locations.\r\nWhat you’ll do:\r\n• Collect and deliver donated goods and stock between Marie Curie shops across Edinburgh\r\n• Help keep our retail spaces fresh, tidy, and well-stocked\r\n• Be a friendly face representing Marie Curie in the community\r\nWhat we’re looking for:\r\n• A full UK driving licence and access to a vehicle (mileage reimbursed)\r\n• Good timekeeping and reliability\r\n• A helpful, can-do attitude and willingness to work as part of a team\r\nWhy volunteer with us?\r\n• Make a real difference to people living with terminal illness\r\n• Gain valuable experience and meet new people\r\n• Flexible shifts to suit your availability\r\nWhether you can spare a few hours a week or more, your time will help us raise vital funds for Marie Curie’s care and \r\nsupport services\r\n\r\nClick link below to apply\r\nhttps://eofb.fa.em3.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/CX_4001/job/6423?keyword=volunteer+driver&mode=location\n\n## Experience required\n\nA can do attitude\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nVolunteers are able to claim mileage for the use of their own vehicle whilst volunteering for:\r\n• travel from their home to and from their normal place of volunteering\r\n• travel between their normal place of volunteering and another location on Marie Curie",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
