                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000A0WtNYAV",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000A0WtNYAV/marie-curie-refreshment-and-catering-assistant",
                    "publishStart": "2025-05-21",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Marie Curie Refreshment and Catering Assistant",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nMarie Curie is committed to providing exceptional care and comfort to people living with terminal illness and their families. As part of this mission, we’re looking for warm, reliable, and compassionate individuals to join us as Refreshment and Catering Assistant Volunteers at our Edinburgh Hospice.\r\nIn this rewarding role, you’ll help create a welcoming environment by supporting our catering team and ensuring patients receive nourishing meals and refreshments with kindness and dignity.\r\nWhat you’ll be doing:\r\n•\tPreparing and presenting the drinks trolley with care\r\n•\tServing meals and/or drinks to patients with friendliness and courtesy\r\n•\tTopping up water jugs with fresh ice and water\r\n•\tCollecting used trays and crockery, and loading them into the dishwasher\r\n•\tKeeping the ward kitchen, family room, and communal areas clean and tidy\r\n•\tAssisting with other related tasks as needed\n\n## Experience required\n\ncompassionate and excellent customer service\n\n## Training details\n\nThey will be provided with training when they begin\n\n## Travel details\n\nBus 11\n\n## Travel expenses\n\n45per mile via own person vehicle use, or travel reimbursed for public transport. Reasonable out-of-pocket expenses also provided for food/drink however terms apply for this",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
