                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Museum Helper",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe are looking for enthusiastic and friendly volunteers who can regularly give us four hours of their time per fortnight.\r\nWe are currently open 2 days a week from 11am to 3pm and are hoping to increase our opening hours in the near future.\r\n\r\nDuties of the role include:\r\n• Welcoming visitors and answering questions\r\n• Selling museum publications\r\n• Recording visitor information\r\n• Receiving items donated by members of the public\r\n\r\nWe are looking for people who have:\r\n· An interest in Dalkeith’s history\r\n· Good people skills\r\n· Good listening skills\r\n\r\nExperience of using Word and Excel would be a bonus You can check out our website for more information about the museum at www.dalkeithmuseum.co.uk. A volunteer application form can be downloaded and printed from the site for completion. Alternatively, email volunteers@dalkeithmuseum.co.uk if you would like to be contacted by the Volunteer Coordinator.\n\n## Experience required\n\nWe are looking for people who have:\r\n· An interest in Dalkeith’s history\r\n· Good people skills\r\n· Good listening skills\r\nExperience of using Word and Excel would be a bonus\n\n## Training details\n\nVolunteers don’t need any experience as we will provide full training. New volunteers are placed with experienced volunteers who provide support and advice.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\n4 hours per fortnight 11am-3pm\n\n## Travel details\n\nThe museum is a short walk from the centre of Dalkeith which is well served by buses. On-street parking is available",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2Faad04f54-1e28-5821-706b-48a9cb9f78b7%2FHi3K7lHa8wXatOHLGJFdBGJQtau2%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=7d85ca7e-5a86-4b52-b26d-76face5b3685",
                    "role": {
