            "name": "First Step Community Project",
            "description": "First Step Community Project is a charity which plays a crucial role in the development and support for young families. The Project provides Early Learning and Childcare for under 5's as well as educational, vocational and social development opportunities for parents and carers. First Step also provides counselling and 1:1 support for families experiencing a period of difficulty in their lives.",
