                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000ICRdBYAX",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000ICRdBYAX/strategic-board-treasurer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-09-29",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-30",
                    "title": "Strategic Board Treasurer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe’re Recruiting! Volunteer Treasurer\r\n\r\nAre you good with numbers and passionate about making a difference in your community? We’re looking for a dedicated Treasurer to join our team!\r\n\r\nWhat you’ll do:\r\n\r\nOversee the project’s finances and budget.\r\nEnsure that financial records are accurate and up to date.\r\nSupport financial reporting and planning.\r\nHelp ensure funds are used effectively to support our community work.\r\n\r\nWhat we’re looking for:\r\n\r\nSomeone organised, trustworthy and confident with numbers. Previous finance experience is welcome, but enthusiasm and commitment are just as important!\r\n\r\nWhy get involved?\r\n\r\nMake a real difference, support a community-focused organisation, and gain valuable experience while working with a passionate team.\r\n\r\nInterested? Get in touch with First Step Community Project to find out more and become part of our journey!\n\n## Training details\n\nFull induction and additional training opportunities offered.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nCommitment 2 Years + 3 Hours, Monthly",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000ICRdBYAX#role",
