                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000I3KUTYA3",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000I3KUTYA3/strategic-board-secretary",
                    "publishStart": "2026-09-21",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-11-17",
                    "title": "Strategic Board Secretary",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe’re Recruiting! Strategic Board Secretary\r\n\r\nAre you organised, passionate about your community, and ready to help shape the future? We’re looking for a dedicated Strategic Board Secretary to join our Board and make a real difference!\r\n\r\nThat you’ll do:\r\n\r\nWork closely with the Chair to ensure the Board runs effectively.\r\nTake minutes at Board and other relevant associated meetings.\r\nPrepare agendas and papers and maintain accurate records.\r\nSupport good governance and ensure compliance.\r\nAct as a key point of contact for Board communications.\r\n\r\nWhat we’re looking for:\r\n\r\nSomeone with excellent organisational and administrative skills, a keen eye for detail, and a commitment to the values and mission of First Step. Previous Board or committee experience is desirable but not essential.\r\n\r\nPlay a key role in supporting children, families and our local community. Help shape our future, contribute your skills, and be part of a team creating positive change.\n\n## Experience required\n\nComputer / IT / Web; General Admin / Office Support\n\n## Training details\n\nFull induction training and additional training opportunities available.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nCommitment 2 Years + 2 Hours, Monthly",
