                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000004FcfNYAS",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000004FcfNYAS/changes-volunteer-befriender",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-01",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-21",
                    "title": "CHANGES Volunteer Befriender",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nThis is an opportunity to make a genuine, positive impact on somebody's life by volunteering as a befriender. The role involves providing 1-1 befriending to someone in the East Lothian community who is experiencing loneliness, isolation and/or challenges with their mental health. By helping people discover - or rediscover - past hobbies and interests and build their social confidence, you will help reconnect them to their local community.\n\n## Experience required\n\nCaring,\r\nGood Communicator,\r\nGood Listener,\r\nOpen minded,\r\nPatient,\r\nReliable / Dependable,\r\nTrustworthy\r\nBefriending / Mentoring\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nCommitment 6 Months 1 Hours, Weekly\n\n## Travel expenses\n\n45p per mile paid monthly\n\n## Taster details\n\nInitial induction and befriending training. Opportunities for further training in mental health are available.",
