                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HePxBYAV",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HePxBYAV/nature-projects-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-07-07",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-05",
                    "title": "Nature Projects Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nDo you love spending time in nature?\r\n\r\nDo you have a keen interest in meeting new people?\r\n\r\nOur nature projects might be the perfect fit for your volunteering.\r\n\r\nAs a nature projects' volunteer with Changes you will be expected to help support group members to enjoy gentle outdoor activity sessions, aimed at improving their mental wellbeing. You will also help the group leader in the delivery of activities, ensuring the session runs smoothly and safely.\r\n\r\nYou can find out more about our Nature Activities here: https://www.changeschp.org.uk/nurture-by-nature\r\n\r\nApply directly on our website or contact us to find out more.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo Expertise, Group work skills\n\n## Training details\n\nGeneral volunteer induction and role specific training\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nCommitment 6 Months 3 Hours, Weekly\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel expenses reimbursed monthly.",
