                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g1p00000CNhJEAA1/volunteers-for-nutrition-studies",
                    "publishStart": "2026-09-14",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-15",
                    "title": "Volunteers for Nutrition Studies",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nThe Rowett Institute, University of Aberdeen promote sustainable nutrition and improve health and well-being through world-class research and education.\r\n\r\nAs part of this we undertake a variety of human nutrition studies for which volunteers are needed.\r\n\r\nTo find out more about studies currently being conducted and how you can get involved and help please visit: https://www.abdn.ac.uk/rowett/volunteer/current-studies/\n\n## Description\n\nThe Rowett Institute, University of Aberdeen promote sustainable nutrition and improve health and well-being through world-class research and education.\r\n\r\nAs part of this we undertake a variety of human nutrition studies for which volunteers are needed.\r\n\r\nTo find out more about studies currently being conducted and how you can get involved and help please visit: https://www.abdn.ac.uk/rowett/volunteer/current-studies/\n\n## Training details\n\nExcellent support and guidance is provided to all volunteers.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nThere are a variety of different studies/times you can volunteer - details for each study are available at https://www.abdn.ac.uk/rowett/volunteer/current-studies/\n\n## Travel details\n\nRowett Institute, University of Aberdeen (Foresterhill Campus)\r\nAshgrove Road West\r\nAberdeen\r\nAB25 2ZD",
