                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-18",
                    "title": "Volunteer Drivers required",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nOur Drivers provide transport to and from cancer patient’s homes to hospitals in Glasgow and locally for cancer treatment. The service is especially useful for those who feel unwell after treatment, those living in rural areas the elderly and parents taking children for treatment.\n\n## Description\n\nOur Drivers provide transport to and from cancer patient’s homes to hospitals in Glasgow and locally for cancer treatment. The service is especially useful for those who feel unwell after treatment, those living in rural areas the elderly and parents taking children for treatment.\n\n## Experience required\n\nMust have full clean driving license and have experience of driving on motorways and in the city, full details of requirements can be found in the attached driver’s policy.\n\n## Training details\n\nVolunteer will be trained on all aspects by fellow colleagues. Support provided by General Manager.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
