                    "title": "Kitchen Porter",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nOur Cafe Bar is open 7-days a week and generally operates 9am-7pm on weekdays and 9am-4pm on weekends. With a footfall of 2800 people weekly, our Cafe Bar is the beating heart of the activities going on. This role would support our Kitchen Team with preparations and cleanliness whilst also offering the opportunity to learn, develop, and share skills.",
