                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-22",
                    "title": "Front of House Shadow",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nOur Cafe Bar is open 7 days a week and generally operates 9am-7pm on weekdays and 9am-4pm on weekends. With a footfall of 2800 people weekly, our Cafe Bar is the beating heart of the activities going on.  This role would support our Front of House Team with setting up and clearing the cafe floor, maintaining cleanliness, and supporting the team with light duties.  You'll also have the opportunity to learn, develop and share skills.",
