                    "title": "Front of house support",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nEvents at CentreStage come in a variety of forms including internal shows, external performances, and conferences.  Within this role, the volunteer will be tasked with supporting our events team with the flow of these events and is a customer-focused role.  As a FOH Support, you are essential in providing a strong impression and being a good representation of the organisation.",
