                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000JNjhRYAT",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000JNjhRYAT/health-and-care-volunteer-ayrshire",
                    "publishStart": "2026-11-03",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-05",
                    "title": "Health and Care Volunteer (Ayrshire)",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nFor people leaving hospital, adjusting to life at home can be a difficult time. Helping someone get their essential shopping, pick up their prescription or get the heating turned on can make all the difference for them to feel safe at home.\n\nWe would like you to:\n\nBe available to volunteer on a regular basis.\nThe role is community based, we are looking for volunteers in the Ayrshire area.\nThe role is to support service users with community re-engagement, shopping, light domestic duties and provide company.\nDriving is not essential but is preferred. If a driver, you need to have held a driving licence for at least 2 years which allows you to drive vehicles in the UK.\nBe able to commit to volunteering for a minimum of 12 months\n\n## Experience required\n\nWarm and friendly with empathy for others.\nGood communication skills.\nEncouraging and supportive.\nEnjoy meeting and spending time with new people.\nCan work independently and as a part of a team.\nAble to commit to a regular shift.\n\n## Travel details\n\nBy car or public transport.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nAs a volunteer, you can claim travel and other out-of-pocket expenses",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-volunteerscotland-search.appspot.com/o/opportunities%2FJRjkAPjCnPXRrETvld9RRVxLqpa2%2FEXXtBf1kHec47nEY-thumbnail.jpg?alt=media&token=2895626b-ab9d-4370-a8e5-c341258f7b60",
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000JNjhRYAT#role",
