                    "title": "Health and Care Volunteer (Scottish Borders)",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nBe available to volunteer on a regular basis.\nBe available to volunteer for a minimum of 4 hours per week although a full day is preferred.\nThe role is community based, we are looking for volunteers in the Galashiels, Kelso, Hawick, Eyemouth, Duns and Peebles areas.\nThe role is to support service users with community re-engagement, shopping, light domestic duties and provide company.\nDriving is not essential but is preferred. If a driver, you need to have held a driving licence for at least 2 years which allows you to drive vehicles in the UK.\nBe able to commit to volunteering for a minimum of 12 months.\n\n## Travel details\n\nScottish Borders in Galashiels, Kelso, Hawick, Eyemouth, Duns and Peebles areas.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nAs a volunteer, you can claim travel and other out-of-pocket expenses",
