            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000DgjajYAB",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000DgjajYAB/household-buddy",
                    "publishStart": "2026-09-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-01",
                    "title": "Household Buddy",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWould you like to help families build confidence and create positive change in their homes?\r\n\r\nFife Gingerbread is looking for compassionate, practical and encouraging volunteers to join our Household Buddy team. This role is ideal for people who understand that managing a home can become overwhelming when families are experiencing poverty, poor wellbeing, isolation, or other life challenges.\r\n\r\nAs a Household Buddy, you'll work alongside parents in a supportive and non-judgemental way, helping them regain confidence, motivation and pride in their living space. Rather than simply helping with household tasks, you'll encourage and empower families to develop routines, skills and strategies that support lasting change.\r\n\r\nBy giving just a few hours of your time, you can help a parent feel more in control, recognise their strengths, and turn a house back into a home.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo special skills are required; just kindness, reliability, and a willingness to get stuck in.\n\n## Training details\n\nAll volunteers receive training and support to help them feel confident in their role. Training includes an introduction to Fife Gingerbread, the rights, challenges and barriers facing families, child protection, unconscious bias, boundaries and lone working safety. Ongoing supervision, peer support and shadowing opportunities are also provided.\n\n## Travel details\n\nopportunities will be Fife wide\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nVolunteers will be reimbursed expenses on a weekly/fortnightly  basis",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000DgjajYAB#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Household Buddy",
                        "description": "No special skills are required; just kindness, reliability, and a willingness to get stuck in.",
                        "applyLink": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000DgjajYAB/household-buddy?#modal_register_a0gQD00000DgjajYAB",
                        "allowsRemoteParticipation": false,
                        "minimumAge": "18",
                        "theme": [
