            "name": "Kirkcaldy YMCA",
            "description": "We offer opportunities for children and young people to increase their physical, emotional and spiritual well-being.  Kirkcaldy YMCA offers capacity building and personal growth opportunities through a variety of informal learning activities for young people and to the wider community, encouraging high levels of participation, inclusion and involvement",
            "website": "https://www.kirkcaldyymca.co.uk",
            "charityRegistration": [
