            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000EgtfyYAB",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000EgtfyYAB/minibus-driver",
                    "publishStart": "2026-07-14",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-12",
                    "title": "Minibus Driver",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nKirkcaldy YMCA is looking for friendly and reliable volunteers to drive our minibus during the school holidays (Easter, Summer and October) youth work programme. You’ll help transport young people from across Kirkcaldy to Kirkcaldy YMCA and back again, ensuring they arrive safely. This role is ideal for someone who enjoys working with the community and supporting local young people. A clean driving licence which includes category D1 and confidence driving a minibus are essential. Your contribution will make a real difference by enabling young people to access fun, positive experiences during the holidays\n\n## Experience required\n\n-Ability to safely operate a minibus; ideally with a clean driving licence\r\n-Punctuality for pick-up and drop-off schedules\r\n-Clear and friendly interaction with young people and staff.\r\n-Understanding of road safety and safeguarding principles.\r\n-Friendly and approachable\r\n-Previous experience driving larger vehicles or minibuses is helpful (but not essential).\n\n## Training details\n\n-Induction will cover an introduction to the organisation and procedures, health & safety, and general role requirements.\r\n-Support will be ongoing as required as the role develops\r\n-Training will include shadowing current drivers, vehicle operation, legal responsibilities, passenger safety, and emergency procedures.\n\n## Travel details\n\nBetween addresses in Kirkcaldy and Kirkcaldy YMCA in Hendry Crescent.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nPaid weekly. Travel expenses (45p per mile or public transport reimbursement)",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
