            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/00124000008nb6uAAA/greener-kirkcaldy",
            "name": "Greener Kirkcaldy",
            "description": "Greener Kirkcaldy is a community-led charity working locally to bring people together, take positive action on the climate emergency and support people through fuel poverty and food insecurity. We deliver a range of projects, events and skills training to achieve the needs and goals of local people – building resilience as a community and working towards a future where everyone can live better and tread more lightly on our planet. Based in the heart of Kirkcaldy – with a community building, training kitchen, bike shop and garden – we carry out activities across Kirkcaldy and work with partners to deliver projects across Fife",
            "website": "https://www.greenerkirkcaldy.org.uk",
            "charityRegistration": [
