                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD0000032NLNYA2",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD0000032NLNYA2/walk-leader",
                    "publishStart": "2025-12-04",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-01",
                    "title": "Walk Leader",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAs part of Greener Kirkcaldy’s Communities Connected Project, they are looking for volunteer walk leaders. Their walks inspire people to reduce their carbon emissions by driving less and walking more, and are easy and sociable. Walk leaders lead and support short walks in the Kirkcaldy area to encourage people to come together and keep active. A small amount of preparation is sometimes required for the walk, alongside the Sessional Walk Leader.\r\n\r\nIf you can give around two hours per month, enjoy walking, and would like to help people to explore the Kirkcaldy area, this could be the role for you.\n\n## Experience required\n\nGreener Kirkcaldy are looking for volunteers with good people skills, communication skills and organisational skills who can adhere to Health & Safety procedures.\n\n## Training details\n\nThe volunteer will be offered a Greener Kirkcaldy Induction and climate action induction. Greener Kirkcaldy encourage volunteers to join a walk and chat to a walk leader first, to see how it works. The volunteer will also be invited to any relevant training and will complete the walk leader training with Paths for All.\n\n## Travel details\n\nOnce a month in and around Kirkcaldy.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nExpenses are available for volunteers. They will fill in a form and claim the most environmentally friendly form of transport.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD0000032NLNYA2#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Walk Leader",
                        "description": "Greener Kirkcaldy are looking for volunteers with good people skills, communication skills and organisational skills who can adhere to Health & Safety procedures.",
                        "applyLink": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD0000032NLNYA2/walk-leader?#modal_register_a0gQD0000032NLNYA2",
                        "allowsRemoteParticipation": false,
                        "minimumAge": "16",
                        "theme": [
