                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-01",
                    "title": "Scouts Team Leader",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWeek by week, Scouts volunteers empower thousands of young people aged 4 to 25 to try new things, make new friends and stand on their own two feet.\r\n\r\nThey are looking for Team Leaders for their Dunfermline and Cairneyhill groups. As a team leader, you will engage with the children/young people in the group, plan activities, help with set up of the group, supervise trips and more. You will be the main point of contact for team members in your group.\r\n\r\nYou don’t need to be Bear Grylls to join them. You don’t need to have been a Scout when you were younger. You don’t even need to know how to put up a tent. Whatever your skillset, lend a hand for as little or as much time as you can spare, and they promise you’ll get more out of it than you put in.\r\n\r\nSounds fun? Worthwhile? It is.\n\n## Experience required\n\nVolunteers should be enthusiastic, willing to engage with others and feel positively about volunteering with children. Good organisational skills would be a plus.\n\n## Training details\n\nVolunteers will have safety, safeguarding and GDPR training, as well as having the opportunity to engage in first aid and further ongoing learning.\r\n\r\nSupport is given by the area coordinator, other group leaders and team members.\r\n\r\nVolunteers are given a 4 week challenge when they start volunteering, with steps to help them learn the role.\n\n## Travel details\n\nThere are opportunities for team leaders in 3 Scout groups in Dunfermline and Cairneyhill. The locations for these are Piggies Lane and Viewfield Church in Dunfermline, and Northbank Road in Cairneyhill.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nExpenses can be discussed on a case by case basis.\n\n## Taster details\n\nVolunteers are welcome to attend for a taster session before signing up to volunteer.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000006f4ttYAA#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Scouts Team Leader",
