                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000QNvDzAAL",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000QNvDzAAL/social-cafe-volunteer-torryburn",
                    "publishStart": "2026-07-06",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-04",
                    "title": "Social Cafe Volunteer (Torryburn)",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nMake someone's day! Help reduce loneliness and social isolation by volunteering at on of their social cafes. The cafes offer older people the chance to chat with others over a cuppa. Quizzes, games and a range of other activities are on offer. \r\n\r\nTheir social cafe volunteers build a positive relationship with members by:\r\n\r\n-meeting and greeting them as they arrive (volunteers are asked to arrive for 10am to help with setting up)\r\n- offering refreshments and clearing away at the end (finishing by12.30pm) \r\n- chatting with members and getting to know them\r\n- helping members to take part in the activities where needed, and giving out pens and paper for the quizzes.\r\n- attending volunteer meetings and information sessions to help with this role  \r\n- raising any concerns with your project worker\n\n## Experience required\n\n- Dependable and trustworthy \r\n- Sensitive and respectful\r\n- Able to work as a team member \r\n- Welcoming\r\n- Friendly and approachable\r\n- Willing to take part in volunteer training and support sessions\n\n## Training details\n\nA volunteer handbook and training in various topics relevant to the role e.g. first aid, confidentiality, food hygiene, safeguarding are provided\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nWe would welcome someone who can give a long-term commitment\n\n## Travel details\n\nTorryburn Community Centre, Main Street, Torryburn KY12 8SR.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\n45p per mile\r\nbus/ rail fares are reimbursed (ticket needed)\n\n## Taster details\n\nYou're welcome to come along to the cafe (by arrangement) and see what it's like.",
