            "description": "The main aim of Western Isles Womens Aid is to provide support, counselling and refuge to abused women and children.  There is also a drop in centre for women and children.  Advice is also on offer including legal, money, lifestyle, etc.  There is also an outreach service where a worker will visit past clients to offer support and a friendly ear.  There is also a 24 hour on call service so a trained member of staff can be contacted at any time.",
