                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000AQ25FYAT",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000AQ25FYAT/scout-leader-lewis",
                    "publishStart": "2025-06-16",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-26",
                    "title": "Scout Leader (Lewis)",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nGot time, skills or energy to share? Scouts Western Isles need YOU! If you are interested in being a Scout Leader, get in touch today.\n\n## Description\n\nScouts Western Isles are looking for leaders for all groups: Beavers (age 6-8), Cubs (8-10 1/2), Scouts (10 1/2- 14) and Explorers (14-18). Scouts do lots of activities from fun games to camps, to arts and music - there's always a badge for it!\r\nScout leaders do not need to have specific skills, although any are welcomed - if you can bring energy and enthusiasm, you will make a great Scout leader.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo specific skills required except for lots of enthusiasm and interest in working with children and young people within a uniformed organisation.\n\n## Travel details\n\nGroups based in Lewis.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
