                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HneLtYAJ",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HneLtYAJ/local-history-assistant-barra",
                    "publishStart": "2026-07-21",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-19",
                    "title": "Local History Assistant (Barra)",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nTo support access to local history collections and resources, helping users explore heritage material while ensuring safe and respectful use of collections.\n\n## Description\n\nRole Purpose\r\nTo support access to local history collections and resources, helping users explore heritage material while ensuring safe and respectful use of collections. \r\nKey Responsibilities\r\n•\tAssist users with local history resources and enquiries\r\n•\tHelp organise and preserve local history materials\r\n•\tSupport digitisation or indexing projects (where appropriate)\r\n•\tPromote library heritage collections\r\n\r\nSkills and Attributes\r\n•\tInterest in local history or heritage\r\n•\tOrganised and careful with materials\r\n•\tGood communication skills\r\n•\tRespect for confidentiality and data protection\r\n\r\nTraining details\r\nThe volunteer will liaise with a nominated member of staff at their local library, who will guide them through their induction, and will be the first point of contact for any issues, questions, or problems should they arise.\r\nRestrictions Minimum age: 17\r\nSafeguarding Responsibilities\r\n•\tMaintain professional boundaries with all users\r\n•\tFollow safeguarding procedures when assisting vulnerable adults\r\n•\tAvoid working one-to-one in isolated situations\r\n•\tReport any concerns to staff promptly\r\nPVG and Recruitment\r\n•\tPVG membership is not normally required, unless the role develops into regulated work\r\n•\tSafeguarding awareness training is required\n\n## Experience required\n\n•\t•\tInterest in local history or heritage\r\n•\tOrganised and careful with materials\r\n•\tGood communication skills\r\n•\tRespect for confidentiality and data protection\n\n## Travel details\n\nLocation: Library branches",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HneLtYAJ#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Local History Assistant (Barra)",
                        "description": "•\t•\tInterest in local history or heritage\r\n•\tOrganised and careful with materials\r\n•\tGood communication skills\r\n•\tRespect for confidentiality and data protection",
                        "applyLink": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HneLtYAJ/local-history-assistant-barra?#modal_register_a0gQD00000HneLtYAJ",
