                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HnGLBYA3",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HnGLBYA3/childrens-activity-leader-lewis",
                    "publishStart": "2026-07-21",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-19",
                    "title": "Children’s Activity Leader (Lewis)",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nTo support and lead library-based activities for children and families, helping to deliver safe, engaging, and inclusive experiences that encourage reading, creativity, and enjoyment of libraries.\n\n## Description\n\nRole Purpose\r\nTo support and lead library-based activities for children and families, helping to deliver safe, engaging, and inclusive experiences that encourage reading, creativity, and enjoyment of libraries.\r\nKey Responsibilities\r\n•\tPlan and deliver age-appropriate children’s activities under the guidance of library staff\r\n•\tSupport children to participate safely and confidently\r\n•\tHelp set up and clear away activity materials\r\n•\tPromote positive behaviour and inclusion\r\n\r\nSkills and Attributes\r\n•\tEnjoy working with children\r\n•\tReliable, patient, and approachable\r\n•\tGood communication skills\r\n\r\nSafeguarding and Child Protection\r\n•\tAlways follow Comhairle nan Eilean Siar safeguarding procedures\r\n•\tMaintain appropriate professional boundaries with children and families\r\n•\tNever be left in sole charge of children\r\n•\tImmediately report any safeguarding concern, disclosure, or incident to library staff\r\n•\tAdhere to procedures for unaccompanied children\r\nTraining details\r\nThe volunteer will liaise with a nominated member of staff at their local library, who will guide them through their induction, and will be the first point of contact for any issues, questions, or problems should they arise.\r\nRestrictions\tMinimum age: 17\r\nPVG and Recruitment\r\n•\tThis role involves regulated work with children\r\n•\tPVG Scheme membership is required\r\n•\tWillingness to undertake safeguarding training\n\n## Experience required\n\n•\tEnjoy working with children\r\n•\tReliable, patient, and approachable\r\n•\tGood communication skills\n\n## Travel details\n\nLocation: Library branches",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HnGLBYA3#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Children’s Activity Leader (Lewis)",
