                    "title": "Activity volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAs part of our afternoon activities, we would love to hear from anyone who could spare an hour a few afternoons a year to spend time with our residents in Harris House care home. \r\nThis would be around 2.30 – 3.30pm and preferably a Wednesday, Thursday or Friday.    \r\nThis could be anything from singing, playing an instrument, crafts or painting.",
