                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HxZnxYAF/day-care-volunteer-barra",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-31",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-26",
                    "title": "Day Care Volunteer (Barra)",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nMonday to Thursday 10am to 3pm or anytime in between to sit with service users and support them to participate in activities.\n\n## Description\n\nDo you enjoy spending time with people who are fun and full of stories, why not come and join us at Cobhair mornings 10am to 1pm or all day 10am to 3pm with lunch provided or hours which may suit you.  Volunteers support service users to join in activities and work with staff to make the day-care as good as possible for all.  A warm, welcoming atmosphere awaits  volunteers.  Volunteers must live locally on the Isle of Barra.\n\n## Experience required\n\nA good listener and patient.\r\nWill need to consent to a PVG being carried out.\n\n## Training details\n\nInvite to participate in any training offered to staff.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nA minimum of 3 hours up to 5 hours a week, but no minimum commitment expected (6 weeks, 6 months, 1 year etc)\n\n## Travel details\n\nMay be able to arrange transport if required.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nLunch is provided.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
