                    "title": "Gardening Help Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nInterested in being outdoors and maintaining service gardens\n\n## Description\n\nGardening help with a view to help with ideas to maintain the garden area both at Bayhead and Hillcrest.\r\n\r\nFurther information given on request.\r\nAll volunteers to go through PVG",
