                    "title": "Fundraising Assistant Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nAnyone interested should get in touch pre Action for Children's Fundraising Week which takes place in July 2025\n\n## Description\n\nVolunteers needed to help with street collections, assisting in the set up and break down of any displays and be able to have a basic knowledge services and centres to any basic questions.   Volunteers will introduced to staff and time given to chat beforehand.  Volunteers will also be paired with an experienced member of staff.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo experience required though needed to be reliable punctual with an open approach\n\n## Travel details\n\nmay be discussed",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
