            "name": "Brain Injury Group (BIG)",
            "description": "The BIG Group is a volunteer-led charity aiming to support all people in Grampian affected by Acquired Brain Injury (ABI) raising awareness of the condition and reducing the social isolation often experienced by people affected by ABI.\r\n\r\nMembership is free and anyone involved with brain injury is welcome.",
