                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Food Co-op & Foodbank Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nSupport to local food co-ops and providing a fresh fruit service to schools.  \r\n\r\n\r\nGood support is provided to all volunteers. Induction and start up training.  All volunteer help is greatly appreciated.\r\n\r\nIf you are interested please contact Kian Donald at email KDonald@cfine.org\n\n## Description\n\nSupport local food co-ops in the community and bring fresh fruit to schools.\r\n\r\nVolunteer opportunities include:\r\n-Assisting with customer service at our food co-op base\r\n-Helping out at community outlets\r\n-Supporting our Foodbank Base\r\n\r\nWhy Volunteer with CFINE?\r\n-Comprehensive support and training for all volunteers\r\n-Induction and start-up training provided\r\n-Your help is greatly appreciated and truly makes a difference\r\n\r\n-About CFINE: \r\nCFINE (Community Food Initiatives North East) is dedicated to improving health, well-being, and the environment. We tackle poverty and build resilience through a range of support services for disadvantaged, vulnerable, and low-income individuals, families, and communities in North East Scotland.\r\n\r\nOur Ethos: \r\nAs a social enterprise, CFINE adheres to cooperative principles, promoting:\r\n-Equality\r\n-Cooperation, Collaboration, and Partnership\r\n-Mutuality and Reciprocity\r\n-Recognising that everyone has something to offer\r\n-Enterprise\r\n\r\nJoin us and be part of a community making a real impact. Volunteer with CFINE today!\r\n\r\nIf you are interested please contact Kian Donald at email KDonald@cfine.org\n\n## Training details\n\nGood support is provided to all volunteers. Induction and start up training.  All volunteer help is greatly appreciated and volunteers receive certificates in recognition of the help they provide.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible times and days available to suit volunteers.\n\n## Travel details\n\nBased in Poynernook Road with outlets across the city\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nAny relevant out of pocket expenses are re-imbursed e.g.: bus fares.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F72e9a286-0e80-5aa0-7590-375f556b149e%2FcG0Yqfo1FmU2EcSHv3tu2v9q1wu2%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=9e863d18-2ef3-40fe-bfad-acd37816781a",
