            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HGVcLYAX",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HGVcLYAX/sport-volunteers",
                    "publishStart": "2026-11-02",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-28",
                    "title": "Sport Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nInchgarth Community Centre is the city's largest, busiest, and most vibrant community centre. We provide a fantastic programme of activities for the community with the tremendous help of volunteers. Inchgarth has over 170 sessions of activity per week-serving every age group and section of the community-a programme and range of facilities second to none. There’s something for everyone at our centre.\r\n\r\nWe're looking for active individuals to volunteer with our brand new sport groups!\r\n\r\nHelp us offer a great weekly time while staying active and having fun!\r\n\r\nAs a volunteer, you will help set up and tidy up for the group. While it's on, you'll be organising activities, games and wee tournament while having fun.\r\n\r\nWe have Badminton, Pickleball, Football & Table Tennis.\r\n\r\nAll volunteers are greatly appreciated and provided with excellent support. Please contact us to find out more, join our amazing team of volunteers and make a real difference in the community: email: volunteerinchgarth@gmail.com / Tel: 01224 325191 / Website: https://www.inchgarth.co.uk/volunteer.html\n\n## Description\n\nInchgarth Community Centre is the city's largest, busiest, and most vibrant community centre. We provide a fantastic programme of activities for the community with the tremendous help of volunteers. Inchgarth has over 170 sessions of activity per week-serving every age group and section of the community-a programme and range of facilities second to none. There’s something for everyone at our centre.\r\n\r\nWe're looking for active individuals to volunteer with our brand new sport groups!\r\n\r\nHelp us offer a great weekly time while staying active and having fun!\r\n\r\nAs a volunteer, you will help set up and tidy up for the group. While it's on, you'll be organising activities, games and wee tournament while having fun.\r\n\r\nWe have Badminton, Pickleball, Football & Table Tennis.\r\n\r\nAll volunteers are greatly appreciated and provided with excellent support. Please contact us to find out more, join our amazing team of volunteers and make a real difference in the community: email: volunteerinchgarth@gmail.com / Tel: 01224 479061 / Website: https://www.inchgarth.co.uk/volunteer.html\n\n## Training details\n\nExcellent support and relevant guidance is provided to all volunteers.\n\n## Travel details\n\nInchgarth Community Centre, Aboyne Place, Garthdee, Aberdeen, AB10 7DR",
