                    "title": "Inchgarth Community Centre Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nInchgarth Community Centre is the city's largest, busiest, and most vibrant community centre. We provide a fantastic programme of activities for the community with the tremendous help of volunteers. Inchgarth has over 170 sessions of activity per week-serving every age group and section of the community-a programme and range of facilities second to none. There’s something for everyone at our centre.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of this is our marvellous volunteer team and there are a great range of opportunities to help at Inchgarth Community Centre.\r\n\r\nAll volunteers are greatly appreciated and provided with excellent support. Please contact us to find out more, join our amazing team of volunteers and make a real difference in the community: email: volunteerinchgarth@gmail.com / Tel: 01224 325191 / Website: inchgarth.co.uk/volunteer\n\n## Description\n\nInchgarth Community Centre is the city's largest, busiest, and most vibrant community centre. We provide a fantastic programme of activities for the community with the tremendous help of volunteers. Inchgarth has over 170 sessions of activity per week-serving every age group and section of the community-a programme and range of facilities second to none. There’s something for everyone at our centre.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of this is our marvellous volunteer team and there are a great range of opportunities to help at Inchgarth Community Centre.\r\n\r\nAll volunteers are greatly appreciated and provided with excellent support. Please contact us to find out more, join our amazing team of volunteers and make a real difference in the community: email: volunteerinchgarth@gmail.com / Tel: 01224 325191 / Website: https://www.inchgarth.co.uk/volunteer.html\n\n## Training details\n\nExcellent support and relevant training is provided to all volunteers.\n\n## Travel details\n\nInchgarth Community Centre, Aboyne Place, Garthdee, Aberdeen, AB10 7DR",
