                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g1p00000DGzq7AAD",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g1p00000DGzq7AAD/video-makingediting-volunteers",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-25",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-22",
                    "title": "Video Making/Editing Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nHelp us make videos & short promotional clips and edit & produce them in a format that suits social media & websites. Express yourself, experiment and have fun while making a real difference.\r\n\r\nThis is a great opportunity to develop your creative skills and gain experience in project management.  \r\n\r\nAll volunteers are greatly appreciated and provided with excellent support. Please contact us to find out how you can help, join our fantastic team of volunteers and make a real difference in the community: Email: volunteerinchgarth@gmail.com / Tel: 01224 325191 / Website: http://www.inchgarth.org/\n\n## Description\n\nHelp us make videos & short promotional clips and edit & produce them in a format that suits social media & websites. Express yourself, experiment and have fun while making a real difference.\r\n\r\nThis is a great opportunity to develop your creative skills and gain experience in project management.  \r\n\r\nAll volunteers are greatly appreciated and provided with excellent support. Please contact us to find out how you can help, join our fantastic team of volunteers and make a real difference in the community: Email: volunteerinchgarth@gmail.com / Tel: 01224 479061 / Website: http://www.inchgarth.org/\n\n## Training details\n\nExcellent support and relevant training provided to all volunteers. Includes induction and there is always someone to help.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible times available. All help is greatly appreciated.\n\n## Travel details\n\nInchgarth Community Centre, Aboyne Place, Garthdee, Aberdeen, AB10 7DR",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g1p00000DGzq7AAD#role",
