                    "description": "## Summary\n\nWe are looking for people to help us with recurring tasks in the community centre. It can be a bit of stocking up, cleaning up and more.\r\n\r\nA fantastic opportunity to help. All help makes a real difference and is always greatly appreciated.\r\n\r\nFor more information, please email us at volunteerinchgarth@gmail.com or phone 01224 325191.\r\n\r\nTo find out about further volunteering opportunities at Inchgarth Community Centre please visit: https://www.inchgarth.co.uk/volunteer.html\n\n## Description\n\nWe are looking for people to help us with recurring tasks in the community centre. It can be a bit of stocking up, cleaning up and more.\r\n\r\nA fantastic opportunity to help. All help makes a real difference and is always greatly appreciated.\r\n\r\nFor more information, please email us at volunteerinchgarth@gmail.com or phone 01224 479061.\r\n\r\nTo find out about further volunteering opportunities at Inchgarth Community Centre please visit: https://www.inchgarth.co.uk/volunteer.html\n\n## Training details\n\nExcellent support and relevant training is provided to all volunteers.\n\n## Travel details\n\nInchgarth Community Centre, Aboyne Place, Garthdee, Aberdeen, AB10 7DR",
