                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD0000032Rf7YAE",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD0000032Rf7YAE/volunteer-at-peggys-cafe-at-inchgarth-community-centre",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Volunteer at Peggys Café at Inchgarth Community Centre",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nHelp your community and gain valuable customer service skills and experience. Make new friends and have fun.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a volunteers to help out on Thursdays from 11am to 3pm in our wonderful community cafe.\r\n\r\nYou will:\r\n•\tLearn how to use the till and our professional coffee machine \r\n•\tServe the table and keep to cafe clean and tidy\r\n•\tFull training will be provided \r\n\r\nAll help makes a real difference and is always greatly appreciated.\r\n\r\nFor more information, please email us at volunteerinchgarth@gmail.com or phone 01224 325191.\r\n\r\nTo find out about further volunteering opportunities at Inchgarth Community Centre please visit: https://www.inchgarth.co.uk/volunteer.html\n\n## Description\n\nHelp your community and gain valuable customer service skills and experience. Make new friends and have fun.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a volunteers to help out on Thursdays from 11am to 3pm in our wonderful community cafe.\r\n\r\nYou will:\r\n•\tLearn how to use the till and our professional coffee machine \r\n•\tServe the table and keep to cafe clean and tidy\r\n•\tFull training will be provided \r\n\r\nAll help makes a real difference and is always greatly appreciated.\r\n\r\nFor more information, please email us at volunteerinchgarth@gmail.com or phone 01224 479061.\r\n\r\nTo find out about further volunteering opportunities at Inchgarth Community Centre please visit: https://www.inchgarth.co.uk/volunteer.html\n\n## Training details\n\nExcellent support and relevant training provided to all volunteers. Includes induction and there is always someone to help.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nWe are looking for a volunteers to help out on Thursdays from 11am to 3pm\n\n## Travel details\n\nInchgarth Community Centre, Aboyne Place, Garthdee, Aberdeen, AB10 7DR",
