            "name": "The Breadmaker (part of Aberdeen Day Project charity)",
            "description": "The Breadmaker is part of the Aberdeen Day Project (a registered charity), is an artisan bakery and coffee house. \r\n\r\nLocated in Aberdeen City we are a successful social enterprise who produce and sell a range of quality handcrafted breads and confectionary to wholesale and retail customers alike with the purpose of providing a range of work placements, training and social activities for adults with learning disabilities (apprentices) who can otherwise experience exclusion and isolation in society.",
            "website": "https://www.thebreadmaker.org.uk",
