            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g24000000eHGVAA2",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g24000000eHGVAA2/health-practice-learning-environment-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-15",
                    "title": "Health Practice Learning Environment Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nVolunteers assist with the education of our health care students. Including:\n\n-volunteers to play the part of a service user or family member to help students in their communication and interview skills.\n-non-invasive clinical procedures such as students taking volunteers blood pressure and temperature.\n\nThrough this volunteers help in the training of Nursing and Midwifery, Physiotherapy, OT, Radiography, Dietetic, Pharmacy and Social Work students.\n\n## Description\n\nVolunteers assist with the education and training of health care students . Helping students develop confidence in aspects such as:\n\n-volunteers playing the part of a service user or family member to help students in their communication and interview skills.\n-non-invasive clinical procedures such as students taking volunteers blood pressure and temperature.\n\nThis helps in the training of Nursing & Midwifery, Physiotherapy, OT, Radiography, Dietetic, Pharmacy and Social Work students.\nFor further details please contact tel: 01224 262905 /Email: f.logie@rgu.ac.uk\n\n## Experience required\n\nReliability.\n\n## Training details\n\nTraining sessions are provided.\nIs a good way to make new friends and meet other volunteers.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nWeekdays\n\n## Travel details\n\nGarthdee and Schoolhill RGU campuses in Aberdeen City (all on bus routes)\n\n## Travel expenses\n\n-All travel expenses re-imbursed (to a maximum of £15)\n\n-A free pass to the swimming pool or aqua aerobics, yoga or tai chi class at the prestigious RGU Sports Centre is provided every time you attend.",
