            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000Pc7GCAAZ",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000Pc7GCAAZ/bumps-babies-and-beyond-group-volunteers-ferryhill",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-15",
                    "title": "Bumps, Babies and Beyond Group Volunteers - Ferryhill",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nOpen up in the Centre, put out toys, welcome parents and carers, make tea/coffee, offer support and include new people, clear up and tidy up at end of session. This always works well when there is a wee team of volunteers, it is a great way to support parents. You don't have to be a parent to volunteer, but if you do have wee ones it is all done with them there and around them.\r\n\r\nFor further details please contact Victoria Ellis at email: aberdeen@nct.org.uk\n\n## Experience required\n\nWarm, welcoming, friendly person. Experience of babies, good listener.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\n2 hours per week.\n\n## Travel details\n\nTakes place in Ferryhill, Aberdeen, AB11 6UD\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nReasonable travel expenses can be covered.\n\n## Taster details\n\nYou are welcome to come along to the group and speak to one of out friendly volunteers to find out more.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000Pc7GCAAZ#role",
