            "name": "The Living Well Project",
            "description": "Dementia is a progressive and debilitating condition affecting not only the person with a diagnosis but the whole family.  The Living Well Cafés offer a safe, friendly and welcoming place where people are supported and can spend time participating in optional activities, having fun or just sitting watching others.  Music plays a big part at our cafés. This is a great opportunity to help make a real difference in the lives of people living with dementia.",
