            "name": "North East Sensory Services (Aberdeen Services)",
            "description": "North East Sensory Services (NESS) is the leading provider of fully integrated joint sensory services in the North East of Scotland. Through our wide range of services, we work to achieve independence for blind and deaf people.",
            "website": "https://www.nesensoryservices.org",
            "charityRegistration": [
