                    "title": "Fundraiser Volunteers-Scottish Culture and Traditions",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe are looking for someone who can source funding for both our adult and youth programmes. The adult programme is self-sustaining, but we endeavour to provide free or subsidised places for those from disadvantaged communities and students, so require additional funding for this. The Youth programme is financed to large extent by Creative Scotland, but we have to raise a significant amount of funding ourselves as it is a condition of their grant that the programme is completely free to all participants.\n\n## Training details\n\nExcellent support and guidance  is provided to all volunteers. The volunteer will be briefed on the organisation and its historic funding. Also on most recent funding applications and sources of funding that we have used in the past.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible to suit volunteers.",
