                    "skos:prefLabel": "Emergency Response / Disaster Relief"
                },
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/Volunteering",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Volunteering"
                }
            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g24000001NcKwAAK",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g24000001NcKwAAK/aberdeen-samaritans-listening-volunteers",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-15",
                    "title": "Aberdeen Samaritans Listening Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nAnyone can talk to Samaritans, at any time, about whatever’s getting to them. We’re just ordinary people, who give up our time to listen. \r\n\r\nThe Aberdeen branch is looking for people who are interested in becoming listening volunteers. No previous experience is required and full training and support is given. \r\nFor further information please contact:\r\nMargaret Smith\r\nE Mail: volunteering@aberdeensamaritans.org\r\nTel No: 03705627282\n\n## Description\n\nAnyone can talk to Samaritans, at any time, about whatever’s getting to them. We’re just ordinary people, who give up our time to listen. \r\n\r\nThe service we offer is confidential and non-judgemental. Samaritans operates 24/7, 365 days a year. We offer support to people over the phone, by email, text and face to face.\r\n\r\nThe Aberdeen branch is looking for people who are interested in becoming listening volunteers. No previous experience is required and full training and support is given. \r\n\r\nAll help is greatly appreciated and makes a real difference.\r\n\r\nFor more information or to apply online to join our volunteer team please visit: https://www.samaritans.org/scotland/support-us/volunteer/\n\n## Experience required\n\nFull training is given and people of any age or background who enjoy helping others are welcome to apply.\n\n## Training details\n\nFull training is given and people of any age or background who enjoy helping others are welcome to apply. We offer information evenings for you to find out more and to help you decide if volunteering with Samaritans is right for you.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible times available to help. All help makes a real difference and is greatly appreciated.\n\n## Travel details\n\nAberdeen Samaritans\r\n60 Dee Street\r\nAberdeen\r\nAB11 6DS\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nOut of pocket expenses e.g.: bus fares are re-imbursed.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
