                    "publishStart": "2026-08-30",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-28",
                    "title": "Board Member / Charity Trustee x 2",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAcredale House is an established centre dedicated to providing care for the older community in West Lothian.\r\n\r\nThe governance of Acredale is managed by a dedicated group of professionals who form part of the Board and also act as Charity Trustees.\r\n\r\nThe Board are actively seeking two new volunteer members to enhance the current structure.\r\n\r\nThis role is provided on a voluntary basis however, expenses maybe provided where appropriate.\r\n\r\nThe vacancies are based upon oversight of governance so experience in Health Care or Business Management is desirable, but not essential.\n\n## Experience required\n\nExperience in organisational governance and/or health care provision.",
