            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g24000000eH37AAE",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g24000000eH37AAE/winter-maintenance-volunteers",
                    "publishStart": "2016-10-13",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-12",
                    "title": "Winter Maintenance Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nThe Swan is an important part of Shetland's maritime heritage and a community asset, through which the Trust offers a wide range of sailing and volunteering opportunities.\r\nMaintenance and refit work is ongoing November to March and includes:\r\nRemoving rig, sails, equipment from boat in Scalloway to store in Lerwick.\r\nOrganising and maintenance of equipment at stores in Lerwick - including cleaning, varnishing, painting and storage.\r\nOn board maintenance, at boat in Scalloway - includes cleaning, varnishing and painting as well as engineering maintenance on all on board systems.\n\n## Description\n\nThe Swan is an important part of Shetland's maritime heritage and a community asset, through which the Trust offers a wide range of sailing and volunteering opportunities.\r\nWinter Maintenance and refit work is ongoing September to October (removing rigs and sails) and January to March (maintenance and painting) and includes:\r\nRemoving rig, sails, equipment from boat in Scalloway to store in Lerwick.\r\nOrganising and maintenance of equipment at stores in Lerwick - including cleaning, varnishing, painting and storage.\r\nOn board maintenance, at boat in Scalloway - includes cleaning, varnishing and painting as well as engineering maintenance on all on board systems.\n\n## Experience required\n\nConscientious attitude to work experience. No physical experience necessary for refit work as full training and supervision provided.\n\n## Travel details\n\nOn board the Swan, Scalloway, October - March; At the Swan store, Hay's Dock Lerwick: year round.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nIf funding becomes available.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g24000000eH37AAE#role",
