            "name": "Shetland Community Bike Project (SCIO)",
            "description": "The project aims to provide work for trainees for up to 1 year.  The trainees will have the opportunity to gain practical experience in a workplace environment. The project will help to prepare persons with a substance misuse, or any barrier, for a return to sustainable employment.  Shetland Community Bike Project will provide a workshop which trainees will restore and fix bicycles.",
