                    "publishStart": "2008-11-06",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-11-27",
                    "title": "Shetland Community Bike Project",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nWorking in a suported workshop, assisting worker / volunteers with barriers to employment e.g. mental health, drugs / alcohol issues, to carry out assigned tasks.\n\n## Description\n\nThe workshop is a safe alcohol / drug free working environment.  Our aims are to support our workers and where possible enable them to enter into mainstream employment.\r\nWorking in a supported workshop, assisting worker / volunteers with barriers to employment e.g. mental health, drugs / alcohol issues, to carry out assigned tasks.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nAny to suit volunteer - Weekdays.\n\n## Travel details\n\n16-18 Commercial Road, Lerwick, Shetland.  ZE1 0LX\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nvolunteer expenses up to £7 per day.",
