            "name": "Samaritans of Shetland",
            "description": "To befriend the suicidal and despairing.  Listening without judement so people can find a way through their feelings.\r\n\r\nUsually we work by phone but increasingly by email and text.  Also face to face.",
            "website": "https://www.samaritans.org/branches/shetland/",
            "charityRegistration": [
                {
                    "registrar": "https://www.oscr.org.uk",
                    "registrationNumber": "SC006913"
                }
            ],
            "cause": [
