                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g24000000eNStAAM/fundraiser",
                    "publishStart": "2014-01-29",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-01",
                    "title": "Fundraiser",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nFundraiser - Help raise funds for our charity, from organising events to taking part on the day!\n\n## Description\n\nWe are looking for someone to help with fundraising for our charity.  Coming up with money making ideas, organising events, helping out at events.\r\nCould be anything from 'Soup and Sweet' at local hall to 'quiz sheet' sales at local shops.  \r\nAny help, support, ideas welcome.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nVariable.\n\n## Travel details\n\nFundraising events could take place anywhere throughout Shetland.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nNo",
