                    "title": "Events Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nClan Events Volunteers - help out at different Clan events and fundraisers.  Events can include; coffee mornings, awareness campaigns, attending community fundraising events or even hosting an event with Clan.  Bake goods for Clan, help sell merchandise etc.  \r\npromote Clan Services\r\nThese events usually take place weekends or evenings - but can also be at times during the week.\n\n## Experience required\n\nPromote Clan services, help at fundraising events or host the events.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nClan remiburses expenses in accordance with their Expenses policy",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
