        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/0011p00002ci33TAAQ",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/0011p00002ci33TAAQ/ayr-academy",
            "name": "Ayr Academy",
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000EEP1kYAH",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000EEP1kYAH/breakfast-club-assistant",
                    "publishStart": "2025-12-23",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-29",
                    "title": "Breakfast Club Assistant",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAyr Academy is one of eight secondary schools within South Ayrshire which is located in South West Scotland. They are a six year non-denominational comprehensive school and the school roll over the last five years has been between 400 and 700.\r\n\r\nThey are currently looking for volunteers to assist at the Breakfast Club. The main duties will be preparing food and drink for the pupils attending and organising resources. \r\n\r\nSkills & experience required: \r\n\r\n•\tAbility to engage positively with young people and staff.\r\n•\tClear and friendly verbal communication skills.\r\n•       Organisational Skills\r\n•\tManaging time effectively to set up and serve breakfast promptly.\r\n•\tKeeping the area tidy and ensuring food safety standards.\r\n•       Teamwork\r\n•\tWorking collaboratively with other volunteers and school staff.\r\n•      Basic Food Handling Knowledge\r\n•\tUnderstanding hygiene and safety when preparing or serving food.\r\n\r\nThis role is available Monday - Friday 8 -9am.  We will be flexible if applicants can do some mornings but not others.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2Fccd5ae1d-8d0c-47a7-bbbb-e4cc3a8af677%2FcJdW0lmlOSSkht3fHIw2RKaUhVU2%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=29eeeab2-90a5-447b-81e8-ff8a93ed7efb",
