            "name": "Isaro Community Initiative",
            "description": "The organisation has a vision for a safe and multi-culturally enriched Scottish community,and aims to promote social and cultural integration and mutual understanding between the diverse communities within Scotland. It also aims to promote education, sustainable employment and the economy.",
            "charityRegistration": [
                {
                    "registrar": "https://www.oscr.org.uk",
