                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000AIMYzYAP",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000AIMYzYAP/charity-shop-assistant",
                    "publishStart": "2025-06-09",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-08",
                    "title": "Charity Shop Assistant",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nNo matter how good our services are, we can't properly support our users/community well if we don't have good sales people in the team. If this sounds like you?... we would love you to consider volunteering with us for a few hours per week.\r\n \r\nEmpowered communities living in harmony, with strengthened mutual cultural understanding and greater global awareness.\r\n \r\nOur friendly shop is an ideal place for you to put your retail skills to great use – outgoing nature, enthusiastic personality, friendly, reliable, helpful nature, talking and assisting customers, aware of product placing, making up information packs for the charity and selling charity products.\r\n\r\nSo, whether you are looking to use your time well, update your skills or have the chance to do something a bit new, we would love to hear from you. In return, we can offer you a warm welcome and all of the support and help you could need.\r\nWe are seeing a rise in demand for our services, everyday. Having your help will allow us to be there for the people who need us. Any time you can give will make a real difference. \n\n## Travel details\n\nClydebank",
