                    "publishEnd": "2027-05-07",
                    "title": "Kirkwall shop volunteer - Orkney",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nVolunteers will be involved in handling and pricing donations, operating the till and helping to create eye-catching displays.\n\n## Experience required\n\nVolunteers will enjoy working as part of a team and enjoy learning new skills. Creativity is also valued.\r\nFull training will be given and no prior experience necessary.\n\n## Training details\n\nIn-house training provided regarding the practical aspects of the volunteer role – handling and pricing donations, operating the till, etc. Volunteers will also complete online training in relation to the history of the Red Cross, Red Cross values, health and safety, etc.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nWed \t10-1\t and 1-4\t Thurs \t10-1\tand 1-4\t Fri \t10-1 and\t1-4\t Sat \t10-1\tand 1-4",
