            "name": "Cambuslang Out of School Care Project",
            "description": "Cambuslang Out of school care have a progressive and holistic early childhood education philosophy, thye understand that each child has unique needs and interests. They provide the environment and tools a child needs to thrive to the best of their abilities. \n\nThe Project is takes children aged 4-16 yr olds. Pick ups from Cairns Primary School, St Bride's Primary School, West Coats Primary School \nPromoting the care, education, health and wellbeing of children in need of care during out of school hours and school holidays.\n2.30pm to 6.pm Monday to Friday Term Time 8.00am to 6pm Monday to Friday School Holidays",
            "website": "https://outofschoolcarecam.wixsite.com/cambuslang",
