                    "title": "Minibus escort",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nwe are looking for someone who can pick up the children at St Charles primary and then onto Newton farm primary to pick up a staff member and more children , then return them to the base in Cambuslang. \nIt should take no more than 1 hour per day 2.30-3.30pm \nthe person needs to be over 25 with a clean driving licence .\nThe person will need 2 references\n\n## Experience required\n\nDriving, Caring,Patient,Reliable / Dependable,Trustworthy,\n\n## Travel details\n\nThis is a South Lanarkshire opportunity and takes place in   \nAcross South Lanarkshire",
