            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000Vhqc7AAB",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000Vhqc7AAB/the-meeting-place-service-advisor",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-01",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-31",
                    "title": "The Meeting Place Service Advisor",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe are looking for a friendly person who is is confident and can work independently in the kitchen within our busy community hub and café - The Meeting Place. As a volunteer your duty is to provide a warm welcome to all visitors. You will assist with taking food orders, ensuring visitors feel welcome, engaging with customers, assist with clearing tables, keeping kitchen area clean, making hot drinks and preparing food. \n\nWelcoming and friendly manner, commitment to ensuring cleaning and hygiene measures are always maintained, work well within a team and willingness to help colleagues reliable and willingness to learn.\n\n## Experience required\n\nCatering / Hospitality,Fundraising, Caring,Good Communicator,Good Listener,Hard Working,Organised,Patient,Practical,Reliable / Dependable,Sociable,Team Player,Trustworthy,\n\n## Training details\n\nVolunteers will go through a 4 week induction period where they will receive one to one training and a volunteer pack with lots of useful information including role description and the relevant policies and procedures. After the end of the 4 weeks we have an informal chat about the volunteers progress and how they feel about volunteering with us. After the chat the volunteer will continue to be supported throughout their time with us.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nHour café is open between 10am to 4pm. We are looking for people to come in from 11am-1pm or 1pm - 4pm or we can work around your availability. Hour café is open between 10am to 4pm. We are looking for people to come in from 11am-1pm or 1pm - 4pm or we can work around your availability. This applies to expense payment frequency\n\n## Travel details\n\nThe opportunity takes place at multiple location across South Lanarkshire \nEast Kilbride\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nExpenses are paid as per policy",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
