                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000SsIwWAAV",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000SsIwWAAV/group-befriender",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-30",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-05",
                    "title": "Group Befriender",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nA group befriender will work with a team of volunteers to run a friendship group in one of our localities in South Lanarkshire with the support of a group befriending coordinator. The groups are run for older people (50 and over) in their area that are looking for more social contact. Volunteers will spend time with our clients offering companionship to build their confidence and link them back into the local community. Your role will consist of helping to make teas and coffees, welcoming in guests and running activities at the group such as crafts, seated exercise, reminiscence to name a few of the activities we run. You will have the support of staff and other volunteers while at the group.\n\nSome of the skills we look for in a volunteer are: An empathy with older people; reliable and trustworthy; being sensitive and supportive; flexible; Having a few hours spare each week; Being friendly; Being interested in people.\n\n## Experience required\n\nBefriending / Mentoring,No Expertise, Caring,Good Communicator,Good Listener,Open minded,Patient,Reliable / Dependable,Sociable,\n\n## Training details\n\nAll volunteers are given a group befriending training session as well as ongoing training such as dementia awareness, mental health awareness and others throughout volunteering role.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\n3 hours per week. Minimum Commitment: 6 months. (9am - 4:30pm) - Flexible to suit. 3 hours per week. Minimum Commitment: 6 months. (9am - 4:30pm) - Flexible to suit. Travel expenses are reimbursed (Monthly).\n\n## Travel details\n\nThe opportunity takes place at multiple location across South Lanarkshire \nBlantyre,Cambuslang,East Kilbride,Hamilton,Rutherglen,Uddingston\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel expenses are reimbursed (Monthly).",
