                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-31",
                    "title": "Dementia Services Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nThe LEAP Dementia services are looking for volunteer to help with our community groups which include two lunch groups, two music groups, an activity group and a carers cafe. We are also looking for befriending volunteers to support people living with dementia in their homes.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo Expertise, Caring,Good Communicator,Good Listener,Patient,Reliable / Dependable,Team Player,\n\n## Training details\n\nWe offer induction training and a comprehensive training development programme.\n\n## Travel details\n\nThe opportunity takes place at multiple location across South Lanarkshire \nAcross South Lanarkshire,Cambuslang,East Kilbride\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel expenses within South Lanarkshire.",
