            "description": "Covey Befriending offer one-to-one and group befriending and mentoring throughout South Lanarkshire and in areas of North Lanarkshire.\nAt the heart of what they do are committed and passionate volunteers choosing to help children, young people and families. Their key purpose is that young people and families live happy and fulfilled lives. Through strong trusting relationships they support children, young people and families to become more resilient, safe and better equipped to reach their full potential.",
            "website": "https://www.coveybefriending.org.uk/",
            "charityRegistration": [
                {
                    "registrar": "https://www.oscr.org.uk",
                    "registrationNumber": "SC020754"
                }
            ],
            "cause": [
                {
