        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/00124000008nXbdAAE",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/00124000008nXbdAAE/oxfam-shop-lanark",
            "name": "Oxfam Shop (Lanark)",
            "description": "Oxfam shop Lanark sell your generously donated good quality clothes, books, music and homewares to raise money to fight poverty and suffering. We also sell a good range of greetings cards.",
            "website": "https://www.oxfam.org.uk/shops/oxfam-shop-lanark/",
            "cause": [
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/CharityShop",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Charity Shop"
                }
            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000VhwysAAB",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000VhwysAAB/shop-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-01",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-31",
                    "title": "Shop Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nW e   n e e d    y o u r    h e l p \n\nOxfam Lanark is looking for:\n\nSales Assistants\nWindow dressing\ne-commerce & ecommerce fulfilment\nmedia advertising\nStock room management.\nTeam leaders.\n\nWhat you could be doing: \n•\tLearn & practise excellent customer service.\n•\tDiscover your inner creative self and express your flair with eye-catching displays. \n\nFrom picking items for online sales through to dispatch and handling any queries regarding on line sales. \n\nMedia advertising through many socials to recruit, advertise stock for sale, shop displays, and offers.\n\nManage and prepare donated Items for sale and collect for themes.\n\nTo manage a small team (after training) with some responsibilities. Empowerment grows confidence.\n\n\t\n\nWhat’s in  it for you: \n•\tGrow your confidence and meet new people \n•\tDevelop and improve a new skill set.\n        Training is provided for all positions.\n        Lunch and travel expenses can be paid to you for your time.\n•\tWe can be flexible around your work, education, family etc \n\nAll training is provided and you will join a lovely team of volunteers whilst making a difference, giving back and beating poverty together! \nPlease pop in and have a chat with Amanda for more details or you can apply online www.oxfam.org.uk\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo Expertise, Caring,Creative,Good Communicator,Good Listener,Hard Working,Open minded,Organised,Patient,Practical,Reliable / Dependable,Sociable,Social Conscience,Team Player,Trustworthy,\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible to the applicant Flexible to the applicant This applies to expense payment frequency\n\n## Travel details\n\nThe opportunity takes place at multiple location across South Lanarkshire \nAcross South Lanarkshire,Lanark",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
