            "name": "Wiston Lodge",
            "description": "Wiston Lodge is a former Victorian Hunting Lodge set in 52 acres of ground at the foot of Tinto Hill in the village of Wiston near Biggar. They provide residential and day programmes for groups of young people and adults at risk. They do this by using Personal  Social and Emotional Development (PSED) delivered using Outdoor Adventure Activities  Environmental Education  Music & Arts. Wiston Lodge is also a venue for training  conferences and self programming groups.",
            "website": "https://wistonlodge.com/",
