            "name": "East Kilbride Community Trust",
            "description": "To promote community development and equality and diversity in East Kilbride by encouraging participation in sports, horticulture, activities and programmes which bring together a cross section of the community, encouraging all to participate, regardless of background or ability. To advance education in the community of East Kilbride, particularly in relation of health and fitness, sporting activity and life skills, through providing or organising educational, training and lifelong learning opportunities.",
