                    "title": "Womans Walk Leader",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe are looking for 2 walk leaders to lead a womans health walk through k-woodlands on a set weekday evening. Volunteer must be first aid trained and first aid trained.\n\n## Experience required\n\nFirst Aid / Medical / Therapy, Caring,Creative,Good Communicator,Good Listener,Hard Working,Open minded,Organised,Reliable / Dependable,Sociable,Trustworthy,\n\n## Travel details\n\nThe opportunity takes place at multiple location across South Lanarkshire \nAcross South Lanarkshire",
