                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD0000096azhYAA",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD0000096azhYAA/k-woodlands-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-01",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-31",
                    "title": "K-Woodlands Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nThe East Kilbride Community Trust is currently recruiting enthusiastic volunteers to support activities at both K-Woodlands and K-Park. This is a great opportunity for anyone interested in sports, conservation, marketing, community work, or improving their own health while making a positive impact. The Trust welcomes people of all backgrounds and will help match each volunteer with a role that suits their interests and skills. If you’re looking to get involved, meet new people, and contribute to your local community, you’re encouraged to get in touch today.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo Expertise, Caring,Good Communicator,Open minded,Team Player,Trustworthy,-\n\n## Training details\n\nLearn on the job from other volunteers\n\n## Travel details\n\nThe opportunity takes place at multiple location across South Lanarkshire Yes\nEast Kilbride\n\n## Travel expenses\n\n-",
