                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g1p00000DGrP9AAL",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g1p00000DGrP9AAL/befriend-a-child-volunteers",
                    "publishStart": "2026-09-30",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-24",
                    "title": "Befriend a Child Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nMake a positive difference to a local young person in need of support. \r\n\r\nWhether you are supporting a child as a befriender or mentor through our 1:1 befriending and mentoring programmes, helping them build skills and make friends at our group activity sessions or youth clubs, or supporting our fundraising team, you will be playing an active role in changing the life of a local child or young person.\r\n\r\nThere are several fantastic benefits to becoming a volunteer with Befriend a Child such as:\r\n•\tAccess to training and upskilling opportunities\r\n•\tThe chance to play an active role in shaping the future of a child or young person\r\n•\tThe opportunity to build transferable skills for your future and career\r\n•\tThe chance to expand your horizons and try new activities\r\n•\tBeing part of an amazing volunteer community\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in volunteering with us please email volunteer@befriendachild.org.uk or call 01224 210060 to speak to a member of our team!\r\n\r\nFurther details are also available at: https://www.befriendachild.org.uk/volunteering/volunteer-with-us/\n\n## Description\n\nMake a positive difference to a local young person in need of support. \r\n\r\nWhether you are supporting a child as a befriender or mentor through our 1:1 befriending and mentoring programmes, helping them build skills and make friends at our group activity sessions or youth clubs, or supporting our fundraising team, you will be playing an active role in changing the life of a local child or young person.\r\n\r\nThere are several fantastic benefits to becoming a volunteer with Befriend a Child such as:\r\n\r\n•\tAccess to training and upskilling opportunities\r\n•\tThe chance to play an active role in shaping the future of a child or young person\r\n•\tThe opportunity to build transferable skills for your future and career\r\n•\tThe chance to expand your horizons and try new activities\r\n•\tBeing part of an amazing volunteer community\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in volunteering with us please email volunteer@befriendachild.org.uk or call 01224 210060 to speak to a member of our team!\r\n\r\nFurther details are also available at: https://www.befriendachild.org.uk/volunteering/volunteer-with-us/\n\n## Training details\n\nExcellent training and support is provided to all volunteers.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible times available to suit volunteers.\n\n## Travel details\n\nOpportunities across Aberdeen City and Aberdeenshire.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nRelevant out of pocket expenses are re-imbursed.",
