                    "title": "Volunteer Mentor",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nBefriending is designed for children aged 5 – 16 years old who are facing difficult life circumstances.\r\n\r\nWe run a mentoring programme within befriend a child helping support young people in Aberdeen City aged 7-15 years old who are living at home supported by social work or living in kinship care. \r\nOur volunteer mentors spend 2-3 hours twice a month with a young person enjoying activities and outings in the community which are goal focused and child-led.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nA monthly allowance to cover expenses",
