            "name": "British Red Cross (Aberdeen)",
            "description": "The British Red Cross helps people in times of crisis, providing a range of services in local communities across the UK. We are a volunteer-led humanitarian organisation that helps people in crisis, whoever and wherever people are.",
            "website": "https://www.redcross.org.uk",
            "charityRegistration": [
