                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-15",
                    "title": "Befriender",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nNHS GRAMPIAN at WOODEND: Hospital Befriending\r\n\r\nFor further details please contact:\r\nFiona Thomson:\r\ntel.:  01224 556645\r\nEmail: fiona.thomson3@nhs.net\n\n## Description\n\nNHS Grampian -  Befriending clients in Hospital \r\n\r\nFor further details please contact:\r\nFiona Thomson:\r\ntel.:  01224 556645\r\nEmail: fiona.thomson3@nhs.scot\n\n## Experience required\n\nGood communication skills, caring attitude, ability to work with minimal direct supervision and reliability.\n\n## Training details\n\nInitial induction by VSC and ward/department manager.  Volunteer meetings on topics relevant to hospital volunteer work held at irregular intervals.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible times available. All help greatly appreciated.\n\n## Travel details\n\nWoodend Hospital - Lang Stracht/Woodend\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel expenses paid to volunteers by cheque.  Claims take approx. 4 weeks to process.",
