            "name": "Instant Neighbour Charity",
            "description": "The Charity’s aims and objectives are directed at helping people: To set up home for the first time on a low income To set up home after a period of homelessness Who are forced to seek accommodation because of divorce or relationship break-down Who are experiencing hardships as a result of prolonged dependence on benefits By providing volunteer opportunities for people furthest away from the labour market By providing employability and employment options for long term unemployed people",
