            "name": "Home-Start Aberdeen",
            "description": "We are one of Scotland’s largest Home-Start schemes, providing up to 180 families and 270 children with 27,500 hours of emotional and practical support in their own homes each year.\r\nHome-Start Aberdeen works with families to help them: \r\n•gain access to relevant health and welfare services \r\n•manage family budgets and nutrition \r\n•engage with their communities \r\n•enjoy family life again.",
