            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/00124000008nXdvAAE",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/00124000008nXdvAAE/aberdeen-citizens-advice-bureau",
            "name": "Aberdeen Citizens Advice Bureau",
            "description": "For over 80 years the Aberdeen Citizens Advice Bureau (ACAB) has been improving the lives of the people of Aberdeen and enabling them to take control of their own affairs. ACAB is a fully independent registered charity with its own Board of Directors/Trustees. The advice service offered is independent, holistic, free, confidential, effective, impartial and accessible to everybody.",
