            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000A2eBhYAJ",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000A2eBhYAJ/social-media-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Social Media Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nAre you passionate about social media and want to make a difference? Aberdeen Youth Movement is looking for a Social Media Content Creator to join our dynamic team! As part of our social media crew, you’ll help us create engaging content and manage our online presence across X, Instagram, BlueSky, and TikTok.\r\n\r\n-What You’ll Do:\r\n•\tCollaborate with our team to design and post exciting content across our social media channels\r\n•\tHelp manage and oversee our social media accounts, keeping everything active and engaging\r\n•\tPromote events, opportunities, and campaigns to reach and inspire young people across Aberdeen\r\n•\tWork with a creative and supportive team to develop new ideas and strategies\r\n•\tWhat’s in it for You?\r\n•\tValuable experience in social media content creation and management\r\n•\tBuild your portfolio with hands-on work in a real-world setting\r\n•\tEnhance your skills in digital marketing, social media strategy, and creative design\r\n•\tBoost your CV with practical experience in a youth-led organisation\r\n\r\nNo formal experience required – we’re looking for enthusiasm, creativity, and a willingness to learn!\r\n\r\n-Interested?\r\nGet in touch with us! Email  AYM@aberdeencity.gov.uk telling us why you’d be a great fit. We can’t wait to hear from you!\n\n## Description\n\nAre you passionate about social media and want to make a difference? Aberdeen Youth Movement is looking for a Social Media Content Creator to join our dynamic team! As part of our social media crew, you’ll help us create engaging content and manage our online presence across X, Instagram, BlueSky, and TikTok.\r\n\r\n-What You’ll Do:\r\n•\tCollaborate with our team to design and post exciting content across our social media channels\r\n•\tHelp manage and oversee our social media accounts, keeping everything active and engaging\r\n•\tPromote events, opportunities, and campaigns to reach and inspire young people across Aberdeen\r\n•\tWork with a creative and supportive team to develop new ideas and strategies\r\n•\tWhat’s in it for You?\r\n•\tValuable experience in social media content creation and management\r\n•\tBuild your portfolio with hands-on work in a real-world setting\r\n•\tEnhance your skills in digital marketing, social media strategy, and creative design\r\n•\tBoost your CV with practical experience in a youth-led organisation\r\n\r\nNo formal experience required – we’re looking for enthusiasm, creativity, and a willingness to learn!\r\n\r\n-Interested?\r\nGet in touch with us! Email  AYM@aberdeencity.gov.uk telling us why you’d be a great fit. We can’t wait to hear from you!\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo experience is required as full training will be provided.\n\n## Training details\n\nExcellent support and relevant training is provided to all volunteers. New volunteers will be given support and development sessions every three months and will also be paired with a peer mentor for their first 6 months. Ongoing support for volunteers is available anytime via the AYM staff team. Training for various opportunities within AYM is also provided.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible times available to volunteer. All help makes a real difference and is greatly appreciated.\n\n## Travel details\n\nThis role will include content creation and coordination of social media accounts - approx 2.5hrs a week which can be done remotely. \r\n\r\nAberdeen Youth Movement's steering group meets once a month from 6pm - 8pm for 2 hrs in the city centre which is a requirement of the post.  \r\n\r\nThere are a number of events and meetings across Aberdeen City that are possible for our volunteers to attend depending on their availability.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F2f195d3d-3ab8-4676-bdbd-706a551c0dbb%2FqpZhYKSIPVM1o4ts4qLTgPfyY0s2%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=d9779f4b-a4dd-46cf-8eb5-f487c3d0fbd1",
