                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000C8Q85YAF",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000C8Q85YAF/volunteer-gritters",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-25",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-22",
                    "title": "Volunteer Gritters",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nAre you community-minded and looking for a simple but meaningful way to help your neighbours?\r\n\r\nWe’re looking for  volunteers who can help with occasional gritting at our community centre during the winter months. The pathway running from Holburn Street to Margaret Place is well-used by local residents, and a little support with gritting will help keep it safe and accessible for everyone.\r\n\r\nThis role is:\r\n•\tA chance to give back to your local community\r\n•\tFlexible and only needed on an ad hoc basis\r\n•\tA small act that makes a big difference in keeping people safe\r\n\r\nIf you’d like to help out and be part of making Ruthrieston a safer place this winter, please get in touch with Amanda Stephen, Centre Manager at email: RuthriestonDevelopmentManager@gmail.com or telephone: 07342280500\n\n## Description\n\nAre you community-minded and looking for a simple but meaningful way to help your neighbours?\r\n\r\nWe’re looking for  volunteers who can help with occasional gritting at our community centre during the winter months. The pathway running from Holburn Street to Margaret Place is well-used by local residents, and a little support with gritting will help keep it safe and accessible for everyone.\r\n\r\nThis role is:\r\n•\tA chance to give back to your local community\r\n•\tFlexible and only needed on an ad hoc basis\r\n•\tA small act that makes a big difference in keeping people safe\r\n\r\nIf you’d like to help out and be part of making Ruthrieston a safer place this winter, please get in touch with Amanda Stephen, Centre Manager at email: RuthriestonDevelopmentManager@gmail.com or telephone: 07342280500\n\n## Training details\n\nExcellent support and relevant guidance is provided to all volunteers.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible times to help. All help makes a difference and is greatly appreciated.\n\n## Travel details\n\nRuthrieston Community Centre\r\n532-536 Holburn Street\r\nAberdeen\r\nAB10 7LL",
