            "name": "Castle Furniture",
            "description": "* To provide support and therapeutic work placements to those recovering from a mental health illness.\r\n* To provide training opportunities and work placements to enable local unemployed or disadvantaged people to re-enter the labour market and regain self-worth in the process.\r\n* To bring together people who wouldn't usually meet to do things they wouldn't usually do.\r\n* To relieve poverty and distress.",
            "website": "https://castlefurniture.org",
            "charityRegistration": [
                {
                    "registrar": "https://www.oscr.org.uk",
                    "registrationNumber": "SC022079"
                }
            ],
            "cause": [
