            "name": "Blantyre Victoria YFC",
            "description": "Blantyre Victoria Football Club provides a place for young people who share an interest in football to come along and join in. The club's age groups start from 5 years upwards.\nIn partnership with Football Buzz Lanarkshire, Blantyre Victoria YFC now also offers sessions for kids from 1 year old upwards.\nTo join, please call the club for more details: 07961 985986",
            "website": "https://www.blantyrevicsyouth.com/",
            "cause": [
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/SportLeisureRecreation",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Sport / Leisure / Recreation"
                }
            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g1p00000O0shFAAR",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g1p00000O0shFAAR/social-media-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-09-11",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-01",
                    "title": "Social Media Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nBlantyre Victoria YFC is the youth and adult section of Blantyre Victoria FC and are the youth pathway into Blantyre Victoria FC senior team. We provide a place for young people who share an interest in football to come along and join in.\nWe are looking for someone to help with all forms of social media. To help raise awareness and the profile of the club of all the hard work taking place on and off the pitch. You do not need to be an expert in social media but have a keen interest in how this type of platform can help communicate with a wider audience.\n\n## Experience required\n\nComputer / IT / Web,Jornalism / Media,PR / Marketing, Creative,Good Communicator,Good Listener,Hard Working,Open minded,Organised,Patient,Practical,Reliable / Dependable,Sociable,Social Conscience,Team Player,Trustworthy,\n\n## Travel details\n\nThe opportunity takes place at multiple location across South Lanarkshire \nBlantyre,Hamilton",
