                    "title": "Funding and Fundraising Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nBlantyre Victoria YFC is the youth and adult section of Blantyre Victoria FC and are the youth pathway into Blantyre Victoria FC senior team. We provide a place for young people who share an interest in football to come along and join in.\nWe are looking for someone to help with funding applications and also help plan, co-ordinate and oversee fundraising activities.\n\nLocal volunteers would be preferrable for ease of travel.\n\n## Experience required\n\nAccountancy / Finance,Event Management / Organising, Creative,Good Communicator,Good Listener,Hard Working,Open minded,Organised,Patient,Practical,Reliable / Dependable,Sociable,Social Conscience,Team Player,Trustworthy,\n\n## Travel details\n\nThe opportunity takes place at multiple location across South Lanarkshire \nBlantyre,Hamilton",
