                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g1p00000OEQ96AAH#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Gardener",
                        "description": "Enthusiasm to improve Dundee’s environment, enjoys spending time in the fresh air and see the benefits of the difference they are making. Volunteers do not need any prior gardening experience to attend.\r\n\r\nThe opportunity would benefit someone looking to gain skills in gardening and also those looking to improve social skills and team working ability.",
