                }
            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HDu0zYAD",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HDu0zYAD/adaptive-bikes-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-06-10",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-09",
                    "title": "Adaptive Bikes Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nActive Schools Cycling Programme\r\n\r\nAre you enthusiastic, encouraging, engaging and supportive?  \r\nHelp children build confidence through Active Schools new adaptive bike program - join their volunteer team!\r\n\r\nActive Schools are looking to organise the following types of activities: \r\nWeekly School Sessions\r\nWeekly Family Sessions\r\nOne off events\r\nHoliday Programs\r\nAfter School Clubs\r\n\r\nVolunteers would support this program by either walking around and supporting the families/schools or perhaps ride alongside them encouraging them along the way. \r\nVolunteers will work with children with disabilities and additional support needs encouraging the pupils to participate.\r\n\r\nAs well as the satisfaction of helping the children and families, volunteers will gain leadership and coaching qualifications, disability inclusion training, meet new people and will gain hands on experience in working with others.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo previous skills or experience required, you don't even need to be sporty - just a willingness to help others, be enthusiastic and encouraging.\n\n## Training details\n\nAll training will be given prior to starting.\r\nCycle Training and how to support the adaptive bikes. Ongoing training such as first aid and Child Protection and wellbeing will also be offered.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\n1-3 hours per week, with the potential to be involved with extra sessions for events.\r\nSpring and Summer Time.\n\n## Travel details\n\nWithin Falkirk - further details can be confirmed.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel expenses are not available.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F1b0cda82-9c4e-4d1d-b636-096c618654ac%2FXPrpz4zVmiRWRuGPAUiQ4SyLdVd2%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=e64b64ac-f386-4118-ba42-8a39a25ebe91",
