                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000007p4IWYAY",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000007p4IWYAY/sports-coach-asn-and-disability-support",
                    "publishStart": "2025-01-09",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-09",
                    "title": "Sports Coach - ASN and Disability Support",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nThe goal of Active Schools is to provide more high quality opportunities for children and young people to take part in sport and physical activity. Active Schools host ASN and disability sport sessions across Falkirk District on a daily basis and provide a number of different inclusive activities.\r\n\r\nTo help facilitate these opportunities, Active Schools are supported by volunteers. In turn, we work closely with all volunteers to provide ongoing support, training opportunities, and all necessary admin so that volunteers have a fulfilling and enjoyable experience. \r\n\r\nYou can get involved by leading a sport or activity sessions, or by just coming along to a session and lending a helping hand to the children - it's up to you! \r\n\r\nIf you are interested in this opportunity and would like to find out more, then please do enquire now or contact Lisa Male at lisa.male@falkirk.gov.uk / 07834 120 845.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo previous skills or experience required, you don't even need to be sporty - just a willingness to help others!\n\n## Training details\n\nVolunteer will be placed with coaches to support sessions and will also be offered training opportunities.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nSessions take place during lunchtimes and after school at various schools and sports venues across Falkirk. We are always looking to provide more sessions across Falkirk.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F1b0cda82-9c4e-4d1d-b636-096c618654ac%2FXPrpz4zVmiRWRuGPAUiQ4SyLdVd2%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=e64b64ac-f386-4118-ba42-8a39a25ebe91",
                    "role": {
