            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000V7IiMAAV",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000V7IiMAAV/volunteer-cook",
                    "publishStart": "2023-08-02",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-31",
                    "title": "Volunteer Cook",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nTalbot House is a Day Centre running lunch clubs on a Tuesday & Thursday. \r\nThe objective of our community organisation is to promote and assist the welfare of senior citizens within the burgh of Grangemouth, encouraging the involvement of the wider community.\r\nWe combat loneliness by providing facilities for our community elderly to be socially interactive.\r\n\r\nWe are currently recruiting volunteers to cook for our lunch clubs. Each session will be from 8.30am to 1.30pm, and take place on a Tuesday & Thursday. Volunteers are not expected to commit to both sessions and a rota can be discussed.  \r\nLunches are two course, either soup and main or main and pudding, and all plain type dishes to suit the elderly age group such as soup, stew, mince, pasta and puddings etc. \r\n\r\nFood prep can be done the day before or early morning on the day.  Ideally we are looking for volunteers with experience of catering for around 30 persons.\r\n\r\nVolunteers must be reliable and willing to work with our elderly clients.\r\n\r\nThe lunch club closes for 2 weeks during summer and also over the festive period.\r\n\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/Talbot-House-355846911523772\n\n## Experience required\n\nIdeally we are looking for volunteers with experience of catering for around 30 persons.\r\nVolunteers must be reliable.\n\n## Training details\n\nInduction covers an explanation of charity history, what we do, and what expectations we have. Support consists of help from other team members as required.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nTuesday and Thursdays from 8.30am to 1.30pm.\n\n## Travel details\n\nTalbot Street, Grangemouth, FK3 8HU\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel expenses are available.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2Fd6ab9e8f-0282-9238-2986-0a57a8aa7f64%2FXPrpz4zVmiRWRuGPAUiQ4SyLdVd2%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=64eff9f6-b64c-4962-9f6b-21cbde4f6597",
