                        "commitment": "This role takes place October - March.\r\nWeekday evenings usually between 6 and 8pm.\r\n3 hours per month.",
                        "applyLink": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HXHLFYA5/energy-champion?#modal_register_a0gQD00000HXHLFYA5",
                        "allowsRemoteParticipation": false,
