                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000IBKadYAH#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Bookkeeper Volunteer",
                        "description": "We are looking for someone:\r\n- good with numbers and basic financial processes\r\n- great attention to detail and a methodical approach to tasks\r\n- familiar with spreadsheets such as Excel\r\n- reliable, discreet and a commitment to confidentiality\r\n- a calm, supportive approach and an ability to work well as part of a team\r\n- a willingness to learn and ask questions when something is unclear\r\n\r\nIt would be helpful if you have:\r\n- some coursework, training or experience in bookkeeping, accounting or finance administration\r\n- an interest in gaining practical experience in the charity or not-for-profit sector\r\n- previous experience using accounting software, although this is not essential",
                        "commitment": "4-5 hours per week, minimum commitment of 3 months.\r\nThe office is open Monday - Friday during normal working hours.  Timing can be flexible for volunteers during this period.",
