                    "publishStart": "2023-03-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-06",
                    "title": "General Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nWe believe children have only one chance of a childhood, and therefore help children and their families to overcome severe disadvantage - problems like abuse, homelessness and poverty and tackle the challenges of disability. | DISP-TSI\n\n## Description\n\nJoin us and you'll have the opportunity to:\r\nWork on the till processing sales and returns.\r\nPrepare stock, including sorting, steaming and pricing.\r\nCreate stylish window displays.\r\nReplenish stock on the shop floor.\r\nStocktake and other administrative tasks.\n\n## Experience required\n\nVolunteers should enjoy meeting and talking to people, Being able to work as part of a team environment and with the general public is essential.\r\nWe give all our volunteers full induction and training.\n\n## Travel details\n\nAlexandria",
