                    "publishStart": "2026-07-13",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-11",
                    "title": "Brew buddies volunteer - Kindness Krew",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nBrew Buddies volunteer opportunity offers support to those experiencing loneliness and isolation. Our volunteers visit beneficiaries in their homes, building companionship and confidence, helping them attend social groups to form new friendships. Volunteers will accompany beneficiaries to these social gatherings until they feel comfortable attending on their own.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
