                    "title": "Admin Assistant Voluntee",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nProviding administrative volunteer assistance for the kindness krew team. Join us in supporting the Kindness Krew coordinator with administrative tasks such as making calls, sending emails, and scheduling appointments for the kindness krew beneficiaries.",
