                    "publishStart": "2026-07-13",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-11",
                    "title": "Community Assistant Volunteer - Kindness Krew",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nVisiting beneficiaries in their homes is one of the most effective ways to understand their needs. Our Community Assistant volunteers, alongside the Kindness Krew coordinator, will meet with individuals to gather vital information. This will help us provide the appropriate support from our volunteer teams and services, making a significant impact on the beneficiaries.",
