                    "publishStart": "2026-05-27",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-11-16",
                    "title": "Retail Assistant",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nGain customer care skills, assist with admin duties, put your artistic skills to good use designing shop displays.\n\nVolunteering commencement usually 2-3 wks depending on references as per an email on 09/01/08 - IW\n\n## Description\n\nAs part of a committed team you would have an active role in raising the profile of barnardos as well as providing excellent customer services.  This has many elements that would enhance any existing skills as well as providing an opportunity to learn new ones.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo formal qualifications required, friendly enthusiastic person, no experience necessary.\n\n## Training details\n\nIn house induction package plus continued supervised support.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\n6 hours per Day. Minimum Commitment: 3 Month\n\n## Travel details\n\nBridgegate, Irvine",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
