                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-08",
                    "title": "Information and support volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nCan you spare a few hours a month to help people affected by cancer?. The Macmillan Cancer and information Support Service in Kilwinning Library is open on the first and third Friday of the month form 10.30 to 12.30. You will work with a team of volunteers to provide support by listening to people, providing information and directing them to local services.\n\n## Experience required\n\nCaring and empathetic. Willingness to listen and provide support to people",
