            "name": "Age Scotland (Western Isles)",
            "description": "As Scotland's National charity supporting people over the of 50.   Age Scotland works to improve peoples lives and promote their rights and interests.  We aim to help people love later life, whatever their circumstances.  We want Scotland to be the best place to grow older.",
            "website": "https://www.agescotland.org.uk",
