                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000FgmChYAJ",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000FgmChYAJ/volunteer-befriender-migrant-communities",
                    "publishStart": "2026-01-06",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-31",
                    "title": "Volunteer Befriender (Migrant Communities)",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nAs a Volunteer Befriender, you'll provide warm, compassionate support to individuals from migrant communities experiencing social isolation. Through one-on-one interactions and community-based assistance, you’ll help them feel welcomed and connected, making a positive impact on their lives.\n\n## Description\n\nThe Volunteer Befriender will offer warm, dependable, and caring support to individuals from migrant communities who may be feeling socially isolated. By engaging in one-on-one befriending and community-based activities, the volunteer will help people feel more welcomed, connected and supported, boosting their well being and confidence.\n\n## Training details\n\nTraining provided.\n\n## Travel details\n\nEH4 4AB\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel Expenses",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
