                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000FgmCgYAJ",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000FgmCgYAJ/social-media-engagement-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-01-06",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-31",
                    "title": "Social Media Engagement Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nAs a Social Media Engagement Volunteer, you will enhance our online presence and boost audience engagement. We seek a creative individual skilled in Canva and scheduling platforms but not essential\n\n## Description\n\nAs a Social Media Engagement Volunteer, your role is to enhance our online presence and boost audience interaction by assisting in creating and scheduling social media content, increasing engagement on platforms like Facebook, Instagram, and LinkedIn, promoting events, programmes, campaigns, and awareness days, suggesting innovative ideas to expand and engage our online community, and collaborating with staff to ensure our messaging aligns with our values and community voice.\n\n## Training details\n\nFull induction and ongoing support provided\nSafeguarding and data protection training\nRegular supervision and check-ins\nOpportunities to develop skills in community education and digital\ninclusion\n\n## Travel details\n\n5 Rose St\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel Expenses",
