                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000BMNhBYAX",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000BMNhBYAX/sista-circle-group-activities-assistant-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2025-08-05",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-31",
                    "title": "Sista Circle Group Activities Assistant (Volunteer)",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nThe ideal volunteer is someone who likes working with groups of women, who shares our vision (please see our website) and is willing to work in line with our mission. The ideal volunteer is someone who has the ability of signposting and engaging women and their families into our activities and services.\n\n## Description\n\nThe women’s spaces in SistaCircle consist of:\nCoffee morning with sewing, creative arts & crafts; Coffee Mornings (group support);\nTherapeutic Gardening; Exploring Cultures Through Food (cooking sessions); Exploring Cultures Through Creativity & Voice (cultural arts & dance sessions); Day Trips & Family Days Out; Cycling Club; Afrocentric Wellness Family Circle;\n\n## Travel details\n\nProject Esperanza, 12c McMillan Square. Edinburgh. EH4 4AB.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nFill out an expenses claim form.",
