        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/0010800003Br7pbAAB",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/0010800003Br7pbAAB/10th-leith-boys-brigade",
            "name": "10th Leith Boy's Brigade",
            "description": "We provide opportunities for children and young people to learn, grow and discover in a safe, fun and caring environment which is rooted in the Christian faith. Over 40,000 children and young people get involved every week throughout the UK",
            "website": "https://boys-brigade.org.uk/",
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000V7IboAAF",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000V7IboAAF/youth-leader",
                    "publishStart": "2022-10-18",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-31",
                    "title": "Youth Leader",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nDo you have what it takes to help boys learn, grow and discover? 10th Leith Boys' Brigade are currently recruiting youth leaders for 2 of our sections covering boys from 5 to 18 years old.\n\n## Description\n\nAs part of The BB you will help plan and deliver a safe and exciting programme for our young people, making sure everyone reaches their full potential and has the opportunity to gain a wide range of badges, awards, experiences, and develop skills for life. As part of our team you will be supported and empowered to deliver this and share best practice. Giving up just one hour of your week could make a huge difference.\n\n## Experience required\n\nDo I need any particular skills? No – just an attitude that is positive about children and young people, or as we say, have faith in young people. Of course, if you do have skills you can bring then fantastic! However, we value every volunteer just as we value every child and young person.\n\n## Travel details\n\nAddress: 6 Henderson St, Leith, Edinburgh EH6 6BS\n\nOur younger section meets each Wednesday night from 6.30-8.30pm and our secondary school age section meets on Friday nights 7-9.30pm.\n\nEasily accessible via car and bus. Many Lothian bus services pass close by the address. Please see https://www.lothianbuses.com/ for more details\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nNo expenses",
