                        "description": "Do I need any particular skills? No – just an attitude that is positive about children and young people, or as we say, have faith in young people. Of course, if you do have skills you can bring then fantastic! However, we value every volunteer just as we value every child and young person.",
                        "applyLink": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000V7IboAAF/youth-leader?#modal_register_a0g0800000V7IboAAF",
                        "allowsRemoteParticipation": false,
