            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HrlAHYAZ",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HrlAHYAZ/creative-garden-designer-to-help-improve-the-garden-at-crossreach-go2",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-07",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-03",
                    "title": "Creative garden designer to help improve the garden at CrossReach GO2.",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nCreative garden designer to help improve the garden at CrossReach GO2.\n\n## Description\n\nWe are looking for a volunteer with creativity and vision to help us make the most of our large outdoor garden space.\nWe would love support from someone with experience or an interest in garden design or landscaping to help create an accessible, welcoming and engaging environment.\n\nOur garden has great potential, and we are looking for someone who can help us develop ideas and a design that will maximise the space and create a meaningful outdoor experience for the children and young people who use our service.\n\nCrossReach GO2 is a centre supporting children and young people with disabilities.\n\nIf you are interested,&nbsp;please click the &lsquo;Apply&rsquo; button below (available when&nbsp;registered and&nbsp;logged in). You&nbsp;will then be contacted by the coordinator by email or phone call. If you have not heard back after 5 working days, the first step is to contact the organisation with the contact details provided. You could also check your junk/spam folder on your emails just in case the response is there. If that&nbsp;doesn&rsquo;t&nbsp;work&nbsp;out,&nbsp;then please feel free to contact Volunteer Glasgow on&nbsp;info@volunteerglasgow.org.&nbsp;\n\n## Experience required\n\nCreativity and vision with a friendly, patient manner.\n\n## Travel details\n\n10 minute drive from Glasgow city centre, 10 minute walk from Springburn station, served by multiple bus routes.",
