                    "description": "## Summary\n\nCommunity Fridge, Isle of Lewis are looking for volunteers to to online support, cooking , food collections and in person volunteering\r\n\r\nMore details to follow.  In the meantime contact lewis@volunteercentrewi.org if you are interested\n\n## Description\n\nNew volunteer opportunities to support Stornoway North, Community Fridge\r\nTraining will be provided for all\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nTimes to be discussed to suit",
