                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Call Companion",
                        "description": "Good conversation skills; an enthusiasm for speaking on the phone and making connections remotely; a friendly, empathetic approach; the ability to really listen to people; patience; a passion for improving the lives of lonely and isolated older people; a passion for improving the lives of lonely and isolated older people; the ability to volunteer as part of a mutually supportive team of call companions;  basic computer literacy(including the ability to use email).",
