                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000Gvge2YAB",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000Gvge2YAB/home-visitor",
                    "publishStart": "2026-05-21",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-11-19",
                    "title": "Home Visitor",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nBe the highlight of a blind veteran’s week in Dundee - drop in for a cuppa and chat, share laughs, and enjoy local outings. You’ll boost confidence and reduce isolation, with full training and support.\n\n## Description\n\nAs a Home Visitor in Dundee, you’ll offer regular companionship to a visually impaired veteran who may be feeling isolated, through friendly visits (often weekly or fortnightly) that fit around your commitments. \r\n\r\nVisits can be as simple as a cuppa and a chat and may also include supporting the veteran to get out locally for a gentle walk or a coffee, depending on their interests and what you feel comfortable offering. You’ll volunteer independently but will be fully trained and supported, with your manager only a phone call away and a network of other volunteers to link in with.\n\n## Experience required\n\n· Friendly & warm\r\n· Happy to work individually\r\n· Patient & empathetic\r\n· Reliable\r\n· Able to maintain boundaries\r\n· Good listener\r\n· Good sense of humour\r\n· Strong interpersonal skills\n\n## Training details\n\nInduction training, sighted guiding training as well as training on subjects such as Safeguarding and dealing with emergencies.\n\n## Travel details\n\nDundee\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nFuel allowance at 45p/m or public transport reimbursement with receipt. Paid Monthly\n\n## Taster details\n\nWhile no taster is available, any potential volunteers who may match well with a veteran will have their first meeting with them supported by the Volunteer Coordinator.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000Gvge2YAB#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Home Visitor",
                        "description": "· Friendly & warm\r\n· Happy to work individually\r\n· Patient & empathetic\r\n· Reliable\r\n· Able to maintain boundaries\r\n· Good listener\r\n· Good sense of humour\r\n· Strong interpersonal skills",
                        "applyLink": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000Gvge2YAB/home-visitor?#modal_register_a0gQD00000Gvge2YAB",
