                    "title": "Habitat Survey Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAssist the Rangers with surveying our Country Parks for some special species, to help monitor the condition of the habitats and make sure we are doing what we can to help them thrive. Training will be provided. Species surveyed will include bumblebees, red squirrels, butterflies, wetland birds, and more!",
