                    "title": "Conservation Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nInterested in protecting valuable habitats and the animals that call them home? Then come and help the Rangers with practical conservation tasks such as tree planting, invasive species removal and woodland management. Tools, gloves and training will be provided, so all participants need is a reasonable level of physical fitness to work outdoors with tools and an enthusiasm for helping wildlife!",
