                    "publishStart": "2025-06-06",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-10",
                    "title": "Sunday Youth Club Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\n* To assist the Youth & Community Worker (YCW) to run the Sunday Youth Club for S1-6 located in the church premises\r\n* To engage with the young people who attend, ensuring they feel welcome and are able to participate in the activities provided\r\n* To assist the YCW with the activities which may include board games, small group discussion, watching videos and other age-appropriate activities\r\n* To share responsibility for the safety and security of the young people who attend while they are in the premises\r\n* To work alongside other members of the youth work team and share in the debriefing discussion and decision-making about how the project’s development\r\n* To undertake training as may be required for volunteers and attend supervision and support sessions\r\n* PVG membership required\r\n* Timing: Weekly, Sunday evenings, 7-8.30 pm during school term time\n\n## Travel details\n\nSt Andrew's Parish Church, Ralston Road, Barrhead",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2Ff78a4807-c9c3-45c5-af6f-c3c6981420be%2FZTpsVM2s6uO1kBK4LhzHjps4n472%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=74d79498-2d6a-4f8e-8070-cd322a6ee0a8",
