            "name": "Hand of Solace",
            "description": "Hand of Solace is a Scottish Charitable Incorporated Organization working with isolated/lonely elders and young people by offering direct services and support , all designed to help people make the most of life.",
            "website": "https://www.handofsolace.co.uk/",
            "charityRegistration": [
