                    "description": "## Description\n\nVolunteers required to help the Bike Library in dealing with members of the public booking services/repairs in and out.\r\nOther general duties around our Hub as required.\r\nIdeally someone who has an interest in cycling but not necessarily.\n\n## Experience required\n\nBeing able to work with a small team and enjoys meeting members of the Public.\r\n\r\nThe volunteer will always be working alongside another colleague so will not be left unsupported.",
