                    "publishStart": "2025-04-08",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-26",
                    "title": "Shop Assistant",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nButh Bharraigh, the community retail and visitor hub in the heart of Castlebay are looking for volunteers to help in the community shop which provides a range of goods and services to help the community flourish.  The role will involve welcoming customers into the shop, help with enquiries, serve and take payments from customers and maintain and rotate stock.\r\nFull training and support is offered.  Volunteers must be resident on the island.  If you enjoy meeting people why not get in touch!",
