                    "title": "Deck Chair and Beech Wheeler hire Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nThe Summer is here and we are looking for Volunteers for our Deck Chair and Beach Wheelers Project.\r\nAs a Community Volunteer you will receive a role description and volunteer agreement containing full information about your chosen area of work and a clear idea of your responsibilities. All ACDT Community Volunteers will be given induction and training appropriate to the specific tasks to be undertaken. You will be assigned a named contact person who will provide regular support, these support sessions will provide the opportunity for ongoing dialogue about the development of your volunteering role and any advice and guidance as needed.",
