                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000QhimNAAR",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000QhimNAAR/community-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2023-08-08",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Community Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nLocal NCT groups and activities are an essential part of what we do. Our aim is to build welcoming and inclusive communities that improve the wellbeing of parents.\r\n\r\nAs a Community Volunteer you will know what support parents need most in your local area and play an important role in creating spaces for parents to connect and access trusted information and support.\n\n## Experience required\n\nOur Community Volunteers are:\r\nPassionate about supporting parents\r\nMotivated and reliable\r\nAble to plan and organise a one off event or regular group\r\nWelcoming to all parents, and a good listener\n\n## Training details\n\nYou will be invited to attend a monthly catch up with the Volunteering Team for training and support. These will usually be online in the evening and will be supported by closed captioning\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\n2hours a month for a minimum of 3 months",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F08bfb3fb-6a2d-40c0-a626-3a80a0d66fc8%2FWkLzgT1VE9cAHEWcVMpdVMd5bL63%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=0dd8a5df-df20-4d5c-b841-7cde5db4cef6",
