            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000GvcNyAAJ",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000GvcNyAAJ/volunteer-befriender",
                    "publishStart": "2021-04-28",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Volunteer Befriender",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nBefrienders, as part of the circle of support, help the focus person to build their confidence and participate in social activities within their community.\r\n \r\nAs a Volunteer Befriender, you will be a part of a person’s circle of support and help the focus person to build their confidence through participating in social activities within their community. This may include going for walks, participating in clubs or classes together, or attending Equal Futures’ monthly social events.\r\nBefrienders attend the circle meetings (approx. bimonthly) and meet 1:1 with their focus person weekly or fortnightly. Equal Futures supports you throughout your volunteering.\r\nVolunteers will be registered with Disclosure Scotland PVG Scheme\n\n## Experience required\n\n•\tWarm and friendly\r\n•\tApproachable\r\n•\tCompassionate\r\n•\tFlexible\r\n•\tDependable\r\n•\tEmpathetic\r\n•\tReliable\r\n•\tGood listeners\n\n## Training details\n\nInduction training is provided, Ongoing contact is kept with your local Project coordinator who will be on hand help and guide throughout your volunteering experience.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\n2 hours every fortnight\r\nPreferred minimum commitment - one year 2 hours every fortnight Preferred minimum commitment - one year\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTransport and similar expenses are met. Activity/ entrance fees etc.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F62b796d5-5165-3c1e-1c6e-82db74ad59ec%2FHi3K7lHa8wXatOHLGJFdBGJQtau2%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=e7722600-81fd-427b-9649-8eb40721d72f",
