                        "description": "No previous experience is required. This role would suit someone who:\n\nEnjoys meeting people and making them feel welcome\nIs friendly, patient, and approachable\nCan communicate clearly and kindly\nWould like to build confidence in a people-facing role",
                        "commitment": "This opportunity can be flexible. Volunteers may support weekly, fortnightly, or at agreed times that suit both the volunteer and the centre. We are happy to discuss a manageable commitment",
