        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/0011p00001SjLwRAAV",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/0011p00001SjLwRAAV/safe-families",
            "name": "Safe Families",
            "description": "At Safe Families we believe that no one should feel alone, and we exist to create relationship and connection offering hope, belonging and support to children, families, and care leavers. Facing life alone is hard and when families feel like there is no one there to help, it is a scary place to be, so we link children, young people and families with local volunteers who can offer them help and support.",
            "website": "https://safefamilies.uk",
            "cause": [
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/FamilySupport",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Family Support"
                }
            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g1p00000CKEhVAAX",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g1p00000CKEhVAAX/resource-befriender",
                    "publishStart": "2018-01-31",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-28",
                    "title": "Resource Befriender",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nResource Befrienders may do some painting, joinery, gardening or anything practical that helps out the family on a practical level.\n\n## Description\n\nResource Befrienders may do some painting, joinery, gardening or anything practical that will  help a family out.\n\n## Experience required\n\nWe are looking for people who have a concern for others and are happy to invest their time with families in need.  Everyone has varying degrees of life experience and can offer something to help someone else.\n\n## Training details\n\nWe provide training which takes place at various venues across Edinburgh and the Lothians, and online, with lots of dates available so volunteers can choose a date that suits them to attend.\n\n## Travel details\n\nEdinburgh.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nNo expenses paid.",
