        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/0010800003IKlktAAD",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/0010800003IKlktAAD/trinity-active-travel-hub",
            "name": "Trinity Active Travel Hub",
            "description": "To encourage people to take up active travel through becoming more confident and skilled in walking, cycling in a recreational setting. Organise health walks, led cycle rides, cycle skills training, cycle maintenance skills.",
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000VhwQCAAZ",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000VhwQCAAZ/walk-leader",
                    "publishStart": "2026-05-27",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-11-16",
                    "title": "Walk Leader",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nDo you love walking and like a blether? Would you like to encourage people to start walking by helping to organise and lead short walks. to As a walk leader you will: Help people discover and make the best of their local area on foot. Give people the confidence to walk on their own as well as in a group. Welcome as many people as possible by keeping walks easy and accessible.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nWe are looking for people who are friendly, outgoing and have bags of common sense to train as volunteer walk leaders. You will be given training in how to plan a walk, how to make sure a route is safe and what to do during a walk. You will be given full support from the walking coordinator.\n\n## Training details\n\nFull trainind will be given in all aspects of leading walks",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000VhwQCAAZ#role",
