        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/0010800003IKrQTAA1",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/0010800003IKrQTAA1/dbc-community-pantry",
            "name": "DBC Community Pantry",
            "cause": [
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/FoodBanks",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Food Banks"
                },
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/LunchClubs",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Lunch Clubs"
                }
            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000VhwTkAAJ",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000VhwTkAAJ/volunteer-helper",
                    "publishStart": "2023-05-19",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-07",
                    "title": "Volunteer Helper",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nNo matter how good our services are, we can't properly support our users/community well if we don't have skilled people in the team. If this sounds like you?... we would love you to consider volunteering with us for a few hours per week. \r\n\r\nOur friendly environment is an ideal place for you to put your serving skills to great use, serving food to people who attend, clear tables, return dirty dishes to the kitchen, assisting kitchen staff with setting up, serving lunches and washing dishes and a pleasant personality. \r\n\r\nSo, whether you are looking to use your time well, update your skills or have the chance to do something a bit new, we would love to hear from you. In return, we can offer you a warm welcome and all of the support and help you could need.  \r\n\r\nWe are seeing a rise in demand for our services, everyday. Having your help will allow us to be there for the people who need us. Any time you can give will make a real difference. \n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nThursday - 6.30pm- 8.00pm & Friday 11.00am - 2.00pm",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
