                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000VupDZAAZ",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000VupDZAAZ/collection-box-coordinator",
                    "publishStart": "2023-06-22",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-31",
                    "title": "Collection Box Coordinator",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nMDUK supports people with a life-limiting muscle-wasting condition, and there are approx. 9,000 children and adults with a condition in Scotland. We won't stop until effective treatments and cures are found for all muscle-wasting conditions. Make connections in the community to raise awareness of the charity.\n\n## Description\n\nYou can become the local face of MDUK, raising vital funds and constantly raising the profile of the charity so that we can reach more people and their families affected by a muscle wasting condition.\r\n\r\nAs a Volunteer Collection Box Co-ordinator, you will support the Regional Development Manager in your region to raise awareness and funds for the charity by placing and managing collection boxes within businesses in your local community.\n\n## Experience required\n\n· Have a welcoming, friendly manner\r\n· Good organisation skills and ability to maintain records\r\n· Initiative in order to recognise opportunities to place boxes\r\n· Have good written English and basic computer skills\r\n· Can volunteer flexible hours\r\n· Can volunteer independently and as part of a team\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible opportunity for the individual who can get involved in weekly or monthly activity dependent on\nother commitments Flexible opportunity for the individual who can get involved in weekly or monthly activity dependent on other commitments\n\n## Travel details\n\nHome based/ out in Dundee community\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nPayment of out of pocket expenses will be agreed in advance. Mileage of 45p per mile can be paid for\r\n\r\ndistances travelled to attend fundraising events, full guidance will be given during volunteer induction.\n\n## Taster details\n\nYou can’t learn about a role until often being in it so always opportunity for consult.",
