                        "title": "Collection Box Coordinator",
                        "description": "· Have a welcoming, friendly manner\r\n· Good organisation skills and ability to maintain records\r\n· Initiative in order to recognise opportunities to place boxes\r\n· Have good written English and basic computer skills\r\n· Can volunteer flexible hours\r\n· Can volunteer independently and as part of a team",
                        "commitment": "Flexible opportunity for the individual who can get involved in weekly or monthly activity dependent on\nother commitments Flexible opportunity for the individual who can get involved in weekly or monthly activity dependent on other commitments",
