            "name": "Your Love Rara",
            "description": "Your Love Rara (SCIO) is a registered Scottish Charitable Incorporated Organisation (SC053673) based in Aberdeen that supports children, young people, and families through community hubs, creative play, and mental health initiatives",
            "website": "https://www.loverara.co.uk/",
            "charityRegistration": [
