                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000QNtWRAA1",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000QNtWRAA1/paitent-experience-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-10",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-08",
                    "title": "Paitent Experience Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nRole aim:\r\nThe experiences of people using our services is vitally important to us and provides \r\nus with opportunities to learn and make improvements to our services based on our \r\npatient’s feedback. Through volunteering in this role, you will help us find out these\r\nviews and opinions to help us identify what we are doing well and how we could do \r\nbetter.\r\nVolunteers in this role will assist the Patient Experience Facilitator to gather feedback \r\nfrom both patients and visitors using a variety of approaches such as interviews and \r\nsurveys, and will also provide assistance on bespoke pieces of work that require \r\nservice user input.\r\nKey duties:\r\n• Deliver survey cards and posters to wards and departments\r\n• Assist in the completion of patient surveys utilising paper and/or iPad\r\n• Carry out interviews with patients, visitors and other volunteers\r\n• Assist in the analysis and presentation of feedback to various groups such as \r\nSenior Charge Nurses\r\n• Will work under direction of the Patient Experience Facilitator \r\n• This role has the potential to expand and evolve as the service develops",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000QNtWRAA1#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Paitent Experience Volunteer",
                        "applyLink": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000QNtWRAA1/paitent-experience-volunteer?#modal_register_a0g0800000QNtWRAA1",
                        "allowsRemoteParticipation": false
                    },
                    "session": {
                        "type": "Session",
                        "location": [
                            {
                                "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Geography/LocalAuthority/NorthAyrshire",
                                "type": "Location",
