                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000QhjdlAAB/gardener",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-10",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-08",
                    "title": "Gardener",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nChoose a Volunteer role and start your day knowing that you are making a real difference to people’s lives. Feel the fulfilment of a rewarding role, working with a great team of people to support greater independence and creating more opportunities for people with additional support needs. Come along and help us maintain and improve the garden at Trindlemoss Day Opportunities. Duties include Planting, pruning, sewing seeds, weeding, edging borders, digging and ground clearance",
