                    "title": "Woodworker",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nDo you have skills in woodwork that you would like to share in order to make a difference to the lives of adults with additional support needs. This rewarding role will see you volunteering with some amazing people teaching them basic woodworking techniques and perhaps making objects such as bird boxes Other attributes you need are compassion and patience.",
