                    "description": "## Description\n\nChoose a Volunteer role and start your day knowing that you’re making a real difference to people’s lives. Feel the fulfilment of a rewarding role – working with a great team of people to support greater independence and creating more opportunities for people with additional support needs. We are looking for volunteers who have an interest in knitting, sewing, painting, drawing or any craft activity that will stimulate our clients and get them involved\n\n## Experience required\n\nA willingness to support people with additional support needs.",
