        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/00108000031Zs3FAAS",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/00108000031Zs3FAAS/nac-new-scots",
            "name": "NAC New Scots",
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000Pc733AAB",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000Pc733AAB/befriender",
                    "publishStart": "2026-09-07",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-01",
                    "title": "Befriender",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nThis role supports the integration of New Scots (mainly Syrian and Afghan refugees) into their local communities and can work on two levels: \r\n\r\nCommunity Connector – acting as a contact point for New Scots seeking local information, support or activities. Sharing your local knowledge with them and supporting them to build local social networks. \r\n\r\nBefriender – supporting individuals/specific families to integrate by accompanying them on local activities, groups etc and offering general support to enable them to settle successfully. \r\n\r\nThe role may encompass one or both aspects.\n\n## Experience required\n\nRequired Skills\r\n\r\nE = Essential D = Desirable\r\n\r\nGood knowledge of the relevant local community, (groups, organisations etc ) \r\nAble to understand and practice strict confidentiality (E) \r\nExcellent people skills, especially where language may be a barrier (E) \r\nGood at building relationships and respectful of the differing needs and cultures of New Scots (E) \r\nDetermined problem solver with a positive approach (E) \r\nExperience of working with vulnerable people (D)",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000Pc733AAB#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Befriender",
                        "description": "Required Skills\r\n\r\nE = Essential D = Desirable\r\n\r\nGood knowledge of the relevant local community, (groups, organisations etc ) \r\nAble to understand and practice strict confidentiality (E) \r\nExcellent people skills, especially where language may be a barrier (E) \r\nGood at building relationships and respectful of the differing needs and cultures of New Scots (E) \r\nDetermined problem solver with a positive approach (E) \r\nExperience of working with vulnerable people (D)",
                        "applyLink": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000Pc733AAB/befriender?#modal_register_a0g0800000Pc733AAB",
                        "allowsRemoteParticipation": false
