            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000A2JGvYAN",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000A2JGvYAN/volunteer-befrienders-for-young-people-asn",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Volunteer Befrienders for Young People  (ASN)",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWould you like the opportunity to make a positive impact in helping young people get ready for life after leaving school? \r\n\r\nSereniti supports neurodiverse children, young people and their families in the Aberdeen and Aberdeenshire community (aged 5 - 18).  As a Befriender for Young People (minimum age is 18 ) you will be matched with and support a young person on a one-to-one basis through compassion and kindness in establishing a trusting friendship. Befrienders will support young people with attending community activities and commuting on local buses within Aberdeen, reducing loneliness and increasing self-esteem, confidence while promoting independence.\r\n\r\nOur volunteers commit a few hours a week, Activities will be after school hours, weekdays, and on Saturdays.\r\n\r\nWe will provide you with all of the necessary training and support to carry out your responsibilities.\r\n\r\nAll assistance will make a difference and be highly appreciated. We expect a six-month commitment from our befriender volunteers for the young people to experience a smooth transition process.\r\n\r\nFor more information please visit: https://www.serenitiaberdeen.com/get-involved or email us at: serenitiaberdeen@gmail.com\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible times available. A few hours for a couple of days a week. All help makes a difference and is greatly appreciated\n\n## Travel details\n\nOffice address - HQ Building, 3rd Floor,\r\n                          1 Berry Street, Aberdeen \r\n                          AB25 1HF",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
