                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000005Rf5pYAC",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000005Rf5pYAC/session-supporter-cupar",
                    "publishStart": "2026-11-03",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-01",
                    "title": "Session Supporter (Cupar)",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nSporting Memories Foundation Scotland is looking for someone passionate about sport that enjoys talking with older adults and will bring their enthusiasm into the club session. The Session Supporter works as part of a team of Facilitators and Session Supporters to organise and run the club sessions including helping to set up the venue for the club session as well as welcoming members as they arrive, organising refreshments and tidying up at the end. The team of volunteers are there to ensure the smooth running of the club. Sporting Memories clubs support older people who may have a physical disability and/or memory issues. Some of the members are isolated and the club provides them with the opportunity to chat and reminisce about their favourite sports\n\n## Experience required\n\nVolunteers should have an ability to communicate well with others and be able to support club members who have memory or physical health problems. The most important skill is to be able to listen and to encourage participants to engage and get involved in the discussion.\r\n\r\nThe Session Supporter helps the Session Facilitator to set up and run the club and is part of a team of 3-4 volunteers who collaborate to provide our members with a positive and enriching experience.\n\n## Training details\n\nOnline training session covers planning and running a club session (3hours). Online Policies and Procedures training session (1hour). Ongoing support is available from the Volunteer Coordinator and Fife Area Coordinator. Further training available - Dementia Awareness\n\n## Travel details\n\nDuffus Park Bowling Club, Carslogie Rd,Cupar KY15 4HY\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nExpenses are paid monthly and the mileage rate is 45p per mile.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000005Rf5pYAC#role",
                        "type": "Role",
