                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000JdePFYAZ",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000JdePFYAZ/volunteer-tearoom-host",
                    "publishStart": "2026-11-09",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-05-10",
                    "title": "Volunteer Tearoom Host",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAs a Volunteer Tearoom Host, you are the welcome. You help create the warm, relaxed atmosphere that makes The Old Schoolhouse & Tearoom a place people return to, not just for tea and cake, but for connection.\r\n\r\nThis role has a direct and visible impact. By giving a few hours of your time, you help:\r\n- Keep the Schoolhouse active and sustainable\r\n- Create a welcoming space for locals and visitors\r\n- Reduce isolation by offering a place to gather\r\n- Enable us to extend opening days and hours\r\n- Strengthen community life in Inverasdale\r\n- More hosts mean we can open more often and grow what we offer.\r\n\r\nWhat You’ll Be Doing\r\n- Welcoming visitors warmly\r\n- Serving tea, coffee and home baking\r\n- Handling simple payments\r\n- Light kitchen support and washing up\r\n- Helping set up and tidy down\r\n- Being part of a friendly, supportive team\r\n- Skills & Qualities We’re Looking For\r\n\r\nYou don’t need formal experience, just:\r\n- A friendly and approachable manner\r\n- Reliability and punctuality\r\n- Confidence chatting with people\r\n- Willingness to work as part of a team\r\n- Basic numeracy for handling payments\r\n\r\nSkills You May Develop\r\n- Customer service and hospitality skills\r\n- Confidence and communication\r\n- Cash handling\r\n- Teamwork\r\n- Time management\r\n- Experience useful for CVs, especially for young people\r\n\r\nThis role is ideal for someone who enjoys people, values community life, and would like to play a practical part in sustaining The Old Schoolhouse for the future.\r\n\r\nIf you’d like to help us grow something special in Inverasdale, we’d love to hear from you.\n\n## Training details\n\nWe will provide:\r\n- A welcoming induction\r\n- Clear guidance on how the tearoom operates\r\n- Food hygiene awareness guidance\r\n- Ongoing support from experienced volunteers\r\n- A friendly team environment where you can ask questions \r\n\r\nYou will never be left unsupported",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2Fa336d1fc-0374-4676-bb7b-c6a287420a3a%2FzXi5KTfdOxM2lV8QmhrgVF9DBeg2%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=01234654-b50f-44ca-9ef1-de27d4e3fa87",
                    "role": {
