        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/0011p00002OLYMFAA5",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/0011p00002OLYMFAA5/prostate-cancer-uk",
            "name": "Prostate Cancer UK",
            "description": "We’re Prostate Cancer UK and we’re giving every man the power to navigate prostate cancer.  1 in 8 of our dads, brothers, grandads, sons and friends will get prostate cancer. And if you’re Black, your risk is double.  But we’re here to help.\r\n\r\nTogether, we’re raising awareness, funding lifesaving research, campaigning for change and providing high-quality information and support. So every man can find his path through prostate cancer.",
            "website": "https://prostatecanceruk.org/",
            "charityRegistration": [
                {
                    "registrar": "https://www.oscr.org.uk",
                    "registrationNumber": "SC039332"
                }
            ],
            "cause": [
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/Health",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Health"
                }
            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000IqvClYAJ",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000IqvClYAJ/community-awareness-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-23",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-23",
                    "title": "Community Awareness Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAs a Community Awareness Volunteer, you’ll play a vital role in raising awareness about prostate cancer within your local community.\r\nBy organising and delivering awareness talks, hosting information stands, and engaging with groups, you will help educate others and inspire action. You'll use and grow your local knowledge, connections and networks to arrange and deliver awareness raising activities in your local community.. You will identify opportunities, audiences and spaces to connect with community members and share key prostate cancer risk awareness messages. You may have lived experience of prostate cancer or a connection to Prostate Cancer UK, or you have a wide experience of supporting others. This will help increase understanding of prostate cancer, encourage early detection, and drive support for our mission. This role is open to everyone, and you will play a vital role in reaching more people and making a meaningful impact.\n\n## Experience required\n\nThere is no need for you to have a background in healthcare, you’ll receive the training to deepen your knowledge of prostate cancer risk and be buddied up with an experienced volunteer who will help you build your confidence.\r\nTo volunteer with us, you'll need internet access and a smartphone, tablet or computer. You'll also need to be willing to use online systems, email and websites. We use an online platform called VolunteerHub to communicate with volunteers, manage activities, book training and events, submit expenses, and keep volunteer information up to date. Support and guidance will be provided to help you use the system.\r\nYou'll also be buddied up with an experienced volunteer who can help guide and support you. You'll also have the opportunity to shadow awareness events with them to help grow your confidence (geographical dependant).\n\n## Training details\n\nYou'll undertake our online mandatory trainings to keep you safe whilst volunteering with us. This involves safeguarding, data protection, health and safety. You'll also attend a role specific session, this will either be 1 day in person, or two half-days online.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nWe encourage volunteers to aim for around 12 awareness activities a year, as a flexible guide - you can arrange your volunteering to suit you. You can adapt your volunteering around prior commitments as you can set your own pace.\n\n## Travel details\n\nWe’ll reimburse reasonable out-of-pocket expenses in line with our policy, including reasonable travel.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nWe’ll reimburse reasonable out-of-pocket expenses in line with our policy, including reasonable travel.",
