            "name": "BECYCLE Workshop",
            "description": "At BECYCLE we run a community-led workshop aimed at improving cycling access and teaching people how to fix bicycles in Aberdeen. \r\n\r\nWe are a registered charity - SCIO (Scottish Charitable Incorporated Organisation – charity number: SC053291)",
