                    "title": "Fundraising Steering Group member (Great Scottish Sports Quiz Glasgow)",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nOur Great Scottish Sports Quiz Steering Group members play a vital role in supporting Chest Heart & Stroke Scotland by using their connections, influence, and ideas to help deliver successful fundraising events.\r\n\r\nWe're looking for enthusiastic and well-connected individuals to join our Great Scottish Sports Quiz Glasgow Steering Group and help make this year's event a huge success. By giving just 2–4 hours per month, you can make a meaningful difference.\r\n\r\nThe Great Scottish Sports Quiz Glasgow will take place on 20th May 2027 at Barclay Hampden Stadium, and we'd be delighted to welcome you as part of the team helping to make the event a success while continuing to support the vital work of CHSS.\r\n\r\nWhat you will be doing\r\nGathering leads and sourcing auction prizes\r\nusing your Networkings to recruit with potential supporters businesses and guests\r\nSourcing sponsorship of event and promoting it\r\n\r\nThe skills you need\r\nHighly organised\r\nCreative and sharing ideas\r\nMotivated to make a difference\r\nNetworking – Leveraging contacts to open doors for sponsorships or donations\r\n\r\nWhat's in it for you\r\nMeet new people\r\nUse, learn and develop new skills\r\nMake a real difference to people with our conditions\n\n## Travel details\n\nHome based\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nReasonable out-of- pocket expenses will be reimbursed. These should be discussed with your Line Manager prior to outlay and must be submitted within the prescribed guidelines as detailed in the CHSS Volunteer Expenses Policy. ",
