                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000INxufYAD",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000INxufYAD/events-volunteer-great-scottish-sports-quiz-edinburgh-march-2027",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-07",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-01",
                    "title": "Events Volunteer (Great Scottish Sports Quiz Edinburgh March 2027)",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe’re looking for amazing volunteers to support on the night of our Great Scottish Sports Quiz to help us to raise spirits and funds at an evening packed with energy, inspiration, and fun at Tynecastle Stadium and support those who are affected by chest, heart, or stroke conditions or Long Covid. \r\n\r\n- Date: Thursday 18th March\r\n- Time : 5pm - 10.30pm\r\n- Venue: Edinburgh Tynecastle Park, McLeod St, Edinburgh EH11 2NL\r\n- Duties: welcoming and sign-posting guests, collect in envelopes, support with the running of fundraising games including Pass the Ball, our raffle checking Quiz team answers\n\n## Travel details\n\nThe event will take place at Tynecastle Park, McLeod Street, Edinburgh, EH11 2NL. The stadium is easily accessible by public transport and is around a 10-15 minute journey from Edinburgh city centre.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nExpenses Reasonable out-of-pocket expenses will be reimbursed. These should be discussed with your Line Manager prior to outlay and must be submitted within the prescribed guidelines as detailed in the CHSS Volunteer Expenses Policy.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F3ef5f1ee-97e1-4c0c-9a1a-9e065680724a%2FbrKY84AUbTfEXuzI0qubJYrR1gJ3%2Fheader.jpg?alt=media&token=5a677a68-3e8d-45b0-8dec-47aef9e6a909",
