                    "title": "Events Volunteer (Great Scottish Sports Quiz Glasgow May 2027)",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe’re looking for amazing volunteers to support on the night of our Great Scottish Sports Quiz to help us to raise spirits and funds at an evening packed with energy, inspiration, and fun at Barclays Hampden and support those who are affected by chest, heart, or stroke conditions or Long Covid. \r\n\r\n- Date: Thursday 20th May\r\n- Time : 5pm - 10.30pm\r\n- Venue: Barclays Hampden Letherby Drive, Glasgow G42 9BA\r\n- Duties: welcoming and sign-posting guests, collect in envelopes, support with the running of fundraising games including Pass the Ball, our raffle checking Quiz team answers\n\n## Travel details\n\nThe event will take place at Barclays Hampden, Letherby Drive, Glasgow, G42 9BA. The venue is a short walk from Mount Florida and King's Park train stations, with regular services from Glasgow Central.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nExpenses Reasonable out-of-pocket expenses will be reimbursed. These should be discussed with your Line Manager prior to outlay and must be submitted within the prescribed guidelines as detailed in the CHSS Volunteer Expenses Policy.",
