                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD0000056FpVYAU",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD0000056FpVYAU/retail-volunteer-edinburgh-morningside",
                    "publishStart": "2024-08-05",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-27",
                    "title": "Retail Volunteer - Edinburgh Morningside",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nThis is a satisfying and rewarding role which includes welcoming and assisting customers, customer service and sales service, stock control, sorting donations, hanging and ticketing stock and helping to keep the shop clean and tidy.\n\n## Description\n\nFrom stunning boutiques full of designer gems to volume stores where you can grab a bargain, our charity shops are much-loved across Scotland.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for friendly volunteers to help our shop management team assist customers and donors, and ensure the shop is tidy and well stocked.\r\n\r\nWhether you have a passion for customer service and pre-loved fashion, or you would prefer to be behind the scenes in our stockroom, your help could make a difference to people in Scotland who are isolated, scared, or anxious about their condition.\n\n## Experience required\n\nEffective communication and customer care skills\r\nA willingness to volunteer in a team environment, and with the public\r\nA willingness to undertake all training required for role\n\n## Training details\n\nChest Heart & Stroke Scotland will provide all necessary training and ongoing support.\n\n## Travel details\n\n344-346 Morningside Road, Edinburgh, Midlothian, EH10 4QL, United Kingdom. Nearest train station Edinburgh Haymarket. Buses available from the city centre (Lothian Buses 11, 15, 16).\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nReasonable out-of-pocket expenses will be reimbursed. These should be discussed with your Line Manager prior to outlay and must be submitted within the prescribed guidelines as detailed in the CHSS Volunteer Expenses Policy.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2Fd7caf5e2-1dac-46b6-aeee-3f4ea4be9bb6%2FPhrC238yalhV1aRepDgPtVlA1WC3%2Fheader.jpg?alt=media&token=e0be75f6-dd1c-4481-9a37-dfc89d59c4b3",
