rovide all necessary training about shop procedures, which will be carried out under the guidance of the Shop Manager. Formal training will include: online Manual Handling and Gift Aid Training.\n\n## Travel details\n\n62-66 High Street\r\nLeven\r\nKY8 4NA\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nReasonable out-of-pocket expenses will be reimbursed. These should be discussed with your Line Manager prior to outlay and must be submitted within the prescribed guidelines as detailed in the CHSS Volunteer Expenses Policy.\n\n## Taster details\n\nTrial shift will be provided.",
