            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/0011p00002S8dUUAAZ/young-lives-vs-cancer",
            "name": "Young Lives vs Cancer",
            "description": "When cancer strikes Young Lives vs Cancer helps families limit the damage it causes beyond\ntheir health.",
            "website": "https://www.younglivesvscancer.org.uk/",
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000Vhms6AAB",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000Vhms6AAB/collection-tin-coordinator",
                    "publishStart": "2019-08-29",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-31",
                    "title": "Collection Tin Coordinator",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nCoordinating local collection tins is just one way volunteering with Young Lives vs Cancer can make a difference to our work.  \nYou’ll be responsible for coordinating collection tins in your local area.\n\n## Description\n\nCoordinating local collection tins is just one way volunteering with Young Lives vs Cancer can make a difference to our work.  \nYou’ll be responsible for coordinating collection tins in your local area. \nContact the team here to apply https://www.younglivesvscancer.org.uk/join-our-fight/get-volunteering/from-your-community/\n\n## Experience required\n\nYou’ll care about Young Lives vs Cancer and want to help limit the damage cancer causes for children and young people beyond their health\nKnowledge of your local area and the willingness to travel within it\nHighly organised, with attention to detail and the ability to keep accurate records\nAccess to a computer/laptop and some level of IT skills\nConfident when talking  and approaching new people in relation to placing tins\nGood numeracy skills\n\n## Training details\n\nRegular newsletters, full guidance and instructions, provision of collection materials, Hotline to contact us for help.\n\n## Travel details\n\nVarious Edinburgh locations.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nYes",
