                    "title": "SSPCA Micro-volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nScottish SPCA Micro-volunteering: small tasks that make a big difference to animal welfare in Scotland!\n\n## Experience required\n\nAbility to use social media channels for online posts; enthusiasm!; confidence to interact with other people; an interest in the work of the Scottish SPCA\n\n## Training details\n\nWhen you join us you will be asked to complete some online training modules that will help you carry out your role\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nWe are asking for 5-10 minutes of your time just twice a month. Simple online tasks that can make a big difference to animals in need!\n\n## Travel details\n\nN/A\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nThis role does not have any travel requirements.",
