                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-13",
                    "title": "Hospitality Assistant",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nThis role is a hands on role involving welcoming participants into OCK, making and serving refreshments and chatting with people. building relationships. Taking food orders and serving meals then helping to clear up. This is a vital role within OCK requiring working within in a team of like-minded friendly people. Lunch and refreshments are provided. Times are from 10.00 am until 1.30 pm or 11.30 pm to 1.30 pm.\r\nWe appreciate our volunteers and could not support our community without this vital support.\n\n## Experience required\n\nCleaning / Tidying / Sorting Someone who enjoys being around people in a busy environment\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nCommitment Flexible 3 Hours, Weekly\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nThis applies to expense payment frequency",
