                    "publishStart": "2025-03-19",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-18",
                    "title": "Trustees",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nThe John Rae Society (JRS) is looking for new Trustees to help lead our exciting Hall of Clestrain development projects over the next 5 years.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a passionate individual dedicated to public education and heritage preservation, proactive and engaged in Board discussions.\r\n\r\nYou'll have the opportunity to gain valuable experience in charity governance, in rescuing internationally significant heritage and in developing and delivering vital community services and benefits.\n\n## Experience required\n\nWe're looking for people with a commitment to the mission of the Society, culture, heritage and the outdoors, who have a positive outlook and are prepared to help both strategically and practically.\n\n## Training details\n\nA full induction will be provided.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel and expenses can be paid.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
