                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000008fPsHYAU/volunteer-minute-taker",
                    "publishStart": "2026-09-07",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-01",
                    "title": "Volunteer Minute Taker",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nSaltcoats Christmas Carnival are looking for a minute taker to join their group. Without the help of our dedicated volunteers this spectacular event would not go ahead to the disappointment of the local young people. This opportunity would involve attending one meeting per month for apporximately 2 hrs, taking notes and recording details to be shared with the rest of the group. Meetings tend to take place at 5.30/6pm in the evening. This role is open to anyone over the age of 16 and we would be happy to provide references for anyone who wishes to take on this role",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F689fb0f3-7955-4cfc-ab6b-a2ff24ea6930%2FjsAcKOoUCwbzdeCiXo4W0JSMoYu1%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=b9f14635-9805-4547-b6ce-cf49b08dcf0c",
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000008fPsHYAU#role",
