            "name": "Central Wellbeing",
            "description": "Central Wellbeing SCIO is a charity working to improve the mental health and wellbeing of people in Falkirk area.\r\nOur values underpin everything we do:\r\n•\tWe see everyone as a whole person, with valid experiences, talents and their own way of living\r\n•\tWe recognise that lived experience is valuable learning and we use it in everything we do\r\n•\tWe support people to help each other\r\n•\tWe offer people choice as everyone is different\r\n•\tWe work with others and promote looking after mental wellbeing as a need for everyone",
            "website": "https://centralwellbeing.org/",
            "charityRegistration": [
                {
                    "registrar": "https://www.oscr.org.uk",
                    "registrationNumber": "SC051325"
