                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HDqTdYAL",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HDqTdYAL/skill-sharer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-06-10",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-09",
                    "title": "Skill Sharer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nCentral Wellbeing is a peer support mental health charity established in 2021 and based in the heart of Falkirk dedicated to providing compassion, understanding and a safe space for those navigating the challenges of poor mental health. Central Wellbeing do this through facilitating peer support groups and community activities in the Falkirk area.\r\n\r\nInspire others by sharing your knowledge, experience, or creativity.\r\n\r\nCentral Wellbeing are looking for people who would like to share a skill, hobby or life experience with others in a relaxed and informal way. This could be a short talk, group workshop session or friendly demonstration on a topic you’re passionate about.\r\n\r\nYour contribution can help others build confidence, learn something new and feel more connected.\r\n\r\nThis is a flexible opportunity that can be shaped around you. It’s a great way to give back, meet others and share something meaningful—no formal teaching experience needed.\n\n## Experience required\n\nAn interest in sharing your knowledge or experience is all that’s needed. No teaching experience is required—just a willingness to connect with others in a friendly and supportive way.\n\n## Training details\n\nThe Volunteer Coordinator will meet you and support you in this role, based on individual requirements.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible to suit you.\r\n30 mins per week.\n\n## Travel details\n\nCentral Wellbeing Hub, 5 Manse Place, Falkirk, FK1 1JN.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel expenses can be reimbursed as well as materials needed for practical workshops.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://centralwellbeing.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/central-wellbeing-scio-logo.png",
