                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HDmeXYAT",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HDmeXYAT/digital-champions",
                    "publishStart": "2026-06-10",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-09",
                    "title": "Digital Champions",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nCentral Wellbeing is a peer support mental health charity established in 2021 and based in the heart of Falkirk dedicated to providing compassion, understanding and a safe space for those navigating the challenges of poor mental health. Central Wellbeing do this through facilitating peer support groups and community activities in the Falkirk area.\r\n\r\nCentral Wellbeing are looking for people who use social media to help spread the word about Central Wellbeing and the groups they run. This involves sharing weekly posts and upcoming events within local community Facebook groups.  \r\n\r\nIt’s a simple but powerful way to help more people discover the support and connections available - often just with the click of a share button.  Help others find support by sharing what they do. \r\n\r\nThis is a flexible role you can do from home, at a time that suits you. It’s a great way to stay connected to your community, build confidence using social media, and be part of something positive.  You can get involved as much or as little as feels right for you.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo formal experience is needed. \r\nConfidence using social media is helpful, along with a willingness to share information and support others to connect with local services.\n\n## Training details\n\nThe Volunteer Coordinator will meet you and support you in this role, based on individual requirements.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible to suit you.\r\n30 mins per week.\n\n## Travel details\n\nFrom the comfort of your own home.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel expenses are not required for this role.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://centralwellbeing.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/central-wellbeing-scio-logo.png",
