                    "skos:prefLabel": "Volunteering"
                }
            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000QNzqqAAD",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000QNzqqAAD/volunteer-administration-assistants",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Volunteer Administration Assistants",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nThe Hilton Convention Centre is part of the Jesus House Aberdeen Church Charity. Our facilities in support of our charitable and community work include an excellent conference centre, multipurpose hall, business centre, library and resource centre, office space for short or long term rents. We also provide business support services.\r\n\r\nWe currently have great opportunities for people to assist us volunteering as Volunteer Administration Assistants. \r\n\r\nThis is a fantastic opportunity to help, gain experience and be part of a great team. All help makes a real difference and is greatly appreciated.\r\n\r\nFor further details please contact Oghosa Igiehon at email: info@hiltonconventioncentre.com or telephone 01224 588884.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNeed to be people-oriented, welcoming, have a can do attitude and be forward thinking. No specific experience is needed.\n\n## Training details\n\nSupport and relevant guidance is provided to all volunteers.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nVolunteering takes place Monday - Friday, office hours. Flexible times to help. All help makes a difference and is greatly appreciated.\n\n## Travel details\n\nLocation is: Hilton Convention Centre, 13 Smithfield Road AB24 4NR.\r\n\r\nCar parking available and buses that pass nearby are First Bus and Stagecoach numbers: 23, 17, 18, 727, 220, 12.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nWe reimburse any relevant/approved 'out of pocket' expenses related to volunteering every other week.",
