                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD0000069nJ0YAI/opportunities-to-get-involved-in-your-local-community",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Opportunities to get involved in your local community",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nCommunity Planning Aberdeen is your local partnership of the public, private and third-sector organisations and communities all working together to improve people’s lives across Aberdeen City and our local communities.\r\n\r\nThere are many ways you can get involved to make things better for your local community and influence how services are delivered in your area to meet your and your communities needs.\r\n\r\nFor details of current opportunities to get involved and help please visit https://communityplanningaberdeen.org.uk/get-involved/\r\n\r\nAll help makes a real difference and is greatly appreciated.\n\n## Description\n\nCommunity Planning Aberdeen is your local partnership of the public, private and third-sector organisations and communities all working together to improve people’s lives across Aberdeen City and our local communities.\r\n\r\nThere are many ways you can get involved to make things better for your local community and influence how services are delivered in your area to meet your and your communities needs.\r\n\r\nFor details of current opportunities to get involved and help please visit https://communityplanningaberdeen.org.uk/get-involved/\r\n\r\nAll help makes a real difference and is greatly appreciated.\n\n## Training details\n\nRelevant guidance and support is provided to all volunteers. \r\n\r\nCommunity Planning Aberdeen are a Volunteer Charter Champion committed to best practice in volunteer involvement and positive volunteer experiences.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible times available to help. All help makes a real difference and is greatly appreciated.",
