        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/00108000035h0dRAAQ",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/00108000035h0dRAAQ/infohubme",
            "name": "Infohubme",
            "description": "Infohubme Kids club is a social enterprise that provides literacy and creativity services within Edinburgh. We create literacy hub facilities for disadvantaged and busy families, encourage a love of reading and creative development and support children who are struggling with reading.",
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000QNs5jAAD",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000QNs5jAAD/social-mediamarketing-coordinator",
                    "publishStart": "2021-07-05",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-31",
                    "title": "Social Media/Marketing Coordinator",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nWe are looking for someone to take ownership and manage our social media and website. The role will involve looking over our existing platforms and rebuilding them.\n\n## Description\n\nWe are looking for someone to take ownership and manage our social media and website. The role will involve looking over our existing platforms and rebuilding them.\nSetting a communication/strategic plan for the pages.\nAligning all the pages.\nConstantly create and suggest ways to increase engagement on the pages.\nMonitoring the pages.\nUpdating them regularly.\nWork closely with the trustees and volunteers.\n\n## Experience required\n\nSocial media and website management experience is essential. Understanding of social media presentation and the associated applications is essential. Knowledge of editing and filming soft wares desirable. Good clear written communication skills essential. Flexibility essential. Photography skills desirable.\n\n## Training details\n\nI will go over our existing pages and and work closely throughout with the volunteer. I will be available for video calls and phone communication.\n\n## Travel details\n\nOnline platform\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nNo expenses.",
