                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000FqNSwYAN",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000FqNSwYAN/activity-assistant-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-09-25",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-22",
                    "title": "Activity Assistant Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nPlease provide a brief description of your charitable purposes\r\nTwechar Outdoor Pursuits Centre is a community-driven adventure hub offering accessible outdoor \r\nlearning opportunities and shared space for individuals, groups and organisations across Twechar and the \r\nsurrounding areas. We provide a safe, inclusive environment where people can connect, develop new \r\nskills and enjoy the outdoors together.\r\nYou would be assisting instructors with all our land and water based activities helping those who would \r\nbenefit the most from accessing the outdoors,\n\n## Experience required\n\nAlthough not essential a love for all things outdoors is welcomed. With a passion for helping others, polite, \r\nfriendly with a can do attitude\n\n## Training details\n\nAfter informal chat we will meet the volunteer at the centre, give them a tour covering health and safety \r\nand fire regulations. Ongoing training and support will be delivered.\n\n## Travel details\n\nTwechar Outdoor Pursuits Centre",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
