                        "commitment": "On a given day of volunteering, we ask volunteers to commit 4 hours of their time. The frequency of volunteering can be determined by the volunteer, e.g. once weekly, once fortnightly, once monthly.",
                        "applyLink": "https://www.newlanark.org/get-involved",
