            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000IMS89YAH",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000IMS89YAH/branch-social-media-volunteer-north-lanarkshire-branch",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-05",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-05",
                    "title": "Branch Social Media Volunteer (North Lanarkshire Branch)",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe are currently developing our team of volunteers at our North Lanarkshire Branch and are seeking a Social Media Volunteer to help promote branch activities on Facebook and support good communication with followers of the branch.\r\n\r\nThe role will involve communicating with the committee and gathering information for social media each week and regularly updating this to the branch social media page to help keep it active.\r\n\r\nAre you:\r\n\r\nConfident using Facebook\r\nAble to write clear and accurate online posts\r\nAble to access a computer with internet access.\r\nConfident using Outlook, Word and Microsoft Teams\r\nAble to reliably commit 1- 2 hours a week\n\n## Experience required\n\nWhen: Flexible. Approx. 1-2 hours per week\r\n\r\nWhere: Home based with occasional travel to branch meetings in North Lanarkshire\n\n## Training details\n\nYou will be asked to complete our elearning modules\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nWhen: Flexible. Approx. 1-2 hours per week\r\n\r\nWhere: Home based with occasional travel to branch meetings in North Lanarkshire\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nAgreed expenses reimbursed",
