                    "title": "Macmillan Representative (Oban, Ayr, Glasgow, Johnstone)",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nIf you are interested in speaking to community groups and businesses to help raise awareness of cancer and the support and services MacMillan Cancer Support can offer, then this volunteering role may be for you.  In the MacMillan representative role, you would talk to small groups about the work of Macmillan and give them recognition for any fundraising they may have delivered on our behalf . Part of the role would also be to collect, process and bank donations on our behalf.  This is an important volunteer role to support our work in the community and ensure awareness of MacMillan's services and support is shared across the local area.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HshivYAB#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Macmillan Representative (Oban, Ayr, Glasgow, Johnstone)",
                        "applyLink": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HshivYAB/macmillan-representative-oban-ayr-glasgow-johnstone?#modal_register_a0gQD00000HshivYAB",
