                        "commitment": "The Board of Trustees typically meets every 4 - 6 weeks, with occasional additional meetings as required. The time commitment will vary depending on the charity's activities and priorities and therefore some flexibility will be required. We recognise that trustees balance their voluntary responsibilities with other commitments. \n\nThere is an expectation that trustees will commit to a 3-year tenure.",
