                        "commitment": "The Board of Trustees typically meets every 4 - 6 weeks, with occasional additional meetings as required. As Chair, you will also be expected to dedicate some time between meetings to preparing agendas, reviewing relevant documents, liaising with fellow trustees and the management team, and providing guidance and support where needed.\n\nThe time commitment will vary depending on the charity's activities and priorities and therefore some flexibility will be required. We recognise that trustees balance their voluntary responsibilities with other commitments. \n\nThere is an expectation that trustees will commit to a 3-year tenure.",
