                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HsCs2YAF",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HsCs2YAF/cafe-assistant-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-10",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-08",
                    "title": "Cafe Assistant (Volunteer)",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nThe Haven Centre is looking for friendly and reliable volunteers to support our café, which sits at the heart of the centre and provides a welcoming space for families, visitors and the wider community.\r\n\r\nBy giving your time as a volunteer, you will be helping to create a warm, inclusive environment for children, young people and adults with additional support needs, as well as their families. Your time helps us keep the centre open, welcoming and available to those who need it most.\r\n\r\nWhat you will be doing:\r\n- Supporting the day-to-day running of the café.\r\n- Helping with preparing and serving food and drinks.\r\n- Keeping the café clean, tidy and welcoming.\r\n- Chatting with visitors and helping people feel comfortable in the space.\r\n- Assisting staff during busy periods and events.\n\n## Training details\n\nVolunteers will receive a kitchen induction covering Health and Safety and allergen awareness, before being supported to work through different kitchen tasks, the coffee machine and the till step by step at their own pace. \r\n\r\nVolunteers are supported throughout their time with us, helping them achieve their full potential. No previous experience is needed, just a positive attitude.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F7650a9f3-5d62-4c4c-b272-ab1a16f3b59e%2FGBXCSD4ligfOcz5aiTXBSVp1MUa2%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=6df291a1-b52a-42ec-97f1-66a56eba7fe0",
