                    "publishEnd": "2026-11-16",
                    "title": "Mascot Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nThis role is a chance to bring energy by championing you’re outgoing personality and help spread positive vibes wherever you go. This role is a chance to bring energy by championing you’re outgoing personality and help spread positive vibes wherever you go. This role is a chance to bring energy by championing you’re outgoing personality and help spread positive vibes wherever you go. This role is a chance to bring energy by championing you’re outgoing personality and help spread positive vibes wherever you go. This role is a chance to bring energy by championing you’re outgoing personality and help spread positive vibes wherever you go. This role is a chance to bring energy by championing you’re outgoing personality and help spread positive vibes wherever you go. This role is a chance to bring energy by championing you’re outgoing personality and help spread positive vibes wherever you go. This role is a chance to bring energy by championing you’re outgoing personality andhelp spread positive vibes wherever you go.\n\n## Experience required\n\nThe Ayrshire Hospice welcomes applications from all sections of the community.\r\nExperience is not essential for this role, but ideally you should demonstrate:\r\nThe confidence to dress up and be “in character”\r\nAn understanding of the services the hospice can offer people with a lifelimiting illness.\r\nGood interpersonal skills\r\nBe a team player and be willing to work within guidelines provided\r\nBe responsible and reliable\r\nAbility to keep up to date with hospice service provision developments\r\nWillingness to uphold the values of the hospice",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
