                    "publishStart": "2023-09-25",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-31",
                    "title": "Vinted Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nWe have an exciting role to offer you, as our social media vinted volunteer. We often receive little gems which we would like to sell on vinted and need your expert skills to make this happen. Please do get in touch if you feel that this volunteer role may interest you.\n\n## Description\n\nTaking photographs of clothing, posting on social media.\n\n## Experience required\n\nSocial media.\r\nFashion knowledge.\n\n## Training details\n\nHealth and Safety training\n\n## Travel details\n\n6 Bruntsfield Place,\nEdinburgh EH10 4HN. Lothian bus route 23\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nNo expenses.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD0000003LvxYAE#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Vinted Volunteer",
                        "description": "Social media.\r\nFashion knowledge.",
                        "applyLink": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD0000003LvxYAE/vinted-volunteer?#modal_register_a0gQD0000003LvxYAE",
                        "allowsRemoteParticipation": false,
                        "minimumAge": "18",
                        "theme": [
