                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HziTlYAJ/volunteer-driver",
                    "publishStart": "2026-09-08",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-09",
                    "title": "Volunteer Driver",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe're launching a new Patient Transport Service to help people travel to and from renal dialysis appointments at Raigmore Hospital, Inverness. We're looking for caring, reliable volunteer drivers who can provide a safe journey and a friendly, reassuring presence for patients. \r\n\r\nWhat you will get:\r\n- St John Scotland uniform\r\n- Flexible volunteering to suit your availability \r\n- Recognition through service awards and certificates \r\n- The chance to make a real difference in your community",
