            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000006K3r8YAC",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000006K3r8YAC/morph-fit-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2024-10-25",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-22",
                    "title": "Morph Fit Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWould you like to find the fun in movement?  New research shows that 31% of people say they would be more active if they found an activity they enjoy!\r\n\r\nJCS are looking for a volunteer to help out on Monday mornings from 10 am until 12 pm at Morph Fit’s Gentle Movement classes.\r\n\r\nDuties:\r\n\r\n*  Setting up 8-10 chairs in the Hub (depending on class numbers)\r\n*  Setting up the provided tea, coffee, milk, sugar, biscuits etc before class starts at 10.30am\r\n*  After class, serving teas and coffees if required and tidying the space of dishes and chairs.\r\n\r\nThe appointed volunteer can enjoy the Morph Fit class along with the rest of the group free of charge.\n\n## Travel details\n\nThe Walton Community Care Centre, May Terrace, Giffnock.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F66fb9341-4490-4020-aeee-f0a38d0b09c3%2FuLMXgU8zMPQYcW8J41Ac36cYNgp1%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=20ededb3-2ddc-4fe9-bbb9-0981cab48739",
