                },
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/Helplines",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Helplines"
                }
            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000J7c8xYAB",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000J7c8xYAB/buchanan-galleries-festive-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2023-10-24",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-24",
                    "title": "Buchanan Galleries Festive Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nBuchanan Galleries Festive Volunteer\n\n## Description\n\nWe’re excited to be back at Buchanan Galleries for another magical Christmas season! Our much-loved activities are returning, with an extra sparkle added to Santa’s Grotto this year – and we’d love your support to make it all happen. We’re looking for enthusiastic volunteers to help with:\r\n\r\nChristmas Pop-Up Shop – greet customers and process sales\r\nGift Wrapping Station – wrap presents with care (from Friday 11th December onwards)\r\nChoir Collections – help fundraise while our wonderful choirs perform\r\nSanta’s Grotto – support Santa and his elf by assisting children with their ‘Letters to Santa’ and festive colouring sheets (every Saturday & Sunday from 5th December onwards, plus Monday–Wednesday before Christmas)\r\nEach role is clearly defined, so you can pick from the above activities and you’ll know exactly what you’re signing up for.\r\n\r\nJoin us to spread Christmas cheer, get into the festive spirit, and help raise vital funds for the families we support.\r\n\r\nVolunteer Tasks\r\n\r\nEach activity has different tasks associated with it, volunteers will get a full view of what’s involved with each activity prior to signing up.\r\n\r\nShift Times\r\n\r\nShift times vary depending on the centre's opening/closing times but we have morning, afternoon and evening shifts available EVERY day from the 13th of November until the 24th of December! This is a very flexible opportunity so whether you can do one, five, twenty shifts, we would love to hear from you.\r\n\r\nVolunteer Benefits\r\n\r\nJoin a friendly, supportive team and meet new people\r\nReceive a GCHC volunteer T-shirt and full training\r\nTravel expenses reimbursed\r\nGain confidence and experience working with the public\r\nMake a direct impact in raising vital funds for young patients, their families and NHS hospital staff\n\n## Experience required\n\n- No particular skills or previous experience required\n\n## Travel details\n\nClose to bus and train stations in Glasgow city centre\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel expenses reimbursed",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
