                    "title": "Volunteer First Aider, Edinburgh and West Lothian",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nSt Andrew’s First Aid is recruiting volunteer first aiders in Edinburgh and West Lothian.\r\n\r\nAs a volunteer you will provide first aid cover at community and public events across the area, from football matches and concerts to local fairs and fun runs. You will work in a team, in uniform, with a trained lead on every duty.\r\n\r\nNo experience is needed. We train you to a recognised first aid standard before you go on duty, and training continues for as long as you volunteer. Uniform and equipment are provided.\r\n\r\nYou choose the duties that fit around your work and family. Most take place at weekends and in the evenings.\r\n\r\nTo apply, use the link below to register your interest. You will get an email within minutes with a link to the full application. After that we will be in touch about checks, your first training dates and getting you started.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo experience is needed.",
