                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000SbqPkAAJ",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000SbqPkAAJ/handyperson",
                    "publishStart": "2023-07-04",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-01",
                    "title": "Handyperson",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nHandyperson needed to keep the Roundhouse in good upkeep and order. This includes a variety of general maintenance tasks.\n\n## Description\n\nWe are looking for a handyperson who can help us with general maintenance jobs around the Round House to keep it well maintained. This would include simple repairs, small painting work and general routine maintenance jobs.\n\n## Experience required\n\nGeneral DIY/ Maintenance skills and experience are needed for this role.\n\n## Training details\n\nA full induction to the organisation and the centre will be provided\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nongoing and flexible to suit volunteer\n\n## Travel details\n\nRoundhouse, Lothian Crescent, Dundee, DD4 0HU\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nLocal travel expenses are reimbursed, normally this would cover public transport or mileage at a standard rate.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
