            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000IpRztYAF",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000IpRztYAF/retail-fundraising-volunteers-wanted-accord-hospice-accord-hospice-is-looking-for-enthusiastic-volunteers-to-support-our-shops-fundraising-events-across-renfrewshirebarrhead",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-23",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-21",
                    "title": "Retail & Fundraising Volunteers Wanted - ACCORD Hospice ACCORD Hospice is looking for enthusiastic volunteers to support our shops & fundraising events across Renfrewshire&Barrhead",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nRetail & Fundraising Volunteers Wanted - ACCORD Hospice\nACCORD Hospice is looking for enthusiastic volunteers to support our shops & fundraising events across Renfrewshire&Barrhead\n\n## Description\n\nRetail Volunteer Opportunities\n\nOur charity shops play a vital role in raising funds for ACCORD Hospice, and we&#39;re looking for friendly volunteers to join our teams at:\n\n\nNeilston Road, Paisley\nGlasgow Road, Paisley\nPiazza Shopping Centre, Paisley\nRenfrew\nBarrhead\n\n\nVolunteer shifts:\n\n\n10am to 1pm\n1pm to 4pm\n\n\nJust three hours of your time can make a real difference.\n\nAs a retail volunteer, you could:\n\n\nWelcome and assist customers\nSort and display donated items\nCreate attractive shop displays\nHelp keep the shop organised\nGain valuable retail experience and transferable skills\n\n\nFundraising Volunteer Opportunities\n\nLooking for something more flexible?\n\nOur fundraising volunteers support a variety of events throughout the year, including:\n\n\nChristmas Fayre\nKilt walk\nBucket collections\nCommunity events\n\n\nYou can volunteer as often as suits you, whether that&#39;s a few times a year or on a regular basis.\n\nHave your own fundraising idea? We&#39;d love to help bring it to life. From quiz nights and coffee mornings to sponsored challenges, we&#39;ll support you every step of the way.\n\n&nbsp;\n\n## Experience required\n\nGood communication Skills\nPeople skills\nListening skills\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nAll our volunteers are able to claim expenses that they incur as part of their volunteering",
