            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000CLul3YAD",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000CLul3YAD/practical-reserve-work-work-party-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2025-09-29",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-15",
                    "title": "Practical Reserve Work (Work Party Volunteer)",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nRSPB Orkney are looking for work party volunteers to join them on their reserves here in Orkney.  RSPB nature reserves are special places for people and wildlife and they rely on volunteers to help keep these habitats thriving and in good shape.  It might seem like these wild places have always just been there, but quite often RSPB Orkney have to work really hard to maintain habitats to be in the best condition for wildlife. Orkney has lost a lot of wild landscapes, so the small places that we do have need a bit of extra care.\r\n\r\nKey activities include:\r\n•\tCutting and clearing vegetation;\r\n•\tMaintaining and managing tools and equipment;\r\n•\tCreating and maintaining visitor infrastructure, such as paths and benches;\r\n•\tFollowing annual work plans;\r\n•\tFollowing Health and Safety protocols.\r\n\r\nWhat could a volunteer gain from the experience?\r\n•\tLearn new skills and gain knowledge about wildlife conservation work;\r\n•\tKeep your level of fitness up through outside work;\r\n•\tThe satisfaction of knowing you’re making a genuine contribution to nature conservation.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo experience required for this role, as long as volunteers are willing to learn and are fit enough to be able to do a day of walking around/practical work .\n\n## Training details\n\nHelp with their practical skills e.g. using different hand tools and other general conservation knowledge such as species identification.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F9ee3747c-a25f-4a4a-8a4a-09d84403b730%2FliLEC2s9ZwYA46gEa6AxGTVGunx2%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=633edf0d-15a0-4611-b18c-9d41b39a473e",
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000CLul3YAD#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Practical Reserve Work (Work Party Volunteer)",
                        "description": "No experience required for this role, as long as volunteers are willing to learn and are fit enough to be able to do a day of walking around/practical work .",
