                    "publishStart": "2026-11-11",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-05-12",
                    "title": "Volunteer Admin",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAdvocacy Orkney are looking to recruit a volunteer to provide some admin duties to support their small team of advocates. The role will include photocopying, scanning, answering emails, returning phone calls, taking some client info as per booking sheet, and some data entry.\r\n\r\nWhat could a volunteer gain from the experience:\r\nA feeling of proving a valuable volunteering experience both to clients and the team. Refreshing admin skills and gaining confidence.\n\n## Experience required\n\nFriendly, organised, experienced with Microsoft IT, good communicator.\n\n## Training details\n\nWe will provide training in the use of our systems, the type of information and data entry we require but can tailor any training to meet the skills of any volunteer\r\nA named contact will always be available for any queries.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel expenses can be paid",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F9db38b53-631a-4a8a-89c9-e9344ac3adf2%2FU1kaSPPSuCP4eMjKLejUG5nSu0j1%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=da3b2094-2ce9-458a-85ca-15f810533d1a",
