                    "publishStart": "2026-08-03",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-01",
                    "title": "Literacy Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nThe Essential Skills Service offers a free and confidential service across East Ayrshire for adult learners who may need help and support with reading, writing and number skills. \r\n\r\nThe essential skills service can offer:\r\n\r\nOpportunities to volunteer across East Ayrshire\r\n\r\nQuality training and ongoing support\r\n\r\nAccess to a wide range of literacy resources and an opportunity to give resources and an opportunity to give something back to your community.",
