        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/0012400000AA2DqAAL",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/0012400000AA2DqAAL/ragdolls-uk",
            "name": "Ragdolls UK",
            "description": "Our mission is to help as many girls with Turner’s Syndrome as possible by linking them to the support they need.\r\n\r\nBeing diagnosed with Turner’s Syndrome can be a terrifying experience. Our support groups aim to be a place of comfort and discussion away from the doctor’s waiting room where TS girls and their families can learn to come to terms with the condition, the health checks required and the social aspects of what lies ahead. Being available at the earliest possible stage is priority because we aim to support TS girls in living the best life possible.",
            "website": "https://ragdollsuk.wordpress.com/",
            "charityRegistration": [
                {
                    "registrar": "https://www.oscr.org.uk",
                    "registrationNumber": "SC043805"
                }
            ],
            "cause": [
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/AdviceInformation",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Advice / Information"
                },
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/Health",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Health"
                }
            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g24000008kbDLAAY",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g24000008kbDLAAY/fundraising-manager",
                    "publishStart": "2025-04-28",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-01",
                    "title": "Fundraising Manager",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nWe are looking for a committed individual to help us with our fundraising efforts. Although this is a volunteer vacancy, a full time position will be available for the right candidate.\n\n## Description\n\nWe are looking for a committed individuals to help us with our fundraising efforts as part of a fundraising committee. \r\n\r\nYou will be responsible for fundraising ideas, supporting ongoing fundraising activities and supporting a small charity as it continues to grow.\r\n\r\nWho are we?\r\n\r\nWe support women and girls with Turner's syndrome by raising awareness, providing up to date information as well as support groups. This is only possible with ongoing support. \r\n\r\nIf you are interested in joining our fundraising committee contact the details provided for more information.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo experience necessary as full training will be given. However, some experience in the third sector and fundraising would be an advantage.\n\n## Training details\n\nAny relevant training can be provided\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel expenses covered\n\n## Taster details\n\nCandidates are welcome to discuss the role further",
