                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000I2CkHYAV",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000I2CkHYAV/volunteer-coordinator",
                    "publishStart": "2026-09-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-18",
                    "title": "Volunteer Coordinator",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWhat will you be doing?\r\n\r\nThe Volunteer Coordinator will help organise volunteers involved in fundraising events, awareness campaigns, social media contributions and community engagement activities across the UK.\r\n\r\nKey Responsibilities\r\n\r\nVolunteer Support & Coordination\r\n\r\nHelp recruit and welcome new volunteers\r\nMaintain regular communication with volunteers across the UK\r\nMatch volunteers to suitable opportunities based on their interests and availability\r\nCoordinate volunteer involvement for events and campaigns\r\nKeep volunteer records and contact lists organised and up to date\r\nHelp ensure volunteers feel supported, valued and included\r\nEvents & Fundraising\r\n\r\nCoordinate volunteers for fundraising events and awareness activities\r\nSupport planning of volunteer rotas and event staffing\r\nEncourage volunteer-led fundraising initiatives within local communities\r\nHelp identify opportunities for fundraising and community partnerships\r\nSocial Media & Community Engagement\r\n\r\nCoordinate volunteers contributing to social media content and awareness campaigns\r\nSupport volunteers sharing stories, photos, videos and charity updates\r\nHelp maintain engagement across online platforms and volunteer groups\r\nVolunteer Engagement\r\n\r\nBuild positive relationships with volunteers nationwide\r\nHelp create a welcoming and supportive volunteer community\r\nRecognise and celebrate volunteer contributions\r\nEncourage ongoing involvement and participation\r\nWhat are we looking for?\r\nGood communication and organisational skills\r\nFriendly, approachable and supportive\r\nComfortable coordinating people remotely\r\nAble to manage multiple tasks and priorities\r\nPassionate about helping others and supporting charitable causes\r\nExperience in volunteering, fundraising, administration or social media is helpful but not essential\r\nWhat difference will you make?\r\nBy coordinating relevant volunteer support you will make a huge difference in helping a small charity grow and expand on their reach.",
