                    "description": "## Summary\n\nMain Aims: To support women and girls with Turner's Syndrome by raising awareness, providing up to date information and offering support groups.\n\n## Description\n\nWe are looking for enthusiastic individuals to get involved in organising exciting new fundraising events. Any support in the planning to execution of the events would be greatly appreciated.\n\n## Travel details\n\nRemote",
