                    "title": "Festival Helper",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nFestival Helper…in various fields …..logistics / refreshments / advertising\r\nDelivery of first class FREE mjcultural opportunities for the local community in East Dunbartonshire..in the\r\nfield of art, music (e.g. classical, folk) Scottish dancing etc. see www.campsiefest.org.uk\n\n## Experience required\n\nPhysical fitness for helping with equipment and furniture including staging and lights or refreshments set up\r\nand clearing.\r\nAbility to hang pictures for exhibitions\r\nAbility to use social media for advertising\n\n## Training details\n\nLearn by doing..attending zoom meeting and working with others\n\n## Travel details\n\nMilton of Campsie Village Hall",
