            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000QNs5rAAD",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000QNs5rAAD/shop-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2021-06-16",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-28",
                    "title": "Shop Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nGain valuable customer service and retail experience that will look great on your CV all whilst helping out a good cause.\n\n## Description\n\nShop volunteer required to help us in our busy retail space in Dalry. Duties can include:\nTill operation, customer service, stock processing, donation sorting, general cleaning and making the displays and shelves appealing inside and in the window. \nYour creativity and enthusiasm will be essential! \n\nWe need you to help with making displays appealing, sorting a treasure trove of donations, separating the pulp from the bestsellers and identifying the must have items as well as displaying them all to maximum effect!\n\n## Experience required\n\nRetail experience and enthusiasm for shops and displays is essential, good communication skills required and a good level of spoken English would be helpful.\n\n## Training details\n\n20 minute gift aid learning on a computer in-store. One to one training on all tasks and continued support throughout role.\n\n## Travel details\n\n110B Dalry Rd, Edinburgh EH11 2DW\nMultiple bus routes and car parks near by.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel expenses.",
