                    "publishStart": "2026-08-10",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-08",
                    "title": "Gardeners",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nCafe Solace in Kilbirnie have just started on a community garden in which they hope to grow vegetables which they can utilise to use in cafe and supply any surplus to the local community. They are seeking green fingered people to come along and help plant and maintain the plants on a regular basis",
