            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/0012400000XQRnbAAH/the-ayrshire-film-company",
            "name": "The Ayrshire Film Company",
            "description": "Ayrshire Film Co. works with groups of people to either create films or empower them to create films for themselves. Not everyone is a camerman, sound engineer or editor; but we believe everyone can be creative. Film is just another way for people to express themselves (it happens to be our favourite way of expressing ourselves) but with our learning programmes everyone can collaborate to create something unique.",
