            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000DCEPVYA5",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000DCEPVYA5/volunteer-befrienders",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-25",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-22",
                    "title": "Volunteer Befrienders",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nTLC's Befriending Project is on a mission to empower and support people experiencing the effects of poor mental wellbeing, caused in part by loneliness and isolation.\r\n\r\nOur volunteer befrienders commit to a 1 hour visit once a week and seek not to only be a listening ear, but also encourage you in building their befriendee's confidence and sense of belonging in their community. \r\n\r\nWe provide excellent support to all our volunteers, including extensive induction and other continuous trainings. We are with you every step of the way.\r\n\r\nTo join our fantastic team of volunteers making a real difference please contact us at befriending@tlc.org.uk or telephone: 07360159246 for more information.\n\n## Description\n\nTLC's Befriending Project is on a mission to empower and support people experiencing the effects of poor mental wellbeing, caused in part by loneliness and isolation.\r\n\r\nOur volunteer befrienders commit to a 1 hour visit once a week and seek not to only be a listening ear, but also encourage you in building their befriendee's confidence and sense of belonging in their community. \r\n\r\nWe provide excellent support to all our volunteers, including extensive induction and other continuous trainings. We are with you every step of the way.\r\n\r\nTo join our fantastic team of volunteers making a real difference please contact us at befriending@tlc.org.uk or telephone: 07360159246 for more information.\n\n## Training details\n\nExcellent support and training is provided to all volunteers, including extensive Induction and other continuous trainings.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible times available to suit volunteers. All help is greatly appreciated.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
