            "name": "City of Aberdeen Gymnastics Club (COAG)",
            "description": "Our organisation is a gymnastics club. We run gymnastics classes at Alex Collie Sport centre in Bridge of Don. We provide recreational classes for all ages and competitive pathways possibilities. We had the chance to train gymnast who became Scottish champions and even participated in the Northern European gymnastics championships.\r\nWe are a registered charity and are working toward developing our club culture and impact in the community.",
            "website": "https://www.coag.org.uk/",
            "charityRegistration": [
