                    "title": "Art in Mind volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\n*** n.b. this opportunity is based on the Isle of Arran and is only practical & appropriate for people who live on the island due to the ferry connections. ***\r\n\r\nDrivers & support workers.\r\nVolunteers required to transport participants to & from the group, engage with the participants & take part in the art classes.\n\n## Travel details\n\nClass is held weekly at The Rangers Centre.  Participants travel in from all parts of the island.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel expenses available",
