            "name": "Butterfly Trust (Aberdeen & Grampian)",
            "description": "Our aim is that people living with Cystic Fibrosis will have access to the support they need to ensure they can benefit from optimum homecare and enjoy the best quality of life in the community.",
            "website": "http://www.butterflytrust.org.uk/",
            "cause": [
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/AdviceInformation",
