                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000QNqekAAD",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000QNqekAAD/fund-raiser-volunteers",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-15",
                    "title": "Fund Raiser Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nOur mission is to deliver urgent medical samples, equipment and supplies free of charge between hospitals, healthcare sites and laboratories in the North East of Scotland when Healthcare Providers’ own transport services do not operate.\r\n\r\nWe need Fundraisers to help us raise the revenue to continue doing our service for completely free to the end user.\r\n\r\nA fantastic opportunity to help and make a real difference. All volunteers are greatly appreciated. For more details please contact Graeme Scott, Membership Secretary at email: membershipsecretary@nervs.org.uk or telephone.: 07881460792.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo previous experience is required for this role as full training is given.\n\n## Training details\n\nExcellent support and relevant training is provided to all volunteers. Full training on the role as a fundraiser will be given alongside ongoing support and training.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible-there are a range of times available to volunteer and all help is greatly appreciated.\n\n## Travel details\n\nFundraisers travel to various events throughout the year and are the face of NERVS to the public. Fundraisers also help our events coordinator organise ad hoc fundraising events throughout the year.",
