            "name": "Gullane Community Association",
            "description": "The village hall belongs to the village and is the hub of the local community, with activities and events taking place every day of the week. As well as a weekly programme of regular clubs and classes for all ages, the hall is used for private events, and for all kinds of events that are open to the public.",
