                    "publishStart": "2023-03-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-06",
                    "title": "Sales Assistant",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nLooking for a shop assistant for our store\n\n## Description\n\nWe are looking for a Sales Assistant to be an ambassador for Debra whilst volunteering in our store, we require a volunteer who is interested in learning retail and is happy to learn in both the front and rear of house, roles include: Sorting Donations of clothing, working the steam equipment, sorting jewellery, Bric a Brac, moving furniture (if able) and electrical equipment. We like our volunteers to assist in all aspects of the shop including window dressing.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo Experience necessary as we are happy to train our volunteers\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nWe ask all our volunteers to do a shift on the weekend every 2nd week\n\n## Travel details\n\nBased at our Clydebank Store in Clydebank Shopping Centre\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nExpenses paid if volunteering for full day",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
