                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000ITqwxYAD/period-friendly-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-13",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-13",
                    "title": "Period Friendly Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nVolunteers are important to Simon Community Scotland and their contribution is valued. It's our policy to offer out-of-pocket expenses incurred on our behalf. There are fun opportunities to develop the Period Friendly Project, e.g. with our Pants Drive, and engage with the other services within Simon Community.",
