            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000CAAC6YAP",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000CAAC6YAP/youth-volunteer-youth-activist",
                    "publishStart": "2025-09-18",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-01",
                    "title": "Youth Volunteer / Youth Activist",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nBEE (Bold, Equal and Empowered) is a youth activist group at the Compass Centre in Lerwick.  We meet weekly to speak about issues surrounding Gender Based Violence and safety within our communities, which we think are important to Shetland, Scotland and around the globe.  Members are aged 13-25 and come from all over Shetland. Meetings are currently based in Lerwick as that is where the majority of our volunteers are located.  Our volunteer coordinator would be happy to meet with young people in other locations in Shetland and hold meetings within their communities. Meetings can also be joined online or in an alternative location, to ensure this opportunity is accessible to anyone aged 13-25 in Shetland.\r\n\r\nWhy join?\r\n•\tMeet with likeminded young people\r\n•\tMake a difference in your community\r\n•\tHave Fun\r\n•\tTry new things and learn new skills\r\n•\tDevelop your CV\r\n•\tGive back to an important cause\r\n\r\nQuotes from Members:\r\n“A safe place to speak with likeminded young people.”\r\n“I’m passionate about change and I believe that BEE is what is going to make it happen.”\n\n## Experience required\n\nWant to make a difference within your community \r\nWilling to try new things and learn new skills\r\nAble to work in a group and listen to others\r\nInterested in learning about gender-based violence\n\n## Travel details\n\nLerwick with opportunities to attend events such as Pride, Country Shows and events during the 16 days of activism against Gender Based Violence. Can also be delivered within different communities in Shetland, if interest.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000CAAC6YAP#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Youth Volunteer / Youth Activist",
                        "description": "Want to make a difference within your community \r\nWilling to try new things and learn new skills\r\nAble to work in a group and listen to others\r\nInterested in learning about gender-based violence",
                        "applyLink": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000CAAC6YAP/youth-volunteer-youth-activist?#modal_register_a0gQD00000CAAC6YAP",
                        "allowsRemoteParticipation": false,
