                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000GJuoTYAT/youth-cafe-volunteers",
                    "publishStart": "2026-09-30",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-24",
                    "title": "Youth Cafe Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nWe have great opportunities to join our volunteer team as a Youth Cafe Volunteer.\r\n\r\nIn this engaging role, you will help create a warm and welcoming environment for young people in our community. Your responsibilities will include facilitating fun activities, providing a listening ear, and supporting the personal development of our youth. This is a fantastic opportunity to make a real difference for the lives of young people while gaining valuable experience and skills in community and youth work. If you have a passion for empowering the next generation and helping in the community, we would love to hear from you!\r\n\r\nFor more information please contact us at: enquiries.balnagaskcc@gmail.com\n\n## Description\n\nWe have great opportunities to join our volunteer team as a Youth Cafe Volunteer.\r\n\r\nIn this engaging role, you will help create a warm and welcoming environment for young people in our community. Your responsibilities will include facilitating fun activities, providing a listening ear, and supporting the personal development of our youth. This is a fantastic opportunity to make a real difference for the lives of young people while gaining valuable experience and skills in community and youth work. If you have a passion for empowering the next generation and helping in the community, we would love to hear from you!\r\n\r\nFor more information please contact us at: enquiries.balnagaskcc@gmail.com\n\n## Training details\n\nExcellent support and relevant training provided to all volunteers.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nAll help is greatly appreciated.\n\n## Travel details\n\nBalnagask Community Centre, 6 Balnagask Road, Torry, Aberdeen AB11 8HX",
