            "name": "Crohn’s and Colitis UK - Edinburgh Local Group",
            "description": "To work with all those affected by Crohn’s and Colitis to achieve a better quality of life, to improve support and services and ultimately find a cure.",
            "website": "https://www.crohnsandcolitis.org.uk/edinburgh",
