                    "publishStart": "2018-03-16",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-28",
                    "title": "Events and Activities Team Member",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nWe have teams of volunteers based around the country making a positive impact in their local communities to raise awareness of Crohn’s Disease and Ulcerative Colitis. Join our local team, take an active role in planning and delivering awareness raising activities.\n\n## Description\n\nWe have teams of volunteers based around the country making a positive impact in their local communities to raise awareness of Crohn’s Disease and Ulcerative Colitis. Join our local team, take an active role in planning and delivering awareness raising activities. Planning and organising events across the area to raise awareness. Get involved in tasks such as writing articles and creating newsletters to publicise local activities, manage social media pages and fundraising .\n\n## Experience required\n\nVariety of skills and experience welcome, Collaborative and proactive, Compassionate, Open and approachable, Organised, Good communications, Willing to travel within the local area to attend meetings / events within your own local community or across the whole area.\n\n## Training details\n\nInduction and support provided.\n\n## Travel details\n\nTake place in Edinburgh.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nReasonable travel expenses paid.",
