        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/0012400000bcawjAAA",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/0012400000bcawjAAA/aberdeen-climate-action",
            "name": "Aberdeen Climate Action",
            "description": "Aberdeen Climate Action is a volunteer led organisation, which focuses on educating and prompting action on climate change in the North East of Scotland.",
            "website": "https://www.aberdeenclimateaction.org",
            "cause": [
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/CampaigningLobbying",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Campaigning / Lobbying"
                },
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/EnvironmentRecycling",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Environment / Recycling"
                },
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/Volunteering",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Volunteering"
                }
            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000AL9wzYAD",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000AL9wzYAD/action-team-volunteers",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Action Team Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nJoin ACA’s Action Team!\r\nLove the outdoors? Want to take practical climate action in your community?\r\nJoin Aberdeen Climate Action’s Action Team! We organise hands-on events like beach cleans, tree planting, and more, helping keep communities active and healthy in Aberdeen.\r\n\r\nWe’re looking for friendly, reliable volunteers to help plan, promote, and deliver these events. No experience needed—just enthusiasm and a bit of time each month. Get involved, meet like-minded people, and make a difference in Aberdeen!\r\n\r\nInterested? Get in touch at recruit@aberdeenclimateaction.org\r\n\r\nACA is a volunteer led organisation, which focuses on educating and prompting action on climate change in the North East of Scotland.\n\n## Description\n\nJoin ACA’s Action Team!\r\nLove the outdoors? Want to take practical climate action in your community?\r\nJoin Aberdeen Climate Action’s Action Team! We organise hands-on events like beach cleans, tree planting, and more, helping keep communities active and healthy in Aberdeen.\r\n\r\nWe’re looking for friendly, reliable volunteers to help plan, promote, and deliver these events. No experience needed—just enthusiasm and a bit of time each month. Get involved, meet like-minded people, and make a difference in Aberdeen!\r\n\r\nInterested? Get in touch at recruit@aberdeenclimateaction.org\r\n\r\nACA is a volunteer led organisation, which focuses on educating and prompting action on climate change in the North East of Scotland.\n\n## Training details\n\nExcellent support and relevant guidance is provided to all volunteers. Once the potential volunteer has expressed an interest in volunteering, they will be invited to an informal induction chat. There they will be asked a few questions and be able to ask their own to learn more about the organisation. Expectations will be covered and then they will be introduced to the team lead. Check-ins can also be done.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible times available to assist-all help makes a difference and is greatly appreciated.\n\n## Travel details\n\nACA is an Aberdeen based group but has members who join in from afar using video call software. Please be aware that some face-to-face meetings may take place in Aberdeen.\r\n\r\nAs an organisation with no physical offices, our volunteers tend to work from home, with face-to-face meetings happening occasionally. When you join; you’ll be able to access our shared online platforms and video meeting conferences; which allow us to work as a team no matter where we are.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2Fe85db7d1-3d68-4383-b7b7-e1573c25795b%2FvFZa9WNv4MfDUfw8Jx6agqFb6Wh2%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=1616cb03-1c88-4550-ae04-66ebf333c411",
                    "role": {
