                    "title": "Gardening by the Sea",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe are looking for people to help with our amazing gardens. The gardens are in a wonderful setting overlooking Gullane bay and are a real pleasure to spend time in. Nevertheless, they need mowing, weeding, pruning and general maintenance; so anyone who would like to help out would be more than welcome! This can be a great way to meet other people, have a chat and a cuppa and benefit from some time outside in a wonderful location.",
