                    "publishStart": "2026-07-31",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-29",
                    "title": "Radio Station Treasurer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nRegal Radio is currently wishing to engage a Treasurer. The station is a community-based radio station broadcasting 24/7 with around 15 presenters.\r\n\r\nLooking after the finances is not an onerous task as the station has no real overheads and funding is largely by subscription and advertising.\n\n## Experience required\n\nExcellent admin skills.\r\nAccurate and traceable record-keeping",
