                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000EkQQrYAN",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000EkQQrYAN/intergenerational-community-connector",
                    "publishStart": "2026-01-16",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-15",
                    "title": "Intergenerational Community Connector",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nJoin GWT as we work towards a Scotland where generations are more connected.  If you would like to get involved in intergenerational work, learn more about the practice and help strengthen community connections across East Renfrewshire, this could be the perfect volunteer role for you!\r\n\r\nMain responsibilities:\r\n* Help one of our development team members plan and run 2–3 local network meetings each year\r\n* Spread the word about the benefits of intergenerational work within your community\r\n* Share and promote GWT events, meetings, publications and training opportunities\r\n* Connect with local groups and encourage them to showcase their intergenerational projects through the network and GWT\r\n\r\nKey skills:\r\n* An interest in bringing different generations together\r\n* Strong communication skills\r\n* Good organisational abilities\r\n* Confidence in building relationships with community groups\r\n* Enthusiasm for community involvement and connection\r\n\r\nBenefits:\r\n* Induction of the role and one to one support from a GWT member\r\n* Free CPD accredited training, giving you the skills to support intergenerational work in your own community\r\n* Opportunities to connect with local groups and organisations, helping bring people of different generations together\r\n* Reasonable expenses covered (including travel)\r\n\r\nVolunteer commitment:\r\n* 2-3 hours per month (excluding school holidays)\n\n## Travel details\n\nThroughout East Renfrewshire.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F5738042f-0762-4ccc-bf3f-22cd4be22edf%2FUC59fMqTlUgceOwgyfCxCWOzN1y2%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=5c8a153a-88e0-4ed5-9329-8a9f5683f501",
