                    "title": "Cowie Rural Action Group Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nCowie Rural Action Group Volunteer\n\n## Description\n\nCowie Rural Action Group CRAG Community Centre FK7 7BL\n\nCRAG are a community group who have taken over the running of the community centre.\n\nWe are an active group of volunteers with a host of daily/weekly activities. We also run a Calendar of Annual Events.\n\nWe open the centre 9am -9pm Monday to Friday and Saturday / Sunday 9am -1pm.\n\nWe are looking for volunteers who are happy to roll thier sleeves up and get involved.&nbsp;\n\nCafe/Charity shop/ Gym / Hall hires, could be cleaning, cooking, setting uo for let&#39;s, meeting users and general enquiries.\n\nWe work in pairs or independtly.\n\n## Experience required\n\nWillingness to learn and get involved\n\n## Travel details\n\nNo 56 Bus\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nRe-imburse travelling expenses on providing receipts.",
