            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/0012400000gcBW7AAM/police-scotland-western-isles",
            "name": "Police Scotland Western Isles",
            "description": "Police Scotland provide services for the Western Isles",
            "website": "https://www.scotland.police.uk",
            "cause": [
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/CommunitySafety",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Community Safety"
                },
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/LawAndJustice",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Law and Justice"
                }
            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000008ZkGHYA0",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000008ZkGHYA0/special-police-constable-harris",
                    "publishStart": "2024-11-12",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-26",
                    "title": "Special Police Constable (Harris)",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nOur special constables come from all walks of life including professionals, parents, teachers, students, and from sectors such as retail, transport, finance, engineering, and many, many more.\n\n## Description\n\nAre you interested in becoming a volunteer with Police Scotland? \r\n\r\nWith a long and impressive history. The special constable role is a part-time, volunteer opportunity where members of the public can maximise their spare time supporting their communities. Not only will you support the vision of Police Scotland for safer communities, less crime, and supporting victims. You will be joining a thriving workforce which may offer opportunities for a new career. \r\n\r\nAs a special constable, you will be given identical powers to that of a police officer, who you will work alongside and at times that best suit you. \r\nIf you are interested in volunteering up to 96 hours per year, learning new skills, forging strong partnerships in the community, preventing crime, and making a real difference in the community you love, then this is the role for you.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000008ZkGHYA0#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Special Police Constable (Harris)",
                        "applyLink": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000008ZkGHYA0/special-police-constable-harris?#modal_register_a0gQD000008ZkGHYA0",
                        "allowsRemoteParticipation": false,
                        "minimumAge": "18",
                        "theme": [
                            {
                                "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Theme/CrimeSafety",
                                "skos:prefLabel": "Crime / Safety"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
