            "name": "We Too! Charity",
            "description": "We Too! is an Aberdeen based charity. We promote inclusion and produce a free quarterly magazine for families of children with additional support needs which is distributed throughout Aberdeen City and Shire . We Too! also hosts many \"Relaxed Sessions\" in the area allowing full inclusive participation in activities that may ordinarily be difficult to access.",
