                    "publishStart": "2026-10-08",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-06",
                    "title": "We Too!  Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nVolunteer with We Too!\r\n\r\nWe Too! is a  parent-led charity supporting families of children with disabilities across Aberdeen and Aberdeenshire.\r\n\r\nVolunteers are at the heart of everything We Too! does. Supporting families at events and activities, our volunteers play a vital role in making life more inclusive for children and families with additional support needs. If you’d like to give some time, share your skills or simply get involved, we’d love to hear from you.\r\n\r\nFull guidance and support is provided to all volunteers and is a fantastic opportunity to assist a well known charity and welcoming team.\r\n\r\nFor more details please visit: www.wetoo.org.uk/volunteer-with-we-too or email volunteering@wetoo.org.uk\n\n## Description\n\nVolunteer with We Too!\r\n\r\nWe Too! is a  parent-led charity supporting families of children with disabilities across Aberdeen and Aberdeenshire.\r\n\r\nVolunteers are at the heart of everything We Too! does. Supporting families at events and activities, our volunteers play a vital role in making life more inclusive for children and families with additional support needs. If you’d like to give some time, share your skills or simply get involved, we’d love to hear from you.\r\n\r\nFull guidance and support is provided to all volunteers and is a fantastic opportunity to assist a well known charity and welcoming team.\r\n\r\nFor more details please visit: www.wetoo.org.uk/volunteer-with-we-too or email volunteering@wetoo.org.uk\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible times available to help. All help makes a difference and is greatly appreciated.",
