                    "title": "Events Volunteers (Great Scottish Sports Quiz February 2027)",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nWe’re looking for amazing volunteers to support on the night of our Great Scottish Sports Quiz to help us to raise spirits and funds at an evening packed with energy, inspiration, and fun at Pittodrie Stadium and support those who are affected by chest, heart, or stroke conditions or Long Covid:\r\n\r\nDate: Thursday 11th February\r\nTime : 5.30pm-10pm\r\nVenue: Pittodrie Stadium, Pittodrie Street, Aberdeen AB24 5QH\r\n\r\nDuties: welcoming and sign-posting guests, collect in envelopes, support with the running of fundraising games including Pass the Ball, our raffle checking Quiz team answers\r\n\r\nA fantastic opportunity to be involved in a major event and to help Chest Heart & Stroke Scotland in the vital support we provide people.\r\n\r\nFor more details and to register to volunteer please visit: https://volunteer.chss.org.uk/opportunities/126923-events-volunteer-great-scottish-sports-quiz-february-2027-2026-10-26?cookieconsent=set , email: volunteering@chss.org.uk or telephone: 01312972780\n\n## Description\n\nWe’re looking for amazing volunteers to support on the night of our Great Scottish Sports Quiz to help us to raise spirits and funds at an evening packed with energy, inspiration, and fun at Pittodrie Stadium and support those who are affected by chest, heart, or stroke conditions or Long Covid:\r\n\r\nDate: Thursday 11th February 2027\r\n\r\nTime : 5.30pm-10pm\r\n\r\nVenue: Pittodrie Stadium, Pittodrie Street, Aberdeen AB24 5QH\r\n\r\nDuties: welcoming and sign-posting guests, collect in envelopes, support with the running of fundraising games including Pass the Ball, our raffle checking Quiz team answers\r\n\r\nA fantastic opportunity to be involved in a major event and to help Chest Heart & Stroke Scotland in the vital support we provide people.\r\n\r\nFor more details and to register to volunteer please visit: https://volunteer.chss.org.uk/opportunities/126923-events-volunteer-great-scottish-sports-quiz-february-2027-2026-10-26?cookieconsent=set , email: volunteering@chss.org.uk or telephone: 01312972780\n\n## Training details\n\nExcellent support and relevant guidance is provided to all volunteers.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nTakes place at Pittodrie Stadium on Thursday 11th February 2027,  5.30pm-10pm. All help makes a difference and is greatly appreciated.\n\n## Travel details\n\nTakes place at Pittodrie Stadium.\r\n\r\nThe stadium is located just north of Aberdeen city centre and is easily accessible by public transport. Several First Bus services stop nearby on King Street, around a 5-minute walk from the venue. Aberdeen Railway Station is approximately 1.5 miles away, with local buses and taxis available for onward travel.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nExpenses Reasonable out-of-pocket expenses will be reimbursed. These should be discussed with your Line Manager prior to outlay and must be submitted within the prescribed guidelines as detailed in the CHSS Volunteer Expenses Policy.",
