                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000008bMo9YAE",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000008bMo9YAE/rvs-cuppa-club-volunteers",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "RVS Cuppa Club Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nThe RVS Cuppa Club are one of over 100 affiliated partnered peer support groups with Chest Heart & Stroke Scotland. \r\nThis is a social support group (tea & cake, games, bingo etc.) open to anyone who has had a stroke and those with long term health conditions. \r\nThe group meet every Thursday morning from 10am-12pm at Froghall Community Centre, 14 Powis Place, Aberdeen, AB25 3TX. \r\nA fantastic, enjoyable opportunity to help and make a real difference. All assistance is greatly appreciated.\r\nFor further details please contact Tom Milne at email: tom.milne@talktalk.net or telephone: 07725599515.\n\n## Description\n\nThe RVS Cuppa Club are one of over 100 affiliated partnered peer support groups with Chest Heart & Stroke Scotland. \r\nThis is a social support group (tea & cake, games, bingo etc.) open to anyone who has had a stroke and those with long term health conditions. \r\n\r\nThe group meet every Thursday morning from 10am-12pm at Froghall Community Centre, 14 Powis Place, Aberdeen, AB25 3TX. \r\n\r\nA fantastic, enjoyable opportunity to help and make a real difference. All assistance is greatly appreciated.\r\n\r\nFor further details please contact Tom Milne at email: tom.milne@talktalk.net or telephone: 07725599515.\n\n## Training details\n\nExcellent support and relevant guidance is provided to all volunteers.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nThe group meet every Thursday morning from 10am-12pm at Froghall Community Centre, 14 Powis Place, Aberdeen, AB25 3TX.\n\n## Travel details\n\nThe group meet every Thursday morning from 10am-12pm at Froghall Community Centre, 14 Powis Place, Aberdeen, AB25 3TX.",
