            "name": "Barnardos Shop (East Ayrshire)",
            "description": "Volunteers are a valuable part of the retail staff with Barnardos.  We need the support of our volunteers to keep our small charity shop going. The benefits for any volunteers joining our small team are that they gain valuable work experience, not only in the retail sector, but also as working as part of a team, processing stock, replenishing stock and cash handling.",
