                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000008b6g9YAA",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000008b6g9YAA/fundinggrants-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2025-02-20",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-16",
                    "title": "Funding/Grants Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nPolmont Playgroup would love an extra volunteer to join their Funding/Grants Team.  They have a team with lots of experience to support you.  You can choose how often you would like to help out whether that be one application per day, per week or per month - whatever works for you! \r\n\r\nPolmont Playgroup are a registered charity offering an early years experience for children between 2-5 years old.  They are a mixture of paid staff (those looking after the children) and volunteers who support with the running and administration of the charity.  As a charity, to help keep the service running, the playgroup need to fundraise and apply for grants, this is where they need your help!  \r\nPolmont Playgroup need a volunteer to help identify grants to apply for online - but don’t worry, you won’t be on your own.  Other volunteers will be actively looking for suitable grants to apply for and can help you identify and search for these.\r\n \r\nIf you can help translate the great work at Polmont Playgroup and the need for support into grant applications, they would love to have you as part of the team!  Whether this is a one-off, a few hours a week, month or more, your help would be greatly appreciated. \r\nAll volunteers are home-based, however can communicate and meet via WhatsApp, Teams/FaceTime, email or meet up in our Playgroup meeting room for a chat and catchup.\n\n## Experience required\n\nBasic IT literacy.\n\n## Training details\n\nThe funding team will always be on hand to answer any questions or provide any support.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible, home-based opportunity.  \r\nAs much time as you are able to give.\n\n## Travel details\n\nHomebased opportunity - you will need your own computer/laptop/tablet and internet connection.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nNo travel expenses available.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F7f8d0c01-f40f-45d5-8c0c-38ed536f1ba6%2Fq19DcOWGQCRPIPMRCkAF0XcUA2l1%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=3a78e926-13ff-4932-b40f-548369e855b7",
