                        "description": "-Willing to work with interpreter if needed.\r\n-Good communication skills and a good listener\r\n-Positive, reliable and adaptable\r\n-Person-centred.\r\n-Patient, tactful, caring and respectful\r\n-Understanding, sensitive, discrete and able to maintain confidentiality",
                        "applyLink": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000VhvLYAAZ/companion-supporter-befriender?#modal_register_a0g0800000VhvLYAAZ",
