            "name": "African Council",
            "description": "The African Council is an independent voluntary organisation with a mission to promote the social and economic welfare of African People.\r\n\r\nWe celebrate the best in African culture(s), history and values. We promote the attainment of education and life skills especially among Africans. We also advance active citizenship among Africans through engagement in civic and political process, institutions and leadership.",
            "website": "https://www.africancouncil.org.uk",
            "cause": [
