                }
            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000D9OTRYA3",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000D9OTRYA3/board-member-trustee",
                    "publishStart": "2026-05-14",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-16",
                    "title": "Board Member (Trustee)",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nEATS Rosyth is a vibrant, community-led charity in Rosyth, creating welcoming spaces that inspire people to connect, learn, and grow. From their hub and café to their community garden and orchard, they provide places where everyone can engage, share skills, and enjoy nature.\r\n\r\nThey’re looking for passionate and committed individuals to join their Board of Directors and help shape the future of these projects. As a Trustee, you’ll support strategic planning, governance, and financial oversight while sharing your skills and expertise to strengthen their impact.\r\n\r\nThis is a volunteer role with regular board meetings (6 per year) and occasional subcommittee involvement. Training, networking opportunities, and support are provided, along with reimbursement for reasonable expenses. Trustees should be from the KY11 or KY12 area.\r\n\r\nIf you’re ready to make a meaningful difference in your community and help EATS Rosyth thrive, they’d love to hear from you!\n\n## Experience required\n\nExperience in any of these areas is especially valuable:\r\nFinance | Fundraising | Income Generation | Communications | HR | Social Enterprise | Volunteer Management | Partnerships | Community Development | Environmental Action\n\n## Training details\n\nTrustees will be given support by the Chair and other members of the board, and will be given the opportunity to learn about the charity and role.\n\n## Travel details\n\nMeetings are held at the EATS Hub, 115a Queensferry Road, Rosyth, KY11 2PS.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nEATS Rosyth pay reasonable travel rates and reiburse colunteers every month. Mileage rate is 45p/mile.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
