                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g24000003NHykAAG",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g24000003NHykAAG/feedback-helper",
                    "publishStart": "2018-06-05",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-01",
                    "title": "Feedback Helper",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nWe provide a platform both online and offline for those who struggle with mental health, addiction, gender dysphoria , sexuality or who feel like they don't quite 'fit', or feel estranged to this world : to express themselves through art.\n\n## Description\n\nYour role will include interacting with online members giving feedback on the creative arts posts they leave in a positive constructive way. Having a creative, positive and constructive approach will be required. Mentoring will be provided. Spread your wings and come fly with us.\n\n## Experience required\n\nWe are looking for a volunteer with the relevant skills to support us and do this role. You should have a passion for the arts and compassion for mental health also; good communication; dedication, commitment, imagination, working on own initiative, reliable; Organised; At ease with dealing and interacting with people online \r\n\r\nFledgling is currently run by Volunteers online , so this would be an online post.\n\n## Training details\n\nMentoring online\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\n2 days minimum commitment a weekend Monday - Friday (Not weekends)\n-You can jump on and off on those days you are not expected to be on all day 2 days minimum commitment a weekend Monday - Friday (Not weekends) -You can jump on and off on those days you are not expected to be on all day\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nPlease note: No expenses are paid for this opportunity",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
