                        "commitment": "2 days minimum commitment a weekend Monday - Friday (Not weekends)\n-You can jump on and off on those days you are not expected to be on all day 2 days minimum commitment a weekend Monday - Friday (Not weekends) -You can jump on and off on those days you are not expected to be on all day",
