            "name": "Shaper/Caper",
            "description": "Shaper/Caper is a dance theatre company based in Dundee that presents professional productions choreographed by its Dundonian Artistic Director Thomas Small and delivers dance workshops to people of all ages and abilities. From performing in New York City to dancing in care homes in Tayside, our vision is to empower individuals to transform their worlds through dance.",
