                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000JryHdYAJ/event-volunteers",
                    "publishStart": "2026-11-12",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-05-13",
                    "title": "Event Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWould you like to be part of something positive in your local community?\r\nNODA Ayrshire is looking for friendly, enthusiastic volunteers to help us grow, raise awareness and support our fundraising efforts. \r\n\r\nWe're looking for people who can help with:\r\n•\tEVENT SUPPORT - help organise, set up and run community events. \r\n•\tFUNDRAISING - Supporting raffles, tombolas, stalls, collections and fundraising activities.\r\n•\tNETWORKING - Building relationships with local businesses, organisations and community groups.\r\n•\tSPREAD THE WORD - Helping raise awareness of NODA Ayrshire and the support we offer across Ayrshire\r\nYou don't need previous experience - just enthusiasm, a willingness to get involved and a little time to spare!\r\n  \r\nEvery little bit of help makes a big difference \r\nInterested in getting involved? \r\n\r\nGet in touch with NODA Ayrshire today!\r\nContact details: Linda on 07858151969/07393498763 or e-mail: admin.nodaayrshire@gmail.com.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000JryHdYAJ#role",
