                    "publishEnd": "2026-11-30",
                    "title": "Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe provide a service to the local community in Logan and surrounding area. The service strives to tackle social isolation, mental health and food poverty. We aim to provide additional services in the future such as a hairdresser, podiatry, holistic care and various social activities within the centre and at other venues. The management are all unpaid volunteers and your role is to support and assist with all activities.",
