                    "publishEnd": "2026-11-25",
                    "title": "Facilities Caretaker Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nYou will be an enthusiastic, skilled and reliable Caretaker to support the smooth running, safe and welcoming atmosphere of the building by carrying out routine caretaking tasks. This role helps ensure that the facility remains accessible, dignified, and well-maintained for all service users, staff an visitors.  This role involves working with other volunteers and staff.",
