                    "title": "Garden Handyperson Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe are seeking an enthusiastic,  skilled and reliable garden handyperson to assist with basic repairs maintenance and improvements in our community garden. This role supports the safe and efficient operation of the garden by ensuring that structures, tools and infrastructure are functional and well-maintained.  This role involves working with other volunteers and staff to create a safe green space that promotes community engagement.",
