                    "description": "## Description\n\nTo support the delivery of Kilmarnock YMCA Youth Work Sessions by assisting staff in providing high-quality, safe, fun, interesting and inclusive play and activity experiences for children and young people.  Volunteers will contribute to promoting children's wellbeing in line with health & social care standards and Kilmarnock's YMCA's safeguarding responsibilities. Camp volunteers play an important role in helping children enjoy play, promoting wellbeing and ensuring everyone feels valued and included.",
