            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/001QD000011BtYBYA0/east-ayrshire-womens-aid",
            "name": "East Ayrshire Womens Aid",
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000JfqxNYAR",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000JfqxNYAR/volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-11-09",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-05-10",
                    "title": "Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nEast Ayrshire Women's Aid is seeking  new women Directors to join our Board at a crucial time for our organisation and the communities we serve. Every day, women, children and young people across East Ayrshire rely on our support to rebuild their live after domestic abuse.  By joining our Board, you can play a vital role in ensuring these essential services remain strong, sustainable and responsive to local needs. We are looking for women who are:\r\n\r\nPassionate about supporting women, children and young people;\r\nCommitted to equality, dignity and social justice; \r\nReady to contribute their skills, ideas and lived experiences and\r\nInterested in helping a respected local charity make a lasting difference.\r\n\r\nNo previous experience is required.  We will provide full training, guidance and support to help you succeed in this role.\r\n\r\nPVG Disclosure required.  Women only may apply under the Genuine Occupational Requirement provisions of Schedule 9, Equality Act 2010.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000JfqxNYAR#role",
