                    "title": "Family Wellbeing Assistants",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nA level 1 Disclosure criminal record check through the Church of Scotland needs to be undertaken for this volunteering role.\n\n## Description\n\nWe help around 100 people look after their wellbeing every week.  We are looking for suitable people with experience to join our teams in assisting in the delivery of our activities.  Based out of John Knox Church on the High Street in Stewarton, we provide activities open to all that support physical, mental, emotional and spiritual health needs.  Our Christian ethos emphasizes virtues such as love, humility, mercy, kindness, integrity and service to others.",
