                    "description": "## Description\n\nPolice Scotland Youth Volunteers (PSYV) Ayrshire are looking for enthusiastic Adult Volunteers to join our Cumnock group. As an Adult Volunteer, you will help support our Youth Volunteers, develop their skills, and play a vital role in your local community.\r\nYou must be 18 or over and full training will be provided- no previous experience required.\r\n\r\nIf you would like to get involved, please e-mail: ayrshirepsyv@scotland.police.uk",
