            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000GXO3xYAH",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000GXO3xYAH/volunteer-coaches-and-judges-for-arrows-trampoline-club-aberdeen",
                    "publishStart": "2026-09-30",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-24",
                    "title": "Volunteer Coaches and Judges for Arrows Trampoline Club (Aberdeen)",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nBased at Aberdeen Sports Village, Arrows Trampoline Club offers training for trampolinists of all levels, from beginners to those competing at an advanced standard.  The Club is currently seeking enthusiastic volunteers to train for coaching and judging roles.  No previous sporting or judging experience is necessary as full training and support will be provided.\r\n\r\nThese will be rewarding roles as they offer the opportunity to help young people develop and strengthen their trampolining skills.\r\n\r\nIf you would like to make a difference and are able to make a regular commitment, Arrows Trampoline Club would love to hear from you.  Please contact us at email chair.arrowstc@gmail.com  to find out more about the Club and to discuss the volunteering positions that we can offer.\n\n## Training details\n\nFull training and support will be provided for both coaching and judging roles. The training will be structured and will involve undertaking courses and mentoring will be provided by the Club's Head Coach.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nArrows Trampolining Club training sessions take place at Aberdeen Sports Village at the following times:\r\n\r\nSunday - 2pm to 5pm\r\nThursday - 6.30pm to 8.30pm\n\n## Travel details\n\nArrows Trampolining Club training sessions take place at Aberdeen Sports Village at the following times:\r\n\r\nSunday - 2pm to 5pm\r\nThursday - 6.30pm to 8.30pm\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nApproved expenses will be reimbursed on presentation of receipts and a mileage allowance will also be provided.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F7fe1fe95-f919-4f1f-85c5-aa67752a0310%2FiT4smfGSiRbx4weWFlMeQDJzcsE3%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=a807560c-f74e-4baa-a897-feae707419b3",
