                    "title": "Community Fridge Volunteer (Barra)",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nVolunteers are needed to help at the local Community Fridge.  The community fridge  provides free food, with the ethos to provide sustainable, food provision that minimises plastic and food waste .  The role would involve collecting surplus food from the local food store, sorting end dates  and stocking the shelves.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo experience required.",
