                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000BNZDGYA5",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000BNZDGYA5/day-group-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2025-08-06",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-04",
                    "title": "Day Group Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nTo support OPEKA staff in the running of the groups with a focus on helping the service users to engage in the activities as much as possible:\r\n\r\n* To help participants engage in activities\r\n* Socialise with the participants\r\n* Help with the set up for the activities and tidying afterwards\r\n* Taking register of all participants in attendance\r\n\r\nPVG membership required.\n\n## Travel details\n\nCarswell Centre, Eaglesham and The Prince & Princess of Wales Hospice, Bellahouston.",
