            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/001QD00000gfiL3YAI/the-hive-kirkcaldy",
            "name": "The Hive Kirkcaldy",
            "description": "The Hive Kirkcaldy is a community hub based in Kirkcaldy, Fife.\r\nWe are non-discriminatory and welcome everyone. We provide vital support services to the community and will always be a safe and affirmative place.\r\n\r\nThe Hive Kirkcaldy would like to continue to support the local community as we have done for the past 19 months under Love and Harmony CIC.\r\n\r\nWe are committed to improving the lives of local people by offering services that help with cost of living, health and wellbeing, isolation reduction and food poverty.",
