            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000JI2oVYAT",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000JI2oVYAT/machair-symposium-week-volunteers-barra",
                    "publishStart": "2026-11-02",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-11-20",
                    "title": "Machair Symposium Week Volunteers (Barra)",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nVolunteers are needed for a variety of roles during Machair Symposium Week in Barra and Vatersay.  We are needing volunteers to help with the following roles:\r\n\r\nThursday 19th November\r\n\r\nMorning:  Note takers, conversation facilitators,  organise tea and coffee stations and and dishwashers and general management of people.\r\n\r\nAfternoon: Setting up for evening meal\r\nEvening:  Setting up for Ceilidh\r\n\r\nFriday 20th November\r\n\r\nAfternoon: Note takers and conversation facilitators.\r\n \r\nA driver is also required to drive a 17 seater minibus during the week activities.  Volunteers MUST be resident on Barra or Vatersay to volunteer for the above roles.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo experience required.",
