                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Community Support Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nTo help strip cast iron railings around the park and repaint same as a community project as our park will be 100 years old in September 2026. This is not a council owned park but was donated to Newtongrange via Miners Fund in 2926.\r\nIf you have any free time please get in touch.\n\n## Experience required\n\nTo be physically able to manage the effort to strip down the railings and a basic painting ability.\n\n## Training details\n\nVolunteers will be shown how to safely carry out the work and full PPE will be provided.\n\n## Travel details\n\nLocal bus routes",
