            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000IW6kfYAD",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000IW6kfYAD/volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-15",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-15",
                    "title": "Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAs a volunteer you could find yourself helping girls learn about stars, campaign for women’s rights, go camping or even travel abroad. In return, Girlguiding look after volunteers with dedicated support, training and skills development.\r\n\r\nThe role of the volunteers includes helping to plan and run activities with the girls, keep the finances and records up to date, and share with the world what guiding is all about.",
