                        "description": "Organisation, team working, creative, fun and inspiring. We are open to anyone who has their own expertise they can bring to the role, such as arts, outdoors",
                        "applyLink": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000BXImDYAX/unit-leaderassistant-leaders-and-young-leaders?#modal_register_a0gQD00000BXImDYAX",
