                    "publishStart": "2026-09-01",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-23",
                    "title": "Fundraising Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nCycling Without Age, a worldwide movement that aims to provide joy and vitality to all through the magic of bicycle rides. Through the simple act of sharing a bike ride, it weaves a sense of community and gathers unique and invaluable stories, unlocked only by the wind and wheels.\r\nFundraising organiser would be responsible for coming up with Fundraising ideas, coordinate with committee and volunteers for the Chapter to ensure funds come in to support our work.\r\nA great way to support people in the local area to get out and enjoy some time in the community and the wind in their hair.\n\n## Training details\n\nAll volunteers will receive initial health and safety training.\r\nContinued support from the committee",
