            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/001QD00000OoDxEYAV/olivers-army-assistance-and-therapy-dogs",
            "name": "Oliver's Army Assistance and Therapy Dogs",
            "description": "We support you to train your very own Assistance dog.  With weekly classes to attend, with your dog, we support dog owners to train their own dogs to become Fully Trained Assistance Dogs! \r\n\r\nWe also support training of Therapy Dogs as well as help with Basic Training through the Kennel Club.\r\n\r\nWe are about dog training but we also provide people with social activities and a mental health drop in to support you and your family with other needs as well.",
