                        "title": "Youth Voice Volunteers",
                        "description": "You do not need to live with type 1 diabetes to volunteer for us, just a keen interest to learn and develop.\r\n\r\nWe have various volunteering opportunities so they can be tailormade to your time, availability and interests.",
