                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000006FrtNYAS/volunteer-assistant-facilitator-online",
                    "publishStart": "2024-10-22",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-11-27",
                    "title": "Volunteer Assistant Facilitator - online",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nScottish Women's Autism Network (SWAN) - Shetland group is seeking an autistic facilitator (woman/non-binary person) over 18 years old to help run our groups! We provide peer support and a welcoming community. \r\nWhat will I be doing?\r\nHelping the facilitator run monthly online social meet up groups for autistic women and non-binary people aged 18 years and over.\r\nThis involves monitoring the chat during the meeting\r\nNo experience needed as full training given\r\nWhat skills do I need?\r\nLived experience as an autistic person (diagnosed or self diagnosed) woman or non-binary person\n\n## Experience required\n\nMust have lived experience either as a self-diagnosed or diagnosed autistic.  Open to women and non-binary people.\n\n## Travel details\n\nOnline so volunteer can take part remotely.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
