                    "publishStart": "2024-10-22",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-05",
                    "title": "Maybole Mavericks",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nA wide range of volunteer opportunities in and around the Maybole community.\n\n## Description\n\nWorking with the local community, the Maybole Regeneration Project seeks to create an even better town with restored historic buildings, a greater sense of place and civic pride, a strong local economy and a thriving town centre that will better service the local community, businesses and visitors.\r\n\r\nWe are currently looking for 'Maybole Maverick' volunteers.\r\n\r\nMain duties include:\r\nTour guiding\r\nLitter Picking\r\nSign Cleaning\r\nMaintenance\r\nEvent assisting\r\nGardening\r\n\r\nWould you like to do your bit for the town and show everyone that this is a great place to live and work?\r\nFor more information contact \r\nmaybolemavericks@gmail.com\n\n## Experience required\n\nFull training will be given",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F7b8c407c-9793-4cec-8f8f-2dea0c30090c%2F0nFCUqNjeiXPIFO483j0BVWArU43%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=ae446e7a-7c5b-4bec-ae56-e86e042bab88",
