                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000Ak6uHYAR",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000Ak6uHYAR/ride-leader",
                    "publishStart": "2025-07-04",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-01",
                    "title": "Ride Leader",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nYou will be a volunteer who will attend and assist the ride captain on the led cycles that we do as part of the cycling club we run, usually twice weekly, an evening ride on a Wednesday and a session on a Saturday.  These will be primarily mountain biking with gravel rides also playing a part.\r\n\r\nYou will also assist the team in doing inductions for new riders, which will involve setting up ramps, courses, running games and assisting kids over obstacles.  Of course what you helped set up has to be taken down as well.\r\n\r\nPVG membership is required.\n\n## Travel details\n\nThe Bike Hub, Cowan Park, Barrhead, G78 1SS",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2Fff952d1c-b74b-4e1e-8a8a-7aa3f16690c5%2FyKvNsCtq9ZNPsjkwuXTxwxTv3Tx2%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=bd8909b5-551b-48ad-9e0e-9caba8212e0b",
