            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/00124000018ObfVAAS",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/00124000018ObfVAAS/the-bite-and-blether-lunch-club",
            "name": "The Bite and Blether Lunch Club",
            "description": "To reduce social isolation in older people in the Vale of Leven",
            "cause": [
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/OlderPeople",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Older People"
                }
            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g24000007TS23AAG",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g24000007TS23AAG/server-and-chatting",
                    "publishStart": "2023-05-16",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-14",
                    "title": "Server and Chatting",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nTo reduce social isolation in older people within the Vale of Leven\n\n## Description\n\nWe are looking for someone to come along to our lunch club to serve lunch to our guests. Duties include setting the tables, collecting meals from the kitchen and serving them to the table, clearing the tables when the meal is finished, keeping the work surfaces clean and tidy. Whilst serving we expect people to have a chat with our guests, making sure that they have everything they need and are enjoying their meal, we hope that people will strike up a good relationship with our guests and are able to talk about many different topics.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo Experience Necessary but the ability to serve meals and chat with our guests is an advantage\n\n## Training details\n\nHealth & Hygiene Training\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFrom 11.30am until 3pm on the 1st and 3rd Wednesday of the month\n\n## Travel details\n\nBased in Alexandria Parish church\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nNot available at the moment",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
