                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g24000007TRx4AAG",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g24000007TRx4AAG/cook",
                    "publishStart": "2023-05-16",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-07",
                    "title": "Cook",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nTo reduce social isolation in older people within the Vale of Leven\n\n## Description\n\nWe are looking for someone to come along to our lunch club to prepare nutritious food for our guests. Duties include preparation of ingredients, peeling potatoes, vegetables and meat, plating up meals once they are cooked and keeping the work surfaces clean and tidy, loading the dishwasher once the plates and cutlery have been returned to the kitchen area, leaving the kitchen in a good condition on finish.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo Experience Necessary but the ability to cook meals from scratch is an advantage\n\n## Training details\n\nHealth & Hygiene Training\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFrom 10am until 3pm on the 1st and 3rd Wednesday of the month\n\n## Travel details\n\nBased in Alexandria Parish church\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nNot available at the moment",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
