                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HpvC9YAJ",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HpvC9YAJ/lighthouse-charity-client-services-support-helpline-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-07-31",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-29",
                    "title": "Lighthouse Charity Client Services Support - Helpline volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAs a Client Services Helpline Volunteer, you will play an important role in supporting the delivery of our services. Working within a compassionate and inclusive environment, you’ll help provide high quality, person centred support to individuals seeking guidance, information, or reassurance.\r\n\r\nThis role involves:\r\n•\tSupporting callers on our helpline\r\n•\tRecording information accurately\r\n•\tSignposting to relevant partner services\r\n•\tWorking collaboratively within a supportive team environment\r\n\r\nWe ideally ask for a commitment of one 4 hour shift per week, although we do appreciate that this may not always fit around everyone’s circumstances. This is a remote volunteering position.\n\n## Experience required\n\n•\tEmpathy\r\n•\tLead with Integrity\r\n•\tOffer Support\r\n•\tShows Commitment\r\n•\tValue Teamwork\r\n•\tAre Open to Learning\r\nNo previous experience is required – empathy, reliability, and an ability to listen, along with a genuine desire to help are what matter most.\n\n## Training details\n\nFull training is provided which consists of initial e-learning, then a weeklong virtual training session led by a dedicated member of the team.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nWe ask for a commitment of 4 hours per week, shifts are agreed in advance. Our Helpline runs 24/7.\n\n## Travel details\n\nnot required\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nnot required - home based opportunity.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2Ffa15a7a6-56ba-43c3-9292-447f02b0f89a%2Fm5KbcSc6IkV0T0LHkiDoDEYTyhB2%2Fheader.jpg?alt=media&token=8dc9e622-f0a5-48f1-95be-2b143c4d6265",
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HpvC9YAJ#role",
