                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-05",
                    "title": "Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe are so excited to be opening our doors to a new Community Cafe- a warm, welcoming space for everyone to gather, chat, and enjoy good food and company.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for friendly, enthusiastic volunteers to help with serving, hosting, making drinks, and keeping the space running smoothly.  No experience needed- just a big smile and a willingness to help.",
