                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000Hpew5YAB",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000Hpew5YAB/station-administrator",
                    "publishStart": "2026-07-30",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-28",
                    "title": "Station Administrator",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nYou can support the smooth day-to-day running of Heartsong Live through admin support.\n\n## Description\n\nHeartsong Live is an innovative, community-focused Christian radio station committed to amplifying voices and enhancing lives. Inspired by their Christian values, they create uplifting radio programmes, podcasts and community initiatives that bring hope, encouragement and practical support to people from all walks of life.\r\n\r\nYou can support the smooth day-to-day running of Heartsong Live by coordinating station operations and ensuring programmes, playlists and schedules are kept up to date. The role will involve maintaining programme schedules, broadcast calendars, presenter rotas, and studio bookings; liaising with presenters; maintaining station records; monitoring general enquiries; and preparing meeting agendas.\r\n\r\nVolunteering with Heartsong Live is more than giving your time. It is an opportunity to develop new skills, gain valuable experience and become part of a team that is passionate about making a positive difference through media.\n\n## Experience required\n\nHeartsong radio is looking for volunteers who are organised and reliable, enjoy admin and organisation, have good communication skills, and are confident in using Microsoft Office or Google Workspace. Volunteers should respect and support Heartsong Live’s Christian ethos and values.\n\n## Training details\n\nA full induction will be provided. Ongoing support is available from the Heartsong Live team and project coordinator.\n\n## Travel details\n\nThis role can be carried out remotely, with opportunities to attend broadcasts, meetings, training sessions and community events throughout the year.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nExpenses can be discussed on an individual basis.",
