                    "description": "## Description\n\nCumnock Angling Club\r\n\r\nVolunteer: We are looking for volunteers to help with selling tickets, general maintenance and assisting the committee members to run the club.\r\n\r\nIf you can spare a few hours each week the committee would like to meet you. \r\n\r\nAnyone interested can go along to the club this Saturday, August 1 from 10am or contact the Commitee via the Cumnock Angling",
