                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HpwMjYAJ/section-team-members",
                    "publishStart": "2026-07-31",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-29",
                    "title": "Section Team Members",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nTo contribute to the development of young people so they achieve their full potential, advance education,\r\nand promote citizenship and community development\r\nWorking with young people to learn skills for life and get new life experiences.\n\n## Experience required\n\nPeople looking for early year/childcare/outdoor education experience.\n\n## Training details\n\nInitial online learning modules including safety & safeguarding, basic leader learning with opportunities to complete further learning and even external qualifications in first aid, outdoor activities etc.\n\n## Travel details\n\nLenzie",
