            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000IaOB7YAN",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000IaOB7YAN/fundraising-support-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-19",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-16",
                    "title": "Fundraising Support volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nFundraising Support volunteer\n\n## Description\n\nWe are seeking a passionate and motivated Volunteer Fundraiser to support our fundraising efforts and help make a meaningful difference. The role involves raising awareness\n\nkey Responsibilities\n\n\n\tAssist with planning and delivering fundraising events and campaigns.\n\tBuild relationships with supporters, local businesses, and community organizations.\n\tPromote fundraising activities through social media and community networks.\n\tHelp identify new fundraising opportunities and sponsorships.\n\tSupport donation collection and record-keeping where required.\n\n\nSkills and Qualities\n\n\n\tEnthusiastic and committed to supporting our cause.\n\tStrong communication and people skills.\n\tGood organizational abilities and attention to detail.\n\tComfortable working independently and as part of a team.\n\n\nIf you are interested, please click the &lsquo;Apply&rsquo; button below (available when logged in and registered). The coordinator will then contact you by email or phone call. If you have not heard back after 5 working days, the first step is to contact the organisation with the contact details provided. You could also check your junk/spam folder for your emails, just in case the response is there. If that doesn&rsquo;t work out, then please feel free to contact Volunteer Glasgow at&nbsp;info@volunteerglasgow.org\n\n&nbsp;\n\n&nbsp;\n\n## Experience required\n\nShare your professional knowledge, personal experience or hobbies to support a cause you care about.",
