            "name": "Belmont Community Cinema",
            "description": "The ccharities objects are: The advancement of the Arts & Culture and the advancement of Education in furtherance of this by; i) Procuring and operating for the public benefit the Belmont Cinema in the City of Aberdeen ii) Promoting cinema screenings and other artistic events in the Belmont Cinema iii) Promoting education, film making and training iv) Working in partnership with other bodies to achieve the purposes.",
            "website": "https://belmontcinema.co.uk/",
