                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000Fv6T3YAJ/members",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-25",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-22",
                    "title": "𝐏𝐫𝐨𝐣𝐞𝐜𝐭 𝐁𝐨𝐚𝐫𝐝 Members",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nJ𝐨𝐢𝐧 𝐨𝐮𝐫 𝐛𝐨𝐚𝐫𝐝... \r\n\r\nWe're seeking two new members to join our 𝐏𝐫𝐨𝐣𝐞𝐜𝐭 𝐁𝐨𝐚𝐫𝐝 as we move forward with the next phase of our redevelopment, supported by The National Lottery Heritage Fund. \r\n\r\nWe are particularly interested in individuals with 𝐞𝐱𝐩𝐞𝐫𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐢𝐧 𝐡𝐞𝐫𝐢𝐭𝐚𝐠𝐞 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐜𝐨𝐧𝐬𝐭𝐫𝐮𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 who can provide strategic insight as we deliver this important stage of the project. \r\n\r\nThis is an exciting opportunity to contribute your expertise to a significant cultural project, supporting the regeneration of Aberdeen’s only independent cinema. \r\n\r\nIf you would like to find out more or register your interest, please contact our CEO Matt Buchanan at email: matt.buchanan@belmontcinema.co.uk to discuss the opportunity further.\r\n\r\nMore information about the Belmont Community Cinema is also available at https://belmontcinema.co.uk/\n\n## Training details\n\nExcellent support and relevant guidance is provided to all volunteers.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible times available-all help greatly appreciated.",
