                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-13",
                    "title": "Event",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nAyr Town Hall 25/10/2026 6.30pm-9pm\r\nHope and Honey Ball 30/10/2026 6.30pm-10.30pm\n\n## Description\n\nWe have some exciting opportunities to join the Honeypot team and help us raise vital funds to support Scotland's young carers!\r\n\r\nWhether you can spare a few hours or simply want to get involved and have a fantastic evening, we would love to hear from you!",
