        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/001QD00000iAkmeYAC",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/001QD00000iAkmeYAC/4ward",
            "name": "4WARD",
            "description": "World's largest climate and sustainability network\r\nDriving real results through collaboration, community, and consultancy. Scaling global goals through local, measurable action.",
            "website": "https://www.4ward.earth/",
            "cause": [
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/EnvironmentRecycling",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Environment / Recycling"
                },
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/Volunteering",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Volunteering"
                }
            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000BoY6bYAF",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000BoY6bYAF/4ward-local-climate-leads",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "4WARD Local Climate Leads",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nBecome a 4WARD local city leader!\r\n\r\nWant to be an ambassador leading our local-to-global movement in your city? Love organizing events that bring together innovators, investors & thought leaders?\r\n\r\nJoin us in our mission to accelerate climate and sustainability impact locally (and globally) through networking, partnerships and spontaneous collaboration by leading our community & events in your city.\r\n\r\n-City Leads are responsible for:\r\n\r\n•\tFinding a fun venue for your meetups\r\n•\tHosting at least 6 events in your city per year (the more, the merrier)\r\n•\tPublishing your event via our dedicated Luma city calendar\r\n•\tPromoting your event to your network and local community (we'll help too!)\r\n•\tSharing your event in our local city WhatsApp group\r\n•\tGreeting guests creating a positive event & networking atmosphere\r\n•\tHaving fun (if you enjoy the event, others will as well :)\r\n\r\n-We empower City Leads with:\r\n\r\n•\tFlexible times to volunteer\r\n•\tHands-on training and community building guides\r\n•\tA personal 4WARD city events rep to help with events & promotion\r\n•\tA complete events and community management infrastructure\r\n•\tTools & templates to simplify hosting great events & community\r\n•\tA local sustainability WhatsApp group for your city\r\n•\tAccess to City Lead-only spaces and networking on 4WARD platform\r\n•\tRegular city lead meet & great networking calls with other regions\r\n•\tExposure & a premium City Lead badge on your community profile\r\n\r\nA fantastic opportunity to get involved and make a real difference. For more information please contact Alex Steel, Regional Lead Europe North at email: alex@4ward.earth or telephone: 07858138016\n\n## Description\n\nBecome a 4WARD local city leader!\r\n\r\nWant to be an ambassador leading our local-to-global movement in your city? Love organizing events that bring together innovators, investors & thought leaders?\r\n\r\nJoin us in our mission to accelerate climate and sustainability impact locally (and globally) through networking, partnerships and spontaneous collaboration by leading our community & events in your city.\r\n\r\n-City Leads are responsible for:\r\n•\tFinding a fun venue for your meetups\r\n•\tHosting at least 6 events in your city per year (the more, the merrier)\r\n•\tPublishing your event via our dedicated Luma city calendar\r\n•\tPromoting your event to your network and local community (we'll help too!)\r\n•\tSharing your event in our local city WhatsApp group\r\n•\tGreeting guests creating a positive event & networking atmosphere\r\n•\tHaving fun (if you enjoy the event, others will as well :)\r\n\r\n-We empower City Leads with:\r\n•\tFlexible times to volunteer\r\n•\tHands-on training and community building guides\r\n•\tA personal 4WARD city events rep to help with events & promotion\r\n•\tA complete events and community management infrastructure\r\n•\tTools & templates to simplify hosting great events & community\r\n•\tA local sustainability WhatsApp group for your city\r\n•\tAccess to City Lead-only spaces and networking on 4WARD platform\r\n•\tRegular city lead meet & great networking calls with other regions\r\n•\tExposure & a premium City Lead badge on your community profile\r\n\r\nA fantastic opportunity to get involved and make a real difference. For more information please contact Alex Steel, Regional Lead Europe North at email: alex@4ward.earth or telephone: 07858138016\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible times to volunteer-all help greatly appreciated.",
