            "name": "1st East Kilbride Scout Group",
            "description": "The Group run two Beaver Colonies, three Cub Packs and two Scout Troops from their HQ at Park Terrace. Westmains, East Kilbride. We believe that through adventure we challenge individuals so that they learn and experience new things that enrich their lives",
