        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/001QD00000jZDdGYAW",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/001QD00000jZDdGYAW/go-flourish",
            "name": "Go Flourish",
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000C7m5pYAB",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000C7m5pYAB/volunteer-outdoor-teaching-assistant",
                    "publishStart": "2025-09-16",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-23",
                    "title": "Volunteer Outdoor Teaching Assistant",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nDo you like working with children and enjoy being outside? We are looking for some help with our outdoor teaching sessions at North Kessock Primary School. \r\n\r\nThe classes are taught by Laura, the Go Flourish Liaison Teacher and support curriculum learning. Having extra help will allow the classes to be split into smaller groups, which help to nurture the children's time spent hands-on gardening. \r\n\r\nGardening knowledge isn't essential as all instructions will be given by Laura. Enthusiasm, patience and an ability to work as part of a team and use your own initiative are key for this role. \r\n\r\nAs this volunteer role involves working with children in schools, we will need to carry out a PVG Disclosure Scotland Check. There is no fee attached but we will need to work with you to gather the necessary information and IDs etc. before starting.\r\n\r\nPlease get in touch with lyn@goflourishcharity.org if you would like to find out more information.\n\n## Training details\n\nNo formal training is provided but Laura is a fully qualified teacher and so a great opportunity to learn how to integrate the curriculum through nature based learning.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F2b799365-4714-4f4f-8aca-fbbbc7def491%2FJqK8q7mcUtcgywKvmhEW9RRQbgy1%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=c10d2ad4-5205-4f2c-9195-80659db20c30",
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000C7m5pYAB#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Volunteer Outdoor Teaching Assistant",
                        "applyLink": "http://www.goflourishcharity.org/",
                        "allowsRemoteParticipation": false,
                        "minimumAge": "18",
                        "reward": [
                            "https://ns.volunteeringdata.io/TrainingProvided"
                        ]
                    },
