            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000CMVPdYAP",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000CMVPdYAP/advocacy-and-peer-support-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-01",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-01",
                    "title": "Advocacy and Peer Support Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAdelphe is looking for advocacy and peer support volunteers to support women, carers, and families living with long-term conditions by offering advocacy, practical help, and peer encouragement.\r\n\r\nAdelphe works to empower women from ethnic minority backgrounds by providing tailored coaching, mentorship, and practical workshops that foster growth, professional success, and a strong sense of community, ensuring that every woman is seen, heard, and empowered.\r\nAdelphe is looking for advocacy and peer support volunteers to support women, carers, and families living with long-term conditions by offering advocacy, practical help, and peer encouragement.\r\n\r\nThe main duties are to:\r\n-Accompany participants to health or service appointments.\r\n-Offer befriending and peer support.\r\n-Help facilitate group sessions and monthly workshops.\r\n-Provide practical assistance such as errands.\r\n\r\nAs an Adelphe volunteer, you can gain experience in advocacy, have the opportunity to support people with lived experience, and build valuable skills for careers in health, care or community roles.\n\n## Experience required\n\n-Empathy and patience.\r\n-Good listening skills.\r\n-Understanding of challenges faced by carers and people with long-term conditions.\r\n-Reliable and discreet.\n\n## Training details\n\nVolunteers will receive an induction to Adelphe, and will have ongoing support from other members of the team.\n\n## Travel details\n\nAdelphe will match volunteers with women in their local area, as far as possible.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nExpenses can be discussed on a 1-1 basis.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000CMVPdYAP#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Advocacy and Peer Support Volunteer",
