                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000CMV33YAH",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000CMV33YAH/events-support-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-01",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-01",
                    "title": "Events Support Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nAdelphe Connect is looking for volunteers to support their events and summits, helping create welcoming, impactful experiences for participants.\n\n## Description\n\nAdelphe Connect develops and delivers community projects specifically designed to uplift women, and foster a community where health, confidence and opportunity intersect. They work closely with ethnic minority women to offer customised support.\r\n\r\nAdelphe Connect is looking for volunteers to support their events and summits, helping create welcoming, impactful experiences for participants. Your role will be to:\r\nAssist with event set up\r\nRegister participants\r\nSupport with hosting the event\r\nPack away at the end of the event\r\n\r\nAs an Adelphe Connect volunteer, you can be part of a friendly team, you can make a difference in your local community, and you can gain experience in event management.\n\n## Experience required\n\n●\tOutgoing and confident with people.\r\n●\tOrganised and reliable.\r\n●\tAble to volunteer in busy event environments.\r\n●\tTeam player.\n\n## Training details\n\nVolunteers will receive an induction to Adelphe, and will have ongoing support from other members of the team.\n\n## Travel details\n\nEvents can happen anywhere within the Fife area, or in the Edinburgh and Lothians area. Volunteers can get involved locally to them.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nExpenses can be discussed on a 1-1 basis.",
