                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000CfabhYAB/volunteer-shop-assistant",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-27",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-15",
                    "title": "Volunteer Shop Assistant",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe’re looking for a friendly and reliable person to join our small, creative team at Creative Recycling Limited!\r\n\r\nYour role will include: – Welcoming and assisting customers with a smile – Handling simple sales and transactions – Supporting creative projects and everyday shop tasksAs a valued volunteer, you’ll be treated with respect and dignity. We’ll reimburse out-of-pocket expenses such as bus fares, and you’ll have the opportunity to get involved in fun, creative shop activities — from seasonal window displays to arranging themed layouts.\r\n\r\nWe’d love to hear from friendly, easy-going individuals who enjoy working with people and can contribute both independently and as part of a team. Some customer service experience would be an advantage, but enthusiasm and a love of creativity are just as important!",
