            "name": "Scottish Old People's Assembly - SOPA (Midlothian)",
            "description": "The Scottish Older People’s Assembly exists to give a strong voice to older people about their experience of life in Scotland, the challenges they face, and mission concerns they have, and to celebrate the positive contribution that older people make to society.\r\nOur main aims are:\r\n• To facilitate and empower older people to have their voices heard.\r\n• To influence policy and practice on issues relating to older people, age and ageing.",
            "website": "https://sopa.scot/",
            "charityRegistration": [
                {
                    "registrar": "https://www.oscr.org.uk",
                    "registrationNumber": "SC046520"
