            "name": "Lothians Community Event First Aid",
            "description": "We are a non for profit first aid provider, who provides first aiders for organisations who are organising small to medium community events that require first aid medical cover to comply with the terms of their insurance provider. We provide all the necessary training for volunteers to become a first aider for Lothians Community Event First Aid. This will help to give volunteers additional knowledge and skills or add to existing skills also help with improving confidence. The aim of our organisation is to help take the strain from the NHS by providing on site treatment to any casualty that presents to a first aider at the event.\r\nAll new volunteers would be teamed with two trained first aider during training.",
