            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000D4HAsYAN",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000D4HAsYAN/scout-group-volunteers",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-25",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-22",
                    "title": "Scout Group Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\n*Volunteer Roles*\r\nCould you spare some time to support 1st Aberdeen in a voluntary capacity?\r\n\r\nWe are looking to appoint enthusiastic and dedicated individuals as Section Leaders for our Beaver (6–8 yrs) and Cub (8 - 10.5yrs) Groups.\r\n\r\nWe deliver a varied programme of both indoor and outdoor activities for young people, to help them build confidence, make friends, develop skills for the future and become great citizens in our local community.\r\n\r\nDo you love the great outdoors? Love a bit of arts and crafts? Want to feel part of a supportive community? Want to help young people develop transferable skills? Then we want to hear from you!!\r\n\r\nOur weekly Beaver sections run on Wednesday and Thursday evenings, and our Cub section on Tuesdays at our Scout Hut on Forest Avenue Lane, Aberdeen, AB15 4TW.\r\n\r\nWe occasionally run outings to our district campsite, Templars Park, or elsewhere in and around Aberdeen City.\r\n\r\nGet in touch with us by email today to find out more, and start your Scouting journey.  Please contact Hannah Clarke , Team Leader (Cubs) at email: firstabzgroup@gmail.com\r\n\r\nMore information on our sections can also be found here: https://www.scouts.org.uk/groups/10010867?loc=aberdeen&page=2&slug=1st-Aberdeen-Aberdeen-Grammar-School\n\n## Description\n\n*Volunteer Roles*:\r\n\r\nCould you spare some time to support 1st Aberdeen in a voluntary capacity?\r\n\r\nWe are looking to appoint enthusiastic and dedicated individuals as Section Leaders for our Beaver (6–8 yrs) and Cub (8 - 10.5yrs) Groups.\r\n\r\nWe deliver a varied programme of both indoor and outdoor activities for young people, to help them build confidence, make friends, develop skills for the future and become great citizens in our local community.\r\n\r\nDo you love the great outdoors? Love a bit of arts and crafts? Want to feel part of a supportive community? Want to help young people develop transferable skills? Then we want to hear from you!!\r\n\r\nOur weekly Beaver sections run on Wednesday and Thursday evenings, and our Cub section on Tuesdays at our Scout Hut on Forest Avenue Lane, Aberdeen, AB15 4TW.\r\n\r\nWe occasionally run outings to our district campsite, Templars Park, or elsewhere in and around Aberdeen City.\r\n\r\nGet in touch with us by email today to find out more, and start your Scouting journey.  Please contact Hannah Clarke , Team Leader (Cubs) at email: firstabzgroup@gmail.com\r\n\r\nMore information on our sections can also be found here: https://www.scouts.org.uk/groups/10010867?loc=aberdeen&page=2&slug=1st-Aberdeen-Aberdeen-Grammar-School\n\n## Training details\n\nExcellent support and relevant training is provided to all volunteers.\r\n\r\nAll roles in Scouts are subject to ongoing mandatory online training modules, which will run for as long as the individual holds their position in Scouting.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nOur weekly Beaver sections run on Wednesday and Thursday evenings, and our Cub section on Tuesdays at our Scout Hut on Forest Avenue Lane, Aberdeen, AB15 4TW.\r\n\r\nWe occasionally run outings to our district campsite, Templars Park, or elsewhere in and around Aberdeen City.\r\n\r\nMore information on our sections can be found here: https://www.scouts.org.uk/groups/10010867?loc=aberdeen&page=2&slug=1st-Aberdeen-Aberdeen-Grammar-School\r\n\r\nFlexible times available to suit volunteers. All help greatly appreciated.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F753f2f35-1395-4000-9c1c-9f7f3538ee91%2FVJht21C1wtZpEkxOo0bzChQ05d12%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=1f049a8c-26c0-4700-b19c-c31e2e394476",
