                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-29",
                    "title": "Repair Cafe Fixer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nOnce a month for a few hours on a Saturday morning fixing stuff.  Whatever our neighbours need sorted, toys, bikes, electronics, clothing rips and tears?  If you can fix anything and want to help local people to repair goods we would love to hear from you.\n\n## Experience required\n\nAbility to fix things.\r\nDesire to learn to fix things.",
