                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000Jf4BLYAZ/volunteer-lead",
                    "publishStart": "2026-11-09",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-05-10",
                    "title": "Volunteer Lead",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAre you an experienced volunteer leader who enjoys bringing people together, developing opportunities and making a difference in your community?  We're looking for a Volunteer Lead to help us strengthen, develop and grow our volunteer programme at Megan's Space.  We are looking for someone with proven experience leading and developing volunteers who can bring fresh ideas, enthusiasm and strong organisational skills to the role.  This role will be based at Megan's Space Head Office, Ballot Road, Irvine.  This permanent post will be 20 hours per week.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
