                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HQGiTYAX",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HQGiTYAX/the-music-rooms-host-booking-assistant",
                    "publishStart": "2026-06-23",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-22",
                    "title": "The Music Rooms Host & Booking Assistant",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nWe are looking for someone who is reliable, passionate about community and music, to help us keep The Music Rooms running smoothly. This role involves lone working, making it perfect for someone who wants to read, study or work using our free WiFi. Additional tasks, responsibilities and projects are available for candidates willing to expand their role. We look forward to hearing from you.\n\n## Description\n\nBe the friendly face of Forfar Music Group, ensuring our space is safe and welcoming for every booking.\r\nHow you will make a difference:\r\nWelcome & Access: Arrive 15 minutes early to open the building, set up equipment, and provide a warm welcome to our guests.\r\nSupport: Act as the go-to person for facilities (WiFi, lights, WC) and any questions during the session.\r\nSafety & Compliance: Ensure fire exits remain clear and any risk assessments are followed. As we carry full public liability insurance, you’ll help us maintain these high safety standards.\r\nData & Privacy: Handle any guest information with care, ensuring we remain GDPR compliant and maintain strict confidentiality regarding our bookings, guests and members.\r\nClosing Up: Tidy the space, store equipment safely, and ensure the building is locked up.\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in joining our team, please send a brief cover note and your CV to info@forfarmusicgroup.org. Or, alternatively, you can pop into our premises and fill out an application form.\r\nIn your application, please let us know:\r\n●\tWhy you are interested\r\n●\tAny experience you have with basic tech or equipment (though full training is provided)\r\n●\tYour general availability\n\n## Experience required\n\nTraining: Don’t worry if you aren’t a technical expert. We provide full training to ensure you are confident in:\r\n●\tOperating our specific lighting and security systems.\r\n●\tSetting up music equipment and how to pack away.\r\n●\tUnderstanding our safety protocols.\n\n## Training details\n\nTraining: Don’t worry if you aren’t a technical expert. We provide full training to ensure you are confident in:\r\n●\tOperating our specific lighting and security systems.\r\n●\tSetting up music equipment and how to pack away.\r\n●\tUnderstanding our safety protocols.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F44a863c8-a809-49d9-95d5-5303a905651c%2F7HnVR4w7ogcOWRip5OnuXQp8T2f1%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=0515892c-9c27-4370-b428-b147cada994f",
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HQGiTYAX#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "The Music Rooms Host & Booking Assistant",
