            "name": "Next Chapter Scotland",
            "website": "https://opportunities.volunteerglasgow.org/profile/NextChapterScotland",
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000H4m4HYAR",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000H4m4HYAR/copy-outreach-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-06-01",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-11-28",
                    "title": "COPY - Outreach Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nCOPY - Outreach Volunteer\n\n## Description\n\n<p>We&rsquo;re looking for compassionate, reliable volunteers to join our Next Chapter Scotland Outreach team in Glasgow. This service supports people and families affected by the justice system offering information, advocacy and a listening ear when it&rsquo;s needed most.</p>\n\n<p>What&rsquo;s involved:<br />\nWe are looking for volunteers to promote our service in various community venues across Glasgow.</p>\n\n<p><br />\n- Two full days of initial training<br />\n- Ongoing support and optional further training if you&rsquo;d like to grow your role<br />\n- Lived experience of the criminal justice system (your own or through a family) is especially valued<br />\n- No PVG required</p>\n\n<p>You&rsquo;ll be part of a supportive, trauma-informed team helping people take the next step in their journey.</p>\n\n<p>If you&rsquo;d like to learn more or get involved, send us a message or email info@nextchapterscotland.org.uk</p>\n\n<p>If you are interested, please click the &lsquo;Apply&rsquo; button below (available when logged in and registered). The coordinator will then contact you by email or phone call. If you have not heard back after 5 working days, the first step is to contact the organisation with the contact details provided. You could also check your junk/spam folder for your emails, just in case the response is there. If that doesn&rsquo;t work out, then please feel free to contact Volunteer Glasgow at&nbsp;<u><a href=\"mailto:info@volunteerglasgow.org\">info@volunteerglasgow.org</a></u></p>\n\n## Experience required\n\nA friendly, inclusive attitude.\n\n## Travel details\n\nTravel expenses are available where required.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel expenses are available where required.",
