                    "publishStart": "2026-06-02",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-01",
                    "title": "Director",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe are currently seeking individuals with experience as a Director, or with a strong background in finance or fundraising, to join our organisation as Volunteer Directors. \r\nThis is a valuable opportunity to contribute to the strategic direction of a small non-profit supporting adults with learning disabilities, autism, and mental health challenges. \r\nThe role involves attending quarterly board meetings and supporting the continued growth and sustainability of the organisation. \r\nWe also make use of the skills and talents of our trainees to provide free services to vulnerable individuals within the local community. This approach not only supports those in need but also provides meaningful, real-world experience for the people we support, helping them to build confidence, develop skills, and contribute positively to society.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2Fce043875-4169-4121-8a8a-668af2a62543%2FxxymN99P34NhsjAgh9k3z5xnvpz1%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=512479bd-2f51-4393-85fa-e5dfb732ea27",
