                        "description": "No previous trustee experience is required as support will be provided. Knowledge and experience of HR/people management, funding applications, finance, governance, marketing, compliance or digital skills would be beneficial.\r\n\r\n\r\nA passion for mental health and wellbeing, a desire to support people in need, reliable with the ability to act with integrity and use a thoughtful, supportive approach, think collaboratively and contribute to group discussions",
