                    "title": "Minute Taker",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nSave Ardrossan Harbour whose, aim is to keep Ardrossan Harbour as the main port for access to Arran. We are looking for someone to come along to our monthly meetings, which take place every second Tuesday of the Month from 7-9pm.\r\nWe are a friendly bunch and will make you feel welcome. Tea and  facilities are available.",
