            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HI5x7YAD",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HI5x7YAD/forensic-advocacy-admin-assistant-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-06-15",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-07",
                    "title": "Forensic Advocacy Admin Assistant Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nForensic Advocacy Admin Assistant Volunteer\n\n## Description\n\nHelp ensure people in forensic settings feel heard and supported. This role supports individuals at Rowanbank Clinic and Leverndale Hospital to express their views and access support.\n\nWhat you&rsquo;ll do:\n\n\n\tProvide administration and research support\n\tMaintain accurate and confidential records\n\tPrepare correspondence\n\tSupport organisation of advocacy information\n\n\nWhat you&#39;ll gain from volunteering in this role:&nbsp;\n\n\n\tExperience in forensic services\n\tInsight into advocacy work\n\tWork alongside professionals\n\n\nWe are looking for individuals with an interest in social care, psychology or legal setting, with good IT skills (Office 365), strong attention to detail, who are professional and reliable.&nbsp;\n\nIf you are interested,&nbsp;please click the &lsquo;Apply&rsquo; button below (available when&nbsp;registered and&nbsp;logged in). You&nbsp;will then be contacted by the coordinator by email or phone call. If you have not heard back after 5 working days, the first step is to contact the organisation with the contact details provided. You could also check your junk/spam folder on your emails just in case the response is there. If that&nbsp;doesn&rsquo;t&nbsp;work&nbsp;out,&nbsp;then please feel free to contact Volunteer Glasgow on&nbsp;info@volunteerglasgow.org.&nbsp;\n\n## Experience required\n\nSkills & Qualities:\nInterest in social care, psychology or legal setting\nGood IT skills (Office 365)\nStrong attention to detail\nProfessional and reliable\n\n## Travel details\n\nThis role is office based in Rowanbank Clinic with opportunities to shadow advocacy at Leverndale hospital in a low secure setting.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel if traveling between hospitals is able to be expensed for mileage.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
