                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HTQa1YAH",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HTQa1YAH/upholstery-and-sewing-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-06-26",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-25",
                    "title": "Upholstery and Sewing Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nHelp restore and repair donated furniture and textiles, enabling more items to be reused, resold and kept in circulation. This role supports our commitment to sustainability while helping us share practical repair skills with staff, volunteers and members of the community.\r\n\r\nTypical Tasks:\r\nUpholstery and furniture restoration projects \r\nSewing repairs and alterations \r\nAssessing suitable repair methods \r\nShare knowledge and practical skills with staff and volunteers where appropriate \r\nHelping maintain workshop equipment and materials\r\n\r\nBenefits:\r\nShare valuable practical skills \r\nWork on a variety of restoration projects \r\nSupport sustainability and waste reduction \r\nMeet like-minded people \r\nHelp preserve traditional repair skills\n\n## Training details\n\nSupport from workshop staff and volunteers, induction and health and safety briefing.\r\n\r\nPlease get in touch if you require any adjustments to help you volunteer with us.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F7ba6a0b3-f2ce-4cac-b737-5aab30e3ea94%2FaEKv1gVbL1YZDtwMaKysWqzShAg1%2Fheader.jpg?alt=media&token=890cabef-286c-44bd-9bd1-92ef19a0b59c",
