            "name": "Shotts Bon Accord Walking Football",
            "website": "https://vanl.teamkinetic.co.uk/profile/ShottsBonAccordWalkingFootball",
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HVu7NYAT",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HVu7NYAT/a-walking-football-volunteer-is-needed-to-support-and-facilitate-monday-evening-sessions-at-calderhead-high-school-in-shotts",
                    "publishStart": "2026-06-29",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-26",
                    "title": "A walking football volunteer is needed to support and facilitate Monday evening sessions at Calderhead High school in Shotts",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nA walking football volunteer is needed to support and facilitate Monday evening sessions at Calderhead High school in Shotts\n\n## Description\n\nWe&rsquo;re looking for volunteers to support our growing Walking Football group in Shotts. This is a great opportunity to get involved in a welcoming, community-focused football programme while supporting others to stay active and connected.\n\nSession Details:\nMonday evenings, 7:00pm &ndash; 9:00pm\nCalderhead High School\nDyfrig Street, Shotts, ML7 5ET\n\nWhat you&rsquo;ll do:\n\n\n\tHelp set up and support weekly walking football sessions\n\tAssist with delivering activities and encouraging participation\n\tProvide basic refereeing support during games\n\tHelp organise events and group activities\n\tTake part in sessions and learn more about the game\n\n## Experience required\n\nConfidence in engaging with groups\nStrong communication skills\nWillingness to support and encourage others\nA passion for football\n\n## Travel details\n\nBy Car:\nCalderhead High School is located on Dyfrig Street, Shotts. There is parking available on-site. The 3G pitches are located at the back of the school.\n\nBy Train:\nThe nearest station is Shotts Train Station, around a 10–15 minute walk from the school. Exit the station toward the town centre and follow signs toward Dyfrig Street.\n\nBy Bus:\nLocal bus services run through Shotts town centre. Most routes stop within a short walking distance of the school. From the main street, it’s appro\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTransport costs",
