                    "publishStart": "2026-07-10",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-08",
                    "title": "Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nHelp us grow trees to be planted along local riverbanks to shade, protect and feed endangered Atlantic Salmon and other vulnerable species of wildlife.\r\n- Hands on learning\r\n- Seed collecting\r\n- Seed sowing \r\n- Transplanting \r\n- Propagating cuttings \r\n- Tree identification \r\n- And various other fun activities!\r\n\r\nThe Tree Hatchery\r\nOpposite Gearrchoille wood car park. East of Ardgay A836. What 3 Words: ///such.helpful.flippers",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
