                    "publishStart": "2026-07-19",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-06",
                    "title": "Alva Glen monthly volunteer days",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nAlva Glen monthly volunteer days\n\n## Description\n\n<p>Join our team of wonderful volunteers to help take care of Alva Glen! Alva Glen Heritage Trust is a small, volunteer-led charity dedicated to caring for the gardens and wildlife of our beautiful Glen.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>We meet on the first Sunday of the month from 10am-12pm. Varied tasks we undertake include planting, painting, litter picking, tidying paths and much more!</p>\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo skills or experience needed",
