        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/001QD000016iFQWYA2",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/001QD000016iFQWYA2/jedburgh-food-bank",
            "name": "Jedburgh Food Bank",
            "description": "Charity foodbank operated by volunteers, and reliant on community donations, to serve people facing hard times in the Jedburgh and St Boswells area.",
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HnF7NYAV",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HnF7NYAV/jedburgh-food-bank-coordinator-role",
                    "publishStart": "2026-07-27",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-19",
                    "title": "Jedburgh Food Bank coordinator role.",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nJedburgh food bank delivers packages of food to individuals and families who have had a referral. The coordinator’s role is to pick up these referrals from recognised agencies, collate information, and pass this onto the delivery team. \nThere is no need to visit the food bank or deliver parcels.  This is a home based coordinator role.\n\n## Experience required\n\nPhone skills. people skills. Decision making.  The ability to manage an awkward situation. You will sometimes need to say no to people.\n\n## Training details\n\nWould be with another coordinator until confident, then there is always support.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\n1-2 hours work, from home, Monday - Friday ONE WEEK IN FOUR.\n\n## Travel details\n\nA car is not essential, this is a home based opportunity. The coordinator information and phone passes between the coordinators on a weekend, so some travel, or availability for collection is required.\n\n## Taster details\n\nWe can discuss the role over the phone, I can show you examples of the work.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-volunteerscotland-search.appspot.com/o/opportunities%2FsagYD9Czo1Rq5O2hBU83hHCzHbg2%2FeMFVr17vKu1fu14L-thumbnail.jpg?alt=media&token=d5c63c84-9bae-48d7-8f5c-fc02d6490dd4",
