            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HnmPtYAJ",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HnmPtYAJ/instructor",
                    "publishStart": "2026-07-22",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-20",
                    "title": "Instructor",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nDo you enjoy working with children? We have classes from 3 years to 6 years, then 7 years and older. We will train you for 3 months, once a week (either in class time or during instructor training).\n\n## Description\n\nDo you have martial arts experience? (If not, we give full training). Our curriculum involves basic kicks, punches and hand drills to begin with and gets a little more challenging as we climb the belt ladder.\r\n\r\nDo you enjoy working with children? We have classes from 3 years to 6 years, then 7 years and older.  We will train you for 3 months, once a week (either in class time or during instructor training). Training is fun and always held in a safe, comfortable environment. Then we can officially onboard you if both parties are happy to continue. \r\n\r\nAfter some training and class experience, you will be contributing to the flow of the class and if you so desire, we can bring the MF Martial Arts School to more children across Dundee and Angus together going forward. Keeping children off the street and helping them to value their own worth is what the MF Organisation is all about.\r\n\r\nAny expenses getting to and going back home will be covered.\n\n## Experience required\n\nSome martial arts preferred but full training given working with children and young people.\n\n## Training details\n\nTraining for Instructors is ongoing.\n\n## Travel details\n\nLocations - Farifield Community Sports Hub, Comrie Hall, Downfield Mains and Kingsmuir Hall.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nBus fares or mileage reimbursed,\n\n## Taster details\n\nCoffee first then come see our classes.",
