                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HngxBYAR",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HngxBYAR/class-host",
                    "publishStart": "2026-07-22",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-20",
                    "title": "Class Host",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nBecome a Class Host for MF Martial Arts.\n\n## Description\n\nIf you enjoy working with children, this role offers you the lightest admin work of helping younger students find their attendance cards and handing out information sheets to students and parents.\r\n\r\nDuring class time, you can gently remind young children of our rules (standing still during line work or reminding them of what they should be doing in class).\r\n\r\nIt would be great to have you at the table to deal with any late comers too so that the flow of the class can continue. Including letting students leave the hall for toilet breaks. \r\n\r\nWe are looking for somebody who really wants to bring joy into children’s lives. Just by having a happy personality and making children feel glad that they met you when they came to class can make all the difference to the children’s day.\r\n\r\nAll training will be provided. Training will not be ongoing as once you learn how to run the table; you don’t need further training.\n\n## Experience required\n\nShould enjoy working with children and young people. Some martial arts experience preferred but full training given.\n\n## Training details\n\nTraining is short term.\n\n## Travel details\n\nThis opportunity takes place at Fairfield Community Sports Hub, Comrie Hall, Downfield Mains and Kingsmuir Hall.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nBus fares or mileage reimbursed.\n\n## Taster details\n\nCoffee first then come see our classes.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HngxBYAR#role",
                        "type": "Role",
