                    "description": "## Description\n\nYou will be required to join us at various community litter pick-ups.  Greener Communities will provide: Litter pickers and Litter bags. We also arrange for any items to be uplifted and disposed of after such events or provide a skip if appropriate. We look forward to you joining us!",
