                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000EovPdYAJ/meeting-centre-volunteers",
                    "publishStart": "2026-01-19",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-19",
                    "title": "Meeting Centre Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe are looking for welcoming and compassionate volunteers to help create a warm, supportive and engaging environment for our members. Volunteers play a vital role in ensuring that everyone who attends feels valued, included and comfortable.\r\nWhat you will do:\r\nDepending on your interests and skills you may -\r\nSupport staff with group activities such as arts & crafts, games, music, or reminiscence\r\nHelp members if needed prepare teas & coffees etc\r\nSpend time chatting with members and building positive relationships\r\nAssist with tidying up activity spaces\r\nSupport staff during events or special activities including regular fundraising events\r\nHelp maintain a respectful, safe and dementia friendly environment\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo formal qualifications required. We are looking for volunteers who are:\r\nFriendly, patient and empathetic\r\nGood listeners with a positive attitude\r\nComfortable working as part of a team\r\nWilling to learn about dementia and person centred support\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nVolunteers can do as many hours as they can spare",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F403de282-aef4-4323-ac6c-95cced7cf15c%2FAGGDoBIya9c8SYitlOjP1PmfFRL2%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=96dd631b-d56c-4903-a387-ffdcd2c13286",
