                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-06",
                    "title": "VOLUNTEERS WANTED!",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nVOLUNTEERS WANTED!\n\n## Description\n\nAre you looking to make a difference in your community?\nJoin us at The Preshal Trust and become part of something meaningful!\n\nWe are a dedicated charity organization based in the heart of Govan, Glasgow and Paisley, committed to supporting our community through a wide range of services and activities.\n\n&lsquo;Preshal&rsquo; is the Gaelic for precious &ndash; and this is one of the key values that describes the care and support given to all people who access our services.??\n\n?? Our Centres Are Open:\n?? Govan: Monday to Friday, 9am&ndash;4pm\n?? Paisley: Monday, Wednesday &amp; Friday, 9am&ndash;4pm\n\n?? Visit our website: www.preshaltrust.org.uk\n\n?? Or check our previous posts to learn more about what we do.\n\nWe&#39;re currently looking for friendly, reliable volunteers to:\n? Help with day-to-day activities\n? Share your skills or lead fun, creative workshops\n\nIf you&#39;re interested or have ideas to support us, we&#39;d love to hear from you!\n\n?? Contact Us:\n?? Govan: 8 Aboukir Street, Glasgow, G51 4QX\n?? Paisley: 20 Neilston Road, PA2 6LN\n?? Email: admin@preshaltrust.org.uk\n\n?? Phone: 0141 445 3689\n?? DM us on Facebook or Instagram",
