                        "description": "•\tGood practical baking skills and confidence sharing them with others. \n•\tFriendly, patient and encouraging. \n•\tComfortable demonstrating and explaining baking techniques. \n•\tGood communication and people skills. \n•\tAble to create a welcoming and inclusive environment. \n•\tWilling to follow food hygiene and kitchen safety guidance. \n•\tReliable and available on Friday mornings. \n•\tEnthusiastic about helping others learn, participate and enjoy baking. \nYou don't need to be a professional b",
                        "applyLink": "https://opportunities.volunteerglasgow.org/volunteers/opportunity/10304498",
                        "allowsRemoteParticipation": false,
                        "minimumAge": "18"
