                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000Hu5UfYAJ",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000Hu5UfYAJ/receptionist-govan",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-13",
                    "title": "Receptionist (Govan)",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nReceptionist (Govan)\n\n## Description\n\nMake a difference in Govan with The Preshal Trust! Since 2002, The Preshal Trust has supported people in Govan and Paisley, helping to tackle social exclusion and build stronger, more connected communities.\n\nWe&rsquo;re looking for a friendly Volunteer Receptionist to be the welcoming face of our centre..\n\nYour role\n\nWelcome clients and visitors.\n\nManage sign-ins and sign-outs.\n\nShare information about our classes and activities.\n\nIntroduce new clients to the centre and help them feel at home.\n\nSupport our friendly, inclusive community.\n\nGive your time, meet new people and make a real difference. Join The Preshal Trust today!\n\nIf you are interested, please click the &lsquo;Apply&rsquo; button below (available when logged in and registered). You will then be contacted by the coordinator by email or phone call. If you have not heard back after 5 working days, the first step is to contact the organisation with the contact details provided. You could also check your junk/spam folder on your emails just in case the response is there. If that doesn&rsquo;t work out, then please feel free to contact Volunteer Glasgow on info@volunteerglasgow.org\n\n## Experience required\n\nwelcoming, professional, friendly\n\n## Travel details\n\nBuses and Underground links to Govan",
