                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-31",
                    "title": "Volunteer Drivers",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nVolunteer Drivers\n\n## Description\n\nAre you retired or do you have some spare time in your week? (Even just an hour?)\n\nAre you looking to do something new?\n\nWould you like to help your community?\n\ndo you like meeting new people?\n\nWe are looking for volunteer drivers to help us get the new Transport to Health service up and running\n\nWhat we are looking for volunteers do to?\n\nDrive North Lanarkshire residents to NHS hospital and health appointment\n\n&nbsp;\n\n## Experience required\n\nA clean full UK driving licence\nAccess to a Vehicle\nA willingness to help others",
