                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-26",
                    "title": "Dualathon Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nFully affiliated with Triathalon Scotland\n\n## Description\n\nMontrose Triathlon Club are looking for volunteers for the clubs annual Dualathon  at The House of Dun, Sunday 27th September 2026. The volunteer roles required are for the running and cycling routes, these are easy & fun, involving cheering and pointing participants in the right directions. Lunch will be provided for all volunteers. Contact Nicola via email at montrosetriathalon@outlook.com. Alongside your note of interest please include an email address, phone number, emergency contact including phone number.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNone required",
