        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/001QD000018xwJ5YAI",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/001QD000018xwJ5YAI/lochview-rural-training",
            "name": "Lochview Rural Training",
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HxlsLYAR",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HxlsLYAR/outdoors-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-09-01",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-02",
                    "title": "Outdoors Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAre you looking for a way to spend more time outdoors, enjoy the company of animals, meet new people?\r\n\r\nAt Lochview Rural Training we are looking for volunteers to join us. There is no minimum commitment and no expectation of regular attendance. \r\n\r\nBy volunteering with us, you can:\r\n- Spend time with our livestock\r\n- Help in our polytunnel and growing areas\r\n- Enjoy the fresh air \r\n- Take home some produce from the polytunnel\r\n- Create a new poultry area\r\n- Build raised veg beds\r\n- Design and build a new egg and produce honestly box \r\nEtc.\r\n\r\nCome and enjoy the outdoors, help create something special and be part of the Lochview Rural Training community\n\n## Training details\n\nA tour of the croft and a volunteer induction meeting",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
