            "name": "All Life Chances",
            "description": "All Life Chances fosters community connections in Aberdeen by offering professional, practical, and financial support to existing charities and groups across the city’s priority neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nWe help create community hubs, which support children, young people and their families in Aberdeen's most deprived areas. \r\n\r\nBy working with organisations across the private, public and third sectors, we can drive meaningful change, build stronger communities and improve lives.\r\n\r\nBy drawing on our collective skills and networks, we help ensure that vital resources reach those who need them most. Together, we can make a lasting impact and build a brighter future for all.",
