                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HyDobYAF",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HyDobYAF/lived-experience-panel-member",
                    "publishStart": "2026-09-02",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-01",
                    "title": "Lived Experience Panel Member",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nLived Experience Panel Member\n\n## Description\n\nAs a Lived Experience Panel Member with Visably, you&rsquo;ll use your experiences, ideas and perspective to help shape our services and future direction.\n\nWe&rsquo;re looking for people with lived experience of sight loss, as well as people with relevant experience of supporting someone living with sight loss. We want the panel to reflect a wide range of backgrounds, experiences and perspectives from across the UK.\n\nYou&rsquo;ll attend quarterly online meetings where you&rsquo;ll share your views, provide feedback on our services and ideas, and help us understand what matters to people living with sight loss.\n\nThere may also be occasional opportunities to provide feedback between meetings or represent lived experience in conversations with partners and other organisations.\n\nNo previous volunteering, panel or committee experience is required. We&rsquo;ll provide an induction, accessible information and ongoing support.\n\nThis is a remote role. Meetings are held quarterly and usually last approximately 1 to 1.5 hours.\n\n&nbsp;\n\n## Experience required\n\nLived experience of sight loss or relevant experience supporting someone living with sight loss; willing to share views and experiences; able to listen to different perspectives; constructive and respectful; understands confidentiality. No previous panel experience required.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HyDobYAF#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Lived Experience Panel Member",
                        "description": "Lived experience of sight loss or relevant experience supporting someone living with sight loss; willing to share views and experiences; able to listen to different perspectives; constructive and respectful; understands confidentiality. No previous panel experience required.",
