                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HyDa5YAF",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HyDa5YAF/home-visit-support-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-09-02",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-01",
                    "title": "Home Visit Support Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nHome Visit Support Volunteer\n\n## Description\n\nAs a Home Visit Support Volunteer with Visably, you&rsquo;ll help people living with sight loss feel more confident using technology in their own homes.\n\nYou&rsquo;ll visit people following an agreed referral or introduction from Visably and provide friendly, practical support based on their individual needs. This could include helping someone get more from their Visably equipment, listening to any additional support needs and making them aware of other support available through Visably.\n\nYou won&rsquo;t be expected to deal with everything yourself. You&rsquo;ll receive a full induction, role-specific training and ongoing support from the Visably team.\n\nThis is a flexible, community-based volunteering opportunity, with visits arranged around local need and your availability.\n\n&nbsp;\n\n&nbsp;\n\n## Experience required\n\nFriendly, patient and supportive; good listener and communicator; confident supporting people in their homes; reliable; respectful of confidentiality and individual choices; willing to follow safeguarding and lone-working procedures. No previous volunteering experience required.",
