                        "description": "We are looking for volunteers who are:\n\n* Caring, compassionate and approachable.\n* Reliable and committed to their volunteering.\n* Good listeners and communicators.\n* Respectful of different backgrounds, experiences and circumstances.\n* Able to maintain appropriate boundaries and confidentiality.\n* Comfortable working as part of a team.\n* Willing to learn and take part in relevant training.\n\nPrevious experience of working with children, families or within a community setting would be",
