            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000IPBu1YAH",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000IPBu1YAH/committee-secretary",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-08",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-08",
                    "title": "Committee secretary",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nCupar and district u3a is part of the UK wide u3a network and is one of over 1000 locally run u3as across the UK. Like all u3as, it is a voluntary organisation that provides retired and semi retired people with learning opportunities and social interaction and promotes physical and mental health and wellbeing through a wide range of activities and opportunities.\r\n\r\nThe organisation is managed by a small executive committee.\r\n\r\nThe main role of secretary is to take the minutes (decisions only) of a maximum of five meetings annually, and deal with any correspondence. They work closely with the chair and vice chairs from whom they receive support.\r\n\r\nThis role would suit someone from an admin background with basic IT skills and the ability to summarise discussion where required and to note decisions.\n\n## Experience required\n\nBasic admin and IT skills plus the ability to engage constructively and empathetically with colleagues and u3a members.\n\n## Training details\n\nInformal induction training in the requirements of the role and the preferred approach, working relationships and so on will be provided by the chair and vice chair. The chair and vice chair will also provide ongoing support and advice where necessary.\n\n## Travel details\n\nCommittee meetings normally take place at Cupar YMCA-YWCA\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel expenses can be reimbursed where necessary.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000IPBu1YAH#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Committee secretary",
