            "name": "Sands",
            "description": "Sands is the UK’s leading pregnancy and baby loss charity. We are here to support everyone touched by pregnancy loss or the death of a baby. Always.\r\n\r\nSands provides a safe, understanding and caring community for anyone touched by pregnancy or baby loss. Every day, we work to improve maternity and bereavement care, discover why babies are dying and reduce inequalities in healthcare.",
            "website": "https://www.sands.org.uk/",
            "charityRegistration": [
