                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000IBSMnYAP",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000IBSMnYAP/volunteer-technical-coach-remote-or-in-person",
                    "publishStart": "2026-09-28",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-29",
                    "title": "Volunteer Technical Coach (remote or in-person)",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nOur non-profit organisation creates pathways between learning and securing a technology-based career. We are deliberate in supporting people from under-represented and low-socio-economic communities. Join us and help us to support unemployed, aspiring Technology Professionals and help someone to reach their potential. \r\n\r\nWe have opportunities for micro, skills-based volunteering, which can be completed as a one-off, one-hour engagement, where you can review and sign off a particular stage of a build, as well as more regular engagements. We have both in-person and remote volunteer opportunities available. Whatever your tech skills - Data; Security; DevOps; Cloud Infrastructure; Software Development - we can put your skills and kindness to good use, supporting a jobseeker. We create pathways between learning and technology careers for young people, female returners, mid-career re-skillers, people with disabilities, refugees and anyone else looking to launch their career in tech. We appreciate the support of existing industry professionals to support them in their pathway.\n\n## Experience required\n\nWe are looking for Technical Coaches that can coach DevOps, Software Development, Data, IT Security and Cloud projects.\n\n## Training details\n\nWe support with coaching and mentoring skills. We can also support some technical up-skilling\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nAs little as one-off for one hour, or full time. Opt into support when you have the time.\n\n## Travel details\n\nRemote projects available. In-person volunteering available in Edinburgh, Glasgow and Dundee",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000IBSMnYAP#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Volunteer Technical Coach (remote or in-person)",
                        "description": "We are looking for Technical Coaches that can coach DevOps, Software Development, Data, IT Security and Cloud projects.",
