                    "title": "WEA Community Garden",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nThe Community Garden Lead Volunteer will play a key role in supporting the day-to day activities of the WEA Kilmarnock Community Garden. This is a hands-on volunteer lead role that involves welcoming and supporting volunteers, sharing gardening knowledge, and helping to create an enjoyable, inclusive, and productive environment for everyone involved.\r\nWorking alongside the existing garden team, the Volunteer Lead will help develop the garden, encourage community participation, and contribute new ideas to support the garden’s continued growth and success.\r\nAn enhanced PVG is required for this post.",
