            "name": "Who Cares? Scotland",
            "website": "https://vanl.teamkinetic.co.uk/profile/WhoCaresScotland",
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000IMhtZYAT",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000IMhtZYAT/volunteer-youth-workers-needed-in-north-lanarkshire",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-06",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-06",
                    "title": "Volunteer Youth Workers Needed in North Lanarkshire!",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nVolunteer Youth Workers Needed in North Lanarkshire!\n\n## Description\n\nJoin our incredible team and make a real difference in the lives of care experienced young people! We&#39;re looking for passionate individuals to support and empower young people aged 14-26, helping them to navigate their journeys and reach their full potential. This is a chance to be a positive influence, share your experiences, and contribute to a brighter future.\n\n\nMeeting fortnightly on Mondays from 6pm to 8pm to connect with and support young people.\nParticipating in four special meetings per year with the Champions Board on Wednesdays from 6pm &ndash; 8pm, contributing to strategic discussions.\nSupporting special events and helping out on away days and trips.\nBuilding meaningful relationships and acting as a positive role model.\n\n\nReady to be a champion for change? Your time and dedication can profoundly impact these young lives. Sign up today and become an essential part of our mission to empower and uplift!&nbsp;\n\nThis opportunity would suit people aged 25 and over and we would be keen to hear from retired individuals.\n\n## Experience required\n\nGood Communication Skills.\nExcellent listener.\nExperience of or willing to work with young people.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000IMhtZYAT#role",
                        "type": "Role",
