                    "title": "Drivers",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe are currently seeking minibus drivers for groups requiring transport, mainly for Westhill and Kemnay Academy pupils attending football matches and other activities (typically 2–3 trips per month per driver).\r\nVolunteer car drivers also transport individuals to hospital appointments.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nCar drivers for patient transport get 55p per mile",
