                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000DUoazYAD/gardener",
                    "publishStart": "2026-06-26",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-25",
                    "title": "Gardener",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe are a community owned park . With football pitch, fairy trails, bee and butterfly garden. Walking paths.\r\nPicnic benches.\r\nTo help maintain the park in general. In the summer, cutting the grass on our sit on mower, helping plant\r\nup planters. Painting picnic benches .\n\n## Experience required\n\nSomeone who likes the outdoors and nature\n\n## Travel details\n\nTorrance village, bus stop just outside park on main st.\r\nWoodmill Park off Woodmill Drive G64 4HP.",
