                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HeRKfYAN",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HeRKfYAN/drop-in-support-worker",
                    "publishStart": "2026-07-07",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-07",
                    "title": "Drop in Support Worker",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nWe are a new Charity in Dundee. We are looking for people to help create a warm, welcoming space for people in our community. Support with making tea and coffee, chatting with individuals, playing games, arts and crafts, and signposting them to further support.\n\n## Description\n\n@yourside offers a twice weekly Drop In for individuals who experience disadvantage such as addiction, homelessness, and poverty. Join our friendly drop-in team and help make a real difference in people’s lives.\r\n\r\nAs a volunteer, you’ll help create a safe and welcoming environment by setting up and serving tea and coffee, supporting activities such as games and arts and crafts, and spending time talking with individuals to understand what support they may need.\r\n\r\nYou may also help people with practical tasks such as completing forms, making phone calls, or accessing services. \r\n\r\nNo specialist experience is needed – just a kind, approachable attitude and a willingness to support others. Full training will be provided.\r\n\r\nThis role is ideal for someone who enjoys meeting people, working as part of a team, and helping build confidence and connection in the community.\n\n## Experience required\n\nEmpathetic, non judgemental.\n\n## Training details\n\nTraining is ongoing and may involve signposting, form filling, referrals to other Third Sector Organisations, and boundaries and expectations.\n\n## Travel details\n\nChurch Hall or Dundee Congregational Church, 3-5 Nicol Street, Dundee, DD1 1LY.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HeRKfYAN#role",
