            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000FwFndYAF",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000FwFndYAF/treasurer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-03-19",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-08",
                    "title": "Treasurer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe are looking for a volunteer treasurer to support our annual Sandwick Fun Day.   The role involves attending a small number of meetings between April and July and helping manage basic finances for the event.  Support will also be needed on the day itself.\r\n\r\nYou'll be joining a great team of friendly and supportive community members working together to create a fantastic day for everyone.  It's a great opportunity to get involved and meet new people and contribute to a positive community event.\n\n## Experience required\n\nA knowledge of finance would be welcomed.\n\n## Travel details\n\nSandwick Social Clun (meetings)\r\nSandwick Football Pitch (event)\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nStationery costs.",
