                    "publishStart": "2026-06-29",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-28",
                    "title": "Walk Leader",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAyrshire 360 are looking to recruit enthusiastic people who are willing to give up their time to help improve the health and wellbeing of the people of East Ayrshire. We provide full training and support to become a walk leader for one of our health walks which take place on a weekly basis at Dean Castle, Dumfries House, Drogan and Newmilns, please see website for more details - Ayrshire360 – Walking Scotland \r\nPlease contact Kyle Johnson - kyle.johnson@ayrshire360.com for more information on how to become a Walk Leader.",
