        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/001QD00001D5KEJYA3",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/001QD00001D5KEJYA3/wd-trading-standards",
            "name": "WD Trading Standards",
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000J8WJAYA3",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000J8WJAYA3/test-purchase-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-29",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-29",
                    "title": "Test purchase volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nNo matter how good our services are, we can't properly support our users/community well if we don't have good organisers in the team. If this sounds like you... we would love you to consider volunteering with us for a few hours per week.\r\nWest Dunbartonshire Council Trading Standards enforce the underage sale of  products containing tobacco and nicotine. When complaints are received about a shop selling age restricted products to young people aged under 18 test purchasing is carried out with the assistance of volunteers in the shop. \r\nWe are looking for volunteers aged 16 to carry out underage sales test purchasing and aged 18 to carry out integrity testing (also known as challenge 25).\r\nVolunteers will be accompanied by the Trading Standards team of 3 Trading Standards Officers. Permission from a parent or carer with be required.\r\nAll travel within West Dunbartonshire will be provided. \r\nThe volunteer will work up to a maximum of 7 hours per day, food and drink will be provided during the day.\r\nThe young person carrying out the test purchasing will attempt to buy an age restricted product as directed by a Trading Standards Officer. They will be accompanied at all times by a Trading Standards Officer in order to gain evidence of any offence that takes place. \r\nKnowledge of the products purchased is not required, the volunteer must be able to follow instructions and display confidence when approaching staff to attempt the test purchase.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000J8WJAYA3#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Test purchase volunteer",
                        "applyLink": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000J8WJAYA3/test-purchase-volunteer?#modal_register_a0gQD00000J8WJAYA3",
                        "allowsRemoteParticipation": false,
                        "minimumAge": "16",
