                    "description": "## Summary\n\nBrechin Beavers Swimming Club is looking for new committee members\n\n## Description\n\nManage the club finances   \r\nComfortable using spreadsheets and basic bookkeeping skills   \r\nUseful also for someone who is studying and would like to gain experience  \r\nJUST 1-2 HOURS PER MONTH CAN DO THE DIFFERENCE!   Join our friendly team and help keep Brechin Beavers Swimming Club running for our swimmers!   Please get in touch! brechinbeavers@gmail.com\n\n## Travel details\n\nTravel details will be discussed",
