                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000JHISEYA5",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000JHISEYA5/swimming-coach",
                    "publishStart": "2026-11-02",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-05-03",
                    "title": "Swimming Coach",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nBECOME A SWIMMING COACH AT BRECHIN BEAVERS SWIMMING CLUB\n\n## Description\n\nHelp our swimmers reach their potential!\r\nMake a real difference - Help local children build confidence, skills and lifelong healthy habits.\r\nFull training provided - The club will cover the cost of the coaching course.\r\nLearn new skills - Gain a recognised qualification and valuable experience.\r\nBe part of a great team - Join a friendly and supportive swimming community.   \r\nIt's rewarding! - See swimmers grow, achieve and have fun.\r\nInspiring Healthier Happier Brighter Futures\r\nSmall Time Big Impact   Interested?   Get in touch with the club to find out more about the next coaching course.   brechinbeavers@gmail.com   VOLUNTEER | LEARN | SUPPORT | INSPIRE\n\n## Travel details\n\nTravel details will be discussed",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
