                    "publishStart": "2026-11-09",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-05-10",
                    "title": "Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nVolunteering with Look Good Feel Better is an amazing way to support the cancer community. Giving your time and skills will not only help Look Good Feel Better achieve its mission but will also have many positive benefits for you as an individual or business.  Join hundreds of others across the country to volunteer with us in our workshops, in local community fundraising groups, in our office and from home.\r\n.\r\nVolunteer roles include: Skin and Makeup and Workshop Volunteer",
