            "name": "Thrive Together Aberdeen C.I.C",
            "description": "At Thrive Together Aberdeen C.I.C., we believe every individual deserves the opportunity to live a happy, independent, and meaningful life.\r\n\r\nWe are a community-based service supporting adults with learning disabilities, autism, additional support needs, and those experiencing social isolation. Through person-centred support, we help individuals build confidence, develop essential life skills, form lasting friendships, and become active members of their local community.",
