                    "title": "Winter Food Collection Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nFelix, formerly FareShare and The Felix Project, is a food redistribution charity. We redistribute surplus food to charities nationwide, who turn it into vital meals and food support for people who are struggling.\r\n\r\nHow can you help:\r\n\r\nWe are specifically looking for volunteers who could help us at: \r\n•\tTesco Aberdeen South – AB12 3DN \r\n•\tTesco Aberdeen Newtonhill – AB39 3PX \r\n•\tTesco Westhill – AB32 6UF\r\n\r\nWe are looking for volunteers who can give up 3 hours of their time to help in stores, let shoppers know we are collecting food, collect donations and thank shoppers. All food collected at the Tesco Food Collection will support local community organisations and charities supplied by Felix. These include homelessness shelters, schools, refuges and community kitchens, all helping to feed people facing hardship this winter. Last year each volunteer helped to collect the equivalent of 215 meals for the people we serve.\r\n\r\nFor more information and to sign up to help please visit: https://felix.org/get-involved/volunteering/tesco-food-collection\n\n## Description\n\nFelix, formerly FareShare and The Felix Project, is a food redistribution charity. We redistribute surplus food to charities nationwide, who turn it into vital meals and food support for people who are struggling.\r\n\r\nHow can you help:\r\n\r\nWe are specifically looking for volunteers who could help us at: \r\n•\tTesco Aberdeen South – AB12 3DN \r\n•\tTesco Aberdeen Newtonhill – AB39 3PX \r\n•\tTesco Westhill – AB32 6UF\r\n\r\nWe are looking for volunteers who can give up 3 hours of their time during the 26–28 November 2026 to help in stores, let shoppers know we are collecting food, collect donations and thank shoppers. All food collected at the Tesco Food Collection will support local community organisations and charities supplied by Felix. These include homelessness shelters, schools, refuges and community kitchens, all helping to feed people facing hardship this winter. Last year each volunteer helped to collect the equivalent of 215 meals for the people we serve.\r\n\r\nFor more information and to sign up to help please visit: https://felix.org/get-involved/volunteering/tesco-food-collection\n\n## Training details\n\nExcellent support and relevant guidance is provided to all volunteers.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nIn stores between 26-28 November 2026. Flexible times available to assist. All help makes a difference and is greatly appreciated.\n\n## Travel details\n\nWe are specifically looking for volunteers who could help us at: \r\n•\tTesco Aberdeen South – AB12 3DN \r\n•\tTesco Aberdeen Newtonhill – AB39 3PX \r\n•\tTesco Westhill – AB32 6UF",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F7fffa411-0d29-4585-b0f0-b479559892f9%2FOukHqzqiDHU3dDOGWZnvEleyhzQ2%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=935996f4-d373-42a7-84b9-40332325c770",
