            "name": "21st Aberdeen (Cults) Scout Group",
            "description": "The 21st Aberdeen (Cults) Scout Group is a registered charity (Scottish Charity Number SC018385). \r\n\r\nThe Scouts prepares young people with skills for life, supported by amazing leaders delivering an inspiring programme.",
