            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000QNr84AAD",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000QNr84AAD/scout-group-volunteers",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Scout Group Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe’re scouting for talent. You don’t have to be Chief Scout to volunteer.\r\n\r\nEvery week we help prepare over 200 young people with skills for life. We make a big difference.  You could too.  Use your skills and talents for good and make a difference. Practical, flexible Team working in a variety of tasks. Mainly to grow and start new sections for Squirrels, ages (4-6); Beavers (6-8); Cubs (8-10½); and Scouts (10½-14).   Minimum age for volunteers is 18 yrs. \r\n\r\nTo find out more please Email: volunteering21stscouts@gmail.com\n\n## Training details\n\nExcellent support and relevant training is provided to all volunteers.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible times available to suit volunteers. All help greatly appreciated.\n\n## Travel details\n\n21st Aberdeen (Cults) Scout Group\r\nScout Centre\r\nSouth Avenue\r\nCults\r\nAberdeen\r\nAB15 9LP",
