            "name": "Scottish Police Authority (Shetland)",
            "description": "Independent custody visiting is the system of approved members of the community carrying out random unannounced visitis to police stations where people are detained to ensure that their human rights are being observed and monitor their treatment and the conditions in which they are detained.",
            "website": "http://www.spa.police.uk/",
            "cause": [
