            "name": "Barrhead Community Sports Hub",
            "description": "To assist the advancement of sport for the people of Barrhead and beyond. To assist the advancement of sporting facilities for the people of Barrhead and beyond.\r\nPresent activities include participating in sports, football, cricket, badminton, tennis, trampolining and netball.",
