            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000CNRDWYA5",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000CNRDWYA5/activities-events-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2025-10-01",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-26",
                    "title": "Activities & Events volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nDo you have a child in Sir E Scott school? \r\nWould you like to help at events & activities which need extra adults for supervision?\r\n\r\nRecently the PVG scheme changed, which means its not so easy for parents to nip into the school to volunteer their time. \r\nNow, every volunteer, needs to have a PVG, which has greatly reduced the options for outside help. \r\n\r\nIf you would like to help, please get in touch with Kathleen.",
