            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000ChHTJYA3",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000ChHTJYA3/board-trustee",
                    "publishStart": "2025-10-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-01",
                    "title": "Board Trustee",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nHelp shape the next chapter of Uppertunity! Join our board and empower adults with additional support needs through creativity, inclusion, and community. Your voice and lived experience truly matter.\n\n## Description\n\nUppertunity just turned 10, and we’re stepping into an exciting new chapter. We want your voice to help write it! We’re a Dundee-based charity dedicated to empowering adults with additional support needs and autism to lead fuller, more meaningful lives. \r\n\r\nWe’re looking for two new board members:\r\n\r\n- Someone with lived experience of additional support needs and/or autism\r\n- A parent or carer of someone with additional support needs\r\n\r\nAs a trustee, you’ll help shape our vision, champion our members’ voices, and get creative and hands-on through vision days, community events, and strategy discussions. You’ll gain new skills, confidence, and connections, and be part of a passionate, inclusive community making real change. Meetings are quarterly (in person or online), with opportunities to get more involved. No prior board experience needed, just enthusiasm, openness, and heart.\n\n## Experience required\n\nEnthusiasm, integrity, and commitment to inclusion. Experience in governance, business, finance, or community work is welcome but not essential.\n\n## Training details\n\nTraining given in all aspects of role, on-the-job and in-person. All volunteers will receive welcome pack.\n\n## Travel details\n\nGround Floor Left, The Circle at Dudhope Castle, Barrack Road, Dundee DD3 6TU\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nPlease note - No expenses are payable for this role.",
