                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-29",
                    "title": "Trustee",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe are looking for enthusiastic board members who want to make a difference to the lives of autistic children & young people and their families. We operate services across Edinburgh and the Lothians focusing on improving social & play opportunities. No previous board experience is required and we will consider all applications.\n\n## Experience required\n\nWe are ideally looking for someone with a professional background in finance, HR, social care and/or social work.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nOnce per month - in person at least 4 times per year.\n\n## Travel details\n\nWe are based in Portobello but meetings will be a mix of in person and online.",
