                        "title": "RNID in Communities Volunteer",
                        "description": "No previous experience is required, as full training and support will be provided. We are looking for friendly, reliable and confident communicators who are comfortable speaking to groups and engaging with people from a wide range of backgrounds. Volunteers should be dependable, willing to follow volunteer guidelines, health and safety procedures, and confidentiality requirements. We also value people who are inclusive, work well with others, and are enthusiastic about raising awareness of hearing loss, tinnitus and deafness within their local community. Most importantly, we are looking for people who want to make a positive difference in the lives of local people who are deaf, have hearing loss or tinnitus.",
