                    "publishStart": "2011-08-12",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-28",
                    "title": "Driver for Wee Red Bus",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nDo you have some time to Spare?\nDrivers required for our Wee Red Bus.\n\n## Description\n\nDo you have some time to Spare?\r\nWe need your help to make someones Day.\r\n\r\nOur Wee Red buses provide Community Transport in East Renfrewshire to help people within our community get to & from events, groups, hospitals etc.\n\n## Experience required\n\nReliability, happy to work in one-to-one and group situations, conscientious driver\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nTo be confirmed - weekdays\n\n## Travel details\n\nThroughout East Renfrewshire",
