                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HtSTJYA3",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HtSTJYA3/tea-helper-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-14",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-12",
                    "title": "Tea Helper Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe need your help to brighten someone’s day!\r\n\r\nAfternoon Tea Volunteers will help with the set-up, meet and greet people attending the afternoon tea event, socialise and help with the serving of the tea and cakes.  Volunteers will also assist with clearing up at the end of the afternoon tea session.\r\n\r\nThis role offers the opportunity to make a meaningful difference to people's lives.  For some attendees, the afternoon tea may be their main or only opportunity for social interaction during the week, so a friendly conversation can have a significant positive impact.\r\n\r\nKey responsibilities:\r\n* Set up tables for people attending the event\r\n* Welcome visitors and help them find a seat\r\n* Provide support with serving refreshments to the visitors and having a friendly chat with those attending\r\n* Help to clear up at the end\r\n\r\nVolunteer skills and experience:\r\n* Must be 16 years or older\r\n* Willing to follow confidentiality and boundaries guidelines\r\n\r\nVolunteer training:\r\n* The volunteer will receive continuous support from the Volunteer Co-ordinator\r\n* All volunteers will receive induction training before starting first shift\r\n\r\nVolunteer hours:\r\n* Afternoon teas are on Thursdays from 1- 4 pm, volunteers can choose if they want to help weekly, every other week or once per month etc\r\n\r\nVolunteer expenses:\r\n* Travel expenses are available\n\n## Travel details\n\nBarrhead Centre, 8 Carlibar Road, Barrhead, G78 1AA.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F545c069d-31bb-4151-88c8-e2f4ea8fd115%2FFUaGnglJjRXt8RVuG2atb0RiFe93%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=fd1fc804-d683-4700-885b-959ee8239e8f",
