                    "title": "Camp cook/caterer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nTo cook a main evening meal for our young people, staff and volunteers on our weekend camps at Cairngorms Christian Centre, Kincraig: usually for up to 10 people. We will provide the food and details of dietary requirements etc.\r\nFrequency: we have probably about 10 weekend camps per year at Kincraig but would welcome someone who could come and help even occasionally.\n\n## Training details\n\nSafeguarding \r\nFood Hygiene",
