                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-10",
                    "title": "New Secretary required for community group The Buddy Beat",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nNew Secretary required for community group The Buddy Beat\n\n## Description\n\nJoin our vibrant team and make a real difference in our community! We&#39;re seeking passionate individuals to help us bring joy and support to those who need it most. This is your chance to contribute your unique talents and be part of something truly rewarding.\n\n\nEngage directly with beneficiaries: Spend quality time interacting with individuals, offering companionship and assistance\nCollaborate with a supportive team: Work alongside like-minded individuals in a positive and encouraging environment.\n\n\n&nbsp;\n\n## Experience required\n\nNote taking and typing skills would be adventageous\n\n## Travel details\n\nBy bus into Johnstone or car direct to our venue\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nWe can assist with travel expenses for our new secertary",
