                    "title": "Digital Skills Support Volunteer (Visual Impairment)",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe are seeking a friendly and patient volunteer to support individuals who are visually impaired to develop their digital skills and confidence in using online devices and services.  Working alongside the Digital Inclusion Officer, you will  provide practical one-to-one support to help people use smartphones, tablets, computers and accessibility tools to stay connected and independent.",
