                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-09",
                    "title": "Volunteer Van Driver",
                    "description": "## Description\n\n🚗 Volunteer Delivery Van Driver Needed\r\nWe’re looking for a friendly and reliable volunteer driver to help support our social enterprise café team.\r\n\r\n🧭 What you’ll do:\r\nDeliver catering in and around the Inverness area using our Ford Transit van.\r\n\r\n⏰ Time commitment:\r\nTypically 2-3 hours per week (usually late morning/early lunch time).  \r\nExtra hours may be required during busy times/staff holidays.\r\n\r\n✅ What you’ll need:\r\nFull UK driving licence\r\nA positive attitude and reliability\r\nGood communication skills",
