                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g24000001BTq0AAG",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g24000001BTq0AAG/fundraising-group-members-penicuik",
                    "publishStart": "2018-07-30",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Fundraising Group Members (Penicuik)",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nJoin your local Marie Curie Fundraising group! Meet new people and have fun while raising vital funds to help our Marie Curie nurses provide care for local people with terminal illnesses.\n\n## Description\n\nEvery day of your life matters – from the first to the last. That's why the right care at the end of your life is so important. With other group members from your local area, you will organise fundraising events, collections and bring your community together in supporting Marie Curie. The group meets approximately every 6 weeks to organise 2-4 events per year.\r\n\r\nDue to Covid-19 at present all volunteer fundraising is being carried out virtually.\n\n## Experience required\n\nAbility to work as part of a team, reliability, good organisational skills and good communication skills.\n\n## Travel details\n\nPenicuik. The group organise events in Penicuik.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nMileage can be paid for distances travelled to attend fundraising events, full guidance will be given during volunteer induction. Mileage rate is 45p per mile.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2Fd97c0974-9130-172f-2844-1a5deb203b65%2FWkLzgT1VE9cAHEWcVMpdVMd5bL63%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=e780e035-f279-4c54-9703-35cec7b0a06a",
