                    "title": "Retail Volunteer- Hyndland Road",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nPlay a key role in the day‑to‑day running of our charity shop.\r\nWhether you’re helping on the shop floor, sorting donations, pricing items, or creating a friendly and welcoming space, your time and support will make a real and meaningful difference.\r\n \r\nAvailability: 3 hours per week\r\nTime: Shifts available Mon - Sat 9:30-5pm \r\n\r\nWhat you'll do:\r\n\r\n•\tSort donations and uncover hidden gems\r\n•\tPrep items - steam, tag, and style for sale\r\n•\tChat with customers and operate the till\r\n•\tSpruce up window displays and restock shelves\r\n•\tKeep things clean, tidy, and fabulous\r\n\r\n\r\nTraining, ongoing guidance and wellbeing support provided\r\nTravel and expenses covered\r\nAccess to discounts on shopping, travel, entertainment, and more\r\n15% discount in-store at our Marie Curie Shops (Terms & Conditions apply)\r\n\r\nRef: 2964\n\n## Experience required\n\n•\tA positive, can-do attitude\r\n•\tFriendly and compassionate to those around you\r\n•\tComfortable talking to people from all walks of life\r\n•\tGood organiser and happy to provide support where necessary\r\n•\tTeam spirit - contributing to a positive team dynamic\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\n3 hours per week\n\n## Taster details\n\nWe offer all new volunteers a trial shift with us, so they can get to know a bit more about the role and find out if volunteering is right for them.",
