                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000GhpajYAB",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000GhpajYAB/collections-host-volunteer-edinburgh-or-livingston",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-07",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-07",
                    "title": "Collections Host Volunteer - Edinburgh or Livingston",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nBe the heart of the action, the organiser behind our community collections and become a Collections Host Volunteer\r\n\r\nYou’ll be the friendly face that keeps everything running smoothly at busy locations like supermarkets, train stations, high streets and shopping centres. You’ll support our volunteer collectors, inspire generosity from the public, and help raise vital funds for Marie Curie services.\r\n \r\nAvailability: 4 hours - at various points of the year\r\nTime: Flexible to suit your schedule\r\nLocations: Edinburgh or Livingston\r\nCriteria: Aged 18 or over\r\n\r\nWhat you’ll do:\r\n•\tBe present on-site during collection days\r\n•\tWelcome volunteers, help them feel confident and ready\r\n•\tKeep things organised and positive\r\n•\tEncourage public support and kindness\r\n•\tHelp recruit new collectors\r\n•\tThank volunteers, secure donations and assist with banking\r\n\r\nWhat you'll receive and achieve:\r\n•\tEssential training, ongoing guidance and wellbeing support \r\n•\tTravel and expenses covered \r\n•\tAccess to discounts on shopping, travel, entertainment, and more \r\n•\t15% discount in-store at our Marie Curie Shops (Terms & Conditions apply)\r\n\r\nReady to roll up your sleeves and be part of something special? \r\n\r\nRef: 6639\n\n## Experience required\n\nWhy you’d be a great fit:\r\n\r\n•\tBring a positive attitude, a smile and great people skills\r\n•\tOrganisational flair and team spirit\r\n•\tA passion for helping others\r\n•\tBonus points: you know the best spots in town!\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\n4 hours on allocated days - flexible commitment throughout to suit your schedule\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nReasonable out-of-pocket travel and expenses reimbursed, including travel by own vehicle or public transport",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F1a7c47d9-3978-4ddd-a626-3b3cd7c3fc3f%2F6pmR7QAygEPdeRVdh8skBzGU5Hu1%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=e8f58897-7bed-499f-b19f-280c2cecf44f",
