                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-30",
                    "title": "Volunteer Hairdresser/Barber Glasgow Hospice",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nYour role will include some of but is not restricted to the following:\r\nProvide a hairdressing service to patients at the hospice\r\nConsult staff about which patients would like to use the service\r\nChat to patients\r\nKeep the hairdressing room clean and tidy\r\nLet staff know about any issues concerning patients well-being\r\nHelp with other related tasks when necessary\n\n## Experience required\n\nBasic hairdressing skills",
