                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000Pc7UOAAZ",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000Pc7UOAAZ/retail-volunteer-partick",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-01",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-11-30",
                    "title": "Retail Volunteer- Partick",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nMarie Curie charity shops play a vital role in raising funds to support our nurses and the care they provide to people living with a terminal illness and their families.\r\nWe’re looking for enthusiastic Shop Volunteers to join our retail team and help deliver a great shopping experience. From fashion and homeware to books and unique finds, our shops offer a wide range of quality donated items, and we need your help to sort, prepare, and sell them.\r\n \r\nAvailability: 3 hours per week - weekdays or weekends\r\nTime: Flexible to suit your schedule\r\nCriteria: Aged 16 or over. No previous experience required.\r\n\r\n\r\nSort donations and uncover hidden gems\r\nPrep items - steam, tag, and style for sale\r\nChat with customers and operate the till\r\nSpruce up window displays and restock shelves\r\nKeep things clean, tidy, and fabulous\r\n\r\n\r\nTraining, ongoing guidance and wellbeing support provided\r\nTravel and expenses covered\r\nAccess to discounts on shopping, travel, entertainment, and more\r\n\r\nRef: 6757\n\n## Experience required\n\nWe're looking for volunteers with a friendly and cheerful manner who can work well with others. The ability to follow instructions will be important. An interest in fashion, or a knowledge of popular and good quality brands will be useful but is not essential.\n\n## Training details\n\nWe give all of our volunteers full training when they join us, as well as ongoing training and support from our friendly team in store.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nWe're looking for volunteers who can do 2-3 hours a week\n\n## Travel details\n\nOur Partick shop is located on Dumbarton Road, near the Morrisons Supermarket and the Partick Train Station. Please note that parking is of limited availability in the area at some times and parking charges may apply.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nWe pay reasonable out of pocket expenses incurred by our volunteers. Your volunteer manager will be able to discuss this with you and help you claim any expenses you are entitled to.\n\n## Taster details\n\nWe offer all new volunteers a trial shift with us, so they can get to know a bit more about the role and find out if volunteering is right for them.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g0800000Pc7UOAAZ#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Retail Volunteer- Partick",
