                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000Hv141YAB",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000Hv141YAB/community-fundraiser-volunteer-scotland",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-20",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-18",
                    "title": "Community Fundraiser Volunteer - Scotland",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe're looking for community-minded volunteers to help grow our network of Community Fundraising Volunteers across your local area \r\n\r\nOperate behind-the-scenes and help grow and maintain our network of Collection Hosts and Collection Box Coordinators \r\n\r\nThis is a flexible, rewarding opportunity that fits around your lifestyle. From chatting with local business owners and community groups to supporting activity behind the scenes, you'll be part of a welcoming team of volunteers who share a passion for making a positive impact close to home. \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nAvailability: Totally flexible to suit your lifestyle \r\n\r\nTime: Can be arranged around your existing availability to suit you \r\n\r\nLocations: Various locations across all of Scotland available\r\n\r\nCriteria: Aged 18 or over. Access to public transport or own transport is beneficial but not required \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nWhat you'll do: \r\n\r\nIdentify local businesses, shops, cafés, and community venues that may be interested in hosting a collection box \r\nSupport the recruitment of new volunteer collectors \r\nBuild positive relationships with local businesses and community members \r\nDeliver, check, and collect donation boxes when required \r\nRecognise and thank businesses and individuals for their support \r\nAct as a local ambassador for Marie Curie within your community \r\nHelp maximise income from collection boxes/tins to support our vital work \r\nWhy you’d be a great fit: \r\n\r\nPassionate about supporting your community \r\nComfortable talking to people from all walks of life \r\nOrganised and self-motivated \r\nConfident approaching local businesses and community groups \r\nWhat you'll gain: \r\n\r\nFlexibility to volunteer around your schedule \r\nTraining, ongoing guidance and wellbeing support \r\nRecognition for your time \r\nUpdates on the difference you’re making \r\nLong Service Awards \r\nTravel and expenses reimbursed \r\nAccess to discounts on shopping, dining, travel and more \r\n15% discount in-store at our Marie Curie Shops (Terms & Conditions apply) \r\nDid you know that from 2025 to 2026 Fundraising volunteers helped Marie Curie to raise £3.2 million and 96% of volunteers would recommend volunteering with Marie Curie \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nNeed more information or support with your application form? \r\n\r\nFind out more by clicking here or contact our team at Recruitment@mariecurie.org.uk",
