            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g24000003MnTPAA0",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g24000003MnTPAA0/fledgling-arts-collective-central-online-outreach-volunteers",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Fledgling Arts Collective Central-Online Outreach Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nWe are non-profit-making-volunteer run Arts Collective and charity providing a platform both online and offline for those who struggle with mental health, addiction, gender dysphoria, sexuality, feel like they don't quite 'fit', or feel estranged to this world ,We encourage you to express yourselves through art as catharsis. Combining Art & Catharsis, we believe in being CathARTic.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for Online Outreach Volunteers who will respond to our members in either a live chat (booked in advance) or via email messaging style.\r\n\r\nA fantastic opportunity to help volunteering-all help makes a real difference and is greatly appreciated. For further details please contact: Jewels Johnson at email:  jewels-founder-fledgling@outlook.com\n\n## Description\n\nWe are non-profit-making-volunteer run Arts Collective and charity providing a platform both online and offline for those who struggle with mental health, addiction, gender dysphoria, sexuality, feel like they don't quite 'fit', or feel estranged to this world ,We encourage you to express yourselves through art as catharsis. Combining Art & Catharsis, we believe in being CathARTic.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for Online Outreach Volunteers who will respond to our members in either a live chat (booked in advance) or via email messaging style.\r\n\r\nA fantastic opportunity to help volunteering-all help makes a real difference and is greatly appreciated. For further details please contact: Jewels Johnson at email:  jewels-founder-fledgling@outlook.com\n\n## Experience required\n\nYou should have a passion for the arts and compassion for mental health.;\n\n## Training details\n\nGood support is provided to all volunteers and all help makes a real difference/is greatly appreciated.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible times to suit volunteers.\n\n## Travel details\n\nOperate across the country-people can volunteer for this opportunity from their home.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
