                    "title": "Hadyard Hill Dailly Community Fund. Fund Panel Members",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nDAILLY COMMUNITY FUND NEEDS YOU!\r\n\r\nThe Hadyard Hill Dailly Community Fund awards grants to projects that benefit the people of Dailly, with decisions on\r\nawards being made by a panel of local people.\r\n\r\nCould you help decide on awards and shape the future of the Fund?\r\n\r\nYou need to be 16 or older to get involved and don't need any specialist skills to join the panel.\r\n\r\nAnyone who wants the best future for Dailly and lives, works or volunteers in Dailly can join.\r\n\r\nThe Fund Panel meet up to four times a year in the evening\r\nand full support is given by Foundation Scotland, a grant making charity.",
