                    "description": "## Description\n\nPINWHERRY & PINMORE COMMUNITY FUND NEEDS YOU!\r\n\r\nThe Pinwherry & Pinmore Community Fund awards grants to projects that benefit the people of Pinwherry and Pinmore, with decisions on awards being made by a panel of local people.\r\n\r\nCould you help decide on awards and shape the future of the Fund?\r\n\r\nYou need to be 16 or older to get involved and don't need any specialist skills to join the panel.\r\n\r\nAnyone who wants the best future for Pinwherry & Pinmore and lives, works or volunteers in the locality can join.\r\n\r\nThe Fund Panel meets up to four times a year in the evening and full support is given by\r\nFoundation Scotland, a grant making charity.",
