                        "title": "Community Hall Assistant",
                        "description": "No Expertise, Caring,Good Communicator,Good Listener,Hard Working,Open minded,Organised,Patient,Practical,Reliable / Dependable,Sociable,Social Conscience,Team Player,Trustworthy,",
