        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/001QD00000BL4jpYAD",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/001QD00000BL4jpYAD/the-black-door-shop",
            "name": "The Black Door Shop",
            "description": "A place to meet, chat and take part in helping each other achieve tasks or to donate items of clothing.  We cover litter picking in the local area, repair laptops for use by students in East Renfrewshire.",
            "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FAccount%2Fdc0002af-f313-4484-8686-7e94024f8ee7%2F7IOko5pfsrThTntx6Monre9KEIs2%2Fuser-upload.jpg?alt=media&token=867b9c38-c09c-476b-95e2-69411b08c306",
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000009JS8HYAW",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000009JS8HYAW/retail-assistant",
                    "publishStart": "2025-04-07",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-09",
                    "title": "Retail Assistant",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAs a volunteer you will recognise how valuable your role is when you see how many people are assisted by the simplest of action.  As a team all our members enjoy volunteering.  General helping: sorting donations/tidying up/ welcoming donators. What we are looking for is a few volunteers who have a few hours spare that they could help us. \r\n\r\nOn Saturdays we are open 9 till 2pm. During this time a steady stream of people arrive with household donations and clothing which we receive and sort. \r\n\r\nOn Saturdays volunteers at present comprise 4 adults and 5 DOE students. \r\n\r\nThe role for all volunteers to share on Saturdays is to:\r\n* Welcome donators and assist them to bring in items from their nearby parked car\r\n* Sort donations into bags marked male, female, children, bedding, blankets or shoes and put them in order in their respective places. * * To bring in any other items and sort them into their area. \r\n* Wash and dry dishes and keep the area tidy. \r\n\r\nOn Mondays we are open from 10am - 4pm. During this time we have 3 adults present. \r\n\r\nWe need  4 volunteers from 10-12  on Mondays, Tuesdays and Thursdays to help take out donations and tidy up.\n\n## Travel details\n\nThe Black Door Shop, Rosslea Drive, Giffnock, G46 6RW\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nExpenses not paid",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F3f87db25-817e-4eae-b333-7e6b1e946543%2F7IOko5pfsrThTntx6Monre9KEIs2%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=c39f8edd-36c3-4fe1-b45a-a35f8946f2e3",
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000009JS8HYAW#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Retail Assistant",
                        "applyLink": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000009JS8HYAW/retail-assistant?#modal_register_a0gQD000009JS8HYAW",
