                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000Hnw97YAB",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000Hnw97YAB/donation-welcomer-sorter",
                    "publishStart": "2026-07-23",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-21",
                    "title": "Donation Welcomer & Sorter",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nTo act as the welcoming face of our donation hub, safely receiving household items and clothes from the local community and sorting them efficiently so they can be quickly distributed to our partner charities.\r\n\r\nTime commitment:\r\n* Mondays, Tuesdays & Thursdays (flexible shifts between 9 am and 4 pm)\r\n\r\nThe kind of person we are looking for:\r\n* Friendly & helpful\r\n* Someone who enjoys chatting with the local community and working as part of a happy team\r\n\r\nActive and adaptable:\r\n* Happy to be on your feet and comfortable handling light-to-moderate lifting from cars\r\n\r\nOrganised:\r\n* Someone who appreciates an orderly space and takes pride in keeping surfaces and sorting areas clean and tidy\r\n\r\nGreeting and lifting:\r\n* Welcoming friendly donors as they arrive and helping to bring donations safely from their cars into the shop\r\n\r\nOrganising and sorting:\r\n* Categorising and sorting incoming donations (clothes, books, homeware) cleanly into bags or boxes for distribution\r\n\r\nCreating a safe space:\r\n* Helping to maintain a clean, tidy and welcoming environment by clearing up wrapping materials and wiping down surfaces\r\n\r\nWhat’s in it for you?\r\n* Join a vibrant, warm and highly regarded community initiative\r\n* Clothing and essential household items reaching hundreds of people in temporary accommodation or moving into their first home\r\n* See the direct, immediate impact of your help - your work directly translates into\r\n* Enjoy a lively, social time with a brilliant group of local volunteers\r\n\r\n* PVG membership required\n\n## Travel details\n\nOrchardhill Parish Church, Lower Memorial Halls, Rosslea Drive, Giffnock, G46 6JW",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2Fb1fa9c8d-a9b7-4fef-b272-f75b694cacab%2F7IOko5pfsrThTntx6Monre9KEIs2%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=21d48cab-3fa7-4125-864e-58cd969cfe22",
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000Hnw97YAB#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Donation Welcomer & Sorter",
                        "applyLink": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000Hnw97YAB/donation-welcomer-sorter?#modal_register_a0gQD00000Hnw97YAB",
                        "allowsRemoteParticipation": false,
                        "minimumAge": "16",
                        "service": [
                            {
