                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000002ukv3YAA",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000002ukv3YAA/helper-for-community-tea-party",
                    "publishStart": "2024-03-22",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-11-30",
                    "title": "Helper for Community Tea Party",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nDo you have a couple of hours once or twice a year to share a cup of tea with an Older Person? We need caring people to host tea parties to help combat against Loneliness.\n\n## Description\n\nIsolation and Loneliness are on the rise especially with Older People in the Community. We are looking for friendly and caring people to help with our tea parties. Could you help serve refreshments and friendly conversation from the comfort of your own home? You will only be hosting once or twice a year, so this is perfect for fitting around your own availability and lifestyle.\r\n\r\nAll our guests are driven to your home by volunteer drivers, and you will be led by our tea party\r\nvolunteer coordinator. Normally your tea party will last for about 2 hours on a Sunday afternoon. It is the same local group you host so you can make some real connections to your community and the Older Guests. All training is remote, and you are supported by our team and Tea Party Co-ordinator in your role.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo experience or particular skills required. We just need you to be an empathetic person who is ready to work alongside Older People over the age of 75.\n\n## Training details\n\nFull remote training provided including PVG check and safeguarding, complete at your own pace.\r\n\r\nIn your role you are also supported by our Support team and your Tea Party Co-ordinator for any questions or queries you have.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nOnce or twice yearly for approximately 2 hours on a Sunday.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nPlease note: No expenses are offered for this role.",
