            "name": "Dunfermline Greenspace",
            "description": "Dunfermline Greenspace has been formed to benefit the community of Dunfermline, to preserve, restore and improve the environment. They aim to use public greenspace to benefit and protect the wellbeing, health, recreation and leisure of the community, while also providing education, training and volunteering opportunities.",
