                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000GmHtNYAV",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000GmHtNYAV/volunteer-social-media-content-creator-tiktok",
                    "publishStart": "2026-05-11",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-05-03",
                    "title": "Volunteer Social Media Content Creator (TikTok)",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe are looking for a creative volunteer to help support our social media presence by creating TikTok content for our page once a week. This is a great opportunity for someone interested in content creation, social media, marketing, or building their portfolio while supporting our organisation/community.\r\nWhat you’ll do:\r\n•\tCreate and edit one TikTok video per week \r\n•\tHelp develop engaging and creative content ideas \r\n•\tStay up to date with TikTok trends and formats \r\n•\tWork with our team to ensure content aligns with our message and brand \r\nWhat we’re looking for:\r\n•\tInterest in social media and content creation \r\n•\tBasic video editing skills \r\n•\tCreativity and reliability \r\n•\tFamiliarity with TikTok trends and platform features \r\nTime commitment:\r\nApproximately a few hours per week, flexible scheduling.\r\nBenefits of volunteering with us:\r\n•\tGain hands-on social media experience \r\n•\tBuild your portfolio and creative skills \r\n•\tReceive a reference upon successful completion \r\n•\tMake a positive impact by supporting our organisation",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
