                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g0800000VhviwAAB/peer-supporter-for-a-cancer-cafedrop-in",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-02",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-02",
                    "title": "Peer Supporter for a cancer café/drop in",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nThere is a local cancer café – a place for people living with and affected by cancer to come for tea, chat and information. The session will be on a Wednesday & will last around 2 hours including set up and close down.  Full training and support provided. Volunteers will help run the sessions.  On every second and fourth Wednesday of the month 11-1pm.\n\n## Experience required\n\nGood communication and listening skills, a pleasant personality and someone who has experience of living with cancer. All training provided.\n\n## Training details\n\nGood communication and listening skills, a pleasant personality and someone who has experience of living with cancer. All training provided.\n\n## Travel details\n\nKirkintilloch has good transport links",
