            "name": "Bridge of Don Community Centre",
            "description": "The main aim of the Bridge of Don Community Centre & Association is to provide a variety of activities for all who reside or work in the Bridge of Don community.\r\n\r\nThe Centre is also available to hire for events and celebrations.",
            "website": "http://www.bodcommunitycentre.co.uk/index.html",
            "cause": [
