                        "description": "No previous outreach experience is needed. We’re looking for:\n•\tA friendly, approachable manner and willingness to chat with people.\n•\tGood listening skills and respect for different backgrounds and views.\n•\tAn interest in Maryhill and its local community.\n•\tReliability and the ability to keep in touch with the Volunteer Lead.\n•\tWillingness to share information clearly and pass on questions or feedback.\n•\tBasic confidence using a phone and online group chat to coordinate with the team.\nTh",
