                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HsOoQYAV",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HsOoQYAV/talking-newspaper-producer-south-ayrshire",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-10",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-08",
                    "title": "Talking Newspaper Producer — South Ayrshire",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nA brand new opportunity - This role is our starting point. Once the Producer is in place, we can begin building the South Ayrshire reading team around them — so the right candidate gets to shape a brand-new service from the ground up.\n\n## Experience required\n\nLead production of our new weekly South Ayrshire talking newspaper for blind and visually impaired listeners. Record and edit volunteer readers, post editions same-day via FREEPOST. Equipment/studio access and space to host readers needed. Full training given. One day a week.\n\n## Training details\n\nFull training on the recording and editing software, plus ongoing support from ARSB. No previous experience needed — just reliability, good organisation, and a determination to have fun doing it!\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nWeekly commitment, one day a week.",
