                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000FW0YvYAL",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000FW0YvYAL/british-sign-language-bsl-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-02-20",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-10",
                    "title": "British Sign Language (BSL) Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nBritish Sign Language (BSL) Volunteer\n\n## Description\n\n<p>Are you fluent in British Sign Language? Would you be happy to volunteer occasional hours with a community charity to help support a deaf team member?<br />\n<br />\nHaving some BSL interperting would allow us to better support our colleague and also allow us to build a better environment around them; with more people in our team getting some support to learn more BSL.<br />\n<br />\nThere doesn&#39;t need to be a commitment to regular hours - occasional support would be incredibly helpful and extremely benfical.</p>\n\n<p>We&#39;re based in Govan, a short five min walk from the subway and bus station.<br />\n7 Harmony Row, Govan, G51 3BB.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>If you are interested,&nbsp;please click the &lsquo;Apply&rsquo; button below (available when&nbsp;registered and&nbsp;logged in). You&nbsp;will then be contacted by the coordinator by email or phone call. If you have not heard back after 5 working days, the first step is to contact the organisation with the contact details provided. You could also check your junk/spam folder on your emails just in case the response is there. If that&nbsp;doesn&rsquo;t&nbsp;work&nbsp;out,&nbsp;then please feel free to contact Volunteer Glasgow on&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:info@volunteerglasgow.org\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">info@volunteerglasgow.org.</a>&nbsp;</p>\n\n## Experience required\n\nBeing able to translate in BSL\n\n## Travel details\n\nIs accessible by Subway or bus and is about half an hour walk from Patrick for example.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nminimum 3 hours",
