                }
            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0g24000007U7ILAA0",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0g24000007U7ILAA0/help-for-heroes-volunteers-aberdeen",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Help for Heroes Volunteers Aberdeen",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nJoin us as a Help for Heroes Volunteer in Aberdeen\r\nYou really can make a massive difference to the lives of our Heroes by ‘doing your bit’.\r\n\r\nVolunteering for Help for Heroes is one of the most rewarding things you can do. Whatever you do, your support is invaluable. Wherever you live, whatever your interests and no matter how much time you have to offer us, there are loads of ways to volunteer for Help for Heroes!\r\n\r\nVolunteering is fun, rewarding and inspiring. Learn more, speak to us today!\r\n\r\nFor more details please:\r\nEmail volunteer@helpforheroes.org.uk\r\nCall 01980 840224 or visit\r\nwww.helpforheroes.org.uk/give-support/volunteer/how-can-i-help/\n\n## Description\n\nJoin us as a Help for Heroes Volunteer in Aberdeen\r\nYou really can make a massive difference to the lives of our Heroes by ‘doing your bit’.\r\n\r\nVolunteering for Help for Heroes is one of the most rewarding things you can do. Whatever you do, your support is invaluable. Wherever you live, whatever your interests and no matter how much time you have to offer us, there are loads of ways to volunteer for Help for Heroes!\r\n\r\nVolunteering is fun, rewarding and inspiring. Learn more, speak to us today!\r\n\r\nFor more details please:\r\nEmail volunteer@helpforheroes.org.uk\r\nCall 01980 840224 or visit\r\nwww.helpforheroes.org.uk/give-support/volunteer/how-can-i-help/\n\n## Experience required\n\nWhatever your interests and no matter how much time you have to offer us, there are loads of ways to volunteer for Help for Heroes!\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nNo matter how much time you have to offer us, there are loads of ways to volunteer for Help for Heroes!\n\n## Travel details\n\nOpportunities available across Aberdeen and wider north east.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
