                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000IQuSPYA1",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000IQuSPYA1/supporter-admin-volunteer-glasgow",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-09",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-01",
                    "title": "Supporter Admin Volunteer (Glasgow)",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAbout the role \n\nWe’re looking for a friendly and reliable volunteer to assist our Supporter Experience team in our Glasgow office. \n\nThis is a great opportunity to get involved behind the scenes and help us provide a great experience for our supporters. You’ll be part of the team helping with the day-to-day practical tasks that keep things running smoothly. \n\n  \n\nWhat you’ll be doing \n\nDepending on what’s needed, tasks may include: \n\nOpening and sorting incoming mail \n\nPreparing and sending fundraising packs and supporter materials \n\nFulfilling supporter requests, tasks and orders \n\nFranking and preparing outgoing post \n\nCarrying out basic administration and data entry \n\nHelping with general office tasks and keeping things organised \n\nSupporting the wider Supporter Experience team as needed \n\n  \n\nWhat we’re looking for \n\nWe’re looking for someone who is: \n\nReliable and organised \n\nHappy working on practical and administrative tasks \n\nComfortable working as part of a team \n\nFriendly and helpful \n\nAble to work carefully and accurately \n\n  \n\nWhat you’ll gain \n\nYou’ll gain practical experience in administration, organisation and supporter service while being part of a busy charity team and supporting Mary’s Meals’ mission to provide school meals to children in some of the world’s poorest communities.\n\n## Experience required\n\nReliable and organised \n\nHappy working on practical and administrative tasks \n\nComfortable working as part of a team \n\nFriendly and helpful \n\nAble to work carefully and accurately\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible volunteering opportunity\n\n## Travel details\n\nMary’s Meals Glasgow office",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-volunteerscotland-search.appspot.com/o/opportunities%2FMOmcUsck5jgPN7g2zqOOsbScQTc2%2Fn1EhXixDH2vw3jAy-thumbnail.jpg?alt=media&token=438fdbc5-8963-4f36-b616-16a0141758b4",
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000IQuSPYA1#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Supporter Admin Volunteer (Glasgow)",
                        "description": "Reliable and organised \n\nHappy working on practical and administrative tasks \n\nComfortable working as part of a team \n\nFriendly and helpful \n\nAble to work carefully and accurately",
                        "commitment": "Flexible volunteering opportunity",
