                    "publishStart": "2024-04-03",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-28",
                    "title": "Retail Assistant",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nVarious roles available, for both front of shop and stock room. Stock room sorting, pricing and tagging stock ready for sale, Front of shop putting stock in window, on shelves and hangers etc. Front of shop operating cash register, serving customers.\n\n## Description\n\nVarious roles available, for both front of shop and stock room. Stock room sorting, pricing and tagging stock ready for sale, front of shop putting stock in window, on shelves and hangers etc. Front of shop operating cash register, serving customers. To apply for this role, please visit: https://www.barnardos.org.uk/get-involved/volunteer\nThank you\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo skills required as full training will be given.\n\n## Training details\n\nTraining is undertaken in store and is ongoing, we support our volunteers every step of the way!\n\n## Travel details\n\nBarnardo's Crighton place, Edinburgh EH7 4NY\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nNo expenses paid.",
