            "name": "COAST",
            "description": "Improve the local marine environment for the benefit of everyone.\r\nEnsure coastal communities have a say in the decisions that affect their seas.\r\nWork to sustain the livelihood of those dependent on fishing and tourism.\r\nIncrease the popularity of Arran and the Clyde as a diving, watersports and tourist destination.\r\nEducate future generations on the need for marine conservation and how to make a difference.",
            "website": "https://arrancoast.com",
            "charityRegistration": [
