            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/0012400001H616EAAR/east-kilbride-table-tennis-club",
            "name": "East Kilbride Table Tennis Club",
            "description": "East Kilbride Table Tennis Club (EKTTC) has a heritage of over 40 years as a local sports club attracting youth players from East Kilbride and the surrounding area, providing facilities to those interested in table tennis.\n\nThe group currently only operate the Friday evening club night between 6.00 pm and 7.45 pm.\n\nThe club regularly enters several teams into the West of Scotland Junior League competition. And the coaches are registered with Table Tennis Scotland, the sport’s governing body.",
            "website": "https://ektabletennis.com/",
            "charityRegistration": [
                {
                    "registrar": "https://www.oscr.org.uk",
