            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000005PbKtYAK",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000005PbKtYAK/our-union-street-brighten-the-streets-volunteers",
                    "publishStart": "2026-09-14",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-18",
                    "title": "Our Union Street - Brighten the Streets Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nJoin our volunteer army!\r\n\r\nWe are building a community that is passionate about Union Street and improving our city centre - and we would love for you to be a part of it.\r\n\r\nWe have mobilised a fantastic volunteer force which is already making a huge difference by cleaning up attractions, freshening up unloved and empty shops to brighten up Union Street and help sell the Granite Mile to the world.\r\n\r\nWe have volunteer opportunities for all abilities to join us as we look to re-energise the street. Whether you are a skilled tradesperson, developer, tech expert or just want to lend some elbow grease to our efforts, we want to hear from you.\r\n\r\nAll help makes a real difference to Union Street, our city and is greatly appreciated.\r\n\r\nFor details of and to sign up to any forthcoming volunteer events and activities please visit: https://www.ourunionstreet.com/volunteer\n\n## Description\n\nHelp brighten the streets!\r\n\r\nOur Union Street is a volunteer-led organisation that is part of the mission to transform Union Street and surrounding lanes and alleys. It's always good fun to meet and volunteer with like-minded people.\r\n\r\nWe are building a community that is passionate about Union Street and improving our city centre - and we would love for you to be a part of it.\r\n\r\nWe have mobilised a fantastic volunteer force which is already making a huge difference by cleaning up attractions, freshening up unloved and empty shops to brighten up Union Street and help sell the Granite Mile to the world.\r\n\r\nWe have volunteer opportunities for all abilities to join us as we look to re-energise the street. Whether you are a skilled tradesperson, developer, tech expert or just want to lend some elbow grease to our efforts, we want to hear from you.\r\n\r\nAll help makes a real difference to Union Street, our city and is greatly appreciated.\r\n\r\nFor details of and to sign up to any forthcoming volunteer events and activities please visit: https://www.ourunionstreet.com/volunteer or email: brightenthestreets@ourunionstreet.com\n\n## Training details\n\nRelevant guidance and support is provided to all volunteers. We are a welcoming team and while helping we also have fun. All help makes a real difference for Union Street and our city.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible times available to help. Please visit: https://www.ourunionstreet.com/volunteer for details of forthcoming activities.\n\n## Travel details\n\nUnion Street, Aberdeen City Centre",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
