        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/001QD00000SMPXZYA5",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/001QD00000SMPXZYA5/food-train-meal-makers",
            "name": "Food Train Meal Makers",
            "description": "Meal Makers is a local, neighbourhood food-sharing project that connects anyone over 55 who would enjoy a home cooked meal and some company, with a volunteer cook in their area.",
            "website": "https://thefoodtrain.co.uk/how-we-help/meal-makers/",
            "charityRegistration": [
                {
                    "registrar": "https://www.oscr.org.uk",
                    "registrationNumber": "SC024843"
                }
            ],
            "cause": [
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/BefriendingMentoring",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Befriending / Mentoring"
                },
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/CommunityFacilities",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Community Facilities"
                },
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/OlderPeople",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Older People"
                },
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/CommunityEngagement",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Community Engagement"
                }
            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000008Ex3dYAC",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000008Ex3dYAC/cooking-befriender",
                    "publishStart": "2025-01-30",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-29",
                    "title": "Cooking & Befriender",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAs a volunteer cook, you would bring round an extra portion of freshly prepared, home-cooked food as well as provide company and a friendly chat.  Meal sharing occurs weekly on a day and time agreed by both.\r\n\r\nWhy volunteer with us?\r\nWe have kind and caring volunteers all over Scotland, bringing friendship and joy to older people’s lives whilst providing much-needed practical help.  Our volunteers are vital to the success of Food Train and without them, we simply wouldn’t be able to operate.\r\n\r\nIf you are aged 16 or over and would like to make a difference to older people’s lives, then why not join us?  We also welcome enquiries from anyone under 16, please contact your local branch here before completing the form to discuss supported roles.  We are proud to be a welcoming, inclusive charity and are keen to hear from people of all communities, abilities, backgrounds and walks of life.\r\n\r\nRoughly 2 hours per week or fortnight at times agreed between yourself and the diner.  We try where possible to match people locally so this can be fitted in alongside other commitments.\r\n\r\nRole Description\r\n-Paired with an older person to deliver a weekly home-cooked meal\r\n-Provide an effective meal-sharing service for your diner\r\n-Spend time with your diner, listen, chat and discuss various topics\r\n-To report back to the Food Train Connects team and complete all required documentation after each meal share\r\n\r\nSkills & Experience Required\r\n-Ability to cook a home-cooked meal while employing good food hygiene principles.  Willingness to use own car or public transport to deliver meals\r\n-Good communication skills and willingness to use own phone and online device to record and submit activity logs and complete online forms\r\n\r\nPVG required.\n\n## Travel details\n\nIn local community.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2Fc97c7b9c-4e66-4969-94d4-bbe74f578789%2FZTpsVM2s6uO1kBK4LhzHjps4n472%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=1fa2e899-bd76-49f1-b78c-cf90b064e11e",
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000008Ex3dYAC#role",
                        "type": "Role",
                        "title": "Cooking & Befriender",
                        "applyLink": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000008Ex3dYAC/cooking-befriender?#modal_register_a0gQD000008Ex3dYAC",
                        "allowsRemoteParticipation": false,
