                    "title": "MCR Pathways Mentor",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nMentors spend an hour each week listening to and encouraging a young person in their school. Can you help a young person to build their confidence and discover their potential?\n\n## Description\n\nAn hour of your time can make all the difference. MCR Pathways are looking for mentors for young people and offer training and support.\n\n## Travel details\n\nMentoring Sessions to take place at The Nicolson Institute, Stornoway",
