                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-15",
                    "title": "Hedgerow volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAn opportunity to help in hedgerow restoration and planting across East Lothian, as part of the East Lothian Hedgerow Restoration project https://eastlothianclimatehub.org/east-lothian-hedgerow-restoration-piloting-a-wildlife-corridor/\r\n\r\nGet involved in hedgerow planting; or helping to survey the condition of hedgerow; or in the rejuvenation of existing hedgerow. No experience necessary - training and supervision will be provided!\r\n\r\nThere will be lots of opportunities over the autumn and winter to get outdoors, get into nature and connect with others - and feel like you've done something to help nature! It's a great way to meet new people, get out in the fresh air and help create some wildlife corridors\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo Expertise\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nCommitment Flexible 3 Hours, Monthly\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nIf volunteering in East Lammermuir, travel expenses can be covered.",
