                    "publishEnd": "2026-11-23",
                    "title": "Self-Harm Network Scotland - Live Chat volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nThe Self-Harm Network Volunteer will utilise their unique understanding gained from \r\nmanaging their own mental health to assist staff in the smooth delivery of our Self\r\nHarm support web chat.\n\n## Training details\n\n• Self-Harm Awareness Training:  \r\n                                       Wednesday 13th January 2027 \r\n                                       6.00 pm – 9.00 pm \r\n• Text base support training:  \r\nSaturday 23rd January 2027 \r\n9.00 am – 5.00 pm \r\n• Escalation and Safeguarding training:  \r\n                                        Wednesday 27th January 2027 \r\n                                        6.00 pm – 9.00 pm\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nThe chat operates between 6pm-10pm, 7 days a week. \r\nWe are looking for a commitment of one 4-hour shift a week, including 1 \r\nFriday or Saturday a moth. One year commitment. \r\nLocation: Remote – Based in Scotland\n\n## Travel details\n\nno travel needed but expenses paid if needed\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nno travel needed but expenses paid if needed",
