                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000007pAe1YAE/gardeners",
                    "publishStart": "2025-01-09",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Gardeners",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nTo work and develop gardening projects that are achievable to persons with a learning disability, teaching new skills such as support in community conservation, planting and growing and sharing a knowledge base that can enrich the lives of those attending. To have a positive and keen attitude that nurture friendship promote through choice, respect and trust.\n\n## Experience required\n\nA good knowledge of gardening and a positive attitude towards others\n\n## Training details\n\nThe volunteer’s will work closely with our Activity Coordinator at all times and she will be first port of call for any support required.\n\n## Travel details\n\nThere is a bus stop outside Sycamore House and the bus runs every 30 min",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
