                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000007pDf7YAE",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000007pDf7YAE/knitters",
                    "publishStart": "2025-01-09",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Knitters",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nLooking to have some volanteers over on the last Monday of the month 2pm-4pm at Sycamore house to help support people with a learning disability to learn how to knit and be creative. Need to have a keen interest in knitting, crochet or embroidery and be patient. This group is all about getting together and having a chat, being creative whilst learning a new skills as well as making new friends. Refreshments will be supplied.\n\n## Experience required\n\nConfident knitter, kind , patient, respectful outgoing and an appreciation of the importance of community connections\n\n## Training details\n\nInformal chat about our services and what we are aiming to achieve through our Yarn and Darn sessions\n\n## Travel details\n\nBuses run every 30 mins and stops outside the office in which our Yarn and Darn group is held\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nBus fares and mileage at 45p per mile",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F65142522-6fbf-41f1-ae2e-ec79e739ab08%2FWkLzgT1VE9cAHEWcVMpdVMd5bL63%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=2b72f1a8-857b-45fa-8288-92901dceeb62",
