                        "commitment": "2 hours per week for 6 weeks (course), or 2 hours per month (group).\r\nBecause we invest in our volunteers (our training and support is high quality), we ask that volunteers see this not as a short-term role but something you're likely to do more long-term.",
                        "applyLink": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000GTdJKYA1/action-for-happiness-volunteer?#modal_register_a0gQD00000GTdJKYA1",
                        "allowsRemoteParticipation": false,
