            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000008h8AbYAI",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000008h8AbYAI/organiser-for-community-tea-party",
                    "publishStart": "2025-02-26",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-12",
                    "title": "Organiser for community tea party",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nRe-Engage which offers free companionship services and groups for older adults aged 75-years and older. Our mission is to alleviate loneliness and social isolation by connecting people and their communities. All our services are led and delivered by our fantastic volunteers to whom we are so grateful. \r\n \r\nRe-Engage currently offer a tea party group in Ayr that covers KA7, KA8, KA9, Prestwick, Troon, but not quite as far as Kilwinning. They meet monthly on the last Sunday of the month in the afternoon\n\n## Description\n\nRe-Engage which offers free companionship services and groups for older adults aged 75-years and older. Our mission is to alleviate loneliness and social isolation by connecting people and their communities. All our services are led and delivered by our fantastic volunteers to whom we are so grateful. \r\n \r\nRe-Engage currently offer a tea party group in Ayr that covers KA7, KA8, KA9, Prestwick, Troon, but not quite as far as Kilwinning. They meet monthly on the last Sunday of the month in the afternoon.\r\n\r\nMain duties: Are you a coordinated and organised person looking to help your local older community from your own home? Help out by organising and communicating timings and locations to the volunteers and to the older guests of our monthly free tea party. Liaise with Re-Engage to communicate recruitment, resource or other needs of the group. You are supported by a Support team as well as all the volunteers in the group, including hosts/drivers and additional groups in the area.\r\n\r\nSkills & experience required: No particular experience required but you should be comfortable communicating digitally.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo particular experience required but you should be comfortable communicating digitally.\n\n## Training details\n\nFull onboarding training is provided online and can be completed at your own pace. This training includes safeguarding, diversity and inclusion, and GDPR, as well as role specific training and a hand to meet other organisers and the team at Re-Engage",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2Fcad92b45-aeaf-4191-b737-734f93fa70d0%2F0nFCUqNjeiXPIFO483j0BVWArU43%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=60c5acd1-727e-49f1-8016-57831cc5cd97",
