                    "description": "## Description\n\nThe charity aims to create a better, more connected community.\r\nhttps://dashcommunity.co.uk/\r\n\r\nWe are currently recruiting for a volunteer Hub and Larder Assistant.\r\nMain duties include serving in the community larder and at the Hub Breakfast/Brunch Club.\n\n## Experience required\n\nFriendly demeanour essential\n\n## Training details\n\nincludes First Aid, Health and Safety, DeFib",
