        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/001QD00000Q64uzYAB",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/001QD00000Q64uzYAB/salvation-army-trading-company-ltd-aberdeen-donation-centre",
            "name": "Salvation Army Trading Company Ltd: Aberdeen Donation Centre",
            "description": "The Aberdeen Salvation Army Donation Centre supports and funds the vital work our charities carry out in communities across the UK.\r\n\r\nSATCoL is the largest charity-owned textiles collector in the U.K actively working to support organisations reduce their carbon footprint and combat climate change. Through our reuse and recycling schemes, we lessen the impact on overflowing landfill sites by extending the useful life of products and minimising waste.",
            "website": "https://www.salvationarmy.org.uk/",
            "cause": [
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/CharityShop",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Charity Shop"
                },
                {
                    "@id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Taxonomy/Cause/Volunteering",
                    "skos:prefLabel": "Volunteering"
                }
            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000006J0P3YAK",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000006J0P3YAK/donation-centre-volunteers",
                    "publishStart": "2026-08-17",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-10",
                    "title": "Donation Centre Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nJoin our volunteer experience and become part of our shop team.\r\n\r\nWith your time and support we will be able to fund the work our charities carries out in communities across the UK.\r\n\r\nThis is a new donation centre, which is also a shop and we need your support to make it a success and to continue that success. \r\n\r\nWe have various roles available and would love you to come on board. These include helping as:\r\n•\tVolunteer Stock Processor\r\n•\tVolunteer Till Operator/Sales Assistant\r\n•\tVolunteer Shop floor specialists such as media and jewellery specialists\r\n•\tVolunteer eBay lister\r\n•\tVolunteer Driver's mate\r\n\r\nBy volunteering with us, you are actively helping to make a difference every day! \r\n\r\nWe look forward to your support and thank you for your help in advance. \r\n\r\nFor more information please contact Andy Smith, Regional Volunteer Co-ordinator\r\n at email: andy.smith@satcol.org or telephone 07568429118.\n\n## Description\n\nJoin our volunteer experience and become part of our shop team.\r\n\r\nWith your time and support we will be able to fund the work our charities carries out in communities across the UK.\r\n\r\nThis is a new donation centre, which is also a shop and we need your support to make it a success and to continue that success. \r\n\r\nWe have various roles available and would love you to come on board. These include helping as:\r\n•\tVolunteer Stock Processor\r\n•\tVolunteer Till Operator/Sales Assistant\r\n•\tVolunteer Shop floor specialists such as media and jewellery specialists\r\n•\tVolunteer eBay lister\r\n•\tVolunteer Driver's mate\r\n\r\nBy volunteering with us, you are actively helping to make a difference every day! \r\n\r\nWe look forward to your support and thank you for your help in advance. \r\n\r\nFor more information please contact Andy Smith, Regional Volunteer Co-ordinator\r\n at email: andy.smith@satcol.org or telephone 07568429118.\n\n## Training details\n\nExcellent support and relevant training is provided to all volunteers. Volunteers will be given an induction, refresher training and continuous training.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nFlexible times available to help. All help is greatly appreciated.\n\n## Travel details\n\nWe pay out reasonable expenses.\r\nParking is available at the site.  \r\nThe Donation Centre is located at Unit B, 876 Great Northern Road, AB24 2BP.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nWe reimburse expenses on a weekly basis or daily if required.  \r\nWe pay out for public transport and personal vehicle use, but after a discussion with the shop manager, to confirm the agreement.",
