                    "description": "## Summary\n\nBirdston care home provides high standards of care to residents living with Dementia and Elderly Care\n\n## Description\n\nTo volunteer with the residents in the care home reading with residents, chatting with them and getting involved in activities.\n\n## Experience required\n\nCare, arts, singing, drama etc\n\n## Travel details\n\nBirdston Care Home, Milton of Campsie",
