        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/001QD00000Qt0d9YAB",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/001QD00000Qt0d9YAB/21st-glasgow-scout-group",
            "name": "21st Glasgow Scout Group",
            "description": "We provide young people with exciting and challenging experiences and then help them use those experiences in their personal and social development.",
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000006ZFC1YAO",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000006ZFC1YAO/scout-group-volunteers",
                    "publishStart": "2024-11-07",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-05-11",
                    "title": "Scout Group Volunteers",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nVolunteering for the Scouts is a great way to take part in new experiences, meet a whole load of friendly people and have fun. \r\n\r\nAs a volunteer, working in teams, you might:\r\n\r\n1) Welcome young people and families to sessions and events\r\n2) Make sure everyone’s safe, supported, included and having fun\r\n3) Help to plan and lead activities\r\n4) Get involved with days out, camps and expeditions\r\n5) Share and learn skills – from coding to cake decorating to canoeing\r\n6) Celebrate young people’s achievements big and small\r\n\r\nYou don't need to be the next Bear Grylls to volunteer, we need volunteers from all backgrounds to support us.\n\n## Travel details\n\n21st Glasgow Scout Hall, Pollok Road (off Castle Road), Newton Mearns, G77 6DH",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2F26bcfdbb-1d46-4c4c-8a0a-570b5fe4e0be%2FZTpsVM2s6uO1kBK4LhzHjps4n472%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=38db0cec-055b-4aab-bdba-33e2ba094820",
