            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000006wpTJYAY",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000006wpTJYAY/shop-assistant",
                    "publishStart": "2024-11-27",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-01-25",
                    "title": "Shop Assistant",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nWe are a Charity Shop serving the community and supporting financially some of our partner organisations, both locally (South Ayrshire Foodbank and Ayr Debt Centre) and internationally.  Based at 254 RESTORE, 254 High St Ayr\r\n\r\nWe need people who would be willing to help out possibly either 1 in every 2 weeks or 1 in every 4 weeks.\r\n\r\nMain duties:\r\nServing customers, sorting and pricing items and general cleaning.\n\n## Training details\n\nInitial training will be given, and you will also work alongside volunteers who have worked with us for some time. There is ongoing training as the needs arise.  Support can be given by Southside Church.",
