                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000ILIfVYAX/workshop-support-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-05",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-05",
                    "title": "Workshop Support Volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nAre you interested in arts and creativity? Could you offer a few hours a week to help the most vulnerable people in your community? We are always interested in hearing from potential volunteers to create welcoming environments for people to enjoy, and arts activities to inspire them to create their own work. We’re looking for a volunteer to support our team to create a welcoming, creative space for young people on our CashBack programme to build confidence, develop skills and explore their potential through art. \r\n\r\nCashBack offers 14-19 year olds a space to meet like-minded young people, learn new skills, improve physical and mental health, build confidence and form friendships through creative engagement. Participants do not require any arts or creative experience for this project; it is a fun way for everyone to develop core transferable skills.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000ILIfVYAX#role",
