                    "title": "Warehouse Assistant",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nFurniture Scheme collect and resell used furniture, white goods and other household items. The scheme has been instrumental in recycling furniture and household goods, thereby reducing landfill waste and aiding those in need.\r\nThey are currently looking for warehouse assistants who will go out with the drivers to collect and deliver furniture, and will also assist in the warehouse with moving furniture and general housekeeping.\r\nShifts required are 10am-2pm Wednesday, Thursday and Friday.\n\n## Experience required\n\nSome heavy lifting will be required for this role.\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nTravel expenses are paid and lunch is also provided for volunteers.",
