                        "title": "Retail Volunteer – Various Glasgow Stores",
                        "description": "No Experience? No Problem!\nThere are no set skills required to volunteer with us. All we ask is that you’re friendly, willing to learn, and passionate about the work Barnardo’s does. We’ll provide all the training and support you need.",
                        "applyLink": "https://opportunities.volunteerglasgow.org/volunteers/opportunity/10252078",
