                },
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000HIbvNYAT",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000HIbvNYAT/retail-online-research-volunteer-store-based",
                    "publishStart": "2026-06-15",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-12-14",
                    "title": "Retail Online Research Volunteer - Store Based",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nYou will be researching and collating evidence to be sent with items. Preparing and packing boxes for items to be sent safely to the Barnardos on-line hub.  Preparing and taking photos of items that might need to be sold as a \"pick-up from store\".  Ensuring the store and back-area remains clean and tidy. Ensure all health and safety policies and procedures are adhered to and ensure all security procedures are adhered to.",
