                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000I2bfRYAR/retail-volunteer-drivers-mate",
                    "publishStart": "2026-09-18",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-19",
                    "title": "Retail Volunteer Driver's Mate",
                    "description": "## Summary\n\nCollections & deliveries. Loading & unloading\n\n## Description\n\nNo matter how good our services are, we can't properly support our users/community well if we don't have good organisers in the team. If this sounds like you... we would love you to consider volunteering with us for a few hours per week.\r\n\r\nThe Salvation Army is a worldwide evangelical Christian church. Our mission is based on our faith in Jesus Christ who wants everyone to experience life in all its fullness. The services we offer are diverse and responsive to the realities of life in the communities we serve.\r\n\r\nAs a Retail volunteer drivers mate for the Salvation Army charity sites, you will play an important role in supporting our retail operations by assisting with the collection and delivery of donated goods, furniture and stock. Your contribution helps generate vital income that enables the salvation army to provide practical support and life changing services to those most in need. Working alongside a driver, you will provide excellent customer service while helping to ensure donations and purchased goods are handled, loaded and transported safely and efficiently.\r\n\r\nSo whether you are looking to use your time well, update your skills or have the chance to do something a bit new, we can offer you a warm welcome and all of the support and help you could need.\r\nWe are seeing a rise in demand for our services everyday. Having your help will allow us to be there for the people who need us. Any time you can give will make a real difference.\n\n## Travel details\n\nClydebank and surrounding areas\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nExpenses paid for a min of a 4 hour shift only",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "role": {
                        "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000I2bfRYAR#role",
                        "type": "Role",
