            ],
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD00000Ai1YvYAJ",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD00000Ai1YvYAJ/volunteer-retail-assistant",
                    "publishStart": "2025-07-03",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-04-02",
                    "title": "Volunteer Retail Assistant",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nBeautiful Inside & Out (SCIO) are a charity whose aims include the saving of lives. They support people of all ages, and families who have lost loved ones by suicide. They organise and fund counselling, provide different types of group therapy and promote kindness, which has the power to save a life.\r\nThey are currently looking for volunteers for their charity shop in Troon, which raises much needed funds and is also used as a hub for different support groups. \r\nVolunteers will serve members of the public in the shop, operate the till, sort donations and price and display items for sale. Hours can be flexible to suit volunteers but the shop is currently open Monday to Saturday 9.30am-5pm, and Sunday 11am-3pm.\r\nIf you are interested , or want to find out more please contact Pauline on 07984 328808.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo experience is required and training will be provided.",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
                    "image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/scvo-org.appspot.com/o/milo%2FVolunteering_Opportunity__c%2Fd69b1736-83e0-4f0f-bbfb-4082f8acb4c5%2F0nFCUqNjeiXPIFO483j0BVWArU43%2Flisting.jpg?alt=media&token=d27938aa-f49f-4129-8a17-fcfd63341131",
