        {
            "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Organisation/001QD00000HPCtsYAH",
            "type": "Organisation",
            "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/organisations/001QD00000HPCtsYAH/baby-blue-bee-bunnies",
            "name": "Baby Blue Bee Bunnies",
            "description": "Baby Blue Bee Bunnies are a non profit constituted welfare organisation which aims to rescue, rehabilitate and rehome rabbits across Scotland and improve their welfare.",
            "website": "https://www.babybluebeebunnies.com/",
            "activity": [
                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000002kxTlYAI",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000002kxTlYAI/one-hop-shop-helpers",
                    "publishStart": "2026-10-01",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-03-31",
                    "title": "One Hop Shop Helpers",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nRetail Assistant - CURRENTLY RECRUITING\n\nLocation: Douglas, ML11\n\nSkills required:\n\nMust be 18+ with transport to and from the rescue.Capable and confident to work alone after training is given.Interested in animal welfare and must be comfortable around animals.\n\nRole Involves:\n\nRestocking shelves, making up stock and recanting products into storage bins.Picking products, making and packing orders.Printing postage labels and taking parcels to the local drop off courier point.\n\nTime Commitment:\n\nOne 2-4 hour shift per week (flexible days either weekday or weekend)\n\n## Experience required\n\nGeneral Admin / Office Support,Literacy / Numeracy, Caring,Good Communicator,Hard Working,Patient,Reliable / Dependable,Social Conscience,Trustworthy,\n\n## Training details\n\nOn the job support.\n\n## Frequency commitment details\n\nOther days could be negotiable\n\n## Travel details\n\nThe opportunity takes place at multiple location across South Lanarkshire \nDouglas",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
