                {
                    "id": "https://data.volunteer.scot/Activity/a0gQD000003xhC6YAI",
                    "type": "Activity",
                    "dc:source": "https://volunteer.scot/search/a0gQD000003xhC6YAI/cafe-volunteer",
                    "publishStart": "2024-06-07",
                    "publishEnd": "2026-11-20",
                    "title": "Cafe volunteer",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nThis opportunity will be in our community café at The Crescent in Whitfield. This will include welcoming people into the café, serving teas and coffees, basic cooking skills, adhering to strict health and hygiene rules, dealing with customers, maintaining a high level of cleanliness in the cafe space and kitchen.\n\n## Experience required\n\nExperience in a café setting (desirable) \nREHIS training (desirable)\n\n## Travel details\n\nThis is on a bus route\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nThis will be covered if agreed with volunteer manager and board of trustees.\n\n## Taster details\n\nWe can arrange a taster session if required. \nInduction will be part of the application process. We are committed to ensuring that our volunteers fully understand what they will be doing,.",
