                    "publishStart": "2026-09-30",
                    "publishEnd": "2027-02-05",
                    "title": "Independent Monitor",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nMembers of Independent Monitoring Board at Dungavel House Immigration removal centre.  Board members carry out weekly visits to the centre to monitor the management of the facilities and listening to any concerns raised in the centre.  This includes talking to detainees and centre staff.\n\nAttendance ant monthly, on site, Board meertings is required.\n\nNo specialist skills required as full training will be given.\n\n## Experience required\n\nNo Expertise, Good Communicator,Good Listener,Open minded,Patient,Team Player,Trustworthy,\n\n## Training details\n\nIMB learning courses\n\n## Travel details\n\nThis is a South Lanarkshire opportunity and takes place in   \nAcross South Lanarkshire,Strathaven\n\n## Travel expenses\n\nReasonable travelling expenses will be paid",
                    "requiresEmergencyParticipation": false,
