                    "title": "Volunteer Drivers and Trustees",
                    "description": "## Description\n\nJoin Beeline Community Transport and support those members of our communities that need a little more help to continue to be active, remain independent in daily activities like their shopping and hospital appointments, and stay connected meeting friends.  Drivers: drive their electric car which is suitable for wheelchair users or our minibus (require D1 licence). Bus helpers: lend a hand when the bus is busy supporting access and chatting with bus user. Maintenance person: assist with the upkeep of their vehicle. Or become a trustee who makes sure the organisation continues to run and flourish.",
